window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":5701,"title":"Chapter 5701: Being Remembered","paragraphs":["Chapter 5701: Being Remembered","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In a dimly lit chamber, as Jian Wushuang departed from the Wu Family Mansion, Wu Li also returned to the Wu Family Sword Tomb through the teleportation array.","Both of them had secret matters to attend to, and neither delayed the other.","However, Jian Wushuang’s affair had little to do with the Sacred Assembly.","Leaving the Wu Family Mansion, Jian Wushuang’s appearance subtly changed. He quietly followed the two Emperors after locking onto them with his thought power.","They headed outside the capital of the Yue Kingdom.","On a warship, the two Emperors left the capital without deliberate flight. Instead, they brought out a massive warship, preparing to depart aboard it.","This surprised Jian Wushuang.","Both of them had been detained by the Yue Kingdom previously. Now, instead of hastily leaving, they leisurely boarded a warship.","When things deviate from the norm, there’s usually something sinister at play.","Jian Wushuang became even more cautious, his physical body transformed into particles as he adhered to the warship through the void.","This warship was an exquisite Eternal Treasure, not particularly powerful. Jian Wushuang directly enveloped the entire warship with his thought power, observing every move clearly.","Aside from the two Emperors, there were many maids on the warship.","They seemed to be exotic maids.","These two certainly knew how to indulge themselves.","They were currently bathing in the cabin.","Jian Wushuang had no interest in peeping at others bathing. After scanning the entire warship with his thought power, he lurked and waited for the two’s actions, eavesdropping on their conversation.","“Nikun, are you sure that person called Jian Wushuang possesses the power Lord Babidi mentioned?”","“Sang Biao, when have I ever lied to you? I’m very familiar with that power. Lord Babidi injected that power into my body back then, causing my strength to skyrocket!”","The words of Nikun and Sang Biao made Jian Wushuang frown slightly.","Babidi, he seemed to have never heard of him.","But judging from the two’s respectful manner, he should be a super powerhouse in the Tribulation Realm.","At least a Universe Master above the Four Tribulation realm.","Otherwise, it would be impossible for these two to be so deferential.","Just mentioning the name had to include the term ‘Lord’.","From their conversation, it seemed that the power these two possessed did not belong to them but came from that Babidi.","And he also sensed a familiar aura from him!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he speculated inwardly, “Could it be the power of Life?”","Very likely!","But the power emanating from these two individuals was the power of Death.","This was quite strange.","Jian Wushuang was also filled with curiosity about Babidi.","At the very least, the other party seemed to be aware of the existence of both the power of Death and the power of Life.","Not simple!","Jian Wushuang remained still, continuing to observe.","If luck was on his side, these two individuals would probably go to find Babidi.","After all, if they discovered the power of Life on him, they might inform the formidable figure known as Babidi.","Having finished bathing, Nikun casually put on a loose robe and relaxed in his guest room.","It seemed Sang Biao had no such intention, merely waiting outside the door.","After about the time it takes for an incense stick to burn, Nikun emerged from the room.","As for the alien girl inside the room, only a skeleton remained.","Red powder skeleton, that’s what they called it.","“Your time is getting shorter and shorter!” Sang Biao mocked.","Nikun didn’t seem to mind. He found a seat directly and gestured for those alien girls to leave before getting straight to the point, saying, “Jian Wushuang’s strength is too formidable. Now that he’s become the son-in-law of the Yue King, it’s not easy to make a move against him!”","“Hehe, all we need to do is inform Lord Babidi of this news. He will surely grant us considerable power when the time comes!” Sang Biao said nonchalantly.","Both of them were originally ordinary members of their respective families, but ever since encountering Babidi, their strength had suddenly skyrocketed.","They soared to become the pride of their family.","But even with the treasures bestowed by the family, they still felt unsatisfied.","They could only rely on the esteemed Lord Babidi.","Especially when they discovered such a powerful Emperor among their peers, greed consumed their hearts even more, desiring to become stronger.","“Let’s return to the family first for preparations, then go pay respects to Lord Babidi!”","“No problem!”","Once they had made up their minds, they each began their respective cultivation.","Jian Wushuang was quite curious about their cultivation progress. When they fully immersed themselves in cultivation, their divine power had already undergone a subtle transformation.","Within their divine power, Death lurked.","These two fools were being manipulated without even realizing it.","If they continued to cultivate like this, they would surely explode and perish.","The warship flew on, quickly leaving Yue Kingdom behind.","To reach the Yongheng Kingdom, they still needed to cross two more kingdoms.","It would probably take about a month, but Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry.","If he pushed himself, he could return to Yue Kingdom in three days.","Time was ample.","But there was one thing: should he accompany these two when they visited Babidi?","If he was discovered, it would be over for him.","If he didn’t go, he could only control these two first, then attempt soul searching.","But Jian Wushuang’s intuition told him that soul searching would be useless.","These two knew too little.","He could only take one risk.","If the other party’s strength exceeded the Five Tribulation realm, it would be very difficult for him not to be discovered.","If it was below the Five Tribulation realm, there was still some hope.","By then, he would have to send a clone, not risking his main self.","If the clone perished, his main self would need to flee with all his might.","Thinking this through, Jian Wushuang’s main self, carrying a considerable amount of treasures, began to separate.","Before the warship entered the Yongheng Kingdom, Jian Wushuang’s main self stayed within the borders of the Saluo Kingdom, which bordered both Yue Kingdom and the Yongheng Kingdom.","In fact, his clone wasn’t much different from his main self.","It was just the power of the Beast God that was lacking.","The Beast God’s power was within his main body, so his clone couldn’t wield it.","However, he still possessed the power of the Starry Sky.","Before separating from his clone, he infused all the power of the Starry Sky within him.","It could maintain its peak state for an hour.","But it couldn’t be replenished afterwards.","Only an hour’s time.","Once that time passed, his clone would be left with only 100,000-fold divine power, just like an ordinary Tribulation Realm being.","Not even the air could pose a threat.","By then, Jian Wushuang would also willingly give up.","Phew!","Jian Wushuang’s main body transformed into a blade of grass, falling onto the lush green grassland, trampled upon by wolves, just as resilient as ordinary grass.","The clone, on the other hand, entered the Yongheng Kingdom.","The moment Jian Wushuang entered the Yongheng Kingdom, he felt a powerful bloodline force.","It was the aura of the Yongheng Clan.","This was an extremely mysterious group.","Considered a branch of the human race, they were a type of post-natal variant.","The ancestor who opened the Yongheng Kingdom was a powerhouse at the Half-Step Eight Tribulation realm.","Now, he was probably either fallen or trapped in slumber.","That ancestor created the Yongheng Clan, which flourished from the era of the fall of the Celestial Maidens to the present day, still thriving.","It’s said that the current king of the Yongheng Kingdom is a Universe Master at the Six Tribulation realm."]},{"number":5702,"title":"Chapter 5702: Babidi","paragraphs":["Chapter 5702: Babidi","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","On the Ancient Wood Continent, their reputation was considerable, comparable to that of Shi Xiu.","The strength and potential of the Yongheng Clan were closely tied to their bloodline.","The contemporary ruler had awakened the pinnacle bloodline of the Yongheng Clan, ascending from an Emperor to a Universe Master of the Five Tribulation realm. Later, he consolidated his power once again and entered the realm of Six Tribulation.","He was just slightly weaker than that ancestor.","Jian Wushuang learned about the uniqueness of the Yongheng Clan from various sources.","Since the founding of the Yongheng Clan by that ancestor, numerous masters of the Six Tribulation realms had been born, but there was only one Seven Tribulation realm, that ancestor alone.","If it were an ordinary family or force, it would be considered normal.","However, despite the numerous masters of the Six Tribulation realms born from the Yongheng Clan, there had yet to be a second master of the Seven Tribulation realms.","“It seems that the shortcomings of the Yongheng Clan are related to that ancestor!” Jian Wushuang speculated inwardly.","If that ancestor of the Yongheng Clan were a powerhouse of the Eighth Tribulation realm, there would likely be many masters of the Seven Tribulation Realms among the descendants.","If they were to reach the Nine Tribulation realm!","Jian Wushuang dared not believe it.","The Yongheng Clan was indeed very special and powerful.","He admired that ancestor of the Yongheng Clan even more.","Unfortunately, after becoming a Scattered Tribulation cultivator, that ancestor could not advance his own strength, and the descendants could not break through the barrier either.","What’s the point of this!","While he admired, he couldn’t understand why that ancestor cared so much about the descendants.","If he were to sever the connection of the Yongheng Clan’s bloodline, that ancestor would probably not stop at the Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm.","No!","Perhaps without the bloodline eruptions of those descendants, that ancestor might not have achieved the Half-Step Eighth Tribulation Realm.","Jian Wushuang seemed to understand a bit.","It was complementary after all, not as he had imagined.","This time coming to the Yongheng Kingdom, Jian Wushuang wasn’t really here for the Yongheng Clan, so he didn’t dwell on it much.","The families to which Sang Biao and Nikun belonged were subsidiary forces of the Yongheng Clan, with no real power of their own.","In the Yongheng Kingdom, the Yongheng Clan was supreme.","While there were no Universe Masters in the Seventh Tribulation realm, there were plenty in the Six Tribulation. Almost every era saw Universe Masters in the Six Tribulation realm presiding over the Yongheng Clan.","Their heritage was profound, so within the Yongheng Kingdom, there was simply no force capable of rivaling the Yongheng Clan.","Most of the seven-star sects had already declined, relying solely on a Universe Master in the Five Tribulation realm, unable to sustain themselves.","Within the Yongheng Kingdom, they had no say whatsoever.","Hence, many geniuses from subsidiary forces would enter the royalty established by the Yongheng Clan.","Practicing alongside geniuses of the Yongheng Clan, one’s status was determined solely by strength, completely fair, regardless of background.","This aspect was quite commendable.","In ordinary kingdoms, royal families would undoubtedly be superior.","Just like in the Yue Kingdom, Wu Li had always complained, perhaps also related to the system of the Yongheng Kingdom.","“Not good!” Sang Biao sat up straight inside the warship, his face darkening.","When Jian Wushuang heard this, he thought the other party had discovered him, preparing to act at any moment.","“What’s wrong?” Nikun also stood up, seeing Sang Biao’s unusual behavior and understanding the seriousness of the situation, he hurriedly asked, his divine power erupting simultaneously.","With a grim expression, Sang Biao said resentfully, “We’ve wanted men now! The people from the Ancient Wood Sect put a bounty on us. They’ve already arrived in the capital. Just now, people from our family sent me a message, telling us to flee to the Outer Domain!”","“Wanted? How is that possible? It seems like the two of us haven’t offended the Ancient Wood Sect!”","Nikun was startled. He thought carefully but couldn’t figure out why they were wanted by the Ancient Wood Sect.","It seemed that both the clan and the Yongheng Clan were abandoning them.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t be allowed to just run away like this.","For ordinary matters, the Yongheng Clan would intervene to help them settle it.","After all, they were their own people. If they were captured by the Ancient Wood Sect, how could they continue mingling in the future!","The Yongheng Kingdom was also one of the top three super forces. For trivial matters, the Ancient Wood Sect wouldn’t dare to offend the Yongheng Kingdom for these two Emperors.","This time, they must have done something unforgivable.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t be allowed to run away directly to the Outer Domain.","This was obviously to distance themselves from them!","“It must be the Empress of the Yue Kingdom!” Nikun quickly figured it out, then continued, “She is really ruthless. Not wanting to offend the Yongheng Kingdom, she turned around and sold us to the Ancient Wood Sect!”","Sang Biao nodded. They both understood that they used the special power of Death.","That was absolutely forbidden.","Using treasures tainted with the power of Death would be fine, but they both used the power of Death themselves.","And they were only Emperors, they must have felt there were people behind them.","That’s why they came to investigate.","After the Yongheng Clan knew the reason, they gave up on them.","Jian Wushuang also understood.","There was some regret in his heart.","If these two really ran away to the Outer Domain, he would have to give up tracking them and prepare to take action directly.","But he wasn’t in a hurry now.","As they say, those directly involved are often confused while bystanders see clearly.","These two were at death’s door and hadn’t yet seen the situation clearly.","Since the matter was so big, the Yongheng Clan might silence them to distance themselves.","Letting them run to the Outer Domain was just a diversion.","After they arrived in the Outer Domain, they would be silenced directly, which was the real deal.","As a result, it was likely that the Yongheng Clan had some kind of connection with Emperor Babidi.","Unknowingly, Jian Wushuang found himself embroiled in another game.","For now, he remained a spectator, observing how he would make his move.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang’s telepathic range was extensive, always on guard, and it seemed his suspicions were correct.","Sure enough, a powerful expert at the Three Tribulation realm was rushing towards them, seemingly intent on silencing them.","Cloaked in a black robe, completely concealed, the aura around him hinted at the concealment of some precious treasure.","Meanwhile, the two inside the warship were still foolishly debating.","Should they flee directly, or go to seek refuge with Lord Babidi?","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, pondered internally, strategizing his next move.","Once involved, it would become a three-way power struggle.","He swore to annihilate the Death power of the Ancient Wood Sect!","To uncover the Yongheng Clan’s concealment of the Death power!","Lastly, there was Lord Babidi, who could manipulate the Death power!","The first two were in the open, while the latter lurked in the shadows.","If Jian Wushuang intervened, he would be in both light and shadow.","The choice rested upon him.","Once that black-robed expert arrived, those two were doomed.","By then, everything would be settled, and Jian Wushuang would lose all information about Lord Babidi.","He could only dissipate his clone and sneakily return to the Yue Kingdom.","If he intervened to save these two, then devised a plan to have them lead him to Lord Babidi while leaving some clues to attract members of the Ancient Wood Sect.","Using their strength against them.","Perhaps this way would be more perfect.","“Battle!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes glinted with determination.","He was eager to see who this Lord Babidi truly was and whether he had any connection to Mie Sheng.","Relying on his clone on the warship, he directly descended onto the land."]},{"number":5703,"title":"Chapter 5703: Set Up","paragraphs":["Chapter 5703: Set Up","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The warship had just descended, disappearing into the horizon.","However, the traces left above wouldn’t vanish, and Jian Wushuang wasn’t the least bit impatient.","Before long, a terrifying aura flew overhead.","It was that black-robed powerhouse.","A cultivator of the Three Tribulation realm.","Not a Universe Master, nor a member of the Yongheng Clan.","Perhaps he was a hired assassin of the Yongheng Clan. Such tasks required someone with a clean background.","Just as the black-robed elder caught up, Jian Wushuang followed suit.","The plan was just beginning.","Since Jian Wushuang was entering the game, he had to be patient.","He wouldn’t make a move until the crucial moment arrived.","The distance between the black-robed elder and the warship was getting shorter and shorter. Inside the warship, the two individuals also sensed something amiss, feeling a terrifying aura approaching.","But it was too late to evade!","Buzz!","A massive black pillar of Qi shot into the sky, piercing straight through the warship.","“Who is it!”","Both of them flew out simultaneously, looking disheveled.","When they saw the black-robed elder, their eyelids twitched uncontrollably.","A cultivator of the Three Tribulation realm.","Though not a Universe Master, just a Scattered Tribulation expert, they were not opponents that the two of them could handle.","After all, they were merely Emperors.","That Three Tribulation realm cultivator possessed 200,000-fold divine power.","“Senior, why attack us?” Sang Biao still didn’t want to give up at this moment, trying to buy time.","While also sending a message back to the family.","But seeking help now was akin to seeking death.","Both the family and the Yongheng Clan had abandoned them.","Discarded children could not survive!","“You just focus on dying peacefully!” The black-robed elder wasted no words, directly moving to kill.","200,000-fold divine powers erupted, directly attacking Sang Biao and Nikun.","“Let’s go!”","Nikun roared angrily, the power of Death on him surged again.","But facing a Three Tribulation realm expert, they had nowhere to run.","With a single grasp, the black-robed expert threw out a huge wave of energy, dazzling like the sun, directly engulfing the two.","This wave contained 200,000-fold divine power, something two Emperors couldn’t withstand.","“I refuse to accept this!” Nikun resisted frantically, but it was futile.","Sang Biao began to beg for mercy, revealing everything about Babidi.","The black-robed expert remained unmoved, exerting force again, intending to kill the two directly.","At a critical moment, a black mist suddenly rose.","Jian Wushuang, covered in black flames, attacked from behind, his aura transformed into the power of Death.","This Death power wasn’t pure; he extracted it from the power of All Things.","Covered by the power of the Starry Sky, it was indistinguishable to ordinary people.","This was to prepare to deceive Nikun and Sang Biao.","“I, on behalf of Lord Babidi, have come to rescue you two!” Jian Wushuang’s voice changed as he spoke.","With a casual wave, he tore open space and rescued the two from the midst of the energy waves.","The two, who had been in despair, dared not think too much after being rescued. They nodded frantically. When Jian Wushuang asked them where to go, they had no objections.","The black-robed expert frowned when he saw Jian Wushuang.","He was just a death warrior of the Yongheng Kingdom, and he might not know as much insider information as Sang Biao and others.","He couldn’t understand Jian Wushuang’s words at all.","“Thank you, Senior, for saving our lives!” Nikun quickly thanked him after his breath recovered.","Especially when he heard that Jian Wushuang was acting on Lord Babidi’s orders, his heart was filled with even more gratitude.","“You two go and seek refuge with Lord Babidi. I will deal with this person!” Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold as he directly commanded the two.","Sang Biao and Nikun were first stunned, then turned and fled directly.","The black-robed expert wanted to intercept them, but Jian Wushuang stopped him.","“Why bother with these two little guys? Why not play with me instead?” Jian Wushuang flexed his wrist.","The black-robed strongman remained calm. He first communicated with the Yongheng Clan through voice transmission, then said, “You shouldn’t have interfered with me!”","“Haha, is that so?” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, glanced down at the mortal cities below, and said, “Shall we go somewhere deserted?”","“No need!” The black-robed strongman clenched his fists fiercely. His aura surged again, and with a sweep of his arms, the surrounding billions of miles instantly turned to soot.","The next moment, he quietly made his move, heading straight for Jian Wushuang.","200,000-fold divine power erupted with full force, shaking the heavens and the earth.","“To kill, one must be prepared to pay the price!” Jian Wushuang poised himself. As the black-robed expert charged, the surrounding space was instantly shattered, and his figure disappeared from the original spot.","But the black-robed old man was very experienced.","In the instant he disappeared, he had already captured Jian Wushuang’s aura and arrived in advance at the location where Jian Wushuang would land, directly striking Jian Wushuang from behind.","The Eternal Treasure armor on his body shattered directly.","The treasures he carried were all Eternal Treasures.","Facing opponents at the Tribulation Realm, Eternal Treasures were simply inadequate.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang was a super powerhouse purely reliant on strength.","After suffering a setback, he understood that if he wanted to drag the opponent along, he still needed to exert some force.","In this crucial battle, not only did he need to block the opponent, but he also needed to make enough noise.","To catch the attention of those from the Ancient Wood Sect.","Currently, those people should be in the Yongheng Kingdom.","As long as he erupted with a powerful enough aura, he could attract their attention.","Although the overall strength of the Yongheng Kingdom was formidable.","But the number of powerhouses was limited.","For example, a battle at the Four Tribulation realm level was enough to shake the entire Yongheng Kingdom.","Superpowerful individuals at the Five Tribulation realm level rarely made moves in the Ancient Wood Continent.","Usually, they would only act when exploring the Outer Domain.","Otherwise, the Ancient Wood Continent would have been shattered long ago.","These top powerhouses also had an understanding.","If they could avoid taking action in the Ancient Wood Continent, they would.","So generally, top powerhouses at the Five Tribulation realm level would not make moves in the Ancient Wood Continent.","There were already some lessons learned from past events.","The destruction caused by the power of Death served as a warning.","Destroying another continent would greatly burden the Ancient Wood Spacetime.","Jian Wushuang clenched his fists, a flicker at his brow, and roared angrily, “Ah ah ah!!!!”","His entire aura began to skyrocket.","Sang Biao and Nikun had already left, and he had nothing left to hide.","He directly unleashed the power of the Starry Sky.","Although he was a clone, his current combat power could approach the peak of the Three Tribulation realm.","And he also wielded the power of a Universe Master.","He was not someone these Scattered Tribulation realm weaklings could compare to.","The power unleashed by the Starry Sky caused a gust of wind, making the black-robed elder standing there feel a bit unsteady.","Staring at Jian Wushuang in astonishment, curiosity welled up in his heart. When did such a powerhouse appear in the Yongheng Kingdom? He had never heard of it before."]},{"number":5704,"title":"Chapter 5704: Profound Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 5704: Profound Plan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Are you in the Four Tribulation realm?” The black-robed elder couldn’t believe it.","He could tell that Jian Wushuang had no universe of his own, yet he could unleash a much stronger aura than him.","This indicated that the other party might be a powerhouse in the Four Tribulation realm.","That was the only possibility.","He would never have thought, until his death, that Jian Wushuang was an Emperor, hence not having mastery over the universe.","Surrounded by blue electric arcs, Jian Wushuang pointed a finger, “If I didn’t have important matters, you wouldn’t even deserve to see me unleash my full strength!”","This wasn’t just to intimidate the other party.","In his normal state, relying solely on the power of the Beast God, he could unleash 200,000-fold divine power. Coupled with his robust Life power, he could easily defeat a Three Tribulation realm expert with ease.","Unfortunately, he had come as a clone this time.","He also intended to attract the experts of the Ancient Wood Sect, which was why he was unleashing his full strength.","“Die!” Jian Wushuang gathered energy with one hand, a blue divine sword appearing in his hand, brimming with killing intent that filled the sky.","The black-robed expert widened his eyes, at that moment he saw Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source.","6,000 black holes, along with a universe’s secret realm shining brilliantly.","The power of the Origin Source that exceeded his imagination instantly attacked.","In the Ancient Moon Spacetime dominated by divine power, 1,000 black holes would make one the Universe Master.","In other words, Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source heritage was six times that of an ordinary Universe Master.","Of course, this couldn’t be counted as combat power. While his Origin Source was six times that of ordinary Universe Masters, his divine power was much weaker.","After all, the other party’s divine power was dominant.","The Origin Source was only for advancing one’s realm.","Divine power dominance meant breaking all Rule Laws with strength!","Unfortunately, no one could achieve that.","Not even Jian Wushuang believed in it.","Before the black-robed expert fell, he passed Jian Wushuang’s information to the internal members of the Yongheng Clan.","“A Universe Master in the Four Tribulation Realm!”","Hearing this news, the strong members of the Yongheng Clan were quite surprised.","Leaving aside why a Universe Master in the Four Tribulation realm suddenly appeared, just considering the other party’s identity.","Was it an expert sent out by Emperor Babidi?","In the ancient hall, a Universe Master at the Tribulation Realm was furious!","“His reach has gone too far!”","It was evident that he truly believed it.","In fact, the Yongheng Clan didn’t have much connection with Emperor Babidi; they weren’t in a cooperative or hierarchical relationship.","They were more like peers.","Initially, they had thought to lend a hand casually.","But upon realizing not only the lack of gratitude but also being blamed afterward, they decided to ignore the matter altogether.","If Jian Wushuang knew, he would probably burst into laughter.","He had been concerned that the Yongheng Clan might inform Emperor Babidi.","Now it seemed that the two had no connection at all.","“Master, what should we do next?” Outside the ancient hall stood an old servant in black robes, a strong individual at the Five Tribulation realm.","After pondering for a moment, the Universe Master inside the grand hall spoke coldly, “Let the people from the Ancient Wood Sect in. It’s a good opportunity to teach Babidi a lesson and make him understand that this is the Yongheng Kingdom, not some filthy place in the Outer Domain!”","“Yes!” The old servant in black robes respectfully accepted the order.","On the other side, the strong individuals from the Ancient Wood Sect were feeling uneasy at a banquet.","They had come to seek clues about the power of Death but were forcibly brought here by a Universe Master at the Four Tribulation realm from the Yongheng Clan for a drink.","Yet, they couldn’t refuse this face, especially since it was their host’s territory. As the saying goes, “A strong dragon does not crush a local serpent!”","Moreover, the host had promised to help them investigate, so they couldn’t just leave with a cold face. They could only wait.","But every banquet had its end.","They couldn’t believe it would continue indefinitely.","“Brother Qingtian, I just received news that the two individuals you’ve been looking for are in our country’s Riotous Star Sea!”","Upon hearing this, the man in the green shirt couldn’t hide his joy.","He had thought the Eternal Kingdom might make things difficult for them, but unexpectedly, they had actually found the targets for him.","“In that case, I won’t disturb you any longer!” Qingtian Daoist clasped his hands slightly and signaled to the others to prepare for departure.","“Senior Qingtian, you’re too kind. Guests are guests, feel free to ask for help anytime,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Of course!”","Qingtian didn’t delay, taking his people and directly leaving through the void.","He himself was the Universe Master at the Peak of the Four Tribulation realm, accompanied by two scattered experts at the Four Tribulation realm and four Universe Masters at the Three Tribulation realm.","Those four Universe Masters at the Three Tribulation realm were all rising stars of the Ancient Wood Sect, with formidable strength, each wielding around 250,000-fold divine power.","The two scattered experts at the Four Tribulation realm had over 300,000-fold divine power.","As for his own combat power, it was even more terrifying.","He was a Universe Master at the peak of the Four Tribulation realm, not far from stepping into the Five Tribulation realm. His divine power had reached an unimaginable level.","His aura enveloped everyone, and with incredible speed, it would only take an hour for them to reach the Chaotic Sea of Stars.","It was the only unstable area within the Yongheng Kingdom.","Beasts ran rampant, and demonic cultivators were everywhere.","But for them, these were not obstacles.","On the other side, after Jian Wushuang killed the black-robed assassin, he followed the residual aura left by Sang Biao and the others.","Their speed wasn’t slow either. To conserve the power of the Starry Sky, Jian Wushuang had to fly slowly, but he could still keep up, ensuring he didn’t lose track.","As he chased, he also left behind some traces of his aura, so that the experts from the Ancient Wood Sect could follow.","Soon, he sensed the aura of Sang Biao and the others.","They had already entered the Chaotic Sea of Stars.","“They’re actually here!” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed slightly as he felt the chaotic atmosphere within the Chaotic Sea of Stars, understanding why Babidi would hide here.","Searching for the aura of cultivators in this place was incredibly difficult.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang’s residual aura was distinctive, derived from the power of the Starry Sky.","Others couldn’t detect it at all, only he could sense that aura.","Otherwise, it would be like losing direction.","“I wonder if anyone from the Ancient Wood Sect has followed up!” Jian Wushuang worried about the people from the Ancient Wood Sect at this moment.","He feared they might be too foolish.","If they couldn’t keep up, even if he found Babidi, he wouldn’t be able to deal with him, let alone find the source of the power of death from him.","So, he needed external help.","The Daoist Qingtian from the Ancient Wood Sect had already entered the Chaotic Sea of Stars ahead of Jian Wushuang.","But the aura here was chaotic, and they were searching everywhere like headless flies.","“Hmm? There’s the Emperor’s aura!” Daoist Qingtian stood on a huge reef, sensing an aura emanating from the Emperor.","He raised an eyebrow, signaling everyone to surround from all sides.","This was to prevent the other party from escaping again.","Jian Wushuang had been keeping his distance from Sang Biao and the others, so he was flying slowly.","At this moment, he also sensed several auras coming towards him and instantly understood what was happening.","This time he had been careless, in order to leave clues for the people from the Ancient Wood Sect, he hadn’t concealed himself.","As a result, the people from the Ancient Wood Sect arrived too quickly.","They surrounded him.","“Kid, you’d better not resist!” A Universe Master from the Ancient Wood Sect, at the Three Tribulation realm, found that Jian Wushuang was just a slightly stronger Emperor.","So, he was quite relaxed and without any defenses, directly reaching out to capture Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":5705,"title":"Chapter 5705: Are You Threatening Me?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5705: Are You Threatening Me?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Qingtian felt something was amiss and quickly shouted, “Don’t get close to him!”","With that, he rushed towards Jian Wushuang.","But the Universe Master was already close to touching Jian Wushuang.","Upon hearing Qingtian’s shout, he hesitated for a moment, then turned to glance at Qingtian.","But it was this momentary lapse that allowed Jian Wushuang to erupt with the power of the Starry Sky, his strength suddenly soaring.","If his current combat power were converted into divine power, it would be at least 300,000-fold.","The pinnacle of the Three Tribulations realm Universe Masters.","Jian Wushuang pierced through the chest of the newly risen Universe Master with just one hand.","In an instant, he shattered the opponent’s divine body, seizing the Origin Source of his universe.","“Don’t come any closer!” Jian Wushuang roared angrily. “Come closer, and I’ll kill him!”","The plan was getting a bit chaotic at this point, so he could only resort to this tactic.","First, he had to keep these people from acting recklessly. When Sang Biao and Nikun found Babidi, he would lure these people away.","“You all need to hurry!” Jian Wushuang prayed inwardly.","Qingtian instantly appeared in front of Jian Wushuang, his face grim as he stared at him.","“Even if you kill him today, you will also perish. It’s better to cooperate with me. I’ll spare your life!” Qingtian, a seasoned veteran, wasted no time in trying to seize Jian Wushuang’s leadership position.","However, Jian Wushuang just sneered, “Are you trying to threaten me?”","“You can interpret it that way!” Qingtian remained calm, betting that Jian Wushuang wouldn’t dare to risk it.","But he didn’t know that Jian Wushuang was just a clone.","There was nothing he wouldn’t dare to gamble.","Even if this clone perished, he could just create another perfect one.","And to ensure nothing went wrong, his main body had already refined a second perfect clone that was on its way.","When this clone perished, the second one would take its place.","So, he wasn’t worried about perishing at all.","His only concern now was Sang Biao and Nikun, those two fools getting lost. They had been wandering in the Chaotic Sea of Stars for so long, just going in circles.","He didn’t know if they could find Babidi.","At the same time, he also worried that the people from the Ancient Wood Sect might arrive early, and whether that would alert Babidi.","What if he doesn’t come out then!","Sang Biao and Nikun were just pawns, and Babidi wouldn’t stick his neck out for them.","So, there was only one last resort left: to proactively expose his power of LIfe and become bait himself.","Since the other party could manipulate the power of Death, they definitely would want to understand the power of Life as well.","Once he unleashed it, they would feel it immediately.","At that time, there would be no need for him to actively search. They might just come to him with their men.","He could then sit back and watch the show, benefiting from the chaos.","Thinking this, Jian Wushuang once again tried to sense Sang Biao and Nikun, only to find that the two of them were staying in one place without moving.","The direction was very close to here, just a stick of incense’s time away.","If it weren’t for these people surrounding him, he would have arrived long ago.","“Since you want to cooperate, you should at least show some sincerity!” Jian Wushuang backed away while probing, “I know why you’re here, it’s best not to act now!”","“Tsk tsk!” Qingtian exclaimed in surprise, “Are you afraid that I’ll reveal my strength and scare away the people coming to save you?”","He was really good at imagining scenarios, Jian Wushuang admired him for that.","Too bad he guessed wrong.","If his mind were clearer, he wouldn’t have thought that way. He was just a minor character, and shouldn’t have been targeted at this moment to draw out the big fish behind him!","Couldn’t they just follow him in secret?","Jian Wushuang complained inwardly.","The plan was ruined, but fortunately, there was still room for recovery.","But he knew that Babidi had already seen through everything in the Chaotic Sea of Stars.","At the core of the Chaotic Sea of Stars, there was a rhombus-shaped flying boat, standing deep in the sea like a sharp pillar, pointing up and down.","The inside of the flying boat was divided into several layers.","In the core layer of the last level, stood two figures of different races, one tall and one short. In front of them, there was a huge canopy.","These two people could see Jian Wushuang and Qingtian clearly.","They could even see Sang Biao and Nikun clearly.","“Babidi, do you need to deal with these people?” The tall alien expert spoke to Babidi with extreme respect, almost like a servant.","Babidi, short and weak but with an enormous head, shook his head playfully. “It’s rare to encounter a few fresh Universe Masters; it would be a waste to kill them! Dylan, go and meet those two trash. They will surely follow. When the time comes, lead them into the flying boat’s spacetime and have some fun with them!”","“Yes!” Dylan respectfully accepted the order, then disappeared in a flash.","Outside.","Sang Biao and Nikun were almost cursing.","They had been wandering aimlessly in the Chaotic Sea of Stars, unable to find the flying boat where Babidi stayed.","“Damn it, if only we had waited for that Senior!” Nikun lamented.","At this moment, Sang Biao became somewhat sober and felt something was off. He reminded, “Isn’t this a bit too suspicious? Babidi sent someone to rescue us. Normally, there should be others to assist!”","“Who do you think you are? Asking for assistance?” Nikun sneered, but as he said this, both of them froze.","There was nothing wrong with what he said.","What were they, two Emperors, worth?","Why would Babidi save them?","Before they could ponder further, a burly figure appeared in front of them.","“Lord Dylan!” Nikun’s face lit up at the sight of the newcomer.","But deep down, Sang Biao hesitated and worried.","The other was the number one warlord under Babidi, a super strongman of the Five Tribulation realm.","Why would he bother with them, two insignificant pawns?","Even if it was for assistance, any ordinary Tribulation Realm expert would do. There was no need to send such a powerhouse to meet them.","At the same time, the two of them also caught sight of the spacecraft docked within the spacetime.","It was Babidi’s lair.","“Come with me, Babidi wants to see you two!” Dylan’s forehead bore a black mark, resembling some sort of unique totem.","At the sight of the spacecraft, Sang Biao and Nikun’s foreheads also bore the same pattern.","It was a mark of life.","Babidi had planted it on them, capable of controlling their life and death, as well as issuing direct commands.","It was a form of enslavement, but for Sang Biao and Nikun, it was superficial, without any occult techniques, making it indiscernible to others.","However, Dylan’s enslavement was on a deeper level.","Sang Biao and Nikun both fell into a state of trance, following Dylan into the spacecraft in a daze.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang sensed a combination of Death power the moment Dylan appeared.","His gaze flickered, and the blue aura around him surged, directly breaking through the Scattered Tribulation expert behind him."]},{"number":5706,"title":"Chapter 5706: Five Tribulation Realm Expert, Dylan","paragraphs":["Chapter 5706: Five Tribulation Realm Expert, Dylan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“You dare!” Daoist Qingtian roared angrily, bursting with aura and leaping up, instantly catching up to Jian Wushuang.","But the moment he caught up to Jian Wushuang, he hesitated for a moment, his speed greatly reduced.","Because he also felt that powerful aura, and the master of that aura was not weaker than him.","In fact, perhaps even stronger.","Dylan, a strong expert of the Five Tribulations realm.","Stronger than the Universe Lords of the Four Tribulations realm by quite a bit.","Feeling this familiar aura, Daoist Qingtian couldn’t help but stare at Jian Wushuang who was fleeing ahead with some doubt in his heart.","The more he looked, the more he felt like Jian Wushuang was luring him forward.","But that was fine too, as he simultaneously informed the closer royalty of the Shi Kingdom.","The appearance of the power of Death required everyone to exterminate it.","The Ancient Wood Sect was too far away from this place, it would take at least several days to reinforce.","He hadn’t expected that the wielder of the power of death this time would be so powerful.","Originally thought to be some ordinary characters, he hadn’t expected a strong expert of the Five Tribulations realm to appear.","His gaze locked onto Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang also looked at him.","Daoist Qingtian intentionally slowed down, wanting to catch up and investigate.","But little did he know, both of them had already entered into a full-scale confrontation.","Just as Dylan’s aura had just concealed itself, Jian Wushuang suddenly felt something was amiss.","Because that aura was getting closer.","He could sense Dylan’s aura in advance, and Dylan could also sense their aura.","Moreover, this was the other party’s territory. How could they, in this chaotic place, not be detected with their auras exposed recklessly?","He had unique means of detection, and the other party could probably manipulate the power of Death, fearing that they could also sense the auras of other strong experts in this chaotic place.","“Not good!” Daoist Qingtian also sensed the approaching aura, just about to warn, but it was already too late.","Dylan’s figure had already appeared in front of everyone.","The formidable Four Tribulation realm expert who wanted to catch up with Jian Wushuang from the left, unexpectedly ran into Dylan head-on.","“Die!” Dylan’s palm struck deep, aiming directly at the opponent’s vital point.","Buzz!","A surge of powerful divine power instantly tore the expert from the Four Tribulation realm into pieces.","Jian Wushuang’s heart pounded as he threw the Universe Lord of the Three Tribulation realm toward Dylan, while he himself retreated, trying to get closer to Daoist Qingtian.","Watching this scene, Daoist Qingtian cursed inwardly.","He had long felt that Jian Wushuang was somewhat suspicious, and the result was just as he expected.","“Thief, how dare you!” Daoist Qingtian couldn’t care less and could only grit his teeth and rescue the Universe Lord.","As for Jian Wushuang, there was no time to deal with him.","In this way, it became a battle between the two of them, unrelated to Jian Wushuang.","But Dylan’s actions surprised Jian Wushuang, who had just stabilized his figure.","The burly figure of Dylan did not make a move against the Universe Lord of the Three Tribulation realm.","Lord Babidi had instructed earlier that these people still had their uses.","As for the expert from the Four Tribulation realm whom he had just annihilated in an instant, he was just a Scattered Tribulation cultivator, of no use even if he entered the flying boat.","Mainly because he failed to control the power within his body and ended up being killed accidentally.","“Dylan, why don’t you make your move!” Jian Wushuang exerted a Thought power on Nikun. Although it was already severed now, when they met just now, he learned the other’s name.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s shout, Dylan slowly turned his head, his eyes revealing a fierce light.","With just one glance, Jian Wushuang fell silent.","The overwhelming sense of oppression made it difficult for him to breathe.","A super powerhouse of the Five Tribulation realm.","Although the Universe Origin Source had already collapsed, the remaining power was still too much for ordinary strong individuals to confront directly.","Even Qingtian Daoist felt a heavy pressure in his chest, despite his strength.","Fortunately, Dylan hadn’t made a move yet, which allowed Qingtian to breathe a sigh of relief and refrain from advancing further.","In his heart, he could only pray for the strong from Shi Kingdom to arrive quickly.","Once they started fighting, they wouldn’t be able to hold on for long.","Moreover, he had no idea if Dylan had any other strong individuals behind him.","Jian Wushuang’s expression wasn’t too pleasant either, but thankfully, he was cautious enough this time, only sending a clone.","Otherwise, he might have perished today.","That guy named Babidi hadn’t shown up yet.","The fact that a power expert like Dylan was a subordinate implied that Babidi’s strength might surpass Dylan’s by far.","He might even be a super expert of the Six Tribulations realm.","What to do?","For a moment, everyone remained suspended in mid-air.","“Will you enter voluntarily, or shall I throw you in?” Dylan pointed, opening a crack behind him.","Inside was pitch black, nothing discernible.","With that, he tossed the Three Tribulation Universe Master inside.","Qingtian Daoist directly transmitted to the remaining Scattered Tribulation expert, while his figure flickered, wrapping the three Universe Masters behind him with divine power.","It seemed like he was preparing to flee.","Jian Wushuang just reacted when he sensed a surge of formidable divine power erupting.","It was the old man in the nine-stripe robe.","A Four Tribulation expert, although Scattered, at this moment, unleashed a divine power exceeding 330,000-fold.","Before Dylan could make a move, he instantly appeared before him.","Channeling all his divine power, he gathered it into his hands, emitting a muffled sound that shattered the firmament.","A gloomy black aura burst forth.","Jian Wushuang observed closely as the Four Tribulation expert directly ignited his divine body.","This was going to be a fight to the death.","Meanwhile, Qingtian was fleeing without a glance back.","Jian Wushuang didn’t care much. After all, he was a clone. Moreover, attempting to escape from a Five Tribulation realm powerhouse was simply too naive.","Qingtian was a Four Tribulation realm Universe Master, so he had a piece of information he possessed but Jian Wushuang didn’t.","The gap between Universe Master and Scattered Tribulation realm experts was significant.","After all, the Universe Master possessed the Divine Power Origin Source.","While divine bodies were hard to restore, the recovery of the Origin Source was swift!","Furthermore, the divine power bestowed by the Origin Source was incredibly potent, often doubling one’s combat prowess.","Of course, this was overall combat strength.","Under normal circumstances, a Four Tribulation realm expert could unleash up to a maximum of 350,000-fold divine power.","But a Four Tribulation Universe Master could unleash up to 400,000-fold.","And there was no upper limit.","The heaven-defying ones could unleash up to 500,000-fold divine power.","Scattered Tribulation Realm experts, lacking the Divine Power Origin Source, couldn’t possibly unleash such immense divine power.","350,000-fold divine power was already the limit. Even if one had the ability to exceed this divine power, attempting to unleash it would only lead to the rupture of the divine body.","It wasn’t worth the risk!","As Dylan sensed the divine power emanating from his opponent at close range, a smirk formed at the corner of his lips.","The divine power of other Scattered Tribulation experts was fixed at a certain value.","But he didn’t have such limits.","Because Lord Babidi had reconstructed his divine body.","There was no vitality in his body, only endless power of Death.","He was already like a dead man, no matter how he erupted, it would all be the same."]},{"number":5707,"title":"Chapter 5707: Blue Jian Wushuang","paragraphs":["Chapter 5707: Blue Jian Wushuang","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He was already dead, so he could not be more dead, right?","Boom!","Dylan’s aura erupted completely, facing the Scattered Tribulation realm expert in the nine-stripe robe with just a simple punch.","This punch, seemingly ordinary, contained the power of Death.","The Scattered Tribulation realm expert just attempted to block it, only to find his arm burst directly.","A whirlwind shattered half of his body.","His divine body completely exploded.","“So fragile!” Dylan sneered, another punch shattered the opponent’s chest directly this time.","The Scattered Tribulation realm expert, already in a half-dead state, was thrown by Dylan directly into the crack.","That was the entrance to the flying boat.","Jian Wushuang also understood somewhat. The other party didn’t want them to die so easily.","After dealing with the Scattered Tribulation realm expert, Dylan’s figure leaped up again. With his divine power rising once more, he caught up with Qingtian and the others who had already fled far away.","While chasing these people, he didn’t forget to glance at Jian Wushuang.","With just one glance, Jian Wushuang felt that his divine body was somewhat unsupported.","His clone’s divine body was only 100,000-fold.","Without the blessing of the Beast God Weapon, nor the Origin Source of divine power, and the divine power martial arts, he could only display the basic divine body.","However, his clone’s combat power relied not on the divine body, but on the power of the Starry Sky.","When using divine power, Jian Wushuang’s aura was white.","When using the power of the Beast God, the aura on his body was dark red, matching the Beast God Weapon’ eyes.","The power of the Starry Sky was blue.","The same color as the sky.","It also represented his peak state.","Blue Jian Wushuang.","Among peers, in this state, he was invincible.","But facing a Five Tribulation realm expert, even if his true body came here, there was no hope.","However, Jian Wushuang still had a kind of eager-to-try feeling deep down.","If in his peak state, fully displaying the Starry Sky Chronicles, he wondered if he could defeat the opponent.","He could only contemplate such matters; truly attempting them seemed unnecessary, given the immense risks involved.","It sufficed to leave his clone here to play around; there was no need to truly push himself to the limit.","His primary reason for coming here was to ascertain whether the individual manipulating the power of Death was Mie Sheng.","At present, it seemed that it was not Mie Sheng.","It was the Emperor, Babidi.","However, whether the two were connected was beyond his knowledge.","He hoped there was no connection; if they knew each other and pursued similar goals, it would be a headache for him.","Life and Death were archenemies, impossible to shake off no matter where one went.","Heart power, Thought power, Devour, All Things, Life, and the Starry Sky.","He had already perfected his Heart power, the easiest of them all; with a bit more effort, he could reach the peak of Heart power.","Thought power, on the other hand, was different, with countless thoughts making it the most troublesome.","His Thought power was now not far from perfection.","Once he reached the Universe Master, he would naturally achieve perfection in Thought power.","As for the power of Devour, it had no limits, only growing stronger with increased strength.","It was related to one’s own cultivation realm.","It belonged to the realm of space.","And this kind of power was not mainstream.","Unlike Heart power, Thought power, and the power of All Things.","It was obscure.","The power of All Things, in fact, was possessed by everyone, but compared to him, these people seemed to lack it entirely.","Their comprehension of All Things was singular.","While his comprehension of All Things was perfect in every way.","It was more perfect than the path of Myriad Daos.","The “Giant God Clan” in the Starry Sky was inherently the host of All Things.","That’s why his power of All Things and the power of Life were needed in the first place.","The power of Life corresponded more to the Tribulation Realm.","Replenishing vitality.","While the power of All Things was primarily domineering.","Thinking of the Origin Source of the Master of All Things, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but tremble.","If the Master of All Things were still alive, even in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, they would be an unparalleled genius.","Surpassing even the likes of Shi Xiu in strength.","It’s a pity that they were born out of their time.","If it were in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, their achievements would not be weaker than those of Qishen.","This is the deepest manipulation of power they have achieved so far.","The power of Life can only be considered as an assistant, but it will play a significant role in the future universe.","Of course, the premise is a profound understanding of All Things.","As for the power of the Starry Sky, it becomes even more mysterious when mastered.","From observation and borrowing to complete mastery, it resembles a blueprint of the future, much like his Origin Source.","In the future, he is destined to illuminate the Starry Sky.","That’s why he is able to grasp such powerful forces ahead of time.","Because this kind of power was too overwhelming, he could not maintain it normally, only using it in battle.","Even then, it burdened him heavily. He would not use it unless absolutely necessary.","Moreover, this was the power of the Starry Sky after it has been diluted through the Eternal Ancient Transformation, a modification of the Starry Sky power.","In the future, when he becomes the Universe Master, he must refine the Eternal Ancient Transformation, using the purest and richest power of the Starry Sky.","Of course, the power of the Starry Sky would also advance along with his Origin Source.","When he illuminated all the stars in his Origin Source, the power of the Starry Sky would probably be the strongest.","Right now, not a single universe was illuminated, there was still a long way to go.","When he illuminated a universe, he would directly surpass the first Three Tribulation realm and become the Universe Master.","With a strong Origin Source, he could naturally form a universe within his body.","This was something only achievable at the Eighth Tribulation realm, but he will be able to do it at the Three Tribulation realm.","It was also a mobile Dao Arena.","A natural advantage.","And soon, his universe could create life.","That was the most terrifying aspect.","The power of Death could create death.","The power of Life, naturally, could create life.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow.","“Death!” Creating death in the universe?","Wouldn’t that be like the Scattered Tribulation?","He seemed to realize something.","Then he suddenly looked at Dylan.","At this moment, Dylan had caught up with Qingtian.","Both sides were engaged in a deadly battle.","The divine power erupted by Qingtian Dao exceeded 400,000-fold.","It was incredibly powerful.","Seeing that he could hold his own against Dylan.","But Jian Wushuang saw through it at a glance.","Dylan still had something hidden.","A black aura erupted from his body.","A familiar scene!","He had seen it on Nikun and Sang Biao.","The power of Death.","With that power, even Emperors could increase their divine power to several hundred thousand folds.","Not to mention a super strong person beyond the Five Tribulation realm.","As soon as this power burst out, Dylan’s divine power soared to over 500,000-fold.","Qingtian was completely desperate.","Over 500,000-fold divine power.","This was already the threshold of a Universe Master beyond the Five Tribulation realm.","In his own Dao Arena, he could unleash such formidable strength, and he knew very well what that represented.","He was simply not a match.","In his own Dao Arena, he could fight across cultivation realms.","But this wasn’t his Dao Arena.","“I am the direct disciple of Master Mushi of the Ancient Wood Sect. Dare to touch me!” Qingtian roared angrily, but the next moment, he was violently beaten by Dylan.","The red skin behind Dylan tightly bound Qingtian, hanging him in front, each punch pounding Qingtian’s chest.","“Why don’t you call the Divine Wood King here, see if I’m afraid!” Dylan sneered."]},{"number":5708,"title":"Chapter 5708: Babidi’s Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 5708: Babidi’s Plan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In his eyes, all the eight-star sects were nothing but dog sh*t.","Once Emperor Babidi’s plan succeeded, the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime would be theirs.","Even the nine-star sect, the Ancient Moon Sect, would have to crawl over to shine their shoes.","Such arrogant thoughts, one wonders how many teeth would be knocked out of anyone who came to know of them.","Daoist Qingtian was utterly hopeless.","His strength was inadequate.","His background was useless.","All he could do was await death.","Dylan played around for a bit, feeling bored, then grabbed Qingtian along with three others, and returned together to the outside of the rift.","“Why haven’t you gone in yet?!” Dylan looked at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s expression remained unchanged, showing no intention of making a move, and strode in directly.","Right in front of Dylan, he swaggered in.","What did he have to fear?","Another clone had already arrived nearby. The clone’s aura was very weak, and the avatar transformed into a piece of broken stone floating in the storm.","Once this clone was done for, he would let that other clone keep an eye on this place.","Even if he fell in this time, it wouldn’t matter.","His current strength not being enough didn’t mean it wouldn’t be enough later.","As long as he followed the other party, sooner or later, he would go and raid their lair to see what they were up to.","Seeing Jian Wushuang enter straightforwardly, Dylan sneered, then carried a few people and followed suit.","After they all entered, the crack healed again, as if it had never appeared.","Shi Kingdom!","Upon receiving the plea for help from the Ancient Wood Sect, the royal family convened a small-scale meeting with calm deliberation.","They discussed the matter at hand.","Though the power of Death was a common enemy, the Shi Kingdom couldn’t afford to act recklessly towards them!","If news of such behavior spread, the reputation they had painstakingly built would crumble in an instant.","“No need to rush. Let them weaken first, and then we can crush them, which will only enhance the Shi Kingdom’s prestige!” declared an elder sitting in a high position, tapping the armrest of the throne.","There was unanimous agreement below.","“Shi Da, you shall go to the Fire Demon World and have the divine beings dispatch a few Fire Demons to accompany you. Make sure to take down the opponent!” commanded a stout, short man with a tail swaying behind him as he rose from his seat.","He was a superpower who had undergone physical transformation.","A powerhouse of the Six Tribulation realm.","Just as Shi Kingdom was arranging its forces, the Yongheng Kingdom also received a plea for help.","However, the Yongheng Kingdom didn’t just brush it off.","Instead, they swiftly gathered several superpowers of the Five Tribulation realm and headed for the Chaotic Sea of Stars.","They weren’t going to assist the strongmen of the Ancient Wood Sect but were aiming to silence them.","The Yongheng Kingdom had deep ties with Babidi.","Otherwise, Babidi wouldn’t have chosen to infiltrate the Yongheng Kingdom.","“Kill them all, leave none alive!” commanded a group of bizarre-looking extraterrestrial powerhouses of the Five Tribulation realm below.","They mobilized in full force.","In an instant, a storm gathered over the Chaotic Sea of Stars.","In the lowest level of the flying boat.","Babidi received numerous messages.","Some came from within the Ancient Wood Sect, while others originated from Shi Kingdom and the Yongheng Kingdom.","He narrowed his eyes and sighed, “After scheming for so long, it seems it’s time to execute the plan ahead of schedule!”","For him, the more powerful individuals arrived, the better.","Ideally, they would all be Universe Masters.","However, this time, among the superpowers from the three factions, only Scattered Tribulation realm powerhouses arrived.","Clearly, none were willing to take risks.","Even though the Yongheng Kingdom had a cooperative relationship with Babidi, they were hesitant to send Universe Masters.","The Ancient Wood Sect was rather careless the first time, allowing a Universe Master of the Four Tribulation realm to go.","Being a Universe Master represented infinite possibilities. Even if it meant sending a Six Tribulation realm powerhouse to their death, they had to retrieve Daoist Qingtian.","Dylan, after dumping everyone on the top floor, descended directly to the bottom through a hole at the center of the spatial boat.","“Lord Babidi!” Dylan bowed and stood aside.","“Everything’s ready, we can begin!”","Upon hearing this, Dylan began a special technique in front of a crystal ball.","At the top floor of the spatial boat, when everyone arrived, they didn’t notice anything special.","Dylan’s direct departure left them somewhat bewildered, but at least they weren’t immediately killed.","Qingtian was severely injured.","After scanning the surroundings, he felt assured they were being imprisoned.","The other Three Tribulation Universe Masters were somewhat worried.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t worried, but rather curious, looking around.","“Hey, aren’t you on their side?”","Among the group, the only female Universe Master spoke to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang ignored her.","He wished they were on the same side.","Qingtian gestured to his companion, indicating not to talk to Jian Wushuang.","They had been careless this time.","Now, no amount of talk would help; they could only wait for rescue.","But before they could relax their vigilance, the spatial surroundings began to change.","The previously cramped space turned into a star.","Above was desolate, while the sky was filled with stars.","“Be careful!” Qingtian Daoist shouted angrily.","Even Jian Wushuang was startled.","He quickly rose into the air, but found the gravity of this star to be immense, at least 10,000 times stronger than the outside world’s gravity.","As he rose, he noticed countless purple crawling creatures emerging below.","Void!","It’s the Void Crawlers.","He encountered them in the Qishen Temple before.","These creatures are the most troublesome.","He remembered what Frolasa said back then, these crawlers originate from the Starry Sky.","The Void Crawlers in the Qishen Temple originally attached themselves to his eggshell when he was born from the Starry Sky.","“How could there be such things here!” Jian Wushuang frowned.","Qingtian and the others had never encountered nor heard of such creatures.","After realizing that these crawlers weren’t powerful, they all breathed a sigh of relief.","It was mainly because the sheer density of these crawlers, coupled with their unfamiliarity, caused such a reaction.","Now that they realized they weren’t formidable, they didn’t take them seriously and easily killed off a large group.","But Jian Wushuang knew the danger these crawlers posed.","Frolasa had warned him before; once these crawlers reached a certain number, even powerhouses from the Giant God Clan would find them troublesome.","After all, they were beings from the Starry Sky, and Jian Wushuang dared not underestimate them.","He had been avoiding these crawlers without making a move.","Qingtian and the others, however, were casually slaughtering them.","After a while, the number of crawlers didn’t decrease at all, but their individual strengths kept increasing.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang noticed that these crawlers carried a certain power that could corrode the void.","The spatial stability of this place had already begun to falter.","Qingtian and the others also realized that something was amiss.","Among them, only the four Universe Masters at the Three Tribulation realm still had combat power.","Their divine powers had begun to decline.","The gravity here was already much higher than outside, and the corroded void made it impossible for these Universe Masters to manipulate space."]},{"number":5709,"title":"Chapter 5709: Despair and Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 5709: Despair and Death","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The divine power also increased very little.","It was all 250,000-fold divine power.","Qingtian endured the backlash and forcibly used divine power to disperse the void crawlers around him.","However, after the collapse and erosion of the surrounding void, countless void crawlers crawled out from within.","The originally intact space became riddled with holes.","Moreover, within these openings, countless void crawlers continued to emerge.","The first to suffer was the expert of the Four Tribulation realm.","He was a Scattered Tribulation expert, and coupled with the heavy injuries inflicted by Dylan previously, he couldn’t hold on anymore.","His entire being was submerged in the ocean of void crawlers.","After the crawlers besieged and eroded him, not even a trace of aura was left.","Qingtian watched in horror.","Despair!","Despair that emanated from the depths of his soul.","How could he be so unlucky, losing his life so easily on a random mission?","He was a Universe Master with infinite possibilities!","He was a Universe Master who had only recently reached Four Tribulations.","He had every hope of reaching the Five Tribulation realm.","But alas, he was about to Fall.","Jian Wushuang swallowed hard.","This time, it seemed he couldn’t find an answer.","Originally, he had thought that at the very least, he would see Emperor Babidi.","But he didn’t even catch a glimpse of the other party’s face.","Losing the avatar clone wasn’t regrettable, but it was regrettable for his plans.","They had just begun and already met with defeat.","The void crawlers piled up like mountains, and Jian Wushuang casually used the Sword Intent of the Starry Sky to kill those mountain-like void crawlers.","But they couldn’t be completely killed.","The lowest level of the flying boat.","“Sir, they can’t hold on much longer!” Dylan looked at the sky and then at Babidi.","Babidi remained calm and composed.","“That guy with the blue aura is a bit strange!” Babidi’s eyes revealed greed.","He stared at Jian Wushuang and felt increasingly uneasy.","He saw that Jian Wushuang had the combat power of a Universe Master.","But Babidi couldn’t sense any aura of Death within him.","Among the people under the sky, everyone except Jian Wushuang had already shown aura of Death.","Because of the crisis of Death, the aura of Death would arise.","Babidi needed this aura.","He could condense it into the power of Death and continuously gather it to the lower layer of the ship.","By now, his crystal ball had accumulated a considerable amount of Death power.","All this Death power came from the aura of Death emitted by Qingtian and the others.","But there was never any Death power emanating from Jian Wushuang.","This puzzled Babidi.","Whether it was the Tribulation Realm or the Universe Master, they would emit the aura of Death before facing death.","But why was there none from Jian Wushuang?","With a sweep of his hands, Qingtian and the others in the sky were instantly imprisoned.","Only Jian Wushuang remained free to move.","The void crawlers didn’t rush towards Qingtian and the others as expected but instead charged at Jian Wushuang.","This surprised Jian Wushuang!","Why were they suddenly targeting him?","Seeing Qingtian and the others restrained but not dead, Jian Wushuang gave up resistance.","He thought these people must be done for if they were being restrained.","So, he decided to play dead too!","The power of the Starry Sky could last for half an hour, and he immediately suppressed his own aura, returning to his normal state.","His figure submerged into the sea of insects!","Upon seeing this, Emperor Babidi let out a sinister smile. “I thought you could hold on longer, but it seems not!”","He sensed Jian Wushuang’s extraordinary strength, yet couldn’t fully comprehend it.","Thus, he didn’t want Jian Wushuang to Fall just like that.","With a flick of his finger, he imprisoned Jian Wushuang.","“Open the next layer, restore their Origin Sources to their peak!” Emperor Babidi exclaimed excitedly.","Dylan complied without error.","He couldn’t let these people Fall just like that.","The Scattered Tribulation expert didn’t matter. It was fine if he died. But the use of the Universe Masters was immense.","Emperor Babidi still needed to continuously extract the power of Death from these people.","With a slight movement, Jian Wushuang’s figure disappeared from the sea of insects.","In the blink of an eye, everyone was back inside the flying boat.","But they had descended into another layer.","This layer was different from the first one.","Here, there were six healing chambers.","At this moment, they were all soaking inside the healing chambers.","Their bodies were enveloped in green liquid.","Jian Wushuang felt incredibly comfortable in his body, a sensation he was familiar with.","At the same time, he understood what the green liquid around him was.","It was the source of life!","Could anyone feel uncomfortable soaking in it?","Crack!","Jian Wushuang glanced sideways.","One of the healing chambers had been broken from the inside.","The person who walked out was none other than Daoist Qingtian.","His aura had returned to its peak.","Seeing him recover, the other Universe Masters of the Three Tribulation realm also broke out of their chambers one after another.","It wasn’t that they didn’t want to soak anymore, but once vitality reached its peak, soaking further would backlash against the body. They couldn’t afford such risks.","Moreover, they were in a strange space where life and death were entirely out of their control. They had no leisure to seek small advantages.","Jian Wushuang was different.","He came here to see what the mastermind behind the scenes was up to, and to see if Emperor Babidi, who controlled the power of Death, was connected to Mie Sheng.","So, he wasn’t in a hurry at all; he just continued soaking.","Qingtian and the others also noticed that Jian Wushuang had been in the healing chamber all along, so they approached.","“He doesn’t seem to be injured, why is he still in treatment?”","The female Universe Master gazed at Jian Wushuang’s healing chamber with some surprise.","Daoist Qingtian shook his head, reminding, “Don’t worry about that now. He’s not on the same side as us. Let’s first see if there’s an exit nearby. We can’t afford to wait here and die!”","“Yes!”","The group split up to search, while Jian Wushuang continued soaking.","He absorbed the Life power to his heart’s content, then converted it into power of All Things.","The power of All Things transformed into the Universe Origin Source, which then became the power of the Starry Sky.","Though not entirely pure, something was better than nothing.","At least he could prolong his peak state.","And he could stall for time here. What threat would make Qingtian and the others not act?","The key was, his guess was right.","A cage appeared in the middle aisle of the chamber.","There was a layer of black cloth over the cage.","As for what was inside the cage, they didn’t know, nor did they want to know.","But they had no choice.","The black cloth disappeared, revealing the entity inside the cage.","At that moment, the cage also began to weaken.","The entity within, with sharp claws, tore the cage apart directly.","And crawled out from inside.","“The Yongheng Clan!” Qingtian exclaimed in shock.","There was no mistake.","It was indeed the Yongheng Clan.","Their aura was identical.","He had dealt with many strong members of the Yongheng Clan before and was familiar with their unique bloodline.","“This fellow...” Qingtian was about to say something comforting.","But the powerful member of the Yongheng Clan stood up straight, their body continuously expanding, ultimately evolving into a humanoid beast, their aura skyrocketing.","Roar!","With a roar, the powerful member of the Yongheng Clan directly attacked the nearest Three Tribulation Universe Master."]},{"number":5710,"title":"Chapter 5710 The Power of Life Was Exposed","paragraphs":["5710 The Power of Life Was Exposed","....","The razor-sharp claws tore the somewhat unlucky Universe Master to shreds.","As the Origin Source condensed, not yet fully restoring its flesh, the humanoid beast’s mouth elongated, spewing venom.","Accompanying the venom was a terrifying black column of air.","Qingtian couldn’t care less about the consequences; seeing the Universe Master about to perish, he hastily intervened, kicking the beast’s head directly into the wall of the cabin.","The beast wiped a trace of blood from its mouth corner, its eyes filled with murderous intent.","Sensing that the beast’s strength wasn’t particularly formidable, Qinglian’s courage grew, prompting everyone to step back.","He wanted to confront it alone.","In the lower cabin, Babidi and Dylan stared wide-eyed at the sky dome.","So engrossed were they that they forgot to enhance the beast’s divine power, resulting in the creature being thrashed by Qinglian.","At the peak of his recovery, Qinglian erupted with over 400,000-fold divine power, while the beast’s was barely reaching 400,000-fold.","In Qingtian’s hands, it was constantly being trampled.","Originally, he was sent here to force these people to reveal the aura of Death.","But now, he himself was beginning to fear death.","However, Babidi couldn’t care less about this trace of Death power.","Because he had been keeping an eye on Jian Wushuang.","‘It’s been a quarter of an hour!” Dylan exclaimed.","Babidi retrieved a white jade jug shaped like a water pot from behind him,","“Is there any spare vitality left?” he asked.","Dylan shook his head in response.","“Go to the third cabin and drain all the Scattered Tribulation people brought by the Yonghong Clan, then inject it into that kid’s healing chamber!” Babidi ordered. “If that’s still not enough, drain these Universe Masters as well!”","Dylan was somewhat surprised, but he didn’t dare to question it, merely nodding in acknowledgment.","Babidi, on the other hand, was excitedly pacing in front of the celestial canopy.","The more vibrant the vitality, the stronger the power of Death.","He never imagined that he would encounter such a miraculous thing.","A weak Universe Master could actually devour so much Life power.","So how strong would the power of Death erupting from the opponent be at the moment of death?!","Babidi was looking forward to it.","Originally, according to his plan, even if he attracted a large number of strong individuals ahead of schedule, it would still take a long time to guide them.","But now it might be possible to achieve it in one go.","To obtain enough power of Death from Jian Wushuang alone.","But what he would do with this power of Death upon arrival, remains unknown.","Inside the treatment chamber, Jian Wushuang paid no attention to the replenishment of vitality at all.","Instead, he felt that the Life power was getting weaker and weaker, nowhere near as pure as his own. He was ready to go out.","Because after seeing Qingtian beat up that exotic beast, he felt there was no danger,","If there was indeed any danger, he would face it inside the treatment chamber just the same.","The Life power inside the treatment chamber was getting weaker and weaker, and he couldn’t be bothered to","convert it.","Not only would it be a waste of time, but each conversion would also consume some of his Origin Source, so instead of gaining, he would end up losing.","Inside the chamber, Qingtian was becoming stronger and stronger, but he still couldn’t kill the exotic beast. He also noticed that the strength of this exotic beast should not be weaker than his own, it just hadn’t fully erupted yet.","This made him very puzzled.","Clearly possessing strong divine power, yet not erupting.","What was the purpose of this?","As for Jian Wushuang, Qingtian had long stopped paying attention to him,","He only felt that Jian Wushuang was somewhat peculiar. When facing death on the upper level, he was indifferent, and he didn’t fight or seize, forming a stark contrast with the outside world. After coming to the flying boat, it seemed more like he was here to visit.","Jian Wushuang was currently inside the treatment chamber, and he remained there, not coming out. No one knew what he was doing.","Did he intend to push his Origin Source to its limits?","Qingtian found","somewhat amusing.","But the next moment, he couldn’t find amusement anymore.","“Dylan!”","Seeing the other party, Qingtian felt like a mouse encountering a cat, radiating fear from the depths of his heart.","The thrashing from outside had already cast a shadow over his psyche.","However, Dylan didn’t even spare a glance at Qingtian.","Instead, he walked towards the powerful beast of the Yongheng Clan.","The expression on the other’s face upon seeing Dylan was similar to Qingtian’s.","It seemed they had all been ravaged by Dylan!","“Lord Dylan!” The beast continued to retreat, a sense of foreboding creeping into his heart.","Especially upon seeing the jade pot in Dylan’s hand, he couldn’t help but swallow nervously.","Inside the treatment, chamber, Jian Wushuang also saw Dylan’s arrival. At first, Jian Wushuang thought of leaving the chamber, but seeing Dylan, he suddenly changed his mind.","He preferred to stay comfortably inside the treatment chamber and would not go out no matter what.","“Trash!” Dylan glanced at the beast, his arm reaching deep to seize the creature’s head, the speed of his movement too fast. For one to discern.","The beast was caught, unable to move.","Dylan took the jade pot and directly inserted it into the creature’s chest.","Then, a green liquid emerged from the creature’s body, flowing into the jade pot.","This scene made Qingtian and the others continuously retreat.","What was being sucked away was the creature’s vitality.","The strong of the Yongheng Clan were undergoing tribulation,","Once their vitality was sucked away, it meant death.","They never imagined that Dylan would even target his own kind.","In the span of a few breaths, the vitality of a Four Tribulation realm expert was completely drained, not a","single trace left.","The physical body also shriveled to an extreme.","Dylan gazed into the hollow eyes of the beast and his lifeless body.","They all understood that the beast had Fallen, and perished.","Dylan shook the jade pot, feeling the well of Life power inside brimming. He walked straight towards Jian Wushuang’s healing chamber.","“What is he going to do?” Jian Wushuang widened his eyes, a bad premonition creeping into his heart. Trying to break free to disrupt the healing chamber, he found himself completely immobilized.","‘Eternal Ancient Transformation!” Jian Wushuang erupted with all his might, blue flames surging as he broke through the restraint..","Boom!","The healing chamber was completely destroyed, and Jian Wushuang evaporated the remaining liquid on his body, staring fiercely at Dylan.","Seeing Jian Wushuang suddenly go berserk, Dylan paused for a moment and said, ‘It seems you have","recovered!”","He glanced down at the jade pot in his hand, feeling like it was a little bit wasteful.","After all, it contained the vitality of a Four Tribulation realm powerhouse.","Under the gaze of everyone, Dylan inserted the jade pot into his own body.","But this time, he wasn’t devouring his own Life power; instead, he absorbed the Life power within the jade pot.","With such immense vitality absorbed into his body, Dylan’s strength surged once again.","With the power of a Scattered Tribulation realm cultivator, he rivaled that of a Half-Step Six Tribulation realm","expert.","“It’s time you all see what true fear is!” Dylan tossed away the jade pot and attacked directly.","The raging divine power was suffocating.","While the others indeed felt fear, Jian Wushuang remained unmoved.","He now understood; these people never intended to kill them, but rather to make them despair."]},{"number":5711,"title":"Chapter 5711 Fear in the Heart","paragraphs":["5711 Fear in the Heart","....","Ile didn’t know what they were thinking.","Anyway, Jian Wushuang wasn’t afraid. At worst, if his avatar fell, he wouldn’t lose much.","The only thing missing was knowing who was behind it all.","In the depths of the core warehouse, Babidi watched Jian Wushuang closely, also noticing some issues.","Simultaneously, he halted Dylan’s actions.","Dylan’s figure froze in mid-air, looking somewhat awkward!","“Come back, I have a plan!” Dylan smirked.","Inside his flying boat, fear gripped everyone, and death loomed over all.","No one would be spared.","He had already spotted Jian Wushuang’s vulnerability.","Seeing Dylan retreat, the others glanced sideways, feeling a bit uneasy, unsure of what the other party was up","to.","Qingtian turned to Jian Wushuang, asking, “You don’t understand anything about this place?","“What do you think!” Jian Wushuang rolled his eyes.","The other party was too foolish. They hadn’t figured it out yet; he wasn’t one","He was just using Qingtian.","As Dylan retreated, the central passage in the cabin also opened.","Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate at all, heading directly towards the passage.","He couldn’t wait to meet. Babidi and squeeze some information out of him.","Babidi’s group at all.","Descending through the passage, entering the next level, the layout was exactly the same as the previous two levels.","It seemed they hadn’t reached the core level yet.","After scanning the surroundings, Jian Wushuang waited quietly for the other party’s move.","And at that moment, Qingtian also descended.","However, this time Qingtian directly descended to the next level. Jian Wushuang tried to follow, but was held back by some force.","Accompanying him were four other Three Tribulation Universe Masters.","“What’s going on?” Jian Wushuang’s expression revealed his surprise.","Why were they being treated differently?","Placing the five of them on one level, was there some other purpose?","Buzz!","Before they could ponder further, they were already being teleported away.","Or rather, the spatial configuration of the chamber had changed, but they were still within the flying vessel.","The live of them simultaneously arrived in a vast beast-lighting arena.","Within the arena were arranged five platforms, each occupied by one person.","There were no spectators, only desolation pervaded the scene.","What’s fake is indeed fake.","Jian Wushuang slightly closed his eyes, using his Thought power to observe.","For him, his One Thought Universe could achieve the same effect. When he became a Universe Master, it","would be even more achievable.","Such means were nothing to him.","He had returned to the Mahayana Spirit Mountain in the past. The current illusion was truly child’s play to","him.","Ding!","But just as he felt disdainful, he sensed the arrival of five unfamiliar auras.","Among them, one was very familiar to him.","“It’s you!”","The live of them exclaimed simultaneously!","Jian Wushuang stared with widened eyes at the opponent who appeared on his platform, his eyelids twitching.","“Jiang Shang!”","His opponent turned out to be Jiang Shang,","How could it be her?","Just as he was astonished, a strange voice resounded in the sky.","‘Haha, little ones, confront the fears in your hearts!” The owner of the voice was none other than Babidi.","He had summoned their most feared opponents using some means.","Everyone harbored fears.","Jian Wushuang’s greatest fear was Mie Sheng.","How come Jiang Shang appeared?","He didn’t know that the fear evoked by Babidi’s summons came from opponents of similar level, not ones","vastly stronger than himself.","Some even feared the Celestial Maiden. He couldn’t conjure up a Celestial Maiden, could he? So, they all chose opponents of similar level.","Babidi’s Thought power hung in the air, waiting calmly for the fear of the crowd.","His true plan, however, revolved around Jian Wushuang,","The other Universe Masters were hardly worth his attention.","As for Daoist Qingtian, he had other plans.","He had collaborators in the Ancient Wood Sect and a close relationship with Qingtian, so he decided to sparc","him.","That didn’t matter much; a Universe Master at the level of the Four Tribulation realm was nothing to him. It was just giving lace to the other party.","He was now more interested in Jian Wushuang, a person capable of absorbing so much Life power. How powerful must his trump card be?","As death approached, all Life power would be converted into Death.","‘Let’s begin!”","Five platforms erupted with terrifying divine power simultaneously.","Everyone braced themselves for a fight to the death, not just leaving fear but also deep-seated hatred in their","wake.","Though Jian Wushuang also exerted all his strength, he harbored neither hatred nor fear.","At most, it was Jiang Shang’s one-sided hatred.","As for fear, he was unsure.","He had heard that Jiang Shang’s strength was extraordinary, even surpassing the Master of the Azure Dragon","Temple.","Though the Azure Dragon Temple Master couldn’t match a Universe Master, he could contend with ordinary Three Tribulation realm experts.","Jiang Shang’s combat power probably matched that of a Universe Master.","But that wasn’t enough! With just that level of strength, Jiang Shang couldn’t even defeat. Jian Wushuang’s avatar,","Jian Wushuang, you killed my brother, I want you dead!” Jiang Shang’s voice was like that of a puppet, devoid","of any emotion, charging straight at him.","Jian Wushuang shook his head with a sigh.","Too weak.","Ile sparred with Jiang Shang while also keeping an eye on the battles happening on other platforms.","The other Universe Masters’ opponents were all much stronger than Jiang Shang, despite also being Three","Tribulation Universe Masters.","Some of them even surpassed his current strength.","Babidi’s gaze shifted as he noticed Jian Wushuang’s calm demeanor.","There was no hint of fear.","Moreover, the little girl he summoned seemed somewhat weaker.","Narrowing his eyes, he suddenly realized that the opponent was merely an Emperor when he looked closely.","‘He’s just an Emperor too!” Babidi raised an eyebrow, glancing at. Jian Wushuang.","The opponents he summoned were all of the same rank.","If the little girl he summoned was an Emperor, then Jian Wushuang must also be an Emperor,","Rabidi was immensely shocked!","It wasn’t because he was surprised that an Emperor could possess the strength of a Universe Master, but","because he was astonished that Jian Wushuang, an Emperor, could absorb so much Life power.","He gasped, suddenly recalling something.","It was from an incredibly distant era.","During the flourishing period of the nine great temporal rivers, he had followed a formidable being and sailed","on a wooden boat from the Starry Sky to the temporal river.","Before parting ways with that being, he learned of their pursuit.","“The power of Life!”","That being sought the power of Life deep within the temporal river.","The temporal river!","Its source was the Starry Sky, but its end was unknown territory.","The temporal river where Jian Wushuang resided in the Original Universe was very close to the end of the","temporal river.","While the Moro Spacetime was in the middle reaches.","The nine core temporal rivers were considered the upper reaches.","The endless Starry Sky was the source.","Babidi reminisced about the time when he separated from that being and remained alone in the nine great","temporal rivers.","Now, after countless years of wandering, he couldn’t remember how much time had passed,","He once again recalled his past.","The power of Life.","Indeed, it existed.","But he never believed that anyone could create it!"]},{"number":5712,"title":"Chapter 5712 Hu Qing’s Illusion","paragraphs":["5712 Hu Qing’s Illusion","....","If he could create the power of Life at will, wouldn’t he become the creator of All Things?","He came from the Starry Sky and knew more things.","He felt that this was impossible.","He only saw it as the delusion of a whimsical being.","But today, upon seeing Jian Wushuang, he started to believe a little.","“The heavens have treated me well!” Babidi clenched his fists excitedly.","He needed the power of Death, but he also needed the power of Life.","On the arena.","Jian Wushuang had beaten Jiang Shang up in his peak state!","The Sword Intent gathered, and the blue Starry Sky power erupted again.","“It’s over!” Jian Wushuang used all his strength and did not want to continue playing with Jiang Shang.","He gathered the power of the Starry Sky with both hands and condensed it into a formless sword. It came out. of his hands and rushed towards Jiang Shang","The blue longsword pierced through space, surrounded by crackling blue arcs.","Jiang Shang hastily retreated, trying to intercept, but her hands couldn’t break free.","This was merely a manifestation of Jiang Shang, her strength still just an image in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","How powerful she was depended solely on Jian Wushuang’s judgment.","In truth, he had never felt fear towards Jiang Shang.","As the sword of the Starry Sky was about to completely obliterate the illusory Jiang Shang, Jian Wushuang hesitated for a moment.","In that instant, he unexpectedly halted his attack.","Jiang Shang wasn’t truly a threat to him, nor was she someone Jian Wushuang feared.","It was just that the resentment in the other’s heart ran too deep, connecting them karmically, causing her to be conjured by Babidi.","The tip of the sword hovered just an inch from Jiang Shang’s forehead.","“Alas, Jian Wushuang sighed and shook his head.","He knew full well that this was merely an illusion created by Babidi, yet he still hesitated to act","Indeed, he truly couldn’t bring himself to harm Jiang Shang,","Blood sacrifice!","It was a stain on his life, one that couldn’t be erased.","If there ever came a day when he became a super being who mastered spacetime, he vowed to resurrect the other party.","To make amends.","In fact, the two generals under Mic Sheng both harbored deep hatred toward him!","Jiang Shang’s brother died because of his blood sacrifice.","Broly’s father was killed by the people of the Kui Organization.","Although all of this was related, if one were to trace it back, it was all the fault of Shen Ling Frolasa. If revenge were to be sought, it should be sought against Frolasa!","“Jiang Shang, I’m sorry!” Jian Wushuang’s hand manipulated the Starry Sky Divine Sword, intending to completely shatter the illusionary Jiang Shang,","The momentary hesitation just now disappeared in this instant..","This was merely an illusion of Jiang Shang, no need to show mercy","But just as the sword tip was about to pierce Jiang Shang’s forehead, a figure suddenly appeared, grabbing the sword blade with one hand and effortlessly shattering it.","Jian Wushuang’s body also shook!","The power of the Starry Sky burst along with the blue divine sword.","The shattered power, the shattered sword blade.","Crash!","After the dispersal of the power of the Starry Sky, Jian Wushuang saw clearly the figure that had appeared.","“Hu Qing?” Jian Wushuang took a step back, somewhat incredulous.","Hu Qing, dressed in a black robe, still had a bald head as before.","“Brother Wushuang!” Hu Qing joined hands in greeting, standing shoulder to shoulder with Jiang Shang.","This was the fear that Jian Wushuang deep down in his heart didn’t want to admit.","Jian Wushuang’s figure was somewhat unstable, shaking his head and muttering to himself, “This can’t be happening!”","From Hu Qing’s eyes, he saw a glimmer.","A color that Jiang Shang’s eyes didn’t possess.","It didn’t seem like an illusion at all.","“Is it really you?” Jian Wushuang asked in astonishment.","Hu Qing nodded in response to the question, but didn’t speak. When he turned to look at Jiang Shang, there was a hint of guilt in his eyes.","Even after getting confirmation, Jian Wushuang still found it hard to believe.","But he didn’t dare to say too much, after all, this was a world created by Babidi’s illusion.","Everything could be false.","He couldn’t trust it.","Hu Qing gently patted Jiang Shang’s head and said softly, “You’ve suffered!”","At that moment, the illusion of Jiang Shang seemed to display a hint of emotion. Recognizing Hu Qing, she raised her head, tears shimmering in her eyes.","A rift appeared between the master and disciple.","Hu Qing, being naive, didn’t see any issue.","But Jiang Shang harbored deep-seated feelings.","She knew that Jian Wushuang’s relationship with Hu Qing was extraordinary, so she had always suppressed her resentment deep within.","The words ‘You’ve suffered’ completely shattered her.","Because her master understood her.","Jian Wushuang, standing by, felt a sense of discomfort.","And disbelief surged within him.","Not only him, even Babidi was dumbfounded.","Clearly, she was just an illusion, but why did she look more and more real?","Moreover, when the little girl saw Hu Qing, there was an obvious change, and the aura emanating from her caused his brow to furrow.","A familiar aura.","The aura of that existence from the past.","“Impossible!” Babidi’s disbelief didn’t drag Jian Wushuang into fear, but instead, he himself fell into terror.","Thinking of that existence made him shiver.","He couldn’t forget the feeling of being dominated back then.","He didn’t want to follow that existence to the middle reaches of the temporal river but somehow, in the middle of escaping from that existence, a major event occurred.","Now, after countless eons of freedom, feeling the aura of that existence again, he found it difficult to accept...","“Seal!”","Rabidi chanted, attempting to stop and make Jiang Shang and Hu Qing disappear.","But everything around remained unchanged, beyond his control.","And a voice came into his cars, filling him with overwhelming fear.","“Green Monkey!”","That was Babidi’s nickname.","Only he knew of it.","When he emerged from the Starry Sky, Babidi was covered in green fur, thin and small, just like a monkey. Although he no longer had green fur, his skin was still green, and his figure hadn’t changed much, except for a","larger head.","“Master!” Babidi was so scared that he knelt down directly.","In a daze, he saw the old man holding a lantern, with a slender figure and a certain round-edged pointed hat.","That figure was none other than Mie Sheng.","A terrifying existence from the Starry Sky","He was the person Babidi feared most. After glancing at Babidi, the phantom of Mie Sheng floated away and disappeared on its own.","He was a powerhouse at the Hall-Step Seven Tribulation realm, and although Babidi’s secret technique was","strange, it couldn’t maintain the illusion of such a strong individual.","After sensing that presence and its disappearance. Babidi finally regained his senses.","As for Jiang Shang and Hu Qing, he didn’t dare to intervene directly, so he concealed his figure and waited for","the illusion to disappear on its own.","On the arena, the other four Universe Masters had already collapsed.","They were basically trampled.","Only Jian Wushuang was still standing on the arena, hesitating to make a move.","“Hu Qing, how did you end up here?” Jian Wushuang was very puzzled.","It must have come at a great cost to follow the karmic causality and enter this place.","And now that Jiang Shang had also awakened her true form, the murderous intent in her eyes when she looked","at Jian Wushuang was even stronger.","This was the moment. Jian Wushuang feared the most.","Hu Qing teaming up with Jiang Shang to deal with him.","This made it very difficult for him to accept.","“Because of her!” Hu Qing pointed at Jiang Shang, and suddenly there was a burst of energy at his fingertips."]},{"number":5713,"title":"Chapter 5713 Hu Qing Killed Jiang Shang?","paragraphs":["5713 Hu Qing Killed Jiang Shang?","....","Jian Wushuang was startled by the scene unfolding before him.","Jiang Shang’s expression was one of incredulity.","Boom!","A golden beam of light erupted from his fingertips, its buzzing echoing throughout the entire arena.","“Hu Qing, what are you doing? Jian Wushuang tried to intervene, but he noticed a secret rune at Hu Qing’s forehead.","Dylan had one too.","It symbolized being enslaved by Babidi.","Jian Wushuang understood now why Ilu Qing had attacked Jiang Shang.","But even if Jiang Shang were killed here, there would be no consequences, as it was merely an illusion. Only a thought would perish,","Jiang Shang’s true self was safe and sound in the Temple of World Annihilation.","“Wushuang, did I do wrong?” Hu Qing pointed at Jiang Shang’s corpse, then walked slowly toward Jian Wushuang, his eyes turning sharp.","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows. He never imagined that someone as innocent as Hu Qing would be controlled by Babidi.","Rabidi enslaves the strong by inducing fear and thoughts of death in their hearts.","How did Hu Qing get controlled?","Back in the core chamber, Babidi clenched his fist, excitedly watching everything unfold.","Only he knew that Hu Qing willingly submitted to control.","Of course, it was also because Hu Qing truly harbored fear in his heart.","Just like Jian Wushuang, he feared this day as well.","Caught between Jiang Shang and Jian Wushuang, he couldn’t make a choice.","Now, within the illusion, he killed Jiang Shang, letting go of everything.","And then he would battle Jian Wushuang.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t understand.","“Jiang Shang is your disciple, and I am her enemy. If she seeks revenge on me, you shouldn’t interfere!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Even if it truly came down to life and death, it would be his duel with Jiang Shang.","Upon hearing this, Hu Qing shook his head and spoke, “She’s my disciple, and you are my benefactor. To kill","her is to repay kindness with enmity, to kill you is to seek revenge!”","With that declaration, Hu Qing erupted with a force that could shake the heavens and the earth,","A confrontation was inevitable.","Jian Wushuang also unleashed his power.","At that moment, he couldn’t care less about anything else.","Since Hu Qing had made up his mind, what else did he have to hold onto?","To hell with saving the Qishen Temple.","In that moment, Jian Wushuang erupted completely.","“Eternal Ancient. Transformation!”","Jian Wushuang crouched slightly, his arms crossed, surging with energy, blue electric ares flickering. Hum!","With arms outstretched towards the sky, a roar erupted as he entered a state of peak performance. Clad in blue.","The bluc electric arcs in his eyes flashed momentarily as he saw Hu Qing launching towards him. Pupils dilated, distances distorted.","In a flash, he had already moved forward proactively.","Since it was a decisive battle in the illusion.","Then he wouldn’t play any tricks; he wanted to have a straightforward fight.","Boom!!!","The two collided fiercely, palm against fist, fist against, palm, both erupting with force. Bang!","Hu Qing withdrew, one hand behind his back, a giant Buddha appearing,","It wasn’t someone else: was his own likeness.","Now, Hu Qing didn’t need the appearance of others; his own was sufficient.","“Ten Thousand Buddhas Pay Homage!”","Hu Qing’s palm struck down, while his other hand held a silver staff.","The patterns on it were recognized by Jian Wushuang.","This object, he had also heard from Zhen Ling and Ilu Qing, was an extraordinary Universe Treasure.","Its power was immense.","Within the staff lay a universe.","The power was in the palm of his hand.","Jian Wushuang soared into the sky, causing a wave of reverence with just his breath.","Suspended in mid-air, he said calmly, “Now, it’s time to get serious!”","“Don’t hold back!” Hu Qing’s brow furrowed, the black pattern on it sinking deeper.","Jian Wushuang understood that Hu Qing was about to enter a truly violent state.","He wasn’t sure if Babidi could control Hu Qing now.","He didn’t dwell on it much; regardless, today was about determining victory or death. After all, it was an illusion, better to resolve it today than in the real world.","Clang!","The Juryun Sword Intent condensed into an illusory Jueyun Sword.","The silver long staff Hu Qing’s hand also transformed, ensuring fairness.","Neither of them was their true self; both were illusory manifestations.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was also curious about Hu Qing’s truc strength.","Could it match his own?","In the Qishen Temple, he considered himself unbeatable.","The only worthy opponent was Ilu Qing.","Ilu Qing’s strength was always a mystery to him.","When Ilu Qing erupted with the power of the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, he seemed to have","grasped the Ultimate Dao.","And later, everything he witnessed at the Mahayana Spirit. Mountain.","He fell that Hu Qing had also been to the Starry Sky.","Even Nic Yuan, who had once been there, probably saw Hu Qing there too.","Both had significant secrets and their own trump cards.","This battle would be incredibly thrilling.","It was also an opportunity to contend for the position of strongest in the Original Universe, the strongest in","the Qishen Temple!","Inside the core chamber, Babidi was excited to witness this scene.","The simultaneous manifestation of Death and Life from both was simply overwhelming.","Especially the Life power emanating from Jian Wushuang.","Babidi, excitedly produced a circular disk with a pointer on top.","There were nine numbers above from one to nine.","Originally, the numbers only went up to seven, but now they had reached eight.","Since he obtained that item, several epochs had passed.","Now, it was about to be completed. He had advanced his plan, but unexpectedly, changes had made his plan smoother and faster.","With the conclusion of this battle, he would shock the entire of Celestial. Maiden’s Spacetime, even the","temporal river.","Any Tribulation Realm in the future would become his followers.","Thinking of this, Babidi thought of Mie Sheng.","‘Mie Sheng, the times have changed, and so have you!”","He was aware of Mie Sheng’s pursuits.","Matters between Life and Death were the most absurd.","Even if Jian Wushuang was the Emperor who mastered the creation of Life, could Mie Sheng really succeed?","At least not now.","And he could tell that Mic Sheng was aware of Jian Wushuang’s existence.","Being aware didn’t lead to success.","That was even more ridiculous.","His pursuits were far greater.","He wondered what plans Mie Sheng had upon knowing his thoughts.","However, their pursuits were indeed vastly different.","Babidi aimed for all the Scattered Tribulation realm, while Mie Sheng pursued the strongest. Dao, aiming to be","invincible.","As for Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, they were still rising, still on their paths.","Unlike Mic Sheng and Babidi, who seemed to have no other way out. On the arena, Jian Wushuang wielded his sword, and Hu Qing held his staff.","The Jueyun transformed into countless illusions, filling the sky with Sword Qi.","Wherever it passed, space shattered.","Ilu Qing’s stall was even more domineering, embodying the chaos of the primordial heavens, without any","flaws.","The battle between them was equally matched, denting the ground and rupturing the sky,","The light had escalated to a white-hol. intensity.","Neither side had suffered significant injuries, but their energy consumption was immense. Even Jian Wushuang was finding it hard to replenish his energy."]},{"number":5714,"title":"Chapter 5714 Destined Duel","paragraphs":["5714 Destined Duel","....","Ilu Qing wasn’t faring any better; his breath was becoming unstable.","“Haha, exhilarating!” Jian Wushuang gasped for breath, his life power surged, once again enhancing the power of the Starry Sky.","However, the consumption of Starry Sky power was now too great; even replenishing with Life power was insufficient.","Inside the cabin, the healing chamber worked wonders, accelerating the replenishment of his Life power with Starry Sky power.","Hu Qing remained silent, but deep down, he couldn’t help but marvel at Jian Wushuang’s strength. The towering figure from before remained just as formidable.","He had exerted all his strength, yet after battling Jian Wushuang to this point, he still couldn’t determine a victor.","And now, his own aura was faltering, while Jian Wushuang remained as mighty as ever.","Little did Hu Qing know, Jian Wushuang was already at his limit.","The power of the Starry Sky was finite.","It couldn’t be helped; this was merely Jian Wushuang’s clone.","If it were his true self, he could have kept fighting indefinitely.","But now, the Starry Sky power within his clone was nearly depleted.","Both sides were nearing their limits.","Any further delay, and they would decline.","At this moment, both were gathering their strongest aura, preparing to unleash their most potent techniques. Jian Wushuang’s clone, and Ilu Qing’s illusion, both possessed the pinnacle strength of the Three Tribulation realm.","His true self would likely possess the terrifying strength of a Half-Step Four Tribulation realm.","“Catch this!” Jian Wushuang condensed a ball of Life power and directly tossed it to Hu Qing.","It was his last ball of Life power; he couldn’t gather any more, as his clone’s Origin Source was limited.","If it were his true self, he could gather as much as he needed, as long as he was given a moment to catch his breath, he could restore himself to his peak.","Hu Qing hesitated for a moment upon hearing this, but ultimately accepted it.","Grasping the ball of Life power, his aura once again soared to its peak.","However, it was merely an increase vitality; his Origin Source could not be enhanced.","Exhaling deeply, Hu Qing exclaimed, “Life power","indeed a remarkable thing!”","“Now, prepare to receive my strongest strike!” Jian Wushuang gripped the Jucyun Sword with both hands, concentrating all the Starry Sky power onto the blade.","The Starry Sky Chronicles manifested in an instant.","Ilu Qing’s expression changed, his silver stall held upside down in his hand, his eyes furious.","His aura surged violently.","At the same time, beneath his feet, a massive disc appeared.","A Dao Arena!","When Jian Wushuang saw it, he was shocked to his core!","An Emperor capable of a mobile Dao Arena.","Hu Qing’s trump card was even more terrifying than he had imagined.","At this moment, Hu Qing’s aura directly soared to the level of a Half-Step Four Tribulation realin.","“I have one too!” Jian Wushuang roared angrily, space shifted, and a long-unseen One Thought Universe began to expand.","However, the current One Thought Universe lacked the power wielded by his true self.","But there was still some amplification of power.","Actually, he hadn’t intended to use the One Thought Universe.","But seeing Hu Qing unleash his trump card made him somewhat flustered.","He had always been confident facing Hu Qing.","Until this moment, he felt some pressure.","This pressure wasn’t oppressive.","Unlike Broly’s, whose strength grew with every battle, the sense of oppression he gave was overwhelming. Babidi inside the core chamber stared at Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, forgetting the disc in his hand. Mobile Dao Arenas.","Both Emperors possessed one.","Although they didn’t appear to be complete Dao Arenas, they only had 30 percent amplification.","But once they reached the Tribulation Realm, they would probably be able to create complete mobile Dao Arenas.","This meant that after they both reached the Tribulation Realm, their combat power would surpass that of the same level.","Being one level stronger wasn’t much.","In the Tribulation Realm, although it was rare to light across levels, who were Jian Wushuang and Ilu Qing? They were super geniuses cultivated by the Qishen Temple.","And they were recognized by the Starry Sky, ranking among the top in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","After they reached the Tribulation Realm, even without a mobile Dao Arena, they could still fight across levels.","If they added a mobile Dao Arena, their combat power would be incomparable.","Once Jian Wushuang reached the Tribulation Realm, he would directly become the Universe Master, that is, the Three Tribulation realm.","This was an unprecedented event.","Jian Wushuang didn’t even know what the situation would be like by then.","Adding the mobility of the Dao Arena, Jian Wushuang meant that after reaching the Tribulation Realm, he would possess the power of a Four Tribulation Universe Master.","With the abundant Origin Source, even reaching the Half-Step Five Tribulations realm wouldn’t be a problem.","Perhaps he could even rival the Five Tribulation Scattered Tribulation expert.","This advancement wasn’t much less than the increase his Dao Lord stage experienced when breaking through to Emperor.","Perhaps even a bit more.","The distinction between Emperor tiers wasn’t as obvious as in the Tribulation Realm.","Ding!","A black mist suddenly emanated from the disc in Babidi’s hand, accompanied by a strange sound.","*Success!”","Babidi didn’t bother to watch the fight between Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing anymore. Instead, he hugged the dise and, with Dylan, entered a compartment below the core layer.","Dylan was also excited when he saw the disc behaving differently.","He had followed Babidi for the longest time and was the first warrior under Babidi’s command. At the peak of his strength, he could rival the power of a Half-Step Six Tribulations realm expert. “Lord Babidi, are we about to activate it?” Dylan stepped forward and lit the lamp in the crevice. Light emerged, revealing a huge and incomparable egg in front of the two.","The egg had patterns on its shell, and its color was black.","If Jian Wushuang were to see this egg, he would surely be extremely shocked!","He had seen this kind of egg several times before.","The first time was in the murals of the Three Kings Court, the second time was inside the Origin Source of All","Things.","The third time was when Frolosa and Fuego left.","“The Giant God Clan!” Babidi shook his arms, extremely excited.","Because this egg was about to hatch soon.","Originally, the egg of death he had found was now hatched by him.","The entity within this egg would become a master of Death, even more formidable than its owner.","It had embraced Death heavily to achieve enlightenment.","Babidi and Dylan awaited eagerly together.","On the arena, Jian Wushuang also sensed an extremely asymmetrical aura emanating from underground.","A foreboding thought arose within him.","He roughly understood that it had some connection to him.","The Life power within the flying vessel was quite special.","Babidi also valued this kind of power greatly.","Yet, he recklessly erupted.","Perhaps, it would lure out some unknown creature!","This made him even more eager to swiftly end the battle.","“Bring forth your strongest techniques!” Jian Wushuang’s long sword rose in his hand as he continued, ‘I won’t","hold back with this strike!”","Hu Qing’s brow twitched slightly, as if he also grasped something.","The silver staff gathered energy, terrifying auras rose from the ground beneath his feet, blessing him.","The scope of Jian Wushuang’s One Thought Universe was greatly reduced. After all, it was not his true form’s","display. Being able to exhibit it was already commendable.","To even dare to hope to wield the mightiest Starry Sky Universe Master.","He couldn’t even manifest the Life Universe, only the most basic Devouring Universe Master.","He was probably enduring the force of a black hole."]},{"number":5715,"title":"Chapter 5715 Sword and Shield","paragraphs":["5715 Sword and Shield","....","However, it could enhance his combat power by nearly 30 percent, which was already quite impressive.","Back then, he had fought, numerous geniuses relying on this move.","‘Starry Sky Chronicles!” Jian Wushuang struck in an instant.","Hu Qing also roared angrily, stirring up the wind and clouds with his long staff, charging straight towards Jian Wushuang, intending to confront him head-on.","“Ancient Wheel!” Hu Qing’s long staff suddenly flew out, unleashing a set of his unique cosmic secret techniques.","The patterns above were incredibly intricate, gradually forming a shield.","While Jian Wushuang’s Starry Sky Chronicles was the ultimate offensive technique.","One focused on defense, the other on offense.","It seemed they had encountered a formidable foc indeed.","Yet, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but reveal a hint of a smile.","In the face of the Starry Sky Chronicles, defense was simply futile.","Space would regress, and time would halt.","This was the essence of spacetime.","Unstoppable!","“ALLack!”","“Defend!”","The two collided fiercely, but instead of breaking the shield, the Jucyun Sword spread throughout the entire space.","The space here began to solidify, while time reversed.","When Hu Qing saw it, even the speed of his eye movements slowed down.","Ilis shield was broken without even being attacked!","“Brother Wushuang!” Ilu Qing felt his body starting to solidify, about to be trapped in a painting.","Jian Wushuang, seeing this, couldn’t even stop himself,","“Hu Qing, this is just an illusion, you’ll be fine. I’m truly sorry about Jiang Shang!” Jian Wushuang expressed his","remorsc.","The mark on Hu Qing’s brow began to fade, indicating a return to sanity.","‘Let’s put an end to this matter here. I will find a way to resurrect her brother in the future!” Hu Qing’s expression softened slightly.","Jian Wushuang shook his head. “Each person should bear their own responsibilities. You don’t have to be caught in the middle and feel conflicted:”","“Oh, by the way, how did you manage to bring Thought power here?” Jian Wushuang looked at Hu Qing with a puzzled expression.","When they first entered the Ancient Moon Spacetime together, he saw Hu Qing blocking the Celestial Maiden. He wasn’t sure if it was an illusion or something else.","He had intended to ask about it carlier, but they had been fighting until now, only just now resolving their battle.","After regaining his senses, Ilu Qing’s gaze also seemed vacant.","After scanning the surroundings, he replied, “I was in a peculiar place within the Ancient Moon Spacetime, and an acquaintance helped me. That’s how I came here.”","“An acquaintance?” Jian Wushuang was quite surprised and asked further, “You have acquaintances even in the Ancient Moon Spacetime?”","But then he thought, Hu Qing had previously been to the Starry Sky. Perhaps he left something behind, so there was nothing too strange about it.","Hu Qing nodded without elaborating further. After all, this place belonged to Babidi, and there were indeed some things that couldn’t be said too much.","“Wushuang, I’m running out of time! Hu Qing’s body completely condensed, leaving only a thread of Thought power.","This time, he was thoroughly defeated.","Although Jian Wushuang knew it was just an illusory clone, he still felt somewhat reluctant!","To have to kill his lifelong friend was truly a heavy blow.","Jian Wushuang suppressed the remorse in his heart and said calmly, “We will meet again soon!”","“No!” Hu Qing struggled to shake his head, then continued, ‘Be careful of the Ancient Moon Sect. Never go to the Ancient Moon Ruins!”","“You must never go there!”","“You must never go there!”","“You must never go there!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Ilu Qing’s body completely sank into the smooth space, turning into a starry","map.","Jian Wushuang carefully pondered Hu Qing’s words, feeling somewhat puzzled.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime comprised nine heavens and ten lands.","The Ancient Wood Continent was one of the ten lands.","And the Ancient Moon Ruins were also one of them.","It’s just that within that continent, a certain area became ruins.","Countless strong individuals ventured into it, also known as the Outer Domain.","There were still two such ruins among the Ten Lands.","Amidst them were also powerful Special Life Forms, along with some sects and tribes. It was a rather chaotic place.","According to what he had read in the books, the Ancient Moon Ruins were once the origin of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","It was referred to as the land of the Origin Source.","Why did Hu Qing want to stop him from going to the Ancient Moon Ruins?","Jian Wushuang found it somewhat strange. But since it was still far from him, he didn’t dwell on it.","At this moment, the power of the Starry Sky was completely depleted, leaving only his divine power in his","avatar.","Even with 100,000-fold divine power, he couldn’t even beat an ordinary Tribulation Realm expert.","His combat strength was as weak as air.","Buzz!","The surrounding space shattered, and the illusion broke.","In the core layer, Babidi felt relieved when he sensed it.","After all, he had felt that something was amiss since he lost control.","Now that the illusion was broken, a weight lifted off his heart.","All he needed to do now was to wait patiently for the appearance of the entity within the giant egg.","When Jian Wushuang fought. Hu Qing, the pointer on the instrument reached its peak directly, even breaking the pointer.","Obviously, the required power of Death was already sufficient. Now was just waiting for the eggshell to hatch.","Upon discovering that Jian Wushuang was still alive, and moreover, his strength had severely regressed, with no Life power left in his body, Babidi said, “He is a great contributor. Dylan, go bring him over. I want him to","taste the bitterness of despair!”","With his hands behind his back, Babidi stared at the giant egg.","Dylan bowed and accepted the order, then appeared next to Jian Wushuang in a flash.","With one hand on Jian Wushuang’s shoulder, Dylan’s figure flashed again, bringing Jian Wushuang to Babidi’s","side.","Before Jian Wushuang could react, he saw the short, thin, green-skinned alien in front of him. And it had a big head, but slender limbs.","“Are you Babidi!”","Jian Wushuang showed no fear, calling out his name directly!","Dylan, upon hearing this, became furious, grabbing Jian Wushuang by the neck and angrily shouted, “Who do","you think you are, daring to show disrespect to Lord Babidi!”","“Forget it, Dylan!” Babidi was in an extremely good mood now.","He was not angry at Jian Wushuang’s disrespect.","Rather feeling that Jian Wushuang was his lucky star.","Especially seeing Jian Wushuang facing death with such calmness, he felt he was truly talented.","Babidi looked up at Jian Wushuang and replied, “What’s the matter, have you heard of my title?”","I’ve heard little! Jian Wushuang touched his neck, which was indented from being grabbed, then said, “What’s your relationship with Mic Sheng, that you can manipulate the power of Death too!”","“Mic Sheng, you really know Mic Sheng!” Babidi exclaimed, “Since you know about him and are still alive, you’re truly remarkable!”","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, surprised, “What, is he very strong?”","Just a Half-Step Seven Tribulations realm expert.","Even during the era of the Higher Heavens, having Seven Tribulations realm was considered outstanding.","After all, he didn’t think that Dong Jun could be so powerful, this was just a guess.","When Babidi heard Jian Wushuang’s words, his cyclids twitched, feeling that Jian Wushuang was just talking","big.","Whether Mie Sheng was strong or not, he knew best.","The Mie Sheng before leaving the Starry Sky had already become the overlord of the Starry Sky, opposing all","the races in the Starry Sky, and no one could do anything to him!","Mic Sheng’s strength was not something that the fish in the temporal river could understand. Babidi sneered and asked, “What do you know about the Tribulation Realm?” “Tribulation Realm!”","With this question, Jian Wushuang was truly stunned."]},{"number":5716,"title":"Chapter 5716 The Ancients Had No Road","paragraphs":["5716 The Ancients Had No Road","....","In his understanding, the powerful beings of the Tribulation Realm mastered complete control over space before delving into the cultivation of the Temporal Origin Source.","But upon arriving in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he discovered there were other paths.","It wasn’t just a singular route.","Every path led to the Starry Sky; it was a matter of finding the one suited to oneself.","However, Jian Wushuang always believed deep down that spacetime was the most powerful.","The idea of overpowering everything with sheer force was something he couldn’t accept.","If such power truly existed, why hadn’t anyone attained it?","Il no ancient being had reached that level,","then the path of divine power was just a sham.","Deceptive!","Spacetime, on the other hand, was different.","With Temporal Treasures as evidence, and Teacher Xuan Yi!","Jian Wushuang reminisced.","When he first met Teacher Xuan Yi in the Three Kings Court, he had said they would meet again in the future. Being able to traverse spacetime.","Teacher Xuan Yi’s strength was needless to say.","Starting as a master of spacetime.","He hadn’t encountered anyone capable of overpowering everything with sheer force, so he didn’t believe it.","Even the former Celestial Maiden was only at the Nine Tribulation realm.","Although she opened up the temporal river and was about to reach the pinnacle, she perished abruptly.","It indicated that this path was treacherous.","Even the former Celestial Maiden failed.","These practitioners of divine power were probably just dreaming.","To overpower everything with sheer force, one would need to be at least stronger than the Celestial Maiden.","But ever since her demise, the Ancient Moon Spacetime had been increasingly dilapidated.","There was simply no opportunity.","Then there was the power of Death.","Whether was Mie Sheng or the current. Babidi, they were both taking shortcuts.","This path was equally treacherous.","Otherwise, Mic Sheng wouldn’t have been trapped in this realm for so long.","“Tsk tsk, young man!”","Babidi discerned Jian Wushuang’s thoughts and continued, “As an Emperor with such strength, indeed you should be proud, but there are still things you need to learn humbly!”","Jian Wushuang was surprised, “What, learn to absorb others’ power? Do I still need to learn such a practice?”","He almost laughed. When it came to this ability, he was not inferior to Mie Sheng.","It’s just that he didn’t have the strength to swallow Mie Sheng.","The day he surpassed Mie Sheng in power, there was no need to learn anything.","He directly devoured Mie Sheng and mastered reincarnation.","Coupled with the spacetime of Extreme Dao.","What he mastered was the cycle of time.","Then it was the higher level of the Starry Sky.","On the dim ancient road, many bright lights suddenly rose.","Jian Wushuang was unusually firm.","Just as he steadfastly surveyed his surroundings, he quietly discovered the giant egg hidden in the darkness.","The pitch-black eggshell, and the familiar patterns.","“Giant God!” Jian Wushuang was greatly startled.","His clone had not brought the giant god token given by Frolasa, so he had never felt this giant god egg.","Seeing it now, he was shocked to his core!","Trembling, he pointed at Babidi and said, ‘Is this the Giant God egg?”","Babidi was taken aback for a moment.","He didn’t expect Jian Wushuang, an Emperor, to be aware of the peak races in the Starry Sky.","“You dare plunder the Giant God egg, aren’t you afraid of the arrival of the superpowerful beings of the Giant God Clan?” Jian Wushuang questioned.","When Frolasa was imprisoned by the Three Kings Court, attracted Fuego. Only after the destruction of the Moro spacetime did the Giant God Clan give up looking for Frolasa, otherwise, the Qishen Temple would definitely not be spared.","He really didn’t expect Babidi to also have a giant god egg.","“Tsk tsk, it seems you know quite a bit!” Babidi looked at Jian Wushuang with interest, pointing at the giant egg and saying, “This is a Death Egg”","“A Death Egg!” Jian Wushuang frowned, finding it hard to believe.","The egg was laid by the Giant God Clan; how could it be dead!","Frolasa never mentioned anything about Death Eggs.","The more he looked at this egg, the more he realized it was not ordinary.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s disbelief, Babidi snorted coldly. “Even if it’s a living Giant God egg, so what? The power of the Giant. God Clan does not lie in the temporal river. Their control over the temporal river is far inferior to that of the Human Race!”","“But you are not a member of the Human Race either!” Jian Wushuang reminded him.","“Although I am not of the Human Race, this place is the base of the Human Race. Would the Giant God Clan dare to descend upon the Dao Arena of that Celestial Maiden?” Babidi’s words were firm.","Jian Wushuang was unexpectedly intimidated.","Because when he descended upon this place initially, he was indeed threatened.","Later, it was because Hu Qing blocked that Celestial Maiden, and he successfully descended.","In this way, the will of that Celestial Maiden probably has not disappeared but merged into the Dao the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","He also thought of Hu Qing’s warning just now, asking him not to enter the Ancient Moon Ruins!","From the eagerness for the opportunity of the Tribulation Realm when he first entered, to encountering Wanliu later, and now to this day.","Unconsciously, it seemed like the black mist once again enveloped him in a cage.","Jian Wushuang shook his head, deciding not to think about it anymore.","He hadn’t even left the Ancient. Wood Continent yet, and there was no need to go to the Ancient Moon Ruins in the future. It’s better to avoid it.","“Young man, just watch!” Babidi said proudly, “What I do is illuminated by the will of heaven. No one can stop me, instead, countless people will support me!”","Upon hearing this, Dylan couldn’t help but chime in, flattering, ‘Lord Babidi’s dawn will illuminate the entire Temporal River!”","“Delusional!’ Jian Wushuang sneered.","Although he was a bit confused about what Babidi was up to, judging by their demeanor, this clder had the face of a villain.","He wouldn’t be skipping around for long.","Let alone the Ancient Wood Sect, Dylan couldn’t withstand the anger of even the Yongheng Kingdom.","Daoist Qinglian must have called for reinforcements. It probably wouldn’t be long before the reinforcements","arrived.","He wanted to see if these people would still be so tough when the time came.","It was quite a coincidence that he had just thought about reinforcements.","And here they were.","The powerful figures from the Shi Kingdom and the Yongheng Kingdom descended at the same time.","The terrifying aura of the Six Tribulation realm instantly rose.","The entire lying boat was shaking.","Dylan’s expression changed, and his aura began to skyrocket.","“No need to panic, these people can’t get in at all!” Babidi was absolutely certain,","He wasn’t surprised at all that these people had come, because he already knew in advance.","Even if no one informed him, he could have guessed that Qingtian would ask for help.","Crack!","The three of them looked at the giant divine egg at the same time.","Cracks began to appear in the eggshell.","Babidi exclaimed in joy, ‘Iaha, it’s about to succeed!”","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to watch.","He was actually quite curious about what kind of monster would be born from this egg.","Death Egg","What could this thing possibly hatch?","Just as the three f them were waiting for the eggshell to crack, the flying boat collapsed first.","Boom!","Several super strong individuals from the outside world, before they could even make a move, saw the flying boat collapse. They were stunned and looked in surprise at the cosmic flying boat that appeared from the void.","A self-exposure?","There’s a trick inside!","They immediately confirmed their thoughts.","A terrifying Death energy quietly spread."]},{"number":5717,"title":"Chapter 5717 Giant God Egg","paragraphs":["5717 Giant God Egg","The arrivals were all from the Tribulation Realm, not the Universe Masters.","What they feared most was this kind of power.","At this moment, they felt a bit panicked even before the battle began.","This terrifying Death power was much stronger than any they had encountered before.","“How is this possible? Didn’t they say the opponent was the Five Tribulation realm?” The experts from the Shi Kingdom stared disbelievingly at the shattered flying vessel.","Within the cracks, terrifying deathly serpents spread.","Inside the core chamber.","Even Babidi was somewhat panicked.","His cosmic vessel, brought from the Starry Sky, suddenly shattered.","This cosmic flying vessel was a treasure capable of withstanding superpowerful beings from the Seven Tribulation realm.","And now it suddenly shattered.","“It’s because of that egg!” Jian Wushuang reminded them.","He wielded the power of Life and could best understand the horror of that egg.","Now it began to crack.","The aura inside became increasingly terrifying.","Although it didn’t possess the dense purity of Mie Sheng, the thing inside that egg was definitely more powerful than Mic Sheng,","It surpassed the Six Tribulation realm.","There was a great possibility it was the Seven Tribulation realm.","“How could he be so powerful? When a member of the Giant God Clan is born, they would only be a Universe Master, right? The strongest was only at the Three Tribulation realm!” Jian Wushuang now understood why Babidi had such great confidence.","So, this cgg could give birth to a superpowerful being at the Seven Tribulation realm!","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s confusion, Babidi no longer lamented the loss of the cosmic vessel.","Instead, he excitedly waved his arms and explained, ‘He is the Giant God Egg I personally incubated. How could an ordinary Giant God Egg!","The Seven Tribulation realm was not the goal.","According to his speculation, a Death Giant God at the Nine Tribulation realm would be born.","“Ah, I see now!” Jian Wushuang understood.","No wonder Babidi insisted on pushing them to the brink and then healing them afterward. Continuously granting them life while also instilling fear and the sense of death within them. All the extracted power was poured into this egg.","And now, such a terrifying powerhouse emerged from it.","Even before birth, it exuded the aura of the Seven Tribulation realm.","At this moment, there was a commotion.","The Ancestor of the Yongleng Kingdom was the first to notice.","“Babidi succeeded? His eyes flashed with hostility; he was the Ancestor who founded the Yongheng Clan. At the pinnacle of the Seven Tribulation realm, although not a Universe Master, he possessed formidable vitality.","The Ancestor of the Yongheng Clan’s face twisted with anger as he shouted, “Babidi, how dare you deceive me!”","He had cooperated with Babidi, who had promised to inform him first once the plan succeeded. ‘Inform all awakened members of our bloodline to gather at the Yongheng Palace; I will deliver Ancestor of the Yongheng Clan revealed a bloodthirsty expression.","Establishing the Yongheng Clan was for this day.","To unite the bloodline and return to their peak.","And then to seek a breakthrough.","scrmon!” The","Every Scattered Tribulation realm cultivator fantasized about one day reigniting their path of cultivation.","The weaker ones might not have had the opportunity to know about it.","But the powerful ones, the ones at the Seven or even Eighth Tribulation realm, all had their own plans.","Even if it was just a rumor or legend, they were unwilling to give up.","Babidi understood this well and used the power of Life to deceive many powerful Scattered Tribulation cultivators.","They were informed of his plan.","Once successful, it could break the stagnation of the Scattered Tribulation realm, and perhaps even lead to breakthroughs.","Although many deemed it impossible, they still believed.","It was their last hope, and no one wanted to abandon it.","Hope for a breakthrough!","Several Seven Tribulation realm experts from the Ancient. Wood Sect, simultaneously appeared, their gazes fixed on the Yongheng Kingdom.","The Eighth Tribulation realm Ancestor of the Shi Kingdom also opened his eyes.","Even the Flame God guarding the Shi Kingdom noticed.","However, being a Special Life Form, the Flame God was neither a Scattered Tribulation nor a Universe Master; he still had endless paths to take.","He was unaware of Babidi’s plan, but upon sensing the power of Death, he understood that the fate of the Ancient Wood Continent was about to change.","The nine core spacetimes.","There were indeed truly ancient and powerful beings.","However, these beings couldn’t create methods for advancing the Tribulation Realm.","Many had no hope.","But some harbored a glimmer of hope, thinking that those powerful beings didn’t want the Scattered Tribulation realm to continue cultivating,","As a result, the number of entities controlling spacetime would continue to increase.","Currently, among the nine major spacetimes, only three super entities had openly identified themselves.","If the Scattered Tribulation realm could reach its peak as well.","It would inevitably make these entities somewhat uncomfortable.","Even if there were methods, they wouldn’t create such techniques.","Survival of the fittest, compliance with the laws of nature.","Special Life Forms and some peculiar tribes didn’t have Tribulation Realms.","Groups like the Human Race were supposed to have limitations.","Otherwise, it would go against the natural order.","Some powerful figures from the Seven Tribulation realm of the Ancient Wood Continent set out towards the Yongheng Kingdom.","“Hun Tian, it’s quite lively here!’ The first to arrive was a prominent figure from the Shi Kingdom, now in the Chaotic Sea of Stars.","Jian Wushuang’s avatar was so startled it dissipated instantly, without hesitation.","Meanwhile, his true self returned to the Yue Kingdom.","That massive figure just now was undoubtedly a powerhouse of the Seven Tribulation realm.","He had once seen the physical body of Qishen and could sense that aura.","Above the Chaotic Sea of Stars, besides that super existence, there was also a bloody figure.","With a head full of white hair but a face as fair as jade, the handsome features belonged to the Ancestor of the","Yongheng Clan.","Emperor Hun Tian!","He arrived earlier, with only an avatar present. His true self resided in the Yongheng Palace.","‘Shi Xuan!” Emperor Hun Tian frowned as he looked at the imposing figure.","Although this place was his territory, those old monsters of the Tribulation Realm were not to be trifled with.","That’s why he was cager to devour bloodlines, to reach his peak, so he could contend with Babidi of the Eight Tribulation realm.","The several powerhouses of the Six Tribulation below, upon seeing the Ancestor’s arrival, came forward to pay their respects.","Together, they observed the scene inside the cosmic boat.","The terrifying power of Death continued to spread.","“Shi Xuan, why hasn’t your Ancestor come?” Emperor Hun Tian stared at him, hoping to delay a little longer. Only a Seven Tribulation member of the Shi family had come now; the Eigh Tribulation Ancestor had not","arrived.","“Don’t tell me your Ancestor doesn’t know!”","Shi Xuan replied calmly, “Whether the Ancestor knows or not is unimportant. He is the backbone of the Shi Clan and cannot take risks!”","This matter was of great importance; if the Ancestor were to come and perish, the Shi Kingdom would be","finished.","The Flame God was willing to protect the Shi Kingdom because of the Ancestor of the Shi Kingdom. Once the Ancestor fell, the Flame God would leave too.","It was absolutely imperative to prevent the Ancestor from taking risks.","As the strongest Seven Tribulation realm in the contemporary Shi Clan, it was only natural for him to take","charge.","As for the Universe Master, there was already hope for promotion; there was no need for him to take risks. Even if it was wise to plan ahead, there was no need to take such great risks!","“The Shi Clan doesn’t have as many powerhouses as your Hun Clan. If you die, you die. The Hun Clan won’t collapse either!” Shi Xuan knew that Hun Tian who established the Yongheng Clan was not a native powerhouse of the Ancient Moon Spacetime."]},{"number":5718,"title":"Chapter 5718 Yongheng Blood Sacrifice","paragraphs":["5718 Yongheng Blood Sacrifice","....","Ile came from another spacetime.","Hun Tian was not angry after hearing this. Instead, he sighed in relief.","He hoped that all the Eigh Tribulation realm experts would think the same. That way, no one would be his match.","Even the strongest Seven Tribulation realm expert in the Shi Kingdom could not withstand a single blow from him.","If he condensed the blood pool, he could recover to the Hall-Step to the Eight Tribulation realm.","It could match an ordinary Right. Tribulation realm expert.","Other than Universe Masters in the Right Tribulation realm, no one could kill him.","There were only a few Universe Masters at the Eight Tribulation realm in the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime, and there were very few at the Seven Tribulation realm.","Theoretically, there was no Universe Master in the Ancient Wood Continent.","However, the Flame God created his own Flame God Kingdom, which was not weaker than those Universe Masters.","In addition, he was a Special Life Form, so his divine power was terrifying.","In the Ancient Wood Continent, almost no one was his match.","Other than the Divine Wood King at his peak.","Unfortunately, the current Divine Wood King was also old.","“Your original body?” Shi Xuan suddenly sensed a terrifying aura coming from the Yongheng Kingdom. His eyes widened in shock!","Hun Tian’s avatar gradually dimmed. He did not reply!","“Even a vicious tiger won’t eat its cubs. You’re so ruthless!” Shi Xuan’s tone was filled with disgust as he stared at Hun Tian.","At the same time, several Seven Tribulation realm experts allied with Babidi descended.","Apart from the Patriarch [1]of the Shi Kingdom, they were all assembled!","IIun Tian’s original body was an expert who had awakened his bloodline by absorbing Ilou Yi’s blood.","Even the King of Yongheng Kingdom was reduced to bones.","Only until their deaths did they understand that they were just chess pieces.","He had been schemed against by his own Patriarch.","In the blood pool.","The final Half-Step Seven Tribulation expert of the Yongheng Clan raised his head to look. Hun Tian. He angrily said, ‘You are the greatest enemy of the Yongheng Clan!”","‘Humph! The Human Race will prosper! You’re all outsiders! Even if I created you myself, you’ll still die!” Hun Tian laughed coldly. He did not show any mercy.","Every awakened member of the Yongheng Clan who possessed his bloodline perished.","Only some ordinary people remained.","The strongest among them were only at the Three Tribulation realm.","Hun Tian burst out of the blood pool, not intending to spare even these people.","Together with the Six Tribulation expert he sent to the Chaotic Sea of Stars, they all rose.","Their bodies began to dim and shatter.","Strands of red bloodlines gathered toward Hun Tian.","And his power continued to skyrocket.","This shocked all the experts in the Chaotic Sea of Stars.","“What a ruthless heart!” The experts of the Ancient Wood Sect were speechless.","Shi Xuan’s expression, however, was grim. He was more concerned about Hun Tian’s sudden surge in power than condemning him.","With their newfound strength, they were definitely no match.","Securing Babidi later would pose a problem.","Here, there were a total of nine Seven Tribulation realm experts, making Hun Tian the tenth.","As for whether there were any other strongmen, they were clueless.Buzz!","The entire Yongheng Kingdom began to collapse.","Storms swept across the Chaotic Sea of Stars, dimming everything in their path.","Only those in the Seven Tribulation realm could withstand it.","And at this moment, the Yongheng Kingdom quietly closed off.","People from the outside world couldn’t perceive the changes in the Yongheng Kingdom at all.","The powerful beings who had just discovered the gathering of those in the Seven Tribulation realm on the edge of the Yongheng Kingdom noticed a towering barrier.","Blocking their way.","“Go back and inform the Ancestor!” These people left only avatars to observe here, while they themselves returned to their clans to inform the Ancestor.","Those who could cooperate with Babidi were all in the Seven Tribulation realm, even reaching the Eight Tribulation realm.","There were also some Scattered Tribulations who were more traditional and unwilling to believe in Rabidi, Now that they were aware of the anomalies in the Yongheng Kingdom, many Scattered Tribulation superpowers descended one after another, but they couldn’t enter the Yongheng Kingdom, so they could only be anxious.","The Divine Wood King of the Ancient Wood Sect, the Ancestor of the Shi Kingdom, just watched from afar. They both noticed that within the Yongheng Kingdom, two terrifying forces were rising.","One was Hun Tian, who had absorbed all the Yongheng bloodlines, achieving the strength Tribulation realm.","f the Eight","The other carried an infinite power of death, terrifying beyond compare.","Now his aura had risen to the Eighth Tribulation Realm, even stronger than IIun Tian.","This time, Ilun Tian had backed himself into a corner.","The Ancestor of the Shi Kingdom and the Divine Wood King furrowed their brows, realizing they had underestimated Babidi, this outsider from the Starry Sky.","The methods of the Scattered Tribulation realms weren’t so easily created.","Even if they were created, Babidi wouldn’t give them away for free.","So what exactly was he planning?","Almost all the strong beings within the Yongheng Kingdom were on the brink of extinction.","Even the few in the Seven Tribulation realm who could approach Babidi were doomed.","Yet, these people had overlooked the existence of Jian Wushuang.","It seemed like no one knew Jian Wushuang was right at the center of the storm.","Yongheng Kingdom.","It couldn’t be called a kingdom anymore, as everyone had been killed by the founding Emperor himself.","To forge his blood pool, he had exterminated all the people of Yongheng Kingdom.","Elevating his own bloodline, he had also killed all the strong members of the Yongheng Clan.","He had completely achieved the terrifying strength of the Eight Tribulation realm.","The Chaotic Sea of Stars had been annihilated, leaving only a barren desert.","The seawater had long evaporated.","In the dim crimson sky stood ten figures.","Nine of them were simultaneously besieging one.","They all wanted to enter the cosmic ship buried hallway in the yellow sand.","“Hun Tian, for massacring innocent lives, I, representing the Ancient. Wood Sect, will exterminate you!”","“Your ambitions know no bounds; you cannot be allowed to live!”","These Seven Tribulation realm experts, each representing a sect’s elder or the face of a family.","Now, they were all speaking grandiose words as they besieged Hun Tian.","But Hun Tian had made a mistake; he should have acted earlier and killed all these people off.","Now, facing nine Seven Tribulation realm experts, although he still had the upper hand, he knew he couldn’t","drag this on.","Babidi was also not to be underestimated.","“Gentlemen, it seems you have forgotten your mission!”","After suppressing one of the Seven Tribulation realm experts with a casual gesture, Hun Tian continued, “We are here to reignite the path of cultivation. Why hurt each other now? I swear, if I obtain Babidi, I will ensure he spreads his techniques throughout the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime!”","Shi Xuan snorted coldly and said grimly, “You’ve slaughtered even your own descendants clean. Why should","we trust you?”","In fact, Hun Tian did have such a plan.","It wasn’t because he was particularly selfless.","Rather, he wanted to unite all the Scattered Tribulation realm experts and establish his own kingdom.","The current Yongheng Kingdom was just a joke.","He had dreamed of millions of Immortals coming to court, and Emperors descending.","“Brother Shi Xuan, can’t you see the reality?” Ilun Tian roared angrily and slapped Shi Xuan flying with one","palm.","Pointing at the cosmic ship below, he said. “Don’t forget. Babidi has never appeared. Although the force of Death is constantly rising, who knows whose aura it is?”","Indeed!","These people hadn’t even seen that figure; how could they assume that. Babidi had already created","techniques?","[] Patriarch is the same as Ancestor"]},{"number":5719,"title":"Chapter 5719 The Mysterious Man Behind Wu LI","paragraphs":["5719 The Mysterious Man Behind Wu LI","It could produce the power of Death infinitely, and then its aura would soar.","What if it wasn’t a human? What if it wasn’t suitable for them to cultivate?","There were still many problems!","They could not afford infighting,","While they were hesitating, a large group of experts gathered outside Yongheng Kingdom.","Among those great beings, there were many universe masters.","It could be said that they didn’t know anything about Babidi.","Only Shi Xuan and the ancestor of the Shi Family knew that a super family like the Shi Family was working with Babidi.","They weren’t stupid enough to let their Universe Masters participate.","If the Ancient Moon Clan found out about this, they would be enraged.","It wasn’t worth it.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime was in ruins, but the power that the Ancient Moon Clan controlled was not something that these clans could withstand.","There were still Universe Masters at the Eight Tribulation realm in the clan.","Who could stop the descent of such a supreme expert?","Even the Flame God had to stay behind.","After all, it was a Dao Arena with unusual movements. Even if they descended into the Flame God Kingdom, they could still fight with the Flame God.","A genuine Universe Master was not something a Special Life Form could compare to.","Even if he had created his own divine kingdom, it would not work","At the border of Yongheng Kingdom, a familiar figure descended and looked inside through the blood-red","“Looks like the rumors are true!” Wu Li stood with his hands behind his back, looking into the distance. He spoke to himself, looking especially comical.","However, there was a heavy voice in his body that answered, “The power of Death is truly laughable!” “The power of death has been reborn: Wu Li rubbed his nose and continued,” Doesn’t this mean that those Scattered Tribulation cultivators have a method to reignite their cultivation path!”","“It’s not that simple. Death is Death. Only the power of Life is hope, especially the power of Life that is compatible with the Wanliu. When you enter the interior of Wanliu, you’ll understand. The most potent Life power can even resurrect the universe. The hope of Scattered Tribulation cultivators requires a super being who controls the power of Life, not these crooked paths! The heavy voice echoed in Wu Li’s mind.","“Hopefully so!” Wu Li nodded, not lingering in this place for too long before returning to Yue Kingdom.","Since Jian Wushuang’s original body had returned, he needed to exchange for some Origin Treasures and deal with Jian Wushuang.","Currently, Jian Wushuang was Wu Li’s greatest reliance within the Wanliu Divine Tree. Regardless of the request, he would spare no effort to fulfill it.","The Life power within his Jade Sword was not of a particularly high level; compared to Jian Wushuang’s Life power, it was clearly not on the same level.","Even the purity was different.","Ordinary Life power merely represented vitality within the body.","This type of Life force, the cheapest, could be refined from the Origin Source of All Things.","The highest level of Life power could not even be refined by the Universe Masters of the Right. Tribulation realm.","The Life power he obtained was still given to him by the existence within him, originally taken from the Wanliu Divine Tree.","It was the Life power from the Wanliu Tree.","The life of the wood represented its peak.","With just a trace f the Jade Sword, it possessed incomparably powerful vitality,","By virtue of this intimacy, it could even cause the divine tree to flourish.","However, Wu Li did not know that the Life power on Jian Wushuang’s hands was not obtained from the divine tree.","By that time, when the divine tree was opened, who knew what kind of joke would be made?","But these were all stories for later.","As the Sacred Assembly approached, more than ten Seven Tribulation realm powerhouses gathered in the Yongheng Kingdom of the Ancient Wood Continent, and no one knew what had happened internally. Inside the cosmic ship.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang and Babidi, along with others, were working together to break open the crack in the giant divine egg, a scene that was quite comical.","Babidi’s cultivation technique was very powerful, but his combat power was not strong.","He was only at the level of the First. Tribulation.","However, his ability to enslave was unparalleled in the ancient time and space.","At this moment, they exerted all their strength, but the shell of the giant divine egg remained unmoved. “Put in more effort! Those people outside will definitely take risks later, and by then it will all be over!” Babidi was anxious at this moment.","At first, he was very excited, thinking that the giant divine egg could directly give birth to super-powerful individuals.","But now, with the Death power gone, the shell still remained closed.","He panicked.","This was his strongest trump card.","Without this egg, relying solely on Dylan, they couldn’t withstand those at the Seven Tribulation realm experts.","“Gula gula!” Babidi chanted a peculiar spell, pointing one hand at Dylan and the other at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang willingly accepted the aura without hesitation, since he was just a clone.","ITum!","“So strong” Jian Wushuang clenched his fists, his divine power instantly doubling from 100,000-fold to 200,000-fold.","The aura on Dylan surged from the Half Step Six Tribulation realm directly to the Seven.","“Don’t just stand there, move faster!” Babidi shouted at them.","He himself underwent no change, only able to make others stronger.","Jian Wushuang paid him no mind, feeling his own strength increase, he began to pull apart the remaining eggshells.","With Dylan’s enhanced divine power, they dismantled the eggshells frantically.","The eggshells were about to be completely broken.","Through the cracks, Jian Wushuang peered inside.","Despite possessing immense power, they couldn’t get out from within.","This made Jian Wushuang curious; he didn’t even need Babidi’s threats to come dismantle the eggshells.","Knowing Babidi’s greatest reliance, he relaxed a bit.","Though it was not yet clear if he and Mie Sheng were allied, at least Mie Sheng didn’t seem to have any intention of devouring him after learning he wielded the power of Life.","In this aspect, Mie Sheng was much better than Babidi.","When Mie Sheng saw him, was like a wild dog spotting feces.","No, that comparison didn’t fit.","Regardless, Mic Sheng was cager to devour him, and only one of them could survive.","Babidi, however, didn’t have that thought.","This could be seen from his gaze.","But this didn’t mean the other party wouldn’t attack him.","If the two were close, Babidi would surely offer him to Mie Sheng.","If their relationship wasn’t good, Babidi would sever Mie Sheng’s path and kill him.","No way out.","Unfortunately, Babidi’s strength was too weak.","It was not apparent that he was just a clone.","Dylan was only a Scattered Tribulation expert, his divine power had increased, but his realm hadn’t, so his","details couldn’t be discerned either.","Only Mie Sheng knew he wouldn’t die so easily.","Hum!","Jian Wushuang and Dylan continued to dismantle the eggshell, and there were movements inside, as if the fall","of the eggshells had strengthened again.","This excited Babidi, who kept encouraging them.","“Dylan, faster! Once I succeed, I’ll make you the crown prince!”","“Jian Wushuang, don’t stop, if I reach the peak, I’ll help you devour Mie Sheng and let you control the cycle of","time and space!”","Babidi’s words grew more grandiose.","Controlling the cycle of time and space was even mentioned.","If truly achieved, Jian Wushuang could dominate all the temporal rivers."]},{"number":5720,"title":"Chapter 5720 Mouth Is Full","paragraphs":["5720 Mouth Is Full","....","Jian Wushuang would definitely not believe it.","Those old folks were quite cunning.","But he did not stop either.","He worked harder than Dylan, eager to get the powerful Giant God Clan expert inside the eggshell to come","out","It wasn’t just curiosity driving him.","More importantly, he possessed the token of the Giant God Clan.","With that token, perhaps the newly born deceased Giant God Clan expert wouldn’t attack him. Maybe, they would even help him.","That would be a tremendous aid.","Even before coming out, there was already the aura of the Eight Tribulation realm. If they did come out, not only would they soar to the Nine Tribulation realm, they might even reach the state of Half-Step Nine Tribulation realm.","Half-step Nine Tribulation realm represented the peak of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Perhaps even the Ancient Moon Sect wouldn’t have such a formidable opponent. If they truly helped him, he could swagger through this Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Rip!","The sound of space being torn apart was heard. Jian Wushuang’s hands paused for a moment. Then, he felt several terrifying auras wrapping him tightly.","“Babidi!”","Ten terrifying figures appeared in the core chamber.","The entire space trembled.","Babidi continuously retreated, feeling somewhat suffocated under the suppression.","Not much different from Jian Wushuang.","In fact, Jian Wushuang could withstand the pressure better than him.","Seeing these people, Dylan showed no fear. He directly stood in front of Babidi, extending his hands to block","everyone.","This time, without needing Babidi’s urging, Jian Wushuang frenziedly destroyed those eggshells.","He wanted the Giant God Clan expert to come out quickly.","Otherwise, they might be eliminated this time.","“Everyone, what are you doing?” Although Babidi was stunned, he knew that he had to buy time for Jian Wushuang.","Hun Tian cast, a sidelong glance at Jian Wushuang. He then opened his mouth and said, Respected Lord Babidi, it’s time to fulfill your promise back then!”","“Let me ask you quictly, what exactly is our esteemed Lord Babidi doing behind our backs?” Shi Xuan","approached slowly.","Dylan tried to intervene, but Shi Xuan’s fist struck him square in the chest, causing his entire body to cave in.","One punch heavily injured Dylan, and it didn’t leak any shen power.","Babidi retreated to a corner, not daring to move.","Although he knew these people wouldn’t kill him, if he were taken away, he would be finished,","Before, these people hadn’t laid a hand on him, intending to let him fatten up.","Now that he was fat. enough, it was time to reel him in and enjoy him properly.","“Hmm?” Shi Xuan also noticed Jian Wushuang.","He could only see the aura of 200,000-fold divine power from Jian Wushuang’s body. He could not see his","realm clearly.","A Tribulation Realm expert with 200,000-fold divine power was actually not afraid of them. Moreover, after they descended, he was fiddling with a huge egg","This surprised Shi Xuan.","“That power, it’s in the egg” Hun Tian noticed this at last.","The interior of the cosmic ship was special; they hadn’t noticed anything wrong when they first arrived, but now they discovered that the giant egg was emitting the aura of an Eight Tribulation realm.","Realizing that further probing was futile, Jian Wushuang made a decision and simply jumped down from the giant egg, blocking everyone’s path.","Hun Tian sneered, mocking, “What’s this? Lord Babidi has no one left under his command?”","A Tribulation Realm with a divine power of 200,000-fold was now standing in front of nine Seven Tribulation realm experts, daring to confront even Hun Tian, who possessed the combat power of the Eight Tribulation. “Allowing a wet-behind-the-ears kid to come out and stand in for you?”","Everyone chuckled.","In their eyes, if one’s divine power did not exceed a million-fold, one could not be considered a super expert.","A million-fold divine power required at least the strength of a Half-Step Seven Tribulation realm. Dylan just had slightly over a million-fold divine power, yet he was defeated by Shi Xuan with a single punch. The weakest of these old fellows had more than 1.5 million-fold divine power.","The pressure was immense.","Even if the real Jian Wushuang were here and used his strongest Starry Sky Chronicles, it would feel like","giving these people a massage.","Although the Starry Sky Chronicles could trap opponents in a starry picture.","But these people might not be able to break through all techniques.","However, breaking Jian Wushuang’s techniques was still easy.","Jian Wushuang remained calm.","Not just because it was his clone, but because he had a plan.","“You old folks!” Jian Wushuang’s lips curled up, directly shouting angrily, “This is the egg of the Giant God Clan,","containing the method for you to rekindle your cultivation path. I dare you to attack!”","Ilun Tian and the others were stunned.","But Shi Xuan’s eyes flickered, sneering, “Kid, you dare to bluff me!”","“Isk tsk. I’m not bluffing you. If you don’t believe me, try attacking” Jian Wushuang stepped aside, gesturing","for everyone to come forward.","At this moment, Babidi was furious. This was his masterpiece.","Even if he died, he didn’t want these people to ruin it.","“You dare!” Babidi cast a secret technique, directly setting up a barrier around the Giant God Egg.","Ile wanted to continue dragging this out.","The more Iun Tian looked at it, the more he felt that something was amiss. The power of Death within was","still rising,","If they were to release the other party, they might not stand a chance against them.","There was also the looming crisis of Falling!","‘Destroy it?” All eyes turned towards it.","A voice sounded in their hearts.","This was a disaster! They believed that Babidi could revive an inanimate object and enhance its power to such an extent, thinking that he had created a method to reignite the path","Destroying this egg would incur no significant loss.","cultivation.","But Babidi himself knew very well that he had not created any method to reignite the path of cultivation.","He hadn’t even thought about it, let alone creating it for the betterment of the entire spacetime.","His plan was simply to control all Scattered Tribulation cultivators and then dominate the entire temporal","river.","Among the nine great spacetimes, what was most abundant?","Scattered Tribulation cultivators!","Apart from the three eternal existences at the Nine Tribulation realm, the rest would mostly tread the path of","Scattered Tribulation.","And such powerful individuals would only increase in number.","As long as he controlled these people, Babidi could dominate the spacetime.","That’s why he chose to revive this dead giant cgg.","Once his experiment succeeded, he could use the Giant Gods with the power of Death to corrode those","Scattered Tribulation cultivators and then take control of them.","“No!” Babidi cried out. Dylan struggled to rise from the ground, still attempting to intervene, but was directly crushed by the","overwhelming aura, leaving only half a life.","Jian Wushuang, however, didn’t think as much as Babidi did. A trace of satisfaction appeared in his heart, then","he calmly waited for these people to make their move. “Hah!” Hun Tiandi gathered energy in his hands, condensing two clusters of colorful energy waves from his clenched fists. With a press of his hands, the two energy waves merged together, instantly erupting with a devastating aura.","“Ancient!”","Buzz!","His aura increased once again.","This time, Jian Wushuang directly arrived behind Hun Tian. The aura was too powerful. He might die if he was","even slightly affected.","This attack could destroy the entire Yongheng Kingdom and shake the Ancient Wood Continent.","Perhaps the entire continent would sink.","This was madness!","The other nine Seven Tribulations realm individuals were also stirred by it."]},{"number":5721,"title":"Chapter 5721 Hun Tian’s Terror","paragraphs":["5721 Hun Tian’s Terror","....","They had never been this aggressive on the Ancient Wood Continent before.","Even if they had acted before, they hadn’t possessed such formidable strength.","The power gathered between Hun Tian’s hands had reached the level of the Eight Tribulation realm.","This strike could truly annihilate the Yongheng Kingdom,","But it didn’t matter anymore.","With all the people blood-sacrificed by Hun Tian, now that he unleashed this strike, the disappearance of the Yongheng Kingdom meant nothing.","It was considered a complete destruction!","“Break!” Emperor Ilun Tian shouted the final word, and the colorful energy waves between his bands burst. out, instantly destroying the cosmic boat.","Jian Wushuang’s hands moved swiftly, bringing Dylan and Babidi to a safe location.","That was behind those at the Seven Tribulation realm, relying on their aura. of energy.","withstand the powerful waves","A scalding heat wave surged forth, capable of instantly melting divine bodies to a fraction of their original size. Fortunately, Babidi had amplified his divine power to 200,000-fold.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t even have been able to witness this terrifying strike.","Enduring the heat wave, through endless white light, Jian Wushuang witnessed the power of the Right Tribulation realm with his own eyes.","The entire Yongheng Kingdom was utterly destroyed.","Looking down from above the Ancient Wood Continent, there was now a profound and unfathomable crater on the land.","After the heat wave and white light passed, there were tremors and earthquakes,","Nearby kingdoms, and even the entire Ancient Wood Continent, were shaking.","It took several breaths before things gradually calmed down.","Jian Wushuang was completely stunned.","He recalled the Moro Temporal River back then. At that time, learning about its destruction, he had thought everyone had perished, but now it seemed they were simply destroyed by pure power.","Destroying a middle-grade temporal river wasn’t just because of simple consumption. Utter terror!","These two words couldn’t adequately describe Jian Wushuang’s state of mind at this moment.","As the intense light reflected back, everyone experienced a brief moment of blindness.","It seemed like Hun Tian had exhausted some of his power, as his entire aura diminished slightly.","The other Seven Tribulation experts sighed in relief; luckily, they didn’t directly confront Hun Tian. Otherwise, even if they didn’t die, they would be severely injured by such a strike.","It was terrifying.","The power of the Right Tribulation realm was indeed beyond their reach.","Only by sacrificing his own bloodline, Hun Tian had regained his peak strength, comparable to the Right Tribulation realm.","However, such power should be limited; Hun Tian wouldn’t be able to use the same means many times. Even so, at this moment in the Ancient Wood Continent, Hun Tian’s strength could still rank in the top five.","Apart from the Eight. Tribulation realm, only the Universe Masters of the Sevent Tribulation could contend with Hun Tian.","Many people were witnessing such terrifying power for the first time.","Babidi, who had once followed Mie Sheng in his prime, wasn’t particularly shocked by this strike.","He was only worried about the Giant God Egg being destroyed.","Now, he stared fixedly at the black mist at the center of the intense light, as did the others.","“It should be dead!” Shi Xuan trembled and said.","Although Jian Wushuang’s strength was not as formidable as these people, he was very sensitive to the aura of Death: be could still sense a hint of it lingering.","Just now, Hun Tian’s full-force strike didn’t destroy the Giant God Egg.","Now they had to wait for the intense light to dissipate and see what happened.","Even if it hadn’t died, it probably only had a breath left. Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly; if these","people knew the truth, they would probably regret acting now.","Babidi’s hopes were all pinned on the Giant God Egg, which was related to creating a way to reignite the path of cultivation.","If it was destroyed now, everything would be over.","Hun Tian retracted his aura, gasping for breath.","Just now, he had exerted all his divine power, and it had indeed consumed a lot.","The power of the Scattered Tribulation was diminishing, and he wouldn’t be able to use attacks of this level many times.","Of course, he was also gambling, If he could reignite the path of cultivation this time, then the energy he had expended now would be worth it.","Splash!","The intense light faded away.","Outside the boundaries of the Yongheng Kingdom, the dazzling light vanished as well.","Countless Tribulation Realm cultivators who had come to watch hastily retreated.","The recent surge of power exceeded their expectations.","If it weren’t for the blood screen, they would have been doomed.","The wave of energy pierced through the Giant God Egg, with the remaining force striking the blood screen alone, fortunately, screen was immensely powerful and did not rupture.","If it had ruptured, just a tiny bit of force would have been enough to annihilate those unfortunate Tribulation Realm cultivators.","As for Jian Wushuang and the others, they were protected by several Sevent Tribulation experts, so there was no danger, just temporary blindness caused by the intense light.","Now that the intense light had settled, the three of them stood up.","Dylan, already heavily injured, was still supporting Babidi.","“It’s over, my lord!” Dylan sighed, his gaze fixed on the position of the Giant God Egg.","Babidi’s eyes seemed ready to burst.","Only Jian Wushuang felt that things weren’t so simple.","At the location of the egg, only some floating eggshells remained, with the Giant God entity inside gone.","But the aura of Death lingered.","The drifting air!","Shi Xuan and the others breathed a sigh of relief, saying casually, “It seems to be resolved!”","“Hun Tian!”","Others were worried about the future development. The display of strength by the Hun Tian was too","terrifying; they were no match for him.","And now Babidi was right beside them!","Everyone wanted to claim him for themselves.","A major battle was about to break out.","But as they were preparing to face the Ilun Tian, they found him motionless, his face pale.","“Not good!” Shi Xuan was the first to sense something was wrong and quickly retreated.","Just as Shi Xuan retreated and the others were reacting, Hun Tian’s physical body instantly exploded.","The power of Death surged once again.","With his flesh torn apart, Hun Tian seemed to escape from a prison, his divine body fleeing far away before finally coming to a stop.","‘Ile was actually within my body!” Hun Tian’s face was shocked. Just moments ago, he thought he had dealt with it, but he hadn’t expected that within the absorbed breath, there was actually a force of Death,","Moreover, this force had a will.","The crowd shifted their gazes to the bursting body of Hun Tian, their eyes vacant.","“He’s still alive!” Babidi cxclaimed excitedly.","As long as the Giant God in the egg was alive, there was still hope for a turnaround.","None of the top ten Tribulation Realm experts here were his match.","Jian Wushuang also found it astonishing.","Ile had thought that even if this Giant God didn’t die, it should have been severely injured.","But now, that force of Death was rapidly escalating, continuously growing stronger.","It was a terrifying power.","In the sky, countless breaths of Death gradually condensed into a black mist, then rushed toward the place","where Hun Tian’s body burst.","It seemed as though they were merging.","Hun Tian, after recovering, narrowed his eyes and shouted angrily, “Quick, take action, kill him!”","At this moment, the others also reacted and began to exert all their strength.","Hun Tian once again compressed his aura with both hands, preparing to unleash another powerful attack.","But Babidi stepped forward, standing in front of where the black mist was condensing.","“If any of you dare to move again, I’ll kill even myself?!” Babidi gritted his teeth. He didn’t want to be controlled","by others again. The days when he was treated like a dog by Mie Sheng were not easy.","After finally escaping and enjoying freedom for such a long time, he didn’t want to be controlled by these people."]},{"number":5722,"title":"Chapter 5722 Die Together","paragraphs":["5722 Die Together","....","Even in the face of death, they refused to yield.","Shi Xuan and the others hesitated. If they killed Babidi, their efforts would be in vain. Seeing their hesitation, Hun Tian erupted, “Won’t any of you just go and grab him?!”","Only then did someone react and try to seize Babidi.","Buzz!","As soon as the Seven Tribulations powerhouse approached, he was stopped by the protective shield around Babidi.","‘Iaha, it’s not that easy to catch me. As long as you attack, I’ll remove the shield, and we’ll all die together!” Jian Wushuang watched with emotion. At this point, he had no way out and could only be a bystander. This time, it could be considered not in vain. They had even seen the power of an Eight Tribulations expert, with the only regret perhaps being that they hadn’t witnessed the birth of the Giant God!","Although these Seven Tribulations experts were very cager","resume their cultivation path, they would still","choose their lives over it.","“Attack!”","This time, no one hesitated.","They were determined to kill Babidi together.","Otherwise, once that Giant God fully condensed, they would be finished.","The aura of Death was too terrifying,","The ten Seven Tribulations experts cach displayed their unique abilities, bringing out their full power.","For a moment, countless lights shone down from the sky.","Jian Wushuang had already dodged early.","A huge petal withered and fell from the sky, followed by a loud boom, shaking the space and causing a disruption in time.","The figures of the people were somewhat distorted.","The space they were in was already unstable, so they could only retreat and see how things would develop,","Jian Wushuang kept his eyes fixed on Dylan, who had fallen into the abyss below.","With a swift movement, he dashed to Dylan’s side and pulled him out from among the rubble.","Seeing the mark on Dylan’s forehead still intact, Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief.","The control mark on Dylan was still there, proving that Babidi was still alive.","Moreover, the aura of Death had not dissipated.","This time, it was Ilun Tian and Shi Xuan, among others, who felt despair.","They couldn’t kill him!","Despite their combined efforts, along with Hun Tian, a super powerhouse with the strength of the Eighth Tribulation...","They were as good as the top experts of that cultivation realm.","Yet, they still couldn’t succeed.","Instead, the aura Df death became denser, and the pressure continued to rise.","Jian Wushuang frowned as he sensed the aura of Death.","Something seemed oll","Babidi was related to Mie Sheng","He was connected to Mie Sheng!","And then, in the ancient temporal space, they encountered Babidi shortly after arriving,","It seemed too much of a coincidence!","Morcover, Babidi had now created something similar to Mic Sheng, using Death as its origin.","Although he wielded the power of Life, it wasn’t his fundamental essence!","Even when he evolved into the Starry Sky, illuminating the universe, his essence remained rooted in the sword.","It was a normal cultivation path, unlike Mie Sheng","His power was not singular.","“Mic Sheng!” Jian Wushuang held Dylan and turned to look at the sky.","Now, he felt like fleeing.","In the sky, black mist gathered and gradually formed a figure.","Enormous in size.","The face of a demon, with crimson lines across its chest.","Giant God!","On his chest were nine crimson lines, connecting to the dark red core at the center.","That was his heart.","Which was still pulsating.","At a glance, Jian Wushuang recognized the figure’s identity.","“The Giant God Clan, descendants of the Chi God!”","The ruler of the Starry Sky, the Giant God Clan!","They also have their own clans and branches.","Frolasa, Fuego, and Fimisa are all members of the main branch of the Giant God Clan, with noble bloodlines.","As for the Chi God lineage, it’s just a branch.","However, even so, they are true members of the Giant God Clan, not to be underestimated.","Moreover, this existence was carefully crafted by Babidi himsell.","Originally supposed to be stillborn, it now has been reborn through the power of Death.","“It’s over!”","The experts of the Seven Tribulation all showed despair.","That power was too terrifying.","Morcover, on the forchead of this Giant God Clan member, there was the mark of enslavement by Babidi.","Whoosh!","Babidi appeared out of thin air, wrapped in a layer of crimson light.","“Thank you, Chi Jiuxiao!” Babidi’s face was full of confidence. He first thanked Red Jiuxiao, then turned to look at those experts of the Tribulation Realm.","Giant God!","Chi Jiuxiao!","When Babidi’s unfriendly gaze swept over. Red Jiuxiao’s cycs also looked over.","This made everyone involuntarily shrink their necks.","“Jian Wushuang, come here!” Babidi beckoned Jian Wushuang to come forward, then pointed at those experts","of the Tribulation Realm and said. “I’ll give you a choice, kneel down and become dogs!”","When Jian Wushuang, flying towards Babidi, heard this, he almost fell from the sky. This was definitely the most arrogant thing he had ever heard.","A choice!","That meant there was no choice at all.","Carrying Dylan, Jian Wushuang came to Babidi’s side and stood behind him.","Now he seemed to have truly become one of Babidi’s people.","“Your performance just now was pretty good!” Babidi’s expression softened for a moment, then he continued, “I originally planned to annihilate you. In this way, that old dog Mic Sheng would definitely go crazy. He spent who knows how long searching for you just to find you. As long as you die, it can be considered giving peace to the Starry Sky. Otherwise, once this guy returns to his peak, he will definitely cause trouble for the Starry","Sky!”","Jian Wushuang remained as composed as ever, since he was just a clone; he had nothing to fear. Listening to Babidi’s explanation, he nodded and replied, “It seems you’ve had a change of heart!”","“Yes!” Babidi admitted without denial.","Originally, he had indeed intended to kill Jian Wushuang.","But now, there was no need for that..","Perhaps witnessing the strength of Chi Jiuxiao, he started to have second thoughts.","Or maybe he had other plans for Jian Wushuang,","Using their own methods against them.","He still wanted to use Jian Wushuang to cradicate Mic Sheng,","For no particular reason, just to vent the resentment he once held.","He wanted to assist Jian Wushuang in devouring Mie Sheng.","Upon hearing this idea, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but sneer inwardly.","He accepted this seemingly kind gesture.","In his view, Babidi still didn’t understand Mie Sheng!","Mie Sheng could communicate with him through the former Moro spacetime.","Who could guarantee that the Giant. God Chi Jiuxiao and Mie Sheng had no connection?","Although the Death power on the two was different, the scent was too similar.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t afford to be careless.","The main body was already planning to escape at any time.","As if seeing through him, Mic Sheng explained. “Rest assured. Chi Jiuxiao doesn’t need to devour the power of","Life to reach the pinnacle!”","It seems he misunderstood!","At this point, Jian Wushuang could only nod, even if it meant having to serve those Seven Tribulation beings.","As an Emperor, he had no choice.","Fortunately, he was just a clone, so he might as well follow Babidi for now!","As for Jian Wushuang’s main body, it was hiding in Yuc Kingdom, waiting for the Sacred Assembly to enter the","Wanliu Divine Tree.","Next, it depended on Babidi’s plans.","Seeing Ilun Tian and others hesitating, Babidi placed his palm on Dylan’s chest, instantly healing Dylan’s","injuries."]},{"number":5723,"title":"Chapter 5723 Chi Jiuxiao","paragraphs":["5723 Chi Jiuxiao","....","Jian Wushuang was surprised to see this scene, not expecting Babidi to possess such abilities.","It was a reminder not to underestimate others.","Despite his seemingly average strength, he could control so many powerful individuals, even providing healing and amplification.","Hmm!","After Dylan recovered, standing behind Babidi, he stared at those twisted super strong individuals, a smirk playing on his lips.","They were just taking advantage of others.","“Chi Jiuxiao, go kill a few to warm up!” Babidi felt slighted by these people. Three breaths had passed, and they still hadn’t made up their minds.","Hearing Babidi’s command, Chi Jiuxiao acted instantly.","He went straight for the most powerful Hun Tian.","His intuition told him that devouring the opponent would strengthen himself.","This was the most twisted aspect of Chi Jiuxiao, and also what made Babidi proud.","To reignite the path of cultivation in the Scattered Tribulation cultivators, one had to devour weaker Scattered Tribulation cultivators.","Of course, only Chi Jiuxiao could do this.","Regardless, as long as he could reignite the path of cultivation, half the battle was won.","Next, they needed to continue improving, approaching it from a perspective of enslavement, eliminating the demonic nature of devouring, allowing those in the Scattered Tribulation to condense the power of Death for cultivation.","Then, they could create a method to reignite the path of cultivation.","So, practicing this technique meant becoming his servant even for those in the Tribulation Realm.","As for devouring others, that was out of the question.","It would trigger immense temporal disturbances, and the Universe Masters would surely come knocking for trouble.","Although there were many in the Scattered Tribulation, the true power lay with the Universe Masters. And there were also three ancient, eternal beings.","One couldn’t afford to be too arrogant. It was crucial to keep a low profile.","Meanwhile, Chi Jiuxiao had already confronted Hun Tian.","In just a few moves, he severely injured the peak-powered Hun Tian.","The other nine in the Seven Tribulation experts, including Shi Xuan, came to Babidi’s side and knelt before him, paying their respects.","They weren’t foolish.","Refusing now meant only death.","But agreeing meant not only survival but also the opportunity to become among the first superpowers to reignite their cultivation path. Why wouldn’t they agree?","Hun Tian struggled for just a few breaths before collapsing.","“Babidi, I’m willing to be your dog! Hun Tian shouted.","Babidi, however, paid no attention, instead politely chatting with those Seven Tribulation Emperors who had come to pledge allegiance.","This made the powerful figures from the Seventh Tribulation sigh inwardly. Hun Tian was much stronger than them, yet Babidi didn’t care.","It seemed being a dog didn’t depend on strength but on who understood the situation better.","Loyalty came first.","Understanding this, everyone became more eager to please.","Jian Wushuang watched from the sidelines, understanding clearly.","The path of enslavement was indeed remarkable.","Babidi had reached where he was today with absolute mental fortitude.","Seeing that. Hun Tian could no longer hold on, Babidi waved his hand and said, “Jiuxiao, come back!”","Chi Jiuxiao didn’t hesitate at all.","Even though he very much wanted to devour Hun Tian, be obediently returned to Babidi’s side and stood respectfully.","The figure transformed from being the size of tens of thousands of feet towering over, even stronger-looking than the burly Dylan.","The physical form resembled that of a demon, terrifying in appearance.","Just a single glance at it would unsettle one’s mind.","The Seven Tribulation experts, upon witnessing the reverence and obedience of this plague god before Babidi. kneeling in submission, straightened up themselves.","This time, there was no need for Babidi to speak; Hun Tian Emperor flew over directly.","“Lord Babidi!” Hun Tian, like the others, knelt at Babidi’s feet.","The Hun Tian, whose strength was so formidable, the same Hun Tian who had sacrificed all of his kin.","In the end, he became nothing more than a lapdog!","“Hmm!” Babidi held his head high in arrogance, extending a hand adorned with various rings crafted with gemstones.","Hun Tian, seeing the green claw reaching out, swallowed hard.","He leaned forward and kissed it.","“Master!” Ilun Tian’s eyes changed, staring at Babidi’s eyes with utmost respect.","A black mark appeared on his forehead.","The others, upon seeing this, eagerly approached to kiss the back of Babidi’s hand.","Jian Wushuang was speechless as he watched.","He wondered if it were his true self who had come, would he be acting the same as these people now?","For now, it seemed that Babidi intended to keep him.","But he didn’t know if Babidi would enslave his clone.","If he were to be enslaved, he would have to leave.","If his clone were enslaved, his true self would be enslaved too.","Ile would be doomed.","Splash!","A circular cosmic boat appeared above everyone’s heads.","Babidi stood with his hands behind his back, indifferent as he said, “It’s time to leave!”","Whoosh!!!","Everyone simultaneously descended from the suspended compass below the cosmic ship, entering the cabin.","The furnishings inside the core warehouse were peculiar, nothing like objects from their spacetime.","These were artifacts from the stellar civilization.","Their ignorance was understandable.","In front of a round table growing from the ground, Babidi sat at the head, facing Jian Wushuang,","On both sides were ten strong individuals from the Seven Tribulation.","Dylan stood behind Babidi like a guardian, not taking a seat.","On the table lay various types of metal.","Babidi casually picked up a piece and chewed it vigorously.","He was enjoying his meal.","The others, including Jian Wushuang, remained motionless.","Seeing them not eating, Babidi wiped his mouth and cast a cold glance at everyone, saying, “Bring them out, if you’re not going to cat, it’s like disrespecting me!”","Upon hearing this, everyone trembled and hastily picked up the metal from the table, gnawing on it hungrily.","Jian Wushuang hesitated, glancing sideways at the position of Chi Jiuxiao.","Chi Jiuxiao wasn’t seated with them but had constructed a hive above the cabin, his figure shrouded in black","mist..","It seemed to be a customary inheritance.","*Jian Wushuang, why aren’t you eating?” Babidi’s gaze turned unfriendly as he looked at Jian Wushuang.","The others who were still chewing metal also looked at Jian Wushuang with hostile cyes.","Jian Wushuang’s heart stirred, hastily explaining, “Lord Babidi, I have no appetite!”","He didn’t hide anything, speaking directly.","Those Seven Tribulation cultivators were Babidi’s lackeys, but he wasn’t.","Upon hearing his words, Babidi’s eyes grew colder.","The two locked eyes for several breaths, until finally Babidi burst into laughter, ‘Haha, you’re honest, I like","that!”","“Thank you for the praise!” Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief.","As long as he wasn’t enslaved, anything was manageable.","Joining forces to deal with Mie Sheng would be even better.","If Babidi agreed, they could return to the Original Universe’s spacetime now.","And crush Mie Sheng to death directly.","Wouldn’t that be satisfying?","Jian Wushuang was also somewhat eager.","But what Babidi said next poured cold water on his excitement.","soon as","Jian Wushuang, I have high hopes for you. You’re different from those useless people. In the future, you will be able to control the reincarnation of time and space. Practice diligently, catch up with Mic Shenga possible, and when the time comes, I’ll help you devour Mie Sheng!” Babidi’s words made Jian Wushuang feel a bit dejected."]},{"number":5724,"title":"Chapter 5724 Hidden","paragraphs":["5724 Hidden","....","IIun Tian and Shi Xuan, among others, couldn’t help but show envy in their eyes.","Though they were enslaved, they still possessed their own wills.","However, this will was completely controlled by Emperor Babidi.","They would go east if ordered, and never venture west.","Jian Wushuang didn’t feel particularly excited because he had already caught up with Mic Sheng’s pace.","Why would he need Babidi’s help?","It would be better to handle it himself. What if Babidi caused trouble for him again later?","Sigh!","Jian Wushuang’s face revealed a hint of pleasure as he respectfully clasped his fists towards Babidi, expressing his gratitude.","Then he took his seat..","He was curious about where Babidi would take them now.","The Yongheng Kingdom had been destroyed, and when they left, Jian Wushuang had seen Babidi even carve up space. They were evidently planning to completely conceal themselves.","Fortunately, Babidi didn’t intend to conceal anything from them. Instead, he revealed their next course of action.","To reignite the path of cultivation,","This was also what Hun Tian, Shi Xuan, and the others were most looking forward to.","According to Babidi’s plan, they would venture into a dangerous place, wait for a while, then head to a special location to search for a treasure.","Once they obtained this treasure, Babidi would be able to create the path to reignite cultivation.","“Now I need to make some arrangements. Some of you need to return to your respective sects and conceal my involvement. I’ll give you specific instructions later, Babidi began assigning tasks to everyone.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t particularly bothered, just listening with curiosity.","Jiang Liang of the Ancient Wood Sect, as well as the other elders of the seven star sects, were to return to their own forces and continue their normal cultivation.","Il Babidi needed them, he would notify them.","These individuals, even though enslaved, were not afraid of betrayal.","They may have departed, but every move they made was under the surveillance of Babidi, with no possibility of escape.","“Alright, this should be the arrangement. Follow my orders in everything!”","Babidi’s expression was serious. He was more concerned about the method of rekindling the path of cultivation than the Scattered Tribulation cultivators.","Upon hearing this, everyone readily accepted the command.","“Yes, we will not disappoint the Lord’s expectations!”","Babidi casually took out a stack of tokens and distributed them among the crowd.","Each token had a number on it, ranging from one to ten.","Hun Tian held token number one, Shi Xuan held number two, and Jiang Liang from the Ancient Wood Sect held number three.","It seemed to be arranged according to strength.","However, the tokens didn’t seem to have any special features.","Jian Wushuang didn’t take one, so he was a bit curious.","At this moment, Babidi explained, “With this token, you are my people. This plan requires concealing our identities for now, but in the future, you can openly declare yourselves as my people to the outside world, or even claim to be my godsons!”","“Yes, godfather!”","Hun Tian, who suddenly became clever this time, was the first to speak, addressing Babidi.","It was almost like acknowledging a thief as one’s father.","The others also followed suit and addressed him accordingly.","Jian Wushuang stared at Shi Xuan; after all, his father was still alive!","“Alright, you can set off now. Those who haven’t received orders can stay here and practice in the secret chambers as they wish!”","Babidi, now satisfied after eating, slowly stood up from his chair.","Jian Wushuang glanced around, some people left, while others got up and entered the secret room to cultivate.","It all seemed quite normal.","But just moments ago, they were fighting fiercely, as if it were a matter of life and death.","How unpredictable life can be!","Babidi also left the cabin.","As he entered his own core cabin, he turned to Jian Wushuang and said, ‘Jian Wushuang, if you need any treasures, feel free to ask me anytime!”","With that, be departed.","Dylan also followed, entering the core cabin.","Now, only Jian Wushuang remained in the cabin.","He looked up and saw Chi Jiuxiao’s hive, remembering that this guy was also here.","Instead of rushing into the secret room to cultivate, he went to the edge of the cabin and looked outwards.","Before the enormous floor-to-ceiling window, everything was transparent, allowing him to see the scenery","outside.","They were like miniature universes, cach representing a Universe Master.","Though he didn’t know where the flying boat was headed.","But he was clear that he should also head towards the Universe Master.","Leaving the Qishen Temple, merely 10,000 years had passed.","As an Emperor, he had already participated in battles at the level of the Eight Tribulation realm.","Though he was merely a bystander, not needing to exert himself.","But it was still somewhat difficult.","He needed continuous strength to establish himself firmly in the Ancient. Moon Spacetime.","With determined thoughts, Jian Wushuang closed his eyes slowly as he sat cross-legged in front of the floor-to-ceiling window.","His main consciousness also returned to his original form.","In Yue Kingdom, Wu Mansion.","Just three days had passed since the incident in the Yongheng Kingdom, and the entire Ancient Wood Continent, even the Ancient Moon Spacetime, knew about it.","Hun Tian had sacrificed countless lives, leading to heavy casualties as major forces went to besiege him.","The patriarch of the Shi Family, Shi Xuan, had also fallen.","Only four individuals returned alive from the nine great Tribulation Realms.","In no time, the news swept across various regions.","From the Tribulation Realms to the Emperors, everyone was discussing it.","After the fall of the Blood Sunset in the Yongheng Kingdom, many went to investigate.","On this day, Elder Muchen arrived at the Wu Residence, insisting on taking Jian Wushuang and Wu Li along to","join the commotion.","There was no choice; given the elder’s high status, they could only follow along.","For some reason, Jian Wushuang noticed that Wu Li didn’t seem too concerned about the matter.","By all accounts, such a massive battle should have caused shock and curiosity to anyone.","The three set off together, reaching the Yongheng Kingdom in a day.","Jian Wushuang pretended to be curious, looking around.","There was no choice but to play along.","Just a few days ago, his clone had left with Babidi.","Ile was too familiar with everything here.","As for the big battle and the inside story, he knew more than anyone.","He simply had no curiosity about it.","Not even half a day passed before he began persuading Elder Muchen to leave with him,","There really wasn’t anything worth seeing.","The space and land here were all gone.","There was only a huge black hole left.","Not even a trace aura remained.","It wasn’t a battlefield relic; there was nothing to study.","Finally, persuaded by him and Wu Li, the three turned and left.","As they departed, on the other side of the black hole, a group of people arrived.","“They’re from the Yue Kingdom. They’re quite close to the Yongheng Kingdom; they’re much faster than our people from the Shi Kingdom!” one of the young men in the group said methodically.","There were seven in the group: four elders and three young people.","When they heard about the Yue Kingdom, one of the young men spoke up. “The Yue Kingdom... I’ve heard that","not long ago, Shi Jiu suffered a great loss in the Yue Kingdom and was put into a deep sleep by an Emperor!” “To defeat Shi Jiu, it seems that person’s divine power surpasses 180,000-fold. I’m itching for a fight!”","The two young Emperors chattered away casually.","But the woman in red standing before them seemed indifferent."]},{"number":5725,"title":"Chapter 5725 The Last Practice","paragraphs":["5725 The Last Practice","....","She had been observing the tidal black hole, descending into the abyss below. The battles at the Tribulation Realm level intrigued her greatly.","Especially the battles at the Seven Tribulation realm.","However, the two young Emperors behind her were engrossed in discussing matters concerning Yue Kingdom.","“By the way, the Emperor who defeated Shi Jiu, he’s the prodigy of that family, since we’re so close to Yuc Kingdom, why not pay a visit!” one of the young Emperors remarked.","‘I heard he’s the nephew of Patriarch Wu’s, what was his name again?” the other young Emperor scratched his head, then remembered and said, ‘Right, he’s called Jian Wushuang!”","“Jian Wushuang!”","When she heard this name, the expression on the woman in red changed, and almost involuntarily, she turned to look at the two men.","Seeing the expression on the woman in red, both men were startled.","They were the guardians of the Shi Kingdom’s divine spirits, Tian Yi, and also the prodigies of the Shi Kingdom.","But compared to this woman in red, their status was much lower.","That woman in red was the strongest among the recent prodigies of the Shi Kingdom’s Emperors.","She was also the most esteemed among the descendants of the Flame God.","Her status exceeded that of ordinary Universe Masters and was the one successor that the Flame God cared about the most.","This time, four Five Tribulation experts were arranged to protect her.","The other two successors, descendants of the Flame God, though jealous, were inferior to this woman in both status and divine power.","Tan Tianfeng!”","Or rather, “Tan Feng,” the head of the 18 Divine Generals of the Qishen Temple!","When she heard Jian Wushuang’s name, instead of being surprised, she felt excited.","Now, she was much stronger than she used to be, and she had long wanted to show off to someone.","In fact, she believed she had already surpassed the former Jueyun.","“Jian Wushuang!” Fan Feng silently repeated in her heart.","She also learned some things about. Jian Wushuang’s recent thousand years from the mouths of the two men.","He was Patriarch Wu’s nephew, and he was also the future son-in-law of Yue Kingdom.","“Tsk tsk, while we’re all striving forward, you’re just thinking about becoming a son-in-law as soon as you arrive!” Fan Teng sneered inwardly.","Behind them, the two young Emperors didn’t know what the young lady was thinking, and for a moment, they fell silent.","Fan Tianfeng had made up her mind at this moment.","She spoke up, “Let’s go back to the Shi Kingdom and visit the royal family, What kind of waste lost to a kid from the Yue Kingdom and even got their lover stolen by him? They can afford to lose face, but we can’t afford to lose lace with them!”","“Umm?” Both of them hesitated.","What did it have to do with them if the Shi Kingdom’s royal family lost face?","Little did they know, Fan Feng was preparing to take action against Jian Wushuang","And she already had a plan.","Jian Wushuang, who was particularly good at calculating, couldn’t have imagined that he would be schemed by","his own people.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang returned to the Wu Residence. After finally sending Elder Muchen away, he hurried back to his room to cultivate.","He had quite a few treasures on him now,","Especially the Origin Source treasures, with the help of Wu Li, he had exchanged for quite a few.","Now was the perfect time to further enhance his strength before the Sacred Assembly arrived.","Ever since his battle with Shi Jiu, he felt that he couldn’t underestimate the Emperors of the Ancient Wood","Continent.","Perhaps those Emperors who didn’t reveal their full strength had some trump cards.","Just like Sang Biao and Nikun.","A sudden eruption was the most terrifying.","He didn’t want to lose to someone of the same level.","To be honest, after breaking through to become an Emperor, he hadn’t secluded himself for cultivation.","Among Emperors, he had the least improvement in strength.","Of course, this was in terms of the Dao Merge. The time spent on Dao Merge wasn’t counted.","The time when he improved the most in strength was still the Dao Lord.","Even among Emperors, he couldn’t fall behind.","Rumble!","The barrier was set up, and the flow of time was adjusted to 100,000 times.","1 year outside was equivalent to 100,000 years here.","With more than two million years left before the wedding, he planned to come out of seclusion a month early","and spend the remaining time on cultivation.","Over 200,000 years would be enough for him to digest the treasures he had recently acquired.","The Origin Source treasures were worth billions.","In the Qishen Temple, or even in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, the strength required to produce such a multitude of treasures at once would be at least that of a Three Tribulation expert.","Even some Three Tribulation experts might struggle to produce so many treasures at once, considering the","vast gap in strength among peers.","Tribulation Realm experts were not Emperors.","The Scattered Tribulation of the Three Tribulation and the Universe Master of the Three Tribulation could be","said to be as different as heaven and earth.","“The Heart of Spacetime!” Jian Wushuang opened a jade box, feeling somewhat curious.","According to the description above, this circular stone, entirely emerald green, was valued at 70 million cubic","units of universe crystals.","It accounted for one-fifth of all the treasures displayed.","This treasure was no ordinary item.","It contained the true essence of spacetime.","Currently, he had only scratched the surface of the essence of time.","He was still completely ignorant when it came to spacetime.","Space was straightforward.","Time, however, was intricate.","At present, he hadn’t even grasped the concept of time, so how could he understand the power of spacetime?","It was merely a vague sensation.","For example, he knew that spacetime could traverse the future and the past.","Just that.","“Devour!” Jian Wushuang exerted force with the palm of his hand, and the power of the Heart of Spacetime","entered his Origin Source Starry Sky.","Buzz!","6,000 black holes simultaneously operated, crupting with power comparable to that of a Universe Master.","Although he hadn’t come into contact with many Universe Masters, through conversations with Wu Li, he had","gained some understanding.","The Origin Source primarily consisted of divine power.","Space was very weak, and time was even more ordinary.","The time cultivated by many Seven Tribulation experts was not even comparable to that of the Universe","Master of the Five Tribulation in the Moro Spacetime back then.","After all, they only used spacetime as an auxiliary, without focusing on it. 1,000 black holes could condense the essence of the universe, becoming the Universe Master.","Jian Wushuang only considered them micro-universes when he saw those universes.","They were just too small, not even comparable to his One Thought Universe.","Let alone his Origin Source Starry Sky.","Just by lighting up 6,000 black holes, it could rival the Universe Masters of the Four Tribulation.","In the Ancient. Moon Spacetime. 10,000 black holes represented the pinnacle of the Four Tribulation Universe Master,","Of course, this could only be said that the Universe Master of the Ancient Moon Spacetime was much weaker","in space.","But divine power could make up for this shortcoming.","Coupled with complete methods.","The strong of the Ancient Moon Spacetime Tribulation Realm were overall stronger than those of the Moro","Spacetime.","However, there was one thing that made the Tribulation Realm cultivators of the Ancient Moon Spacetime","envious.","That is, the strong of the Moro Spacetime’s have better control of spacetime.","The time of tribulation crossing would be very long. The strong of the Ancient. Moon Spacetime’s tribulation would come a little faster.","The top-notch experts who walked through spacetime could grasp time more accurately and could delay it.","They had more than three times the time of the strong following the divine power route.","This is also why initially, most of the Moro Spacetime were Universe Masters.","They could better overcome the tribulation, and thus there were very few Scattered Tribulation cultivators","from the Moro Spacetime.","This also made many Tribulation Realm experts feel despair. They were unwilling to become Scattered","Tribulation even if they fought until they died.","Qishen was like this.","It’s also possible that, initially encountering Mic Sheng, they were unwilling to become Scattered Tribulation","cultivators and chose to cooperate with Mic Sheng.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang understood Qishen’s approach.","Those Seven Tribulation cultivators of the Ancient Moon Spacetime were all willing to gather enough.","Compared to Qishen, Qishen was still a bit more magnanimous."]},{"number":5726,"title":"Chapter 5726 Peak of Divine Power","paragraphs":["5726 Peak of Divine Power","....","Only with Mie Sheng did he collaborate.","In order to reignite the path of cultivation.","All these Scattered Tribulation cultivators were striving.","There was no right or wrong,","Jian Wushuang sighed and began to continue his cultivation.","Having devoured the heart of spacetime, he once again lit up thousands of black holes.","In the Origin Source Starry Sky, seven thousand black holes had already been lit.","Then it was time to slowly digest.","He couldn’t be too hasty, after all, it was power devoured.","It needed to be stabilized.","For ten thousand years, Jian Wushuang stabilized the Origin Source Starry Sky, then devoured once again.","It took 100,000 years in total before he completely devoured all the treasures of the Origin Source and stabilized all the black holes together.","The strongest universe in the Starry Sky was about to be born.","Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source avatar stood above his own universe, quite satisfied.","A full 9,000 black holes.","And the Universe Secret Realms had risen to nine.","When there were 6,000 black holes, he only had one Universe Secret Realm.","Now, having lit up 3,000 more black holes, he refined eight. Universe Secret. Realms.","The deeper the heritage, the faster the cultivation,","Jian Wushuang was very excited.","Nine Universe Secret Realms, for cultivators in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, were already comparable to nine universes.","“Next, it’s time for divine power!” Jian Wushuang took out the bones of Dong Jun, and his aura suddenly surged.","Babidi had amplified his divine power, which was still in effect.","He happened to use this power to accelerate the devouring of Dong Jun’s bones.","Amplified divine power was genuine divine power.","Unlike the Beast God Weapon, which was only illusory.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang exerted his strength, directly reaching 200,000-fold divine power. Meanwhile, his clone gradually transmitted.","This was the power of Babidi, which he couldn’t maintain on his main body for too long, or else it would be detected.","However, just a stick of incense’s time was sufficient.","“Now, with a base divine power of 200,000-fold, let’s use the power of the Beast God fourfold!” Jian Wushuang clenched his fists tightly, letting out a low roar.","Divine power suddenly surged.","One fold of the Reast God’s power directly increased it by 80,000-fold","Two folds equated to 160,000-fold.","Three folds amounted to 240,000-fold.","Four folds, 300,000-fold!","Jian Wushuang held his breath as his divine power reached its peak.","With the basic divine power added, it was already 500,000-fold.","If the amplification from Babidi were subtracted, his basic divine power would still be merely 100,000-fold.","A base divine power of 100,000-fold couldn’t sustain the fourfold power of the Beast God.","Now, with 500,000-fold divine power, it was already comparable to the Five Tribulation realm.","Although most of it wasn’t his true strength.","But being able to erupt like this, Jian Wushuang was already thrilled.","It was like experiencing the strength of the Five Tribulation realm in advance.","If it were just 100,000-fold basic divine power, his peak might only be around 20,000-fold.","But if the basic divine power were increased to 200,000-fold, he could erupt with five hundred thousand times the divine power.","Dong Jun’s remains!","Jian Wushuang reached out his hand and gently touched it, a chill rushing in, piercing his mind.","In the past, Dong Jun had with tens of millions in terms of divine power. Just absorbing the aura he emitted could increase divine power by tens of thousands of times.","Even a glance would cause severe injuries,","Now with 500,000-fold times the divine power, he could touch it at close range.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang rested one hand on the skeleton while gripping the arm placed on it with the other, the force of devouring swirling madly.","The nine infinite universe secrets erupted to the extreme.","Now, what he absorbed was the divine power from the skeleton.","The power was immense.","Even with his current strength increased to 500,000-fold, it was still somewhat challenging,","The golden aura emanating from the golden skeleton continuously gathered into Jian Wushuang’s palm, then transferred to his divine body.","Jian Wushuang’s divine body began to rapidly increase as well.","His basic divine power soared from 100,000-fold to a direct 150,000-fold.","“Too strong!” Jian Wushuang didn’t feel excitement; instead, he frowned.","No wonder Zhen Ling set up restrictions, urging him to devour during the Tribulation Realm.","Now, the burden of devouring was too heavy for him.","A slight instability could crush his divine body.","It should be noted that his divine body had already increased to 500,000-fold.","He had reached the threshold of the Five Tribulation realm.","The weaker Scattered Tribulation cultivators had 500,000-fold divine power, while the strong ones could reach 600,000-fold.","The Universe Masters were exceptions; even if they were not in their own Dao Arena, they could probably crupt with more than 700,000-fold divine power.","If it were in his own Dao Arena, divine power could even exceed a million.","That was the terror of a Universe Master.","But after he became a Universe Master, it would be even more astounding.","He now had 9,000 black holes in his universe.","If calculated by ten thousand, when his own Dao Arena was empowered, he would probably be ten times stronger than the Universe Master of the Ancient Moon Temporal River. This tenfold increase meant a 10,000-fold increase in combat power.","Exceeding 10,000-fold the same level would directly leap several levels. And he had Dong Jun’s skeleton; his divine power wouldn’t fall behind either.","By then, it would be a double blessing.","Breaking through all techniques with one force!","He didn’t believe anyone else could do it. But now, he was starting to have some confidence in himself.","If he succeeded, the power he would have at that time would be immense.","The power of Life was definitely useful for the long term, with assistance as the main role.","Let’s not talk about swallowing, that was only used during cultivation now.","All things and the starry sky were his two strongest combat powers.","The power of all things allowed his Origin Source to reach its limit.","While the power of the Starry Sky represented the strongest of the stars.","The blue power was extremely terrifying.","If it were divine power, it could reach its peak again.","By then, he would have the reincarnation of spacetime plus unlimited divine power,","Traversing past and future, mastering reincarnation.","Divine power breaks through all obstacles.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but gulp, imagining how powerful it would be.","“Ah!!!!”","Clutching his fists, he suddenly burst out.","The divine power transformed from golden flames began to rise.","The basic divine power jumped to 150,000-fold.","According to his estimate, just swallowing all the aura wrapped around the golden bones could increase his","divine power to 200.000-fold.","But he couldn’t do it now.","Because the amplification given to him by Babidi had already shown signs of instability.","If he continued to cultivate like this, Babidi would definitely suspect.","It was time to stop.","He could only slowly swallow the remaining aura.","Huh!","His divine power instantly dropped from 500,000-fold,","The Beast God divine power no longer erupted.??ll new st??ries at n0ve/lbi/??(.)c??m","Only the basic divine power of 150,000-fold remained.","This time it increased by 50,000-fold.","The later the increase, the slower it became.","Just now, he had only absorbed 10 percent of the golden flames.","There were still 90 percent. left to absorb.","10 percent increased his divine power by 50,000-fold.","The remaining 90 percent could increase it by another fifty thousand times.","But after reaching 200,000-fold, these flames might not even increase it by 10,000-fold.","In the Emperor realm, this was probably his limit.","After he couldn’t use Babidi’s power anymore, his basic divine power plus the amplification of the Beast God","power could probably increase to about 3809,000-fold divine power.","With ten thousand years, it would be enough to swallow all the remaining llames.","By then, his basic divine power would be 200,000-fold,","This was his true limit."]},{"number":5727,"title":"Chapter 5727 Dong Jun’s Strength","paragraphs":["5727 Dong Jun’s Strength","....","To further enhance his strength, he had lost the ability to devour those treasures.","He could only wait until after the Tribulation Realm to devour them again.","The skeletal remains of Dong Jun would eventually merge with his own llesh.","By then, it was possible for him to surpass a million-fold divine power.","Up to now, he couldn’t determine Dong Jun’s true strength.","Within the Yongheng Kingdom, he had witnessed the power of an Eighth Tribulation realm.","From Huntuandi, he did not sense the same aura as the one on Dong Jun’s bones.","This indicated that Dong Jun’s past strength surpassed that of Huntuandi by a fair margin.","At least, an Eight Tribulation realm was guaranteed.","Stronger than Qishen Temple.","The peak period of Qishen, even outside his own territory, possessed the strength of a Half-Step Eighth Tribulation, similar to Hun Tuan,","If within his own territory, he could probably unleash the full power of an Eighth Tribulation realm.","Dong Jun’s strength was definitely stronger than both Qishen and Hun Tian.","From Babidi’s words, he could also deduce the strength of Mie Sheng, which was definitely not that of an ordinary Eight Tribulation realm.","At the very least, was close to a Hall-Step Nine Tribulation.","However, over the years, due to certain events, his strength had regressed.","Originally, he planned to return when he reached the Sixt Tribulation, or even when necessary, the Five Tribulation would suffice.","According to his current strength, as long as he became a Tribulation Realm, he would be at the Three Tribulation.","The Five Tribulation was not far away.","But Mic Sheng’s identity was even more terrifying than he had imagined,","Without proper preparation, returning might result in death.","As for others, he had never considered them.","The nine individuals who came to the Ancient Moon Spacetime with him.","He was in the first tier.","Hu Qing could barely reach this threshold.","In the second tier were Fan Feng, Tongtian Buddha, Zhen Wuyang, and Wu Zuo.","In the third tier were Guangying and Gu Qianluo.","The remaining Dongsheng and Wanyan were just tagging along.","Their strength was far below his.","Becoming a Tribulation Realm wasn’t too difficult.","Reaching the Four Tribulation realm was considered a success.","Although Guangying and Gu Qianluo’s strength was slightly lacking, their future was promising, with hopes of reaching the Five Tribulation realm.","After all, they were the top geniuses in the Original Universe’s spacetime.","Achieving the Five Tribulation was nothing to boast about..","There was a high probability that Wu Zuo and Fan Feng would also reach this level.","Zhen Wuyang and Tongtian Buddha, however, were exceptional, with hopes of reaching the Six Tribulation.","Relying on them to deal with Mic Sheng, the spacetime of the Original Universe would have been doomed long ago.","The only two hopes were him and Hu Qing.","However, Jian Wushuang was unaware that Tan Feng had become the successor of the Flame God, and the strongest one at that.","Their strengths were no longer comparable.","The spacetime channels opened by Zhen Ling, infused with fate energy, were comparable to spacetime itself.","All ten of them were born into exceptional circumstances.","Jian Wushuang himself could have become a scion of a prestigious clan like the Wu Family.","Fan Teng had leaped to become one of the strongest Flame God, Houyi, within the Ancient Moon spacetime.","The others had yet to show their prowess, but they wouldn’t be too far behind.","Their backgrounds were quite lofty, preventing premature deaths.","This was their opportunity.","The opportunity to become Tribulation Realm experts.","With their talents, being born into Tribulation Realm families.","With a little refinement, they could become formidable Tribulation Realm experts.","However, becoming a Tribulation Realm was not their goal.","After achieving the status of Emperor, Jian Wushuang felt a sense of security in the Qishen Temple.","But in the Ancient Moon spacetime, wasn’t enough.","Fortunately, through a stroke of luck this time, he received amplification from Babidi.","This allowed his divine power to break through rapidly.","There were also Origin Source treasures.","Although Ancient Moon Spacetime followed the path of divine power origin, there were also many treasures of spacetime origin, and they were relatively cheap.","He could also take advantage of the situation","The power of 9,000 black holes.","improve his own origin, reaching the peak of Emperor.","The converted origin was several times more powerful than before.","The power of the Starry Sky became particularly rich.","Now, when he unleashed the Eternal Ancient Transformation, his strength could probably soar to the level of","the Four Tribulation, or even stronger.","Basic divine power, once reached his limit, was no weaker than his peak state.","This time, it could be considered a stroke of luck.","Originally, when he was an Emperor, his basic divine power could be increased at most by 100,000-fold.","But now, he could increase it to 200,000-fold.","This could be considered as laying down his trump card for the Sacred Assembly!","Jian Wushuang closed his eyes and began the tedious cultivation.","On one side, be condensed black holes with his origin, cultivating it.","On the other side, he devoured the golden flames on the bones.","Hundreds of thousands of years passed.","Under the acceleration of time, he had already cultivated for over 200,000 years.","His divine power had reached its limit.","This time, further improvement was impossible.","If Babidi could amplify his divine body again, there might be hope.","But in that case, Babidi would probably become aware of his clone.","He couldn’t afford to expose himself.","His name had just appeared in the Yue Kingdom, and very few people knew about him.","Otherwise, if Babidi found out, he might take away his main body.","Fortunately, Babidi had bigger plans and hadn’t contacted the outside world, lurking in the shadows all along.","His clone had been quietly cultivating in the cabin and had not noticed anything unusual.","Since entering the core cabin, Babidi had not appeared again.","Instead, it was Chi Jiuxiao who emerged from the hive and entered the core cabin.","It should be under Babidi’s orders.","Otherwise, this guy wouldn’t move.","Jian Wushuang didn’t dare to observe too much. The aura of death emanating from him made him very","uncomfortable.","On this side, Jian Wushuang was about to leave seclusion.","The aura on his skeletal frame had been entirely absorbed.","What remained of the bones needed to merge once he reached the Tribulation Realm.","After his fundamental basic divine power reached 200,000-fold, Jian Wushuang effortlessly broke through to 300,000-fold divine power using three times the power of the Beast God.","Though lacking Babidi’s secret techniques for enhancement, the increase was somewhat diminished.","This also led him to have some respect for Babidi.","The means of enhancement were much more powerful than the Beast God’s weapons.","But the cost was also very high.","To obtain permanent, enhancement, one had to grovel.","Jian Wushuang came to the Ancient Moon Spacetime precisely because he couldn’t kneel down.","Naturally, he couldn’t stoop to being Babidi’s dog,","Now his divine power was not weak, with four times the power of the Beast God, he could crupt to around","350.000-fold.","He was already comparable to a weak point in the Four Tribulation.","II Wu Li weren’t in his own Dao Arena, he could blast Wu Li with just his divine power alone.","If it weren’t for the fact that he hadn’t seen the Wanliu Divine Wood and knew too little information.","He would have wanted to slaughter Wu Li and seize the Jade Sword.","After the Origin Source became several times stronger, the Eternal Ancient Transformation became even more","powerful.","With the strength of the Four Tribulation, he had stood firm.","Since the Dao Merge, he still lacked some tempering.","Like peak confrontations.","The battle with Shi Jiu was completely unsatisfactory.","He couldn’t even handle it after just using the Eternal Ancient Transformation.","As for the battle with Hu Qing, they were all clones, lacking that kind of pressure.","Far from the exhilaration of the fight with Broly back then.","And the cross-tier battles on the Original Planet, the more he fought, the stronger he became.","From the top-notch Great Yan Immortals at the beginning of the fight.","To the Dao Lords at the end, each time surpassing the limit.","What he wanted was that kind of battle.","Almost there!","The Sacred Assembly is about to begin.","At that time, many Universe Masters in the Five Tribulation who will participate in the Sacred Assembly.","No Scattered Tribulation participants.","Facing the Universe Masters head-on."]},{"number":5728,"title":"Chapter 5728 The Chess Piece “Zibai”","paragraphs":["5728 The Chess Piece “Zibai”","....","That was his time to shine.","Even though his main task was to unlock the Wanliu.","But it didn’t stop him from challenging those Universe Masters.","As for the Emperor?","Jian Wushuang shook his head lightly, his fingers rubbing against the scabbard, making a rustling sound.","The Emperor was proud, just like the Jucyun Sword in his hand.","Both seemed a bit inadequate.","Although the Jueyun Sword now possessed the Life power nurtured by him, it could become a Universe Treasure in the future.","But this divine sword did not come from his upbringing since childhood.","What he had was reverence, what was lacking was that warlike heart.","He should find a way to forge a divine sword of his own,","Now, there was still a month until the grand wedding,","No hurry.","After the wedding, he would visit the Shi Kingdom and pay a visit to those divine craftsmen.","To create the embryo of a Universe Treasure.","Using the starry sky as the origin.","Nurture it slowly, until it ascends to become a Universe Master along with him.","By then, he would also need to obtain some special materials.","For this, he could ask Elder Muchen for help.","The only variable was his meager savings.","From head to toe, he couldn’t scrape together 10,000 universe crystals.","There were plenty of valuable treasures, but they couldn’t be liquidated.","“Got it!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered.","His Thought power instantly descended onto the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard. In the realm where the power of void ascended, several avatars sat cross-legged. They were continuously contemplating the origin of spacetime within the chessboard. Some avatars were also pondering the Origin Source of the chess pieces of the ranks.","The Origin Source of the pawn rank had all been completely cleared by him.","Now, only the generals, kings, and gods remained.","Only the origin of the king rank could be contemplated, which was the Origin Source of the Universe Master, Quickly, he found the weakest chess piece.","It seemed that the internal Origin Source resembled the Origin Source of a Universe Master at the Five Tribulation.","Plunging his hand into the chess piece, he exerted force suddenly.","The tremendous suction force instantly drew the universe Origin Source into his hand.","“Come out!” Jian Wushuang angrily shouted, directly activating the power of the chessboard, forcibly pulling the origin into his grasp.","The elongated yellowish Origin Source was exceptionally mild.","It might also be because his current strength was strong enough, and the other party couldn’t break free.","After taking out the Origin Source, Jian Wushuang began to condense the power of Life in his other hand. The Extreme Dao Secret Technique.","“Revive!”","The vigorous power of Life, injected into the yellow Origin Source, quickly activated it. Hum!","The universe Origin Source detached from his hand, beginning to condense consciousness.","Slowly gathering, it eventually formed a figure.","The condensed shadow was a handsome young man dressed in a white robe.","With tied hair, handsome features, and a slender figure.","He was a rare beautiful youth.","“I am Zibai, paying respects to the controller! The shadow bowed to Jian Wushuang,","Jian Wushuang nodded and pointed, using the power of all things to help the other person condense a physical body.","In no time, from a chess piece, he transformed into a living expert at the Tribulation Realm.","The other party possessed the strength of the Five Tribulation.","And completely obeyed his commands, a rare guardian.","The most crucial point was that the other party could hide within his Origin Source. In critical moments, he could come out to save his life.","Even if he couldn’t defeat them, he could help by blocking some attacks for them.","Just like when he fought against Mie Sheng in the past, he threw out all the soldiers and chess pieces.","Now it was time for the generals.","Originally, the First True King had asked him to use these chess pieces to improve his realm.","But now, he either had to devour these Origin Sources or revive them to serve as scapegoats.","‘Perhaps, it’s all arranged by Teacher Xuan Yi!’ Jian Wushuang comforted himsell.","He still hadn’t fully mastered the ability of the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","He needed to keep understanding it.","Otherwise, it would indeed be a waste.","At least after he became a Tribulation Realm expert, he needed to create the peak secret method of the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard for combat.","Otherwise, he would just be idling away his time.","Wait until all the chess pieces were devoured by him.","He wouldn’t know how to use this treasure anymore.","He certainly couldn’t devour the Temporal Origin Source in the future!","That would be too wasteful.","It would be just like devouring the Origin Source inside the treasure of the universe, gaining sesame seeds but","losing watermelons.","Too much of a waste.","No wonder, when he was given the Origin Source of All Things, even Shen Ling was somewhat hesitant.","It was truly a waste!","But without the Origin Source of All Things, he couldn’t achieve Dao Merge so quickly.","Without fusion, how could he come to the Ancient Moon Spacetime!","Everything could be considered an equivalent exchange!","“Zibai!” Jian Wushuang was very satisfied and said, “You wait here, when I need you, I will summon you!”","“Yes!”","Recently, he would use this Five Tribulation powerhouse.","He had universe crystals.","Then he would go and seize it!","And not from the poor.","Ile would go and rob those big families.","This time, during the big wedding, he could just take a look at the strength of those families.","Many of the top ten families of Yue Kingdom did not have a Five Tribulations Realm expert..","Some didn’t even have a Universe Master,","But their strength was not weak.","Backed by the royal family of Yuc Kingdom, it was quite nourishing.","However, lacking strength, guarding those treasures was just a waste. And it was a waste to this world. Let’s","see who’s unlucky!","Thinking about the treasure of a certain family, Jian Wushuang’s lips curled upwards.","How much could there be?","Perhaps tens of billions of universe crystals!","Conservatively, it would be tens of billions.","A normal Four Tribulation would only be worth billions.","It would take a Five Tribulation to be worth tens of billions. But those ancient families with long inheritances had quite a few treasures. Besides the value of inheritance, the reserve of universe crystals probably exceeded","Lens of billions.","As the grand wedding of the Princess of Yue Kingdom approached, the capital gathered many strong individuals from various families. They didn’t know that they would become the fat sheep for today’s groom.","Out of seclusion!","The wedding is just days away.","Although Jian Wushuang was the one being married off, he still had to come out of seclusion early to prepare.","Just as he emerged from seclusion, he received several summoning calls from the token.","Elder Muchen was looking for him again?","Jian Wushuang picked up the token, just about to respond when he felt Elder Muchen’s aura.","With a flicker, he appeared directly in the guest hall of the Wu Mansion.","Elder Muchen and Wu Li had already taken their seats, apparently having arrived carly.","It was just inconvenient to disturb their cultivation. Sccing","Jian Wushuang appear, Elder Muchen was momentarily stunned. Because Jian Wushuang exuded a divine","power aura of 200,000-fold.","And Elder Muchen could tell that this was still normal for Jian Wushuang.","There was inevitably some shock in his heart!","It seemed that Jian Wushuang had become much stronger again,","He hadn’t even reached the Tribulation Realm yet, and he was already this powerful. In the future, becoming a","Tribulation Realm cultivator, becoming the Universe Master, would be as simple as drinking water.","The Four Tribulation was almost a certainty, and there was a great chance for the Five Tribulation. As for the","Six Tribulation, that was a high barrier.","No matter how heaven-defying an Emperor was, no one dared to say for sure that he would definitely become","a Universe Master at the Six Tribulation realm.","“Nephew Wushuang, it seems you’ve gained a lot from this seclusion!” Elder Muchen praised first. In his view, although Jian Wushuang might not ascend to power in the future, his combat power would definitely not be weaker than his own. It was better to get closer now; he would be a great helper in the future."]},{"number":5729,"title":"Chapter 5729 Recalling the Past","paragraphs":["5729 Recalling the Past","....","This kind of relationship, fighting together in the secret realm, also builds complete trust. Much stronger than the cunning old fox Wu Li.","Every good helper is worth the effort of these strong ones to pull in with all their might.","Wu Li also noticed that Jian Wushuang’s aura had become much stronger, but he didn’t say much about it.","For him, the stronger Jian Wushuang became, the better.","At the same time, he wasn’t worried that Jian Wushuang would turn against them.","His background was not simple either.","“Elder Muchen, thank you for the praise, but it’s just a slight breakthrough!” Jian Wushuang modestly shook his head. As his aura began to shrink like a black hole, until he seemed to be nothingness, visible only to the naked","cyc.","But Thought powers couldn’t perceive him.","Of course, this was also because Wu Li’s and Muchen’s strengths were not up to par.","If it were a Universe Master of the Five Tribulation, naturally, they would be able to sense Jian Wushuang’s presence.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s aura disappear, the two were also somewhat surprised, but personal strength was very sensitive, so naturally, they wouldn’t ask much.","“Sit down and talk, we are not outsiders!” Wu Li saw Jian Wushuang standing uncomfortably and spoke up to let him sit down and chat.","Muchen also nodded and said, “Yes! We will soon be a family. Just now, a mansion specially prepared for you and Jincheng has been built. In a few days, you can move in!”","Jian Wushuang could only nod repeatedly as he sat down.","“Nephew Wushuang, I see you’re a bit reserved. Haven’t you ever been married?” Elder Muchen asked curiously.","Such words would certainly not be said in the ordinary mortal world.","But everyone here was a cultivator, and they had all become Emperors in the Tribulation Realm.","There was nothing wrong with saying such things.","Who, during their time in the secular mortal world, hadn’t married a few partners?","But when thinking about some descendants of big families, they were just teenagers in the secular mortal world, and within 10,000 years, they could become Dao Lords.","Jian Wushuang felt a bit sympathetic towards those descendants of big families.","They had never experienced the worldly trials of the secular world.","Hearing Elder Muchen’s question, he thought of his own past.","The days of struggling in the secular world.","The era of Sword Pavilion when he experienced the warmth and coldness of human relationships, devoted solely to the sword.","At that time, he was full of vigor, breaking through anything he disliked with a single sword.","How carefree he was.","Qinghuo World, in the Divine Power Universe.","Every expedition, he faced without fear.","His former companions, brothers, and fellow travelers.","He didn’t know where they were now.","They were separated by a great distance from the Great Si Region.","Even finding the Emperor was difficult.","But now, in the temporal river, there were two great overlords.","Qishen Temple and Temple of World Annihilation.","He wondered if they would disrupt that peaceful land.","It had been some time since he had returned.","But he remembered, never forgot.","Ile often reminisced about the past.","Longing for those days.","Yet he had to keep moving forward.","Carving out his own path.","To revisit the past joys and sorrows.","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang had become the strongest Emperor, about to ascend to the Tribulation Realm.","Looking back at the past, at the path he had walked.","All the hardships were just adding to the cold snow.","His wife!","At the thought, an image appeared in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","Leng Rushuang!","That was his wife, Jian Wushuang would never forget.","Elder Muchen and Wu Li could see the reminiscence in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","The gossip in their hearts flared up, both wanting to hear more.","Especially Wu Li, be still hadn’t figured out Jian Wushuang’s identity, let alone where he came from?","Was it from the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands, or other nine great timelines?","He had never thought that Jian Wushuang came from the Endgame Timeline.","No one would believe that in the Endgame Timeline, such a powerful Emperor would appear.","After Jian Wushuang reminisced, seeing the two curious about him, he quickly explained, “I’ve only had some crushes before, never been married!”","“Well, that’s a bit of a shame!” Elder Muchen slapped his thigh, seeming skeptical.","Wu Li quickly intervened at this point, changing the subject and talking about recent events.","It was about the Sacred Assembly, and Jian Wushuang listened carefully.","No detail escaped him.","According to Wu Li, this time’s Sacred Assembly would not only select candidates for the Holy Maiden but also recruit a group of strong individuals into the Ancient Wood Sect.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang was puzzled. If they were going to recruit strong individuals into the","Ancient Wood Sect, why not just directly recruit them?","The participants in the Sacred Assembly were all strong members of families. What was the point of recruiting these people?","In the Ancient Wood Sect but his heart in the family.","They raised a group of vampires.","It’s better to gather those potential independent cultivators instead.","Only by nurturing such people can there be a sense of belonging.","Elder Muchen also understood this, but he was also somewhat puzzled.","“Of course, I’ve only heard rumors. Some say that during the Sacred Assembly, the Ancient Moon Sect might. recruit peripheral members. But it’s just hearsay, don’t take it seriously!” Wu Li laughed.","The Ancient Moon Sect.","That’s the only Nine Stars Sect.","Even rumors about it would stir many people.","The Ancient. Moon Sect, recruiting peripheral members.","Even the weakest among them is a Universe Master.","Independent cultivators in the Tribulation Realm have no qualifications at all.","Even independent cultivators in the Eighth Tribulation wouldn’t be recruited.","Because within the Ancient Moon Sect, the one thing they are not lacking is Eighth Tribulation experts. Throughout countless ages, the Ancient Moon Sect has accumulated too many Eighth Tribulation experts.","But Eighth Order Universe Masters are scarce.","There’s only one.","Almost every era has one.","Otherwise, it would be difficult. for the Ancient Moon Sect to gain credibility.","With such a superpower as the Eighth Tribulation Universe Master, who wouldn’t want to join?","Even as a peripheral member, they could dominate in the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","That’s why so many people were shocked.","The number of slots for this Sacred Assembly has also been greatly reduced.","Wu Li mentioned this because of his deep regret!","He almost broke his thigh. If he had acted now, he could have made several times more profit.","Instead, it benefited others.","The qualification token he sold was resold to a Universe Master of the Four Tribulation.","Ilis initial agreement still held.","It meant Wu li gained an ally in the Four Tribulation realm.","It wasn’t a bad deal after all.","After some casual conversation, Wu Li sensed that Ekler Muchen had come here with a purpose.","Certainly not for him, so he took the initiative to leave, leaving Jian Wushuang and Muchen to talk alone.","Once Wu Li left, Elder Muchen finally revealed his true intentions.","Initially hesitant, but seeing that Jian Wushuang’s aura had grown much stronger, he felt relieved.","They had been chatting idly until now, only then did Elder Muchen reveal the true reason for his visit.","...","After listening, Jian Wushuang relaxed his brow. He had thought it was something serious, but it turned out to","be about Prince Jinchen, his future brother-in-law, who wanted to spar with him,","That was an easy matter!","“But is be a Universe Master?” Jian Wushuang asked about the other’s strength.","Elder Muchen waved his hand and said, “Not that strong, if he were truly a Universe Master, I wouldn’t have come to find you. That would be too much of bullying!”"]},{"number":5730,"title":"Chapter 5730 Eldest Prince Lu Chen","paragraphs":["5730 Eldest Prince Lu Chen","....","“That’s easy then, I can accompany you anytime!” Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief. If it were the Universe Master, it would be a bit troublesome; he would need to reveal more of his strength.","But if it wasn’t the Universe Master, it was simple. His pure divine power could crush the opponent. “This time, returning from the Ancient Wood Sect, he has already reached the Three Tribulation. He’s getting close to mastering the universe. You better be careful!” Elder Mu Chen reminded. “By the way, there are also several geniuses from the Ancient Wood Sect with him. Remember not to offend them, otherwise, it will be unfavorable for us during the Sacred Meeting!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t reply, just nodded slightly.","As long as he didn’t offend them, everything would be fine.","It was his brother-in-law who seemed intent on challenging him.","Did he know Shi Jiu and had some disagreement with him as his brother-in-law?","Jian Wushuang’s lips curled up, finding it amusing.","Already at the Tribulation Realm, instead of thinking about transcending tribulations, he was bothered by such trivial matters.","His marriage to Jinchen was already set!","It couldn’t be stopped by just a prince.","After discussing this matter, Elder Muchen mentioned some rules for the upcoming wedding in a few days, then left.","Jian Wushuang got up to see him off, but was politely refused.","As soon as Elder Muchen left, Wu Li appeared.","“It seems your brother-in-law isn’t easy to deal with!” Wu Li clasped his hands around his chest, frowned slightly, and turned his gaze to the distant sky, saying. “They’re here!”","Jian Wushuang also followed his gaze.","In the sky, three figures appeared.","Two Universe Masters at the Three Tribulation realm and another who hadn’t yet mastered the universe. Their strength wasn’t considered weak.","These people could be considered the contemporary pride of the Ancient Wood Sect.","Although they were only a few hundred epochs older than Jian Wushuang, their realm had reached the level of Universe Master.","Indeed, they could be considered the pride of the heavens.","‘Evil comes when the good does not.” Jian Wushuang had a smile on his face, unconcerned.","But Wu Li felt a bit uncomfortable deep down.","Entering his Wu Mansion without using the door, they were the first to dare to do so.","Flying in directly, giving him no face at all.","“You must be Jian Wushuang” The leading man in golden armor, with a stern expression, looked at Jian Wushuang with an air of superiority.","Jian Wushuang was not pleased with this feeling, his expression darkened slightly as he said calmly. “You must be His Highness, the Eldest. Prince. Since you’re here, why not come down for a chat?”","‘I don’t see the necessity for this, such a small courtyard, not even enough to stretch one’s legs! The eldest prince, with an air of disdain, didn’t even spare a glance at Wu Li.","This made Wu Li, who valued face greatly, somewhat angry, itching","But if it came to a fight, these three together weren’t a match for him.","teach these three a lesson.","Especially that eldest prince, having just successfully transcended his tribulation and not yet mastered the universe, dared to be so arrogant.","If he became the Universe Master, wouldn’t he need to broaden his horizons?","“Your Highness, if you feel the yard is small, I can specially expand it for you!” Wu Li responded, waving his hand and unleashing a powerful divine force, directly flattening hall of the Wu residence.","This powerful force erupted, yet was extremely restrained.","So much so that despite the destruction of most of the Wu residence, the outside world didn’t feel the ripple of divine power.","This scene made all three of them narrow their eyes.","Wu Li raised his other hand and swept it towards the intact mansion on the other side.","“Is it enough now?” Wu Li gritted his teeth.","Jian Wushuang was speechless. The entire Wu residence had been leveled. Where would they sleep tonight?","In a few days, it would be his wedding day, yet the Wu residence was razed to the ground at this moment. If this got out, wouldn’t it be even more embarrassing?","The eldest prince frowned slightly. He hadn’t expected Wu Li to be so tough.","And his strength was so powerful, beyond his expectations.","It seemed that even the thought of confronting him was not a good idea.","The other two Universe Masters from the Ancient Wood Faction, however, were somewhat curious about Wu Li’s strength and asked, “Is this person the famous expert Wu Li who has transcended the Three Tribulation and become a Universe Master?”","“Yes, he is Wu Li, also the ancestor of the Wu family, one of the ten major families of Yue Kingdom, with the strength of Hall-Step Four Tribulation!” The eldest prince, Lu Chen, responded indifferently.","When Wu Li saw them discussing his title, a hint of a smile finally appeared at the corner of his mouth. Even if they were provoking him, as long as they acknowledged his strength, it was enough.","With a cold snort in his heart, he thought that after he made a name for himself in the Ancient Wood Continent, not to mention a mere prince of Yue Kingdom, even the Empress of Yue Kingdom would have to be polite to him.","Strength spoke louder than words!","Swish!","The three of them landed slowly,","Both sides cyed cach other.","“Wu Li, you’re quite polite!” Lu Chen scanned the surroundings.","This time, it was genuinely spacious.","Jian Wushuang worried about where they would stay for the night.","Having too much anger wasn’t good.","Upon hearing the words of the Eldest Prince, Wu Li sneered, “When the Eldest Prince graces my humble abode, of course, we must be courteous, lest people talk!”","“If that’s the case, then I won’t be polite!” Lu Chen’s expression darkened as he turned to Jian Wushuang.","He didn’t acknowledge this brother-in-law of his.","Not because Jinchen didn’t like him.","But because Jian Wushuang’s background was too weak.","The Ancient. Wood Sect values one’s origins, and years of cultivation had made him understand the importance","of it.","As for concerns within the clan about inviting trouble, he was disdainful.","With the strength of the Shi Kingdom, how could they possibly covet a small country like Yue Kingdom?","If the ancestors of the clan knew of Lu Chen’s thoughts, they would definitely be furious enough to climb out","of their stone collins.","Every force starts from weakness.","Why belittle oneself needlessly?","Indeed, the Shi Kingdom had a good background, but what did it matter?","Coveting Yuc Kingdom was just a normal precaution.","The ambitions of the Shi Kingdom were so vast; outsiders only saw its dominance and power, but they didn’t see its greed for neighboring countries.","Ambitions of a woll.","It was evident for all to see!","If it weren’t for the Ancient Wood Sect holding them back, the Sixteen Kingdoms would have long become one under the Shi Kingdom.","The founding ancestor of the Shi Kingdom was an Eight Tribnulation.","The Flame God guarding the Shi Kingdom was a super powerhouse no weaker than a Universe Master at at the Eight. Tribulation.","Although the Ancient Wood Sect had several Eighth Tribulation ancestors, they weren’t a match for the flame dcity alone.","That’s why the Shi Kingdom dared to be so arrogant.","Moreover, with the demise of the Yongheng Kingdom, the obstacles for the Shi Kingdom diminished even","more.","Among the Sixteen Kingdoms, the unquestionable first was the Shi Kingdom.","Second was the Daughter Kingdom.","Third, the Yongheng Kingdom had already disappeared.","The remaining kingdoms were much weaker, clearly not on the same level. Not only were there no beings of the Eighth Tribulation presiding, but there were only one or two at the Seven Tribulation realm.","If the Shi Kingdom invaded, it would be a complete sweep.","For kingdoms like the Yue Kingdom, if they provoked the Shi Clan, they would probably meet their demise without even knowing how","It was best not to get involved with the Shi Kingdom. Otherwise, they would risk the support of the Ancient Wood Sect. Otherwise, being on the same boat would only make them cannon fodder for the Shi Kingdom. This was something the ancestor of the Yue Kingdom didn’t want to see."]},{"number":5731,"title":"Chapter 5731 Extremely Reserved","paragraphs":["5731 Extremely Reserved","....","The scope of the situation was far beyond what Luchen could imagine; he was merely a child with naive thoughts.","If he wanted a strong background, he might as well serve as a dog to Emperor Babidi.","No, even Babidi wouldn’t bother with such a weak dog!","The Three Tribulation was indeed beneath Babidi’s notice.","Jian Wushuang had a sudden insight; after all, he could consider himself as part of Babidi’s faction, and the backing of the Shi Kingdom wasn’t insignificant!","With the power Babidi currently wielded, sweeping through the Shi Kingdom or defeating it posed no problem whatsoever.","No matter how powerful the Flame God was, could it surpass Chi Jiuxiao’s strength?","Even at the Half-Step Ninth Tribulation, even in the domain of the Flame God, there was nothing to fear.","“Your Highness Luchen, if you’re not satisfied with me, feel free to make a move!” Jian Wushuang’s demeanor remained unchanged.","But as soon as the other party made a move, he would definitely defeat Luchen as quickly as possible.","Luchen didn’t expect Jian Wushuang to be so resolute.","Blood is thicker than water!","“Alright, with that said, you’ve preserved your dignity. However, you’re only an Emperor. If I were to go all out, it would attract ridicule from outsiders. Here’s the deal: I’ll suppress half of my divine power when facing you. If you can withstand it for the duration of an incense stick burning, I won’t meddle in your affairs with Jinchen anymore!” Luchen extended his hand, and his power rapidly diminished.","200,000-fold divine power.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed slightly.","Is this really just half?","A Universe Master at the Three Tribulation usually has just over 200,000-fold divine powers.","Even if he, at the Three Tribulation, had at most. 250,000-fold divine power, suppressing only 50,000-fold, could that still be considered half!","An incense stick burning!","That’s simple enough.","He just worried that he might go too far and the other party wouldn’t last even an incense stick’s time. Wu Li’s face darkened as he looked at Jian Wushuang and transmitted his voice, “I’ve set up a barrier here. You can act as you wish, give him a good beating for me!”","He had absolute confidence in Jian Wushuang, defeating a Three Tribulation was too easy for him. When he defeated Shi Jiu last time, Jian Wushuang’s explosive power was already comparable to a Universe Master at the Three Tribulation.","Now, dealing with a Three Tribulation without control over the universe was simply child’s play.","Indeed!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened upon hearing Wu Li’s words, and he instantly made his move. There was no change in his aura.","This surprised Prince Luchen somewhat. He had thought Jian Wushuang would first reveal his full strength before attacking, but he didn’t expect such audacity.","Could it be that he didn’t realize Jian Wushuang was erupting with 200,000-fold divine power?","But as Jian Wushuang charged, a rain of punches fell from the sky.","Prince Luchen felt his arms numb and his divine body tremble as he tried to respond.","“You actually concealed your aura, how despicable!”","Jian Wushuang said calmly, “Prince Luchen, you can suppress your strength, so is it excessive for me to","conceal my aura?”","With a feeling of emptiness surrounding him, Jian Wushuang seemed like a ghost.","The two Universe Masters from the Ancient Wood Sect were somewhat astonished.","His power is so strange, not leaking a bit of it. He can control his divine power to such a degree!”","“It seems, as Luchen’s junior brother said, he has 200,000-fold divine power at full strength. Look at his attack;","it’s already at its limit. Although he can conceal his aura, this ability somewhat useless when facing off against the Tribulation Realm!”","Although the two were somewhat surprised, they quickly felt they understood Jian Wushuang.","It was Prince Luchen who found it impossible to defeat. Jian Wushuang with 200,000-fold divine power.","In terms of mastering divine power, he was no match for Jian Wushuang.","Buzz!","Blood trickled from the corner of Luchen’s mouth, indicating he had suffered losses in the recent exchange.","His divine power was now leaking uncontrollably, exceeding 200.000-fold.","But Jian Wushuang acted as if he hadn’t noticed.","Wu Li, who was watching from the side, remained silent.","He was actually quite content to let it play out, waiting for Jian Wushuang to unleash and overwhelm his","opponent.","Interfering now would only make it easier for Luchen to leave.","The two Universe Masters from the Ancient Wood Sect, however, frowned.","For a member of a prestigious sect to resort to tricks while facing the Emperor was beneath dignity.","But it was a family matter, so they refrained from commenting further.","Even if it wasn’t, they couldn’t speak up.","To do so would only be more embarrassing.","The right path!","The wrong lies here.","That’s why Jian Wushuang didn’t believe in righteousness or evil.","He only followed his own path.","Even if it defied the heavens.","In his own domain, he was the law,","A move that left him in despair!","Luchen attacked again, but his punch missed Jian Wushuang, leaving him off balance.","He turned to find Jian Wushuang’s whereabouts.","Only to see Jian Wushuang standing in mid-air.","This time, Jian Wushuang was towering above.","“Your Highness, feel free to exert all your strength, no need to hold back!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression remained unchanged as he stood in mid-air like a deity.","Luchen clenched his fist, and his divine power erupted once more.","This time, he unleashed ninety percent of his divine power.","Another eruption, and it would be a fight to the death.","His divine power, all 250,000-fold, dispersed entirely.","Wu Li furrowed his brow, inwardly sighing. No wonder the Empress chose to pass the throne to Princess","Jinchen rather than the Eldest Prince.","His character was lacking. Entering the Ancient Wood Sect was also due to his background; otherwise, with such a mentality, he wouldn’t","amount to much.","“You’ve gone a bit too far, Junior Brother Luchen!” The Universe Master from the Ancient Wood Sect shook his","head.","‘Indeed, it’s a bit excessive. Although Jian Wushuang has a good grasp of divine power and defeating him","should be simple, there’s no need to unleash so much divine power!”","They hadn’t personally fought Jian Wushuang, so they weren’t aware of the reasons behind it.","Only Luchen sweated profusely.","Even now, unleashing 90 percent of his divine power, he still felt oppressed facing Jian Wushuang.","It wasn’t from his divine power, but from his inability to see through the opponent’s true intentions.","And every time he bolstered his divine power, he still couldn’t gain any advantage over Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang looked like he was merely playing a game.","Buzz!","The Prince, with his unleashed power, struck again. This time, he directly employed his peak secret technique,","unleashing the strongest move known on the surface.","“Moony Doom!” The Crown Prince clasped his hands together, resembling a bright moon.","The arcs of electricity crackled around him, bursting forth with terrifying power, surpassing 250,000-fold","divine power.","The spectators were all astonished by this overwhelming display.","As the battle escalated, they found Jian Wushuang quite ordinary.","They couldn’t. Fathom why Luchen was in such a hurry.","Jian Wushuang stood in mid-air, staring at the charging Prince, showing no intention to dodge or evade.","When the Eldest Prince was only an inch away from him, Jian Wushuang suddenly roared.","Instantly, the surroundings dimmed.","Behind him, a massive black hole appeared, containing the power of nine thousand black holes, completely","restrained and devouring.","“Ahhhh!!!”","Space began to shatter under his roar.","Wu Li’s eyes contracted, and he hastily formed seals with both hands to stabilize the surrounding barriers.","Fortunately, the Wu Mansion was fortified with formations."]},{"number":5732,"title":"Chapter 5732 Break the Enemy in One Move","paragraphs":["5732 Break the Enemy in One Move","....","Otherwise, under Jian Wushuang’s roar, half of the royal city would likely crumble.","With legs slightly bent and fists clenched, Jian Wushuang stared at the Eldest. Prince Luchen after his furious shout.","Shockingly, he directly shattered the opponent’s pinnacle secret technique!","Luchen suffered a considerable backlash, his aura dropping significantly.","He suppressed the dullness in his chest, otherwise, the blood boiling in his heart would have spewed onto Jian Wushuang’s face.","Buzz!","After crushing Luchen, Jian Wushuang’s aura once again returned to calmness.","“What’s this?”","The two Universe Masters from the Ancient Wood Sect, upon seeing this, were not only shocked but also puzzled.","Just now, they felt an incredibly powerful cosmic aura emanating from Jian Wushuang.","It surpassed their own power.","Their universe, gradually formed from a thousand black holes, after practicing for such a long time, had only reached 1,200 black holes.","Within their universe, there wasn’t even a secret realm.","Feeling the immense power of black holes emanating from Jian Wushuang, they were undoubtedly surprised and puzzled.","In their view, that power hadn’t. Jully evolved into a cosmos.","It was black holes.","Which meant that Jian Wushuang was definitely an Emperor.","An Emperor whose momentary eruption surpassed them countless times over.","In just a moment, he completely subdued them.","“Wasn’t he supposed to have only 200,000-fold divine power?”","“The information was wrong!”","Luchen barely floated in the void, his face deathly pale.","He could hardly even speak, because opening his mouth would definitely make him cough up blood.","Even Jian Wushuang himself was somewhat surprised by the recent outburst.","‘Seems like I couldn’t get into it!” Jian Wushuang stretched his neck.","Perhaps his Origin Source had ascended too quickly, without the tempering of a great battle, so the sudden cruption didn’t reach its peak.","Originally, he intended to use the power of the Beast God to settle the fight.","But he found Luchen increasingly annoying.","So, he let despair consume Luchen.","A single move shattered the enemy, all without lifting a finger.","Jian Wushuang inflicted heavy injuries on Luchen.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t concerned if Luchen spread the word.","Individuals like Luchen cherished their reputation.","If word got out that he was severely injured by an Emperor with just one shout, it would damage his pride.","Whether others believed it or not, Luchen would never admit it himself.","“Your Highness, I think we’ll end it here, Jian Wushuang said as he descended gracefully to the ground, his white robes untouched by dust.","Meanwhile, Luchen was left looking disheveled.","Coughing. Luchen attempted to speak but only coughed up specks of blood.","Quickly stepping in, Wu Li attempted to smooth things over, “We’re practically family now. This meaningless sparring has gone on long enough. Today, my humble abode is unable to entertain the Eldest. Prince and the esteemed guests from your sect. Let’s leave it for another day. I’ll host, and we can catch up properly, Your","Highness!","‘Imph!” Luchen could only emit a cold snort, unable to say more. With a flick of his sleeve, he soared into the air, not bothering to exchange words with his companions as he departed.","Although the two Universe Masters from the Ancient Wood Sect were present, they received a transmission and hurriedly followed Luchen.","Sighing, Jian Wushuang turned to Wu Li and asked, “What’s next?”","Surveying the surroundings, he realized that within a hundred-mile radius, not even a single tree remained.","Their marriage with Princess Jinchen was imminent.","If anyone saw this devastation, it would be humiliating.","Their home would be reduced to rubble.","Those unaware might assume they lacked the ability to defend themselves and had been attacked at home,","their houses razed to the ground.","“No big deal!” Wu Li chuckled and shook his head before snapping his fingers.","With a crisp sound, the spatial landscape shifted.","Suddenly, a majestic mansion descended onto the cleared ground.","The layout remained unchanged from before, with only minor adjustments made.","Jian Wushuang glanced around, somewhat surprised. ‘Are all these energy formations?”","“Indeed, they are. They’re expendable anyway. As long as we have universe crystals, we can create as many as","we want. The entire capital city is actually built on this kind of layout,” explained Wu Li.","Jian Wushuang understood. He then asked, “But why didn’t I sense it the first time?”","“Haha, these energy formations are from arrays created by experts at the Eight Tribulation. If you could sense","them, that would be surprising!” Wu Li chuckled.","But Jian Wushuang felt a sinking feeling in his heart.","This type of layout was common throughout the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","How could Jian Wushuang not know about it?","And he seemed to know nothing about the energy formations either.","Picking up a wildflower casually, Jian Wushuang played with it in his hand, unaware that Wu Li was once again","suspicious of his identity.","Due to Luchen’s mischief, the Wu Family had also become lively.","Many servants began preparing for the grand wedding three days later.","However, Jian Wushuang enjoyed the leisure, freely wandering around the Wu Family compound, occasionally","instructing the servants on how to arrange things.","He looked like someone about to be married.","It was his first time getting married.","It could also be considered marrying into the family!","He had always heard how undesirable it was to be a son-in-law.","But now he found it quite good.","Just focus on cultivation while others provide resources.","If he had encountered such a good opportunity carlier, be wouldn’t have faced those troublesome situations","later on.","He would have just coasted through life.","But then, perhaps he wouldn’t have been nurtured by Teacher Xuan Yi.","Back then, Teacher Xuan Yi probably nurtured many practitioners.","He was just one of them, but he turned out to be the only super genius to emerge from the Original Universe.","He had come this far without disappointing anyone.","The three days passed slowly.","For Jian Wushuang at this moment, these were the most fulfilling three days he had ever experienced.","During these three days, he felt an unprecedented sense of relaxation.","It was like giving himself a break.","He left everything behind.","Living leisurely.","Strolling around the capital city with Elder Muchen, drinking fine wine.","Fishing in the Divine Dragon Lake, battling ferocious desolate beasts in the White Water Marsh.","It felt exhilarating.","Unfortunately, there were only three days left.","After the grand wedding, he had to depart for the Shi Kingdom to tend to the divine sword embryo.","By the time the embryo was complete, it would be almost time for the Sacred Assembly.","The timing of the Assembly varied from person to person. Perhaps for some, it would end in just tens of thousands of years.","But this time, it was feared it would shake several epochs.","Because Jian Wushuang and Wu Li’s plan was to unlock the Wanliu.","By then, the two of them would become targets of everyone!","All eyes would be on them.","Everyone would want to obtain treasures from the Wanliu Divine Tree through them.","Including the Ancient Wood Sect.","With the revival of the Divine Wood King, there wasn’t much vitality left. They needed vitality suitable for the","Eighth Tribulation from within the Wanliu Divine Tree.","This kind of vitality couldn’t be created by Jian Wushuang.","Even though his Origin Source was powerful now, the Life power vitality he could create was enough to revive.","the flesh of the Qishen.","But to revive the divine body.","That was too difficult.","It was also difficult for him to reach the Tribulation Realm.","Otherwise, he could easily sell vitality and become rich.","With his abundant Life power, he could probably buy the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime in no time.","But that was just something he could think about."]},{"number":5733,"title":"Chapter 5733 Bridal Escort Team","paragraphs":["5733 Bridal Escort Team","....","Even after reaching the Tribulation Realm, he could still infuse vitality into those Scattered Tribulation cultivators at certain stages.","Once exposed, countless tribulation realm experts would flock to him.","Then there would be no more trading.","It was estimated that at that time, all the experts of the eight tribulation realms would vic for him.","Unless one had enough strength, there would be order in the trade.","But if he truly had that kind of strength, why would he bother selling his own Life power?","It would be better to directly raid those clans.","Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Tomorrow was the big wedding.","Taking advantage of the bright moon tonight, he began to paint.","He painted a scene of the ancient moon and spacetime.","He painted slowly and meticulously.","When he returned to the Qishen Temple that day, he would also narrate his experiences in the Ancient Moon Spacetime to some friends.","This painting would be the witness!","The painting was finished!","The day had already dawned.","In the early morning of the royal capital, the sunlight was dazzling.","In the palace above the clouds, colorful auspicious clouds descended, and a luxurious wedding procession, riding on the auspicious clouds, arrived at the main road of the royal capital and floated all the way to the gate of the Wu Residence.","On both sides of the street, whether mortals or immortal emperors, all showed longing looks.","The wedding procession!","A loud voice sounded, and Princess Jincheng, dressed in a red robe, stepped into the Wu Residence on the auspicious clouds.","But her expression was somewhat embarrassed.","Originally, she wanted her elder brother to teach Jian Wushuang a lesson, but when her elder brother returned, he ignored her.","He didn’t say anything.","Sigh!","Stepping over the threshold.","After entering Jian Wushuang’s room, her expression finally eased a bit.","Things had come to this point, and she had no other way.","If the tough approach didn’t work, she could only try the soft approach.","“You’re here!” Jian Wushuang sat in front of the bed, also wearing a red robe.","From afar, the two of them could be considered a handsome couple.","But Jian Wushuang’s white hair was somewhat distracting.","“Min!” Jincheng replied softly.","Jian Wushuang was somewhat surprised to see the other party speaking to him so calmly and peacefully. He wondered what game this princess was playing.","He needed to be cautious.","As the two locked eyes, they couldn’t find the right words for a moment.","It was the first time for both of them, the eldest girl getting married, and both of them experiencing it for the first time.","It was Jian Wushuang’s first marriage.","It was Jinchen’s first big wedding.","After a while, Jinchen took the initiative to speak, ‘I heard you’ve been in the Outer Domain. Are you accustomed to being back in the Yuc Kingdom?”","‘Fairly well. I’m used to being free. As long as no one coerces me, I can adapt anywhere!” Jian Wushuang replied, adding. “If Princess doesn’t feel comfortable in the future, you can inform me at any time!” Jinchen snorted but considering she would still need Jian Wushuang’s help after the wedding, she replied softly, ‘Certainly!”","The two of them passed the time with sporadic conversation.","Meanwhile, outside, the bridal procession, Muchen and Wu Li, were chatting happily.","After checking the time, they prepared to take Jian Wushuang to the palace.","“The auspicious time has arrived, let’s go!”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang and Jinchen walked out of the room side by side.","Outside, a crowd had gathered.","Each of them was a prominent figure in the Yue Kingdom.","Either they were powerful individuals within the kingdom or exceptional talents among the Emperor’s cntourage.","Congratulations filled the air.","Jian Wushuang returned the greetings with clasped hands.","As he left the Wu residence, Wu Li stood at the door, tears streaming down his face, holding Muchen’s hand, lamenting, “I only have this one nephew, Brother Muchen, you must...","“Don’t worry, we are all family, I will never let nephew Wushuang be wronged!”","Jian Wushuang felt awkward standing by, but he had thick skin, or else he would have found a hole to hide in. Being a son-in-law was indeed not as casy as it seemed.","At the very least, one needed a thick skin.","Jinchen rode on a rainbow auspicious cloud, accompanied by Jian Wushuang, as they entered the dragon carriage.","As the crowd’s gaze followed, the wedding procession flew towards the imperial palace.","It was Jian Wushuang’s first time riding a dragon carriage, and he savored the luxury of royalty.","But as he surveyed the dragon carriage, he felt a powerful aura that surpassed the wedding procession.","Several terrifying auras were around the realm of Six Tribulations.","The newcomers were hostile!","Jian Wushuang looked out through the curtains.","The wedding procession was blocked by a group of people.","*Stand straight!”","A woman in a red robe stood at the forefront, with a red mark on her forehead.","That symbolized the Flame God.","Not only known to the people of Shi Kingdom but also recognized by the strong across the Ancient. Wood","Continent.","Famous throughout the Nine Heavens and Ten Earths.","After all, it was a totem mark left behind by an Eight Tribulations Special Life Form.","Apart from the Universe Masters of the Eight Tribulation, the Flame God was invincible.","Universe Masters might fail their tribulation and become Scattered Tribulation cultivators, but the Flame God was naturally tribulation-free.","No one dared to offend this super existence.","Even the Universe Masters of the Eight Tribulation would not dare to offend.","Once offended, they would be eradicated. Otherwise, when their tribulation failed and someone came","knocking at their door, they would have no chance.","“The Flame God’s successors!’ Jian Wushuang frowned.","He hadn’t heard of any connection between the royal family of Yue and the Flame God!","And the other party’s arrival was hostile.","It seemed they were not here to offer congratulations.","Instead, it seemed like they were here to cause trouble.","“Could they be here to snatch the bride? Jian Wushuang frowned.","He had been snatched before, and he had snatched others.","It could be said that he had experienced a lot.","But this kind of thing couldn’t happen every time, could it?","Jian Wushuang looked at Princess Jinchen and felt that this time The Flame God was the guardian deity of the Shi Kingdom.","Jinchen was related to the Shi Kingdom.","was because of the other party.","It must be because of the other party.","Jian Wushuang was convinced in his heart.","Princess Jinchen’s eyes flickered; she actually hoped that Shi Jiu would bring people to snatch her away.","There was simply no possibility of it.","The ancestor of the royal family had already reached out to the Shi Clan.","They had privately dealt with the matter of Shi Jiu.","As for the successors, she knew quite a few.","But the one before them now, she didn’t recognize.","Moreover, judging by the aura, he seemed to be an Emperor.","The two black-robed elders behind him were both formidable figures of the Six Tribulation realm.","Divine power leaked from them, their oppression palpable.","Among the welcoming party, the strongest was only Elder Muchen, at the peak of the Three Tribulation realm,","Feeling the aura of those two Six Tribulation experts, his expression turned grim.","When he saw the woman, he glanced at Jian Wushuang among the dragon escorts.","A woman of the successors standing in their way.","It seemed not because of Jinchen, but Jian Wushuang.","This time, he had guessed right.","Before he could step forward to inquire, the lead woman in red spoke, Jian Wushuang, you seem quite","leisurely!”","Upon hearing this, Elder Mochen’s cycs flared with fire.","He had been worried about trouble from the Stone Clan.","After it was handled by the ancestor, he thought they had no more worries.","But trouble with Jian Wushuang found its way to them again.","Princess Jinchen in the dragon carriage Escort felt a bit excited inside.","If it was indeed because of Jian Wushuang, then she wouldn’t need to marry him.","Jian Wushuang felt a bit. Ilustered upon hearing those words.","He stood up directly, parted the door curtain, and walked out from the dragon carriage.","Clad in red robes, with white hair flowing, when they saw his face, the successor’s lips curled upwards. Her","speculation was indeed correct-it was Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":5734,"title":"Chapter 5734 Fan Feng Attacks","paragraphs":["5734 Fan Feng Attacks","....","It was Jian Wushuang who had come with her from Qishen Temple!","The woman in the red robe was none other than Fan Feng, the leader of the 18 Divine Generals within the","Qishen Temple.","Descended ten thousand years ago, she directly awakened the strongest divine bloodline.","She soared to become an unparalleled genius.","She was vaguely regarded as the strongest Emperor of the Ancient Wood Continent.","She also used the power of the Ilam God to constantly investigate others. Unexpectedly, Jian Wushuang descended to the Ancient Wood Continent with her. Today was the day to confirm this.","And incidentally, to spoil Jian Wushuang’s good fortune a little.","She never had any good feelings towards Jian Wushuang,","Especially when she heard that Jian Wushuang was going to marry into another family.","She felt it was rather embarrassing,","Embarrassing for the Qishen Temple.","It was a wonder that Zhen Ling still regarded Jian Wushuang as a successor to be nurtured.","In her opinion, Jian Wushuang’s strength was acceptable, but his breadth of vision was far from enough.","If she could inherit the Qishen Temple, combined with her background in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","All those things like Mie Sheng, the Temple of World Annihilation, would be annihilated. Under the command of the Flame God, there were many strong individuals at the Tribulation Realm.","When she reached the Tribulation Realm, she could completely ask the Flame God to transfer two Tribulation Realm experts to accompany her to the Original Universe’s spacetime to eradicate Mic Sheng,","And incidentally, bring the Qishen Temple to the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","By then, inheriting the Qishen Temple, she would surely spread the name of the Qishen throughout the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","A glorious revival!","But if it were really that simple, Jian Wushuang wouldn’t be troubled.","Fan Feng had underestimated Mic Sheng-","And hadn’t fully recognized the true face of the Qishen.","Jian Wushuang stared at Fan Feng, carefully recalling that he indeed didn’t recognize her.","But she could recognize him.","And the tone of her speech was so indifferent.","It seemed she wasn’t here to challenge him out of fame, but because she had known him for a long time.","Only one possibility remained.","Both individuals hailed from Qishen Temple.","Among the nine who arrived together, only one was a woman.","Fan Feng!","Jian Wushuang’s eyelids twitched.","He never imagined Fan Feng would have such luck.","In just a mere 10,000 years, not only had her strength undergone carth-shattering changes.","even her background had reached a level he could only look up to.","Two of the Sixth Tribulation powerhouses acted as escorts.","What kind of influence was this?","The Flame God!","Even stronger than he had anticipated.","Six Tribulation protectors for one Emperor, two of them.","In truth, the Flame God hadn’t gone to such lengths. It was just that this time Fan Feng had managed to persuade two Six Tribulation powerhouses to accompany her on a trip to Yue Kingdom.","Normally, there wouldn’t be escorts of the Six Tribulation.","Only Five Tribulation at best!","Even so, they were not on par with Jian Wushuang,","“What, have you already forgotten about me?” Fan Feng teased.","However, Jian Wushuang’s expression darkened.","Wasn’t this just making things difficult for him?","If it weren’t for the presence of the two Six Tribulation powerhouses, he would have wanted to rush over and give her a good beating.","Ruining his plans like this.","“Dao Friend, perhaps you’ve mistaken me for someone else?” Jian Wushuang furrowed his brow, his eyes flashing wildly, hinting for Ian Feng to leave quickly.","With two Six Tribulation beings around, he dared not communicate through telepathy!","But Fan Feng paid no heed, her words still tinged with ambiguity.","If it weren’t for those two Six Tribulation beings, Elder Muchen would have erupted by now.","These two were truly unnecessary.","Jian Wushuang, if you don’t want to expose your identity, you can use telepathy. The two seniors beside me won’t hear our conversation!” Although Fan Feng disliked Jian Wushuang, she noticed something off about his gaze.","If Jian Wushuang wanted to enhance his strength this way, she wasn’t going to intervene. But in her opinion, Jian Wushuang didn’t even need that.","If she was willing to discard the Jucyun Sword and swear off swordsmanship in the future, she might consider taking Jian Wushuang as a disciple.","The treasures and resources were at her disposal, abundantly so.","Jian Wushuang was nearly infuriated to the point of cursing, but she managed to restrain her emotions and transmitted her voice, “Fan Feng, don’t forget your oath back then, If you dare to ruin my plans again, I won’t spare you!”","“Tsk tsk, you don’t have that strength anymore!” Fan Feng sneered.","“You can try!”","They communicated through their minds, but were simultaneously enraged, ready to make a move! “Eh?” Elder Muchen noticed the two were about to fight, and hurriedly stepped forward to intervene. “Your Highness, today is the royal wedding of the Yue Kingdom. Could you please give us some face?” Elder Muchen cautiously asked.","There were many eyes below watching!","If he didn’t come out to handle the situation, not only would Jian Wushuang lose face, but the Yue royal family would as well!","“Yue Kingdom!” A black-robed elder behind Fan Feng stepped forward, casting a shadow over the clear sky.","Wu Li was pushed back by the pressure of the aura.FOlloow ??ewest stories at n??(v)el/bi/n(.)com","It wasn’t until Jian Wushuang placed a hand on Wu Li’s shoulder that he stopped retreating!","Jian Wushuang bypassed Wu Li, leaving behind only one sentence.","‘Let me handle this myself!”","This statement eased Wu Li’s heart. For some reason, after hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, he felt relieved.","As if Jian Wushuang was the savior.","With absolute strength.","Princess Jinchen, at this moment, also saw the only two shining points on Jian Wushuang.","One was his strength, and the other was his dominance.","“Fan... Tianleng!” Jian Wushuang stumbled over Fan Feng’s current name.","Although it was just a simple name, it contained her reminder.","A reminder for Fan Feng not to forget that she was still Fan Feng of the Qishen Temple.","And not the Flame God’s successor.","All of this was bestowed upon her by Zhen Ling.","Don’t get carried away.","Thinking that she’s a phoenix among crows.","When in fact, it’s the crows among phoenixes.","If you’re lucky, enjoy it secretly in your heart!","Don’t flaunt it.","“Today is my big wedding day. If you all want to toast, Jian Wushuang welcomes you. But if you’ve come to cause trouble, then please leave!” Jian Wushuang declared, channeling the power of the Beast God directly.","The divine power surged, rising from 200,000-fold to around 260,000-fold.","He exerted twice the power of the Beast God, which was about half of his usual strength.","Fan Teng felt a surge of excitement when she sensed this aura.","She also possessed 260,000-fold divine power, even stronger than that.","She was no longer the same as before since her reincarnation, awakening the bloodline of the Flame God.","She had completely transformed into a practitioner whose main source of power was divine.","Buzz!","280,000-fold divine power burst forth, causing ripples in the air.","Many were stunned by this.","An Emperor!","280,000-fold divine power.","Jian Wushuang’s previous outburst of 200,000-fold divine power had already shocked them greatly.","Now, sensing 280,000-fold divine power, it was even more powerful than they had imagined an Emperor could","be.","Even compared to that great high priest who was said to rival the Universe Master and hold his own in battle","against them.","Fan Tianfeng’s current divine power surpassed that of a typical Universe Master, reaching the level of top-tier","Universe Masters.","The strength was terrifyingly powerful.","Comparable to the most extraordinary Emperors of past eras.","“Such terrifying power!” Even the weaker Tribulation Realm cultivators couldn’t face these two emperors","head-on.","Tan Tianfeng, I’ve heard of her. She’s the purest-blooded successor of the Flame God, known as the Invincible Emperor. I didn’t expect her to know the groom!”"]},{"number":5735,"title":"Chapter 5735 Proud Fan Tianfeng","paragraphs":["5735 Proud Fan Tianfeng","....","“That’s normal. Jian Wushuang is a heaven-defying Emperor. Ile can be considered an Emperor of the same level!”","Many people were discussing below.","Jian Wushuang turned a deaf car.","“What do you want?”","‘Don’t be too serious. I just want to see how much you’ve improved these days. It seems that you’re a little stronger than before, but this bit of strength is not enough!”","260,000 divine power was worthless to Fan Tianfeng","Jian Wushuang’s eyes twitched.","She cursed in her heart. She had probably forgotten the fear of being dominated by Mic Sheng!","Back when Mic Sheng possessed Dong Jun’s skeleton, be had unleashed 250,000-fold divine power and could easily suppress her.","How long had it been? Did he think that he could be so arrogant just because he had increased some divine power?","“Fine!” Jian Wushuang agreed.","Since they wanted to spar.","Then he would let the other party know that there was always someone better than him.","There was more!","The Spacetime Origin Source was the strongest.","Jian Wushuang withdrew his divine power aura.","He wanted to use the Origin Source of his hometown to defeat Fan Tianfeng.","Let her understand that she shouldn’t forget her roots.","“Hmm? What? Are you afraid?” Fan Tianfeng asked with a frown when she saw that Jian Wushuang had withdrawn his divine power aura.","Jian Wushuang could not help but laugh. “If I’m afraid, I’ll never leave that place!”","Weng!","Blue!","Boom!!!","The sound of space exploding was deafening.","Today was the day of the wedding, and it couldn’t be delayed.","Since he had chosen to use his Origin Source to deal with Fan Tianfeng, he would not hold back.","“Eternal Ancient Transformation!’","As the blue electric arcs surrounded him, Jian Wushuang’s aura turned blue.","His hair, clothes, and cyebrows were all bluc.","It also meant that it contained the power of the Starry Sky.","This turbulence.","The people in the palace couldn’t help but walk out.","The Empress led her ministers and looked at Jian Wushuang and Fan Tianfeng.","She couldn’t interfere with the actions of the younger generation.","If those two Six Tribulation experts dared to make a move.....","She would have to leave the stage.","Even though those two were at the Six Tribulation realm.","They were not a Universe Masters.","She was a Half-Step Six Tribulation realm Universe Master, and the imperial palace was her Dao Arena.","No matter how many came, they would all die.","Unless the enemy was at the Seven Tribulation.","Otherwise, she was invincible.","Naturally, she did not panic.","However, when she sensed Jian Wushuang’s aura, her cold eyes were surprised.","This aura had also appeared when he was dealing with Shi Jiu.","However, this time, it was much stronger than before.","“He has secrets!” The empress sighed in her heart.","She had thought that Jian Wushuang was the caged sparrow of the royal family, but now she understood.","The Yuc Kingdom was a small place and Jian Wushuang couldn’t be trapped.","She understood that marrying into the family was just a pretense.","However, he had thought that Jian Wushuang, as an Emperor, would not be able to cause much trouble.","However, she was wavering now.","He knew that Jian Wushuang would rise up in the future and that he would be someone that could not be restrained by the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","Recruiting Jian Wushuang might have been the wrong choice.","If she had known that Jian Wushuang had harmed countless people, she would have regretted it.","Fan Tianfeng was not surprised when she sensed Jian Wushuang’s change.","She knew Jian Wushuang’s trump card.","“Draw your sword!”","“You’re not worthy!”","Jian Wushuang attacked instantly and his body was like a thunderbolt in the space.","It was so fast that no one could see its shadow clearly.","Even Universe Masters couldn’t see it clearly.","Elder Muchen couldn’t believe Jian Wushuang’s speed.","He rubbed his eyes and looked at Jian Wushuang again, only to see some afterimages.","And the reason why Fan Tianfeng was so confident was that her strength was naturally not weak.","His 280,000 divine power rose to 300,000.","He had fought with Jian Wushuang several times, but he was not at a disadvantage.","The Eldest Prince, who was beside the Empress, opened his mouth slightly.","Three days ago, he thought Jian Wushuang had used his full strength.","In the end, he was just toying with him back then.","In this state, Jian Wushuang could defeat him with just a glance.","Room!","Jian Wushuang had the upper hand and his sharp fist shattered the space.","If it wasn’t for the array formation in the capital and the Empress’s maintenance...","This place had long since become a ruin just like the Yongheng Kingdom.","He couldn’t destroy the entire Yongheng Kingdom,","However, destroying the capital was not a problem.","The combat strength he had crupted with had already reached the Four Tribulation.","And it was the power of a Universe Master.","Even Universe Masters in the Four Tribulation had power like this.","Princess Jinchen, who was on the dragon carriage, looked up at the explosion of the blue flames in the sky.","She knew that it was produced every time Jian Wushuang fought.","However, he could not see Jian Wushuang’s appearance when he attacked.","How terrifying!","“He’s actually so strong!” Jinchen was speechless.","When Jian Wushuang defeated Shi Jiu, she thought that Shi Jiu was unlucky.","When he reached the Tribulation Realm, he could still catch up to Jian Wushuang.","However, after witnessing Jian Wushuang’s truc battle strength, Shi Jiu was no match for Jian Wushuang even","if he had become a Universe Master.","She had to admit. this.","Wu Li and the others in the capital also raised their heads to look.","He was even more shocked.","Jian Wushuang’s strength had already surpassed his.","He couldn’t grasp it.","Fortunately, he had a trump card.","Otherwise, he would have to consider running away.","If he continued to cooperate with Jian Wushuang, he would have no choice but to kill the donkey when he was","done.","The entire capital, and even the higher-ups of the Yue Kingdom, were paying close attention to this battle.","Some people felt that the royal family had picked up a treasure.","They had actually discovered a peerless genius like Jian Wushuang,","There were also some people who thought further.","He thought that the royal family might be afraid of Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s strength was too shocking.","Jian Wushuang, who was in the blue flames, only used his aura to force Tan Tianfeng back.","Fan Tianfeng, who was also a successor of the Flame God, had an unstable aura.","The series of exchanges just now made her see the gap.","Jian Wushuang’s strength was beyond her imagination.","‘Impossible! How can you be so strong?!” Fan Tianfeng forcefully burned her divine power and charged over","again.","She did not believe that Jian Wushuang could maintain this state for a long time.","He was definitely burning his Origin Source to fight her!","Jian Wushuang stood in the void, his eyes cold.","Buzz!","A beam of light shot out from his finger.","The blue Qi pillar exploded and instantly arrived in front of Fan Tianfeng","Before she could think further, Jian Wushuang’s figure followed the Qi pillar that he had just shot out.","His speed was even faster than his own aura.","Fan Tianfeng had nowhere to hide even if she wanted to.","He couldn’t dodge Jian Wushuang’s attack!","“Your Highness, don’t panic!” The two Six Tribulation experts who were also watching the battle attacked at","this moment.","They were shocked by Jian Wushuang’s terrifying fighting strength.","However, he would not forget his mission.","Protect Fan Tianfeng!","This was sucessor, the person who the Flame God was proud of.","If she died, the two of them would not be able to live either.","Although Jian Wushuang was strong, he was helpless against a Six Tribulation expert.","Ile could only stop.","At this moment, the empress also personally stepped onto the stage.","3,000 red sleeves flew out of the palace.","It covered the sky.","A terrifying aura suddenly descended.","The two Six Tribulation experts protected Fan Tianfeng at the same time and turned to look outside the","palace.","The Empress stood there, and her dharma image soared into the sky.","“Holy Nebula!” the empress shouted coldly."]},{"number":5736,"title":"Chapter 5736 Defeating Fan Tianfeng","paragraphs":["5736 Defeating Fan Tianfeng","....","A huge nebula dao image appeared and condensed the appearance of the Empress.","Clad in red sleeves, the nebula avatar wrapped around her.","With a single palm strike, she directly suppressed two experts of the Tribulation Realm.","Meanwhile, Fan Tianfeng stood rooted to the spot, feeling somewhat bewildered.","With a casual gesture, the Empress flung the two Six Tribulation experts forcefully beyond the borders of Yue Kingdom.","“Continue!” The Empress extended her hand, signaling the two to keep fighting.","Jian Wushuang swallowed nervously, unsure if he should intervene again.","But since he had spoken up, he couldn’t back down now!","Swish!","Fan Tianfeng’s expression grew frantic as she hurriedly sent a message to her ancestor via sound transmission.","At the same time, she attacked again.","Flame God Physique.","A fire demon, as if emerging from hell itself, descended.","That was Fan Tianfeng’s proud bloodline.","The bloodline of the Flame God Spirit.","The strongest sucessor, Fan Tianfeng","However, in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, she was not even worth a single blow.","Gathering the power of the Starry Sky in his hands, a formless sword appeared.","“You’re going to lose!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t draw his sword, but he didn’t say he wouldn’t use Sword Intent!","As he condensed the formless sword, within the capital city, the Sword of Starry Sky hung ominously. Countless Sword Intents filled the sky.","All surged towards Fan Tianfeng.","At this moment, no matter how she struggled, burning divine power was futile!","With one sword move from Jian Wushuang, it was as if billions of swords were unleashed.","If the gathered power of the Starry Sky were to be converted into divine power, it would definitely exceed 500,000.","If he were to draw his sword, he himself didn’t know how strong he would be.","Fan Tianfeng was truly panicked this time.","Continuously retreating, the Flame God Spirit behind her stood as her shield.","However, this was merely a manifestation of power.","It couldn’t hold up against the overwhelming force.","In an instant, it shattered into pieces under the onslaught of countless Sword intents.","“I concede! With no defense from the manifestation, Fan Tianfeng felt utterly hopeless.","If she tried to resist, she would have been risking her life.","Countless Sword Intents converged, forming an invisible sword that hovered around Fan Tianfeng’s neck.","At the same time, the distant sky ignited, turning into a sea of flames within moments.","Within this sea of fire hid a face the Flame God, the strongest in the contemporary Ancient Wood Continent.. The infinite flames contained in his eyes alone could annihilate those at the Seven Tribulation realm.","If he were to strike Jian Wushuang, the entire Yue Kingdom might be destroyed in an instant.","However, he discerned the deep entanglement of causality between Jian Wushuang and Fan Tianfeng, so be refrained from acting directly.","Empress Fengchen’s eyelids twitched as her Dao Arena collapsed in an instant.","She knew the Fire God had arrived a force that her own Dao Arena couldn’t possibly withstand. ‘Leave!’","The Fire God’s voice resonated heavily.","Jian Wushuang didn’t harbor murderous intent; he knew the Flame God wouldn’t attack him.","Nevertheless, being under such scrutiny still exerted immense pressure on him, akin to that of Chi Jiuxiao. Yet, Chi Jiuxiao had never gone all out.","If he had, he would have been even stronger than the Flame God.","“Jian Wushuang, we will meet again!” Fan Tianfeng gritted her teeth, turned, and disappeared through the flames, leaving the Yue Kingdom.","With Fan Tianfeng’s departure, the fiery space in the sky vanished too.","Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief, and so did everyone else. The oppressive aura just now had been too strong.","Princess Jinchen, seated in the dragon chariot, watched Jian Wushuang’s departing figure with fear in her eyes.","She now realized that the mysterious figure she had encountered in the Hundred Flowers Mountain was none other than Jian Wushuang.","“An Emperor, but having the strength of the Five Tribulation realm!”","Jian Wushuang’s recent display of strength undoubtedly matched that of a four Tribulation fighter.","To be able to contend with a Four Tribulation Universe Master.","Incredibly powerful!","Some found unbelievable.","In the Ancient. Moon Spacetime, he truly lived up to being the strongest Emperor.","Many exclaimed in amazement.","Jian Wushuang restrained his aura, feeling that his recent actions had been somewhat extravagant.","Inadvertently, he had unleashed a power that was too formidable.","Mainly because there was a fire burning within him.","Fan Tianfeng’s own strength wasn’t much, yet she relied on her background to suppress others. This didn’t sit well with Jian Wushuang.","They were all Emperors from the Qishen Temple.","They had come to the Ancient. Moon Spacetime to save the Qishen Temple, not to compete based on their backgrounds.","It was meaningless.","“Phew!”","Jian Wushuang glanced around and returned the dragon chariot.","The grand wedding still needed to proceed!","Princess Jinchen looked back at the dragon chariot, steadied her emotions, and continued toward the palace.","This time, the Empress stood outside the palace, waiting for the bridal procession.","Meanwhile, several Six Tribulation powerhouses descended.","The recent aura had even alarmed some of the ancestral figures within the royal family,","“Have we thoroughly investigated this child’s background?”","A quaint voice reached the cars of the Empress.","The proud Empress, upon hearing this voice, was visibly moved.","Then, with respect, she replied, “Ancestor, I have investigated. The matters in the Outer Domain were orchestrated by Wu Li, not. Jian Wushuang!”","“And what about his true background?”","“I couldn’t find anything! The Empress answered truthfully. “It’s as if he appeared out of thin air!”","“Tsk, it seems Yuc Kingdom facing a calamity!”","Upon hearing the words of the Ancestor, the Empress was momentarily stunned.","Then she came to her senses.","Yue Kingdom, among the 16 kingdoms, wasn’t particularly powerful.","The Yongheng Kingdom, a super dynasty, had fallen just a few years ago.","Now, in the Ancient Wood Continent, there were hidden currents.","One had to be cautious about everything.","If Jian Wushuang infiltrated the Yue Kingdom for its assets, neither the Empress nor the Ancestor believed it.","Because Jian Wushuang’s strength surpassed their understanding.","It couldn’t be for Yue Kingdom alone.","It was likely he was hiding his identity for some significant purpose.","What they feared was that it might implicate Yuc Kingdom in the future.","But now that Jian Wushuang had been married into the family, there was no turning back.","All they could do was pray that Jian Wushuang’s future would benefit Yue Kingdom rather than destroy it. Watching Jian Wushuang’s departing figure, this thought was suppressed once again.","No matter how she looked at Jian Wushuang, he didn’t seem like someone who would help Yue Kingdom.","“The auspicious moment has arrived!” A sharp voice rang out, and all the guests took their seats.","The ceremony was incredibly grand.","It lasted from morning until night.","Inside the ball, many strong individuals were discussing Jian Wushuang’s strength.","On the surface, it was said that Yuc Kingdom had found a treasure, but behind the scenes, many were waiting","to see a joke. Such a powerful son-in-law was once considered inferior to that boy from Shi Kingdom.","Once Jian Wushuang reached the Tribulation Realm, it wouldn’t take long for him to become the Universe","Master of the Five Tribulation.","By then, he wouldn’t be inferior to anyone.","Yue Kingdom would also undergo changes.","However, Wu Li was the biggest winner of them all.","Regardless of Jian Wushuang’s strength, the status of the Wu family was rising steadily.","But Wu Li couldn’t find joy in his heart!","Such a powerful Jian Wushuang was not someone he could control.","When it was time to unleash the Wanliu, there would be some trouble.","Although he also had some cards up his sleeve, that presence couldn’t appear casually.","After this grand wedding, the audience was delighted.","But neither the royal family of Yue Kingdom nor the Wu family could be happy.","The banquet dispersed, and the night grew late.","Jian Wushuang sat alone on the bed, while Princess Jinchen saw off guests from various places.","By the time she returned to the Eastern side, it was already deep into the night."]},{"number":5737,"title":"Chapter 5737 What Are You Doing?","paragraphs":["5737 What Are You Doing?","....","A real man was born between heaven and earth!","How could he stay on this bed?","When Princess Jinchen entered the bridal chamber, Jian Wushuang stood up abruptly.","His eyes were firm and clear, and his feet were strong as he approached the other party step by step.","“You!” Princess Jinchen was shocked and stared at Jian Wushuang with purple eyes.","Jian Wushuang’s feat during the day had indeed stunned her.","She now understood that it was not the mysterious Five Tribulation realm at the Hundred Flowers Mountain, but Jian Wushuang.","Although he was still some distance away from the Five Tribulation.","However, Jian Wushuang now had the combat, strength of a Four Tribulation expert...","This time, he had defeated the prodigy with the strongest bloodline in the Ancient Wood Continent.","He was already the current number one in Ancient Moon Spacetime.","In fact, even the top few Emperors of the Reincarnation Era were not as heaven-defying as Jian Wushuang,","“What are you doing? Jinchen subconsciously took a step back.","No matter how strong Jian Wushuang was, there was only one person in her heart.","This would not change.","Jian Wushuang approached Jinchen step by step and stood in front of him.","After pausing for a moment, he said forcefully, “Make way!”","Princess Jinchen was puzzled, but she still took a step back.","Jian Wushuang walked out of the bed and came to a corner.","Although it was said to be a corner, the residence that the royal family had prepared for them was not bad at all.","Even in the corner, there was a praying mat.","Those who didn’t know better would think that it was specially prepared for Jian Wushuang!","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on the futon and closed his eyes.","“Don’t worry, I won’t touch you!”","Imph, at least you know what’s good for you. I have something to handle you. You’d better not do anything out of line!” Princess Jinchen raised her head.","Jian Wushuang frowned when he heard the word “handle”. He stood up instantly and opened his eyes, emitting a murderous aura.","Princess Jinchen, who had been feeling smug just now, lowered her head again when she saw Jian Wushuang’s expression.","‘Don’t offend me. I know why you want to marry into the royal family. Isn’t it because you’re qualified to join the Sacred Assembly? Jinchen said without any confidence.","Hearing that, Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief.","He had thought that the matter of him submitting to Emperor Babidi had been found out!","Now that he had obtained the Sacred Assembly qualification token, there was nothing to hide.","This time, marrying into the family was just a pretense.","If he simply provoked the prodigies of the various large families to show off his strength, it was very likely that he would be crippled halfway.","Arriving at Ancient. Moon Spacetime.","Every time he erupted, it seemed like he was fighting for himself, but in fact, he was fighting for others.","On the surface, Shi Jiu and Fan Tianfeng cach had backgrounds more exaggerated than the other.","He had first made a name for himself in Hundred Flowers Mountain, and then in Yongheng Kingdom. They all had a good reason.","He couldn’t provoke others for no reason and wait for the Ancient Wood Sect or some other super forces to rope him in!","Not only would they not be nurtured, but they would also lose their lives.","The trip to the Qishen Temple in the human world had made him see clearly how terrifying the aristocratic families were.","He could be a dog.","But to be a prodigy?","It would not work.","Even now, it was because of Wu Li’s identity that he was able to ascend to the upper world.","Sometimes, strength was not absolute.","For example, currently, he was only an Emperor.","Even if he had the combat strength of a Four Tribulation expert, he would still be an Emperor. If he did not have a background, he would be worthless. He would even be ostracized by those super forces or even killed. After all, there were only so many resources in this world. If another force rose, there would be one more competitor.","Jian Wushuang knew this very well.","That was why he was carrying out Wu Li’s plan step by step.","This also meant that Wu Li was the mastermind of this game and had long understood the chains of this world.","If he wanted the clan to rise to a higher level, he would need a peerless expert.","He had placed all his bets on himself.","There were only a few Tribulation Realm experts in the Wu family, and their talent was not as good as his.","The family’s foundation was also very shallow.","In the end, resources were limited.","If he wanted to obtain more resources, he had to become stronger.","That was why he dared to spy on the Wanliu Divine Wood.","He was lucky to have obtained that wooden sword, which had the power of Life that matched the Wanliu","Divine Wood.","There was a high chance that it was a treasure that flowed out of the Wanliu Divine Wood.","This was an opportunity, but also a calamity.","If he grasped it well, he would reach the heavens in one step.","Recoming a Five Tribulation Universe Master wasn’t a problem. Perhaps he could go one step further and establish a super force.","If he couldn’t grasp it, he would run away.","This was nothing. After all, the current Wu Clan was only ranked in the top ten in a small dynasty like the Yue","Kingdom.","In the entire Ancient Wood Continent, it was only a nameless force.","He was not interested in those resources.","Jian Wushuang’s thoughts were not as simple as Wu Li’s.","On the surface, he wanted to unlock the Wanliu, but in secret, he wanted to cooperate with Rabidi,","His goal was not only the Ancient Wood Continent, but also the entire Ancient Moon Space.","As long as there were disputes, there would be opportunities.","If Babidi could really overturn the Ancient Moon spacetime, he would be able to obtain many benefits.","The treasures couldn’t all be placed together.","He wanted to set up a multi-pronged scheme.","His current strength was still too weak. If he wanted to rise up, he would need to take risks.","It was risky to follow Babidi, and it was risky to activate the Wanliu.","As long as one of them succeeded.","He would be able to soar into the sky.","Return to Qishen Temple and deal with Mic Sheng,","He could look down on all spacetime.","At that time, he would have the strength and patience to look for Xuan Yi and see the future.","The current him still needed to struggle.","Yue Kingdom, Southeast Region.","A white figure tore through space like a stream of light and flew at an extremely fast speed.","There was still a wisp of Jian Wushuang’s aura on him.","This person was Zibai, the Five Tribulation expert, who Jian Wushuang had refined the chess piece of the","‘general’ symbol and infused it with Life power vitality.","The day before the wedding, Jian Wushuang let Zibai out to wait near the capital.","There were many experts who came for the wedding of the future Empress of Yue Kingdom. There were also","some Five Tribulation experts.","He was not afraid of being discovered.","Zibai was waiting outside.","He took the opportunity to choose his prey.","Among the ten great families, the top three had Six Tribulation experts guarding them.","That was a super force that had existed before the establishment of the Yuc Kingdom.","Even though it had been destroyed, there were no Five Tribulation Universe Masters. However, there were still old monsters in the Scattered Tribulation realm in the family.","Jian Wushuang naturally wouldn’t take the risk.","The remaining ten great families.","He didn’t care about the Wu family at the end.","In the end, it was placed in the fifth-ranked family.","“Chen Clan!”","It rose several cras ago.","His family bad produced a Five Tribulation Universe Master and had established a five-star sect","The Universe Master had fallen, and his sect had been destroyed.","It turned into a clan force..","There were a few Four Tribulation Universe Masters, but they all failed their tribulation and became Scattered","Tribulation cultivators."]},{"number":5738,"title":"Chapter 5738 Chen Family","paragraphs":["5738 Chen Family","....","Currently, the strongest person in the family was a Universe Master at the Three Tribulation realm, and his power was not even comparable to Wu Li’s.","Even in his own universe, he could only unleash the battle prowess of an ordinary Four Tribulation expert. If not for the glory of his ancestors, he would not have been ranked fifth.","There were a few old Scattered Tribulant cultivators in the family who were all at the Four Tribulation realm.","It was a good choice.","Jian Wushuang’s consciousness turned into a fleeting human figure and moved forward in Zibai’s light shadow. ‘Let’s go to that Universe Master’s universe first!’","“Yes, sir!” Zibai didn’t hesitate at all. IIis body rapidly rose and he headed straight for the universe that was being nurtured in the void.","An oval-shaped universe was like a Starry Sky in the void.","If one looked closely, one could see the internal structure.","*There are only over a thousand black holes!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Too weak.","To a Spacetime Monarch like him, such a Cosmos was trash.","It was a work that ruined space.","He was not worthy of living.","“Exterminate it!”","“Yes, sir!” Zibai turned into a light shadow and pierced through the universe.","The origin of all things that enveloped the universe instantly collapsed.","Even the array formation was constantly being corroded.","This was a sign that the Origin Source was being destroyed.","“Who is it?”","“You’re courting death!” A shocked and furious voice sounded. ‘How dare you barge into my universe!” Zibai stopped and looked at the figure inside the universe Origin Source. A smile appeared on his face. A folding fan appeared in his hand and he waved it gently.","It was like a young master.","However, in the next moment, he became a god that destroyed the world.","His body instantly expanded to billions of miles, his entire body emitting colorful light and shadow, Without waiting for the other party to react, he punched the universe Origin Source.","With just one punch, hundreds of black holes that carried the universe collapsed.","The Universe Master’s anger turned into fear.","A single punch destroyed a hundred black holes.","Now, the universe had suffered a heavy blow.","A few more punches and his universe would probably be destroyed.","“Ancestor, save me!” A wail had just sounded before it completely dimmed.","On a certain continent in the Southeast Divine Region, the Chen family sounded the alarm of extinction! “What happened?”","“What’s going on?”","“Look, the family head’s universe is collapsing!”","Along with the noise.","People kept breaking out of the door and flying into the sky.","The universe of the current family head was right above the clan ground. They could see it when they raised their heads.","A star kept flickering, a signal before it collapsed.","Several Four Tribulation experts in the depths of the clan land instantly gathered together.","The avatar of the Three Tribulation Universe Master was there too.","“Run quickly... To the capital!” After the head of the Chen family said this, his avatar shattered,","This also represented the death of the original body.","The eyes of the few Ancestors throbbed.","However, they were all people who had experienced great storms and waves. They instantly reacted.","He couldn’t save the people in the family.","But that was not important.","The elites of the clan were either in the Ancient Wood Sect or the Qingyun Sect.","There were also some experts adventuring outside.","Those who stayed in the clan were some junior Emperors, Immortals, and some mortals.","These could all be cultivated.","As long as the Tribulation Realm was still alive.","As long as the family’s treasury was still there, they could rise again.","The few of them arrived at the treasure vault in an instant.","At the same time, a huge teleportation array rose up.","This teleportation array was connected to the treasure vault.","The treasury was a separate grotto-heaven world.","Normally, it was impossible to enter.","Once the clan was in danger, the treasure vault would activate the teleportation array and fall into the chaotic","flow of time.","Only the few geniuses appointed by the family would sense where it was.","There were four huge pillars around the treasury.","The four Ancestors sat cross-legged on one seat each.","They didn’t need to control the array, they only needed to guard it.","Even if he died, he had to ensure that he could leave the Teleportation Treasury.","The rest of the Tribulation Realm cultivators in the clan would escape if they could. They did not need to care","about ordinary Emperors.","The talented seedlings scattered and fled.","Everything was in order.","It was as if they had rehearsed it.","His reaction was extremely fast.","Even Jian Wushuang, who had just arrived, was speechless.","He looked over.","The Chen family’s lair was in a mess.","However, these scattered powerhouses were no different from trash,","He was pitifully weak.","He did not sense a single Tribulation Realm expert.","Clearly, they had already run away.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang felt a weak aura of spacetime.","If it was an ordinary expert, even a Tribulation Realm expert would find it difficult to sense it.","However, Jian Wushuang was an Emperor of Spacetime practice and was very sensitive to such a feeling.","“Not good!”","That aura was the Spacetime Teleportation Array Formation.","Jian Wushuang casually took out a mask and put it on. He restrained his aura and crushed a seed.","That was the power of the Starry Sky condensed from his main body.","The blue power instantly rose.","In a flash, Jian Wushuang arrived in the formation.","At the same time, he sent the location of this place to Zibai.","He had to destroy this teleportation array.","Otherwise, he would have come for nothing.","However, Zibai was still collecting the treasures in the universe.","If he didn’t plunder, he would be discovered by the great, beings of the universe nearby, and he would have to","leave.","“Don’t worry about it. Let’s go to the Chen family’s land first!” Jian Wushuang ordered.","This array was ten times more powerful than the one in the universe.","Even if he used his butt to guess, he could guess that this treasure vault was definitely inside.","“Hahaha!” Jian Wushuang’s hand appeared.","At this moment, he wasn’t afraid of others suspecting him, and he directly slashed out with all his strength.","This sword shook the entire array.","He was obstructed for a moment.","The four Ancestors were furious.","The power of that sword just now was about the strength of an ordinary Four Tribulation expert.","It was similar to the four them.","‘I’ll go hold him back!” An expert with the most withered face stood out.","He was the oldest Four Tribulation expert in the family.","He was also the Four Tribulation with the least vitality.","It was time for him to sacrifice himself.","‘Farewell, great-grandfather!”","The three Four Tribulation experts who also had the title of Patriarch or Ancestor bowed at this moment.","In terms of seniority, they had to address their great-grandfather.","This Scattered Tribulation great being had once followed the Five Tribulation Universe Master who had","founded his family.","But now, he was about to die.","“Since you dare to attack my Chen Family, you are not afraid of the royal family of Yue Kingdom! Even at this","moment, the skinny old man did not forget to stall for time.","Jian Wushuang didn’t waste any time and continued to attack the formation.","He didn’t even look at the other party.","Although the other party had the combat strength of a Four Tribulation expert, it was hard to say how long he","could last.","It was possible that in less than two moves, his vitality would be completely lost, leaving only his physical","body.","Jian Wushuang dodged the elder’s punch casually.","Holding the divine sword upside down, he floated away.","He changed his location and continued to destroy the array.","Although it was called destruction, it was actually interference.","His current combat strength was not enough to destroy such a grand array.","Even his main body could not do it."]},{"number":5739,"title":"Chapter 5739 The Chen Family Fell","paragraphs":["5739 The Chen Family Fell","....","This formation was definitely created by the Five Tribulation Universe Master for his family when he was at his peak.","Unless it was a Five Tribulation super expert, it was impossible to break it.","Swoosh!","The divine fiend that Zibai had transformed into descended on the divine mountain above the teleportation","array.","“Kill him!” Jian Wushuang was delighted. ‘Break the formation!”","After hearing this, Zibai’s eyes narrowed and he immediately burned his Origin Source.","He was also in the Scattered Tribulation realm now, but he was even weaker than the Scattered Tribulation cxpert.","As long as the Scattered Tribulation expert did not attack, they could still slowly condense their vitality. Unless it had existed for too long and even the seed of life had disappeared, it would completely wither. But Zibai was different.","He was a person who had died before. Even if he had revived, it was only a moment of strength. Once the Origin Source was burned out, he would die completely.","Zibai, who had burned his Origin Source, had the combat, strength of a peak Five Tribulation expert.","Four arms grew out of its back and it had three ugly heads.","It was the strongest divine ability of the ancient times, the peak of the Dao Image.","He directly used three times his combat strength.","It tore the entire array apart.","Jian Wushuang was overjoyed. He did not expect it to be so easy.","Everything was done in a few breaths.","The few Ancestors of the Chen family lost their confidence.","“I want you dead!”","The four Ancestors offered themselves.","He used the last bit of Life power in his body and the last bit of courage he had when he was young to choose self-destruction.","He would die to show his will!","The clan was finished. These old fellows were useless even if they lived.","More importantly, Jian Wushuang would not let them live.","At the moment they self-destructed, Zibai also used all his Origin Source to block the terrifying power for Jian Wushuang","Boom!","The huge divine fiend fell.","Even his body began to shatter","The teleportation array was also destroyed.","Now, all that was left was destruction.","And Jian Wushuang’s practicing body.","Crash!","A black hole appeared behind Jian Wushuang and absorbed all the remains.","Jian Wushuang turned around and took out a Destruction Origin Source from his mustard seed.","He had brought it out from the Qishen Temple.","He originally wanted to devour himself.","Now, he did not lack this, so he might as well bloom here!","Chi chi!","Jian Wushuang tore the space apart and left with his avatar.","A dark flower bloomed behind him.","The Chen family’s land was wiped out.","Although it was midnight, the world of cultivation was different. from day and night..","Similarly, there was no distinction between black and white.","The Chen family was wiped out.","“Master, did you see that? Someone looked up at the sky and was worshipping his master.","There were also people kneeling in front of the Chen family.","There were enemics and benefactors.","There were also some who picked up the leftovers.","Jian Wushuang took away the treasure vault, but he couldn’t take away some fixed resources.","This territory was quickly devoured by the few forces beside it.","However, this was all for the future.","Jian Wushuang’s avatar, traversing through space, dropped a mustard seed onto a meteorite, and the avatar self-destructed.","The meteorite, caught in chaotic currents, was surrounded by billions of similar debris, orbiting a burning star. And here, there were countless stars.","Just like purgatory.","The true self.","The next morning.","Jian Wushuang and Jinchen left the room early and met the Empress at the palace.","This was a royal custom.","Morning was the time for court sessions.","However, in the main hall of the imperial palace, only Jian Wushuang and Princess Jinchen were present in their true forms; the rest were avatars.","They instantly appeared, each on their respective thrones.","The empress also appeared last.","“Your Majesty, the Chen family has been wiped out. According to the latest intelligence, it seems to be the work of a formidable dark practitioner!”","“Three years ago, the Yongheng Kingdom fell, and now the Chen family has been cradicated in the blink of an eye, and the residual power, upon investigation, seems highly suspicious!”","Many were resistant to investigating this matter.","Il even divine kingdoms like the Yongheng Kingdom could fall...","Not to mention the Yue Kingdom.","It was better not to investigate. It was better at this juncture.","Moreover, it was done on the night of the Grand Princess’ wedding. It was clearly premeditated.","The Empress sat on the throne and slowly raised her hand to dip her finger in the ink. She then casually smeared it on a golden roll.","She did not take the Chen family’s matter to heart.","An entire clan was destroyed.","Moreover, it was one of the top five families in the Yue Kingdom.","It was indeed a huge matter, but at this moment, she was not worried at all.","Her heart was as calm as still water.","‘After the Sacred Assembly, we’ll conduct a thorough investigation, the Empress said nonchalantly.","Compared to this matter, what she was about to announce next was the real big deal.","When everyone heard the following words, they were all shocked!","The Sixteen Qingchao Kingdoms.","Ranking first was the Shi Kingdom, not only for its attainment of the Eight Tribulation but also for the guardianship of the Flame God.","In third place stood the Yongheng Kingdom, a realm of no need for introductions, as it boasted Universe Masters of the Six Tribulation generation after generation. It was incredibly stable. Unfortunately, it had now perished, its very existence erased along with its spatial dimensions.","The Yongheng Kingdom was no more.","Both the first and third ranked held special significance.","Among the Sixteen Nations of the Qingchao, the second-ranked was equally extraordinary.","The Daughter Kingdom!","This time, the Empress announced that the ruler of the Daughter Kingdom had successfully transcended her tribulation and become a Seven Tribulation Universe Master.","Originally, this king was as famous as the number one Iniverse Master of Shi Kingdom, Shi Xiu.","In terms of fame, she was not even comparable to the renowned Shi Xiu, who brought glory to the Ancient Wood Continent.","Both were considered pivotal figures of the Ancient Wood Continent, their futures hinging on reaching the","Seven Tribulation.","Presently, the Ancient Wood Continent had only a handful of Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation Realm.","Many had believed Shi Xiu would be the first to break through, but it turned out to be the ruler of the","Daughter Kingdom.","Even the Empress displayed a hint of surprise on her face, her brows furrowing as if pondering over","something.","Yet, the astonishment among the crowd surpassed one another.","“A Universe Master of the Seven Tribulation realm!” Jian Wushuang gasped upon hearing the news, taken","aback.","This was the level of Qishen back then!","This wasn’t just any Scattered Tribulation expert.","This was a bona fide Universe Master.","The number of Seven Tribulation Universe Masters on the entire Ancient Wood Continent was almost on par","with the number of Eigh Tribulation powerhouses.","There were only two or three of them in the entire Ancient Wood Continent..","Among them was an elder of the Ancient. Wood Sect, the founder of the sect, a figure from the era of the","Ancient Moon Sect, who had once jointly established it with the former leader of the Ancient Moon Sect.","They were the oldest batch of Eight Tribulation experts.","Then,","I was the Shi Kingdom’s ancestor and the Flame God.","Finally, it was the Ancestor of the Daughter Kingdom.","However, the Eight Tribulation expert from the Daughter Kingdom had already died.","Moreover, it had been a long time since they had fallen.","All in all, there were only four Eight. Tribulation experts, with one having fallen.","The Divine Wood King of the Ancient Wood Sect was too ancient, with little vitality left, and was probably not","far from their end.","The only one worth mentioning was the Flame God.","As for the founding Ancestor of the Shi Kingdom, they weren’t viable either."]},{"number":5740,"title":"Chapter 5740 Marquis","paragraphs":["5740 Marquis","....","Seven Tribulation Universe Masters were also equally rare.","Moreover, both were within their respective sects. One was the current leader of the Ancient. Wood Sect.","The other was a super powerhouse who had moved from the Ancient Moon Divine Sect. to the Ancient Wood Continent, known as the “Iron-hearted Marquis”!","Among the kingship-level powerhouses, apart from the nineteen super existences who initially established the sects, most had already fallen, or had left the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","The title of Marquis was almost synonymous with the highest status and strength in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","The Seven Tribulation Universe Masters who could be bestowed the title of Marquis were all peak powerhouses of the same level.","In their own Dao Arena, they could rival peak Eigh Tribulation experts!","Even the leader of the Ancient Wood Sect had not been granted the title of Marquis, indicating the prestige associated with it.","Now, the ruler of the Daughter Kingdom had successfully crossed the tribulation.","She was the first Seven Tribulation Universe Master outside of the sects.","She was also the third Seven Tribulation Universe Master of the current era in the Ancient Wood Continent. Within her Dao Arena, she possessed the inexhaustible vitality of Eight Tribulation strength.","Everyone present couldn’t help but envy her.","Most of the people present were Universe Masters.","However, the majority were at the Three Tribulation realm, with only a small portion being Four Tribulation","Universe Masters.","As for Five Tribulation Universe Masters, in the entire Yuc Kingdom, it was only the Empress of the royal family.","Moreover, the Empress was already a complete Six Tribulation Universe Master, just one step away from crossing the tribulation.","Throughout the Ancient Wood Continent, the Empress’ strength among her peers was subtly ranked first.","This was also the reason for the recent great confidence of the Yuc Kingdom.","Now, all that remained was to steadily advance and contend for the position of the Holy Maiden.","Now that the ruler of the Daughter Kingdom had successfully crossed the tribulation, it seemed likely that the Holy Maiden of the Ancient Wood Sect with the same name would soon follow suit.","Regardless of success or failure, they both had to step down.","The Empress was determined to secure the position for the Holy Maiden.","Without any surprises, it should be hers.","“All right, there’s nothing else for today, let’s disperse for now!” The Empress waved her hand, showing signs of weariness.","Yet, there was an added sense of pressure on her face.","That came from her strength.","The ruler of the Daughter Kingdom, the Empress closed her eyes and reminisced.","The two of them in the past.","They belonged to the same generation,","In fact, she was considerably older than the ruler of the Daughter Kingdom.","When she achieved immortality, the ruler of the Daughter Kingdom had just embarked on the path of cultivation.","When she reached the limit of Dao Lord, the other had already caught up with her pace.","That innocent and romantic girl, she vaguely remembered that face.","During the time she went to the Ancient Wood Sect for cultivation.","That girl didn’t hesitate to follow behind her.","But now she had reached a position that even she dared not imagine.","The Universe Master of the Seven Tribulation realm.","She indeed had not thought about it.","At the Six Tribulation, she was already struggling.","Let alone the Seven Tribulation.","If she could also become the Universe Master of the Seven Tribulation, the Yuc Kingdom of the present cra","could rank in the top three of the Sixteen Kingdoms of Qingcao.","Because of the disappearance of the Yongheng Kingdom, there was an extra position.","But the resources were not abundant.","The entire Yongheng Kingdom was gone.","Empress Fengehen rubbed her eyebrows, and the shadows on the other thrones had disappeared.","Jian Wushuang and Princess Jinchen were also walking towards the outside.","Before stepping out of the threshold, they were stopped by a voice.","Jian Wushuang paused for a moment, then turned around hastily and respectfully said, “Your Majesty, is there anything else?”","Although they were already considered family, according to the customs of the Yue Kingdom, he still had to address her as Your Majesty.","“When the ruler of the Daughter Kingdom reaches the Seven Tribulation, there will be congratulations from all sides, and our Yue Kingdom cannot be absent. This time, the two of you will follow the Patriarch of the Zongren Mansion and go together!”","After speaking, a scroll flew out and drifted down in front of Princess Jinchen.","“Mother!” Jinchen was somewhat surprised, hesitated for a moment, then picked up the scroll,","Jian Wushuang watched with envy, wondering what it was all about.","“Step aside!” the Empress said, her figure faintly disappearing.","With their minds full of questions, the two walked out of the grand hall, silent all the way, and returned directly to the mansion in the royal capital below.","As they entered the luxurious mansion, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but ask, “What was that scroll?”","He had noticed in the grand hall that Empress Fengchen had written something on it on the spot.","When handed over to Jinchen, she didn’t say much either.","That scroll must be something special.","“I don’t know!” Princess Jinchen said, walking towards the back garden with her hands behind her back. Jian Wushuang had originally planned to retrieve the hidden mustard seed but found himself extremely curious about that scroll.","So he followed her to the backyard.","He had never really explored this mansion.","Upon reaching the backyard, he realized it wasn’t just a garden; it was a mountain of flowers.","Halfway up the mountain, amidst numerous glamorous flower clusters, there was an ice pool.","The two sat in a pavilion beside the ice pool.","A cool breeze blew, refreshing their minds.","I’ve told you, I can’t open it!” Jinchen was getting annoyed, so she directly took out the scroll and handed it to Jian Wushuang.","He carefully took it, holding the scroll gently, complaining, “Ignorant, this is a treasure, it shouldn’t be treated","like this!’","Jinchen’s big watery eyes rolled, but she coldly snorted inwardly. This scroll was a gift from her mother to the ruler of the Daughter Kingdom, and only the recipient could open it.","However, when it was handed to her, it wasn’t explicitly stated; she was informed via telepathy.","Although Jian Wushuang had married into the royal family, it didn’t mean he was one of them.","He could go as far as showing his face."]},{"number":5741,"title":"Chapter 5741: The Matter Between the Empress and the Country Ruler","paragraphs":["Chapter 5741: The Matter Between the Empress and the Country Ruler","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was very important to him. At that time, he planned to inject all his Sword Dao into it.","He wanted to forge a supreme treasure that could advance with him.","Naturally, he had to be meticulous.","It was a pity that the time was a little rushed this time.","Back then, he did not expect to be able to break through so quickly, so he was not in a hurry.","Now that he was cramming at the last minute, he did not know if it was still too late.","After pondering over the scroll, Jian Wushuang extended his hand and poured a trace of blue power into it.","When Jin Chen saw this, his eyes narrowed and he threatened, “Mother said that only the ruler can open it. If you dare to open it now, it will be a serious crime!”","“Tsk tsk, just as I guessed!” Jian Wushuang smiled and shook his head. Then, he reluctantly returned the scroll to Jinchen.","However, he sneered in his heart.","The power he had just released was for the other party to see.","The moment he touched the scroll, he injected a surge of power into it.","It was just that it was blocked by the restriction.","He used the power of the Starry Sky to continuously test the time in his hand.","He had long since peeped at the contents of the scroll.","What she did just now was just to irritate Jinchen and see what the empress had said to her.","This little girl was playing with him.","The difference was too great.","Jian Wushuang walked out of the pavilion regretfully.","“What are you going to do?” Jinchen couldn’t help but ask when he saw Jian Wushuang’s desolation.","“Back to my mother’s house!”","Jian Wushuang replied angrily.","His figure changed and he left the mansion.","The Wu family!","He wasn’t in a hurry to head to the space-time turbulence to retrieve the mustard seed.","Instead, he went to the Wu Clan to look for Wu Li to inquire about the Shi Kingdom’s divine craftsman.","He also talked about the current situation and asked if there was anything else to prepare before the Sacred Assembly.","They had just entered the Wu Residence.","Wu Li hurried over.","“Why are you back so quickly?” Wu Li’s eyes were filled with surprise.","They had gotten married yesterday, and they returned before noon the next day.","Jian Wushuang walked straight into the backyard. As he walked, he teased, “What? A married man is like water that has been poured out!”","There was no turning back!","He was different.","“That’s not what I meant. I’m just afraid that the royal family will misunderstand!” Wu Li smiled and followed him into the backyard.","Ever since he found out that Jian Wushuang’s strength surpassed his, he had lowered his attitude.","Jian Wushuang came to the backyard and sat down casually. He said, “Brother Wu Li, I’m here for business!”","“Tell me!” After Wu Li heard this, his expression became serious.","Now that Jian Wushuang said that he had something important to do, he was indeed very serious. Perhaps it was something important.","“The Sword Embryo!” Jian Wushuang told Wu Li about his situation and wanted Wu Li to give him some advice.","After Wu Li heard this, he felt that it was not a difficult task.","He also told Jian Wushuang about the embryo in detail.","There were many types of embryos.","There were also many levels.","For example, the Innate Embryo was the embryo of an Innate Treasure.","The embryo of an Eternal Treasure was an Eternal Embryo.","The embryo of a Universe Treasure was naturally a Universe Embryo.","Forging a Universe Embryo was no less than forging a universe.","When Jian Wushuang heard that, his expression changed.","Fortunately, he had robbed the Chen family last night, so he should have enough treasures.","Divine power dominated spacetime.","How many treasures could be used to build a cosmos?","Jian Wushuang smiled and asked Wu Li to speak freely. Let’s not talk about the ordinary ones. If he wanted to talk about the strongest ones, he wanted to forge them.","“Well!” Wu Li was a little embarrassed, but he still continued. “Actually, if you want to create a Universe Embryo that is completely compatible with you, it still has to do with you. The stronger you are, the better!”","Jian Wushuang rubbed his chin and nodded to signal Wu Li to continue.","“Let me give you an example. The Universe Embryo that I created back then was also a Sword Embryo. According to the structure of my universe, I embedded a hundred black holes in the embryo, reaching one-tenth of my universe, which is also the limit of most people. It’s not too difficult for the universe to nurture it. It only takes up one-tenth of the Origin Source!”","If that was the case, Jian Wushuang would need to embed a thousand black holes.","It was only ten times stronger than the limit state that Wu Li mentioned.","Even though their powers were different and their combat strength was a hundred times stronger, Jian Wushuang did not feel suffocated.","His strength was more than 100 or 1,000 times stronger than ordinary Emperors.","A million times was already considered small.","In front of him, no matter how many Emperors there were, they were still ants.","The Sword Embryo he wanted to forge had to be at least 108,000 times different!","“108,000!” Jian muttered thought to himself.","This number was not bad.","If the Sword Embryo was embedded with 108,000 black holes and 8,600 secret regions.","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang had a rough idea.","Wu Li saw that Jian Wushuang was deep in thought, so he started talking about the divine craftsmen.","“In terms of divine forgemasters, the Shi Kingdom is ranked first!”","Jian Wushuang agreed.","He had heard from the beginning that it was also because of the Flame God.","What a Flame God needed the most was flames.","A divine kingdom with infinite flames.","Of course, he didn’t lack this.","Hence, many people acknowledged the Shi Kingdom’s divine forgemasters even more.","“The God of Wine!” Wu Li said a name.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. He had also heard of this title.","Although the peak masters of Shi Kingdom were not members of the royal family, they were honored guests of the royal family of Shi Kingdom.","Their treatment was even better than those of Tribulation Realm experts of the royal family.","His strength was at the Six Tribulation realm, but it was comparable to the Seven Tribulation realm.","“You know him?” Jian Wushuang asked curiously.","Wu Li shook his head immediately when he heard that. He then teased himself. “I was just a poor kid back then. How could I have any treasures to invite that existence?!”","That’s right!","Back then, Wu Li was a rogue cultivator.","It was already not bad to be able to head to the Yue Kingdom to find a divine forgemaster.","How could he be qualified to let the God of Wine take action!","“However, the person who forged the Sword Embryo for me was the disciple of the God of Wine. He’s a Four Tribulation expert. That’s not bad!” Wu Li said proudly.","Back then, he was not as carefree as Jian Wushuang was now.","Not only was his strength heaven-defying, but his background was also very strong.","He could be considered to have stepped on the Wu family and married into the royal family of Yue Kingdom.","With a strong background, one’s strength was even stronger.","If he was willing to use his connections with the royal family of Yue Kingdom, he might be able to invite the God of Wine.","The God of Wine spent most of his time in the divine kingdom built by the Flame God.","On second thought, Jian Wushuang had just offended the successor, who was highly regarded by the Fire God.","He felt that it was hopeless again.","If Fan Tianfeng had been a little petty, Jian Wushuang could forget about forging a Sword Embryo from Shi Kingdom.","“We’re finished!” Seeing Wu Li’s expression, Jian Wushuang realized that he had offended Fan Tianfeng.","This time, he had cut off his own path.","He had also forgotten about this.","What a headache!","In terms of narrow-mindedness.","Out of the ten people from the Qishen Temple, Fan Feng was the most narrow-minded."]},{"number":5742,"title":"Chapter 5742: Daughter Kingdom","paragraphs":["Chapter 5742: Daughter Kingdom","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Now that she had changed her name, she was just as petty.","Jian Wushuang sighed in his heart and stopped thinking about it. Instead, he told Wu Li about the Chen Family’s destruction.","Although the Empress didn’t care much about the situation in the main hall, she was still worried.","However, he was also afraid that he would not be able to find anything.","Wu Li did not know much about this matter.","His main body had also been to the scene and chatted with those who were investigating.","He didn’t find anything.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief.","Next, he talked about the Daugther Kingdom.","He hadn’t been particularly interested in the Daughter Kingdom before, but he was curious about the Empress and the ruler of that kingdom.","In a scroll, he had discovered something intriguing.","It was a painting depicting two women.","One was the Empress of Yue Kingdom, Fengchen, dressed in an unexpected manner – disguised as a man.","It was a trick that would be easily exposed in ordinary circumstances, but even the Empress had played along.","The other woman was the ruler of the Daughter Kingdom, a graceful and charming lady.","Looking at the portrait, one would never guess she was a powerful figure in the Tribulation Realm.","When Wu Li heard about the Daughter Kingdom, he smirked mischievously at first, then solemnly said, “I don’t know much about this matter either. But this time, you’re fortunate. You’ll have the chance to accompany a certain elder from Yue Kingdom to congratulate that ruler. I’d like to take a look too, but I don’t have that privilege!”","Indeed.","The forces going to congratulate the ruler were likely to be from the six-star sects.","The Ancient Wood Sect and the Shi Kingdom would also go.","The experts of the Yue Kingdom’s royal family would not be conspicuous among them.","Not to mention the Wu family, which was at the bottom of the list.","He had witnessed the glory of a Universe Master at the Seven Tribulation realm.","It was indeed a rare opportunity.","At that time, he could also head to the Shi Kingdom.","Kill two birds with one stone.","“If Brother Wu Li is willing, I can bring you a few specialties from the Daughter Kingdom!”","After Wu Li heard this, he couldn’t help but smile.","Naturally, they both knew what the specialties of the Daughter Kingdom were.","After chatting for a while about Wanliu, Jian Wushuang quietly left.","He left the capital directly.","After changing his appearance and circling outside for a while, he returned to the mansion prepared for him by the royal family.","When he entered the mansion, he noticed a familiar aura.","Lord Mu.","Muchen!","“Nephew Wushuang, it’s already noon. Today, I’ll be thick-skinned and come here for a free meal!”","Mu Chen’s face was full of smiles.","Ever since witnessing Jian Wushuang’s strength yesterday, Muchen regarded him as a rare big supporter, someone who wouldn’t be inferior to his own sister in the future.","A figure capable of standing shoulder to shoulder with the Empress naturally deserved to be approached more often.","“Haha, Imperial Emperor, you jest. I owe today’s progress to you. Forget about just one meal, even if you come every day, I’ll be at your service!”","Jian Wushuang’s words pleased Muchen greatly, who beamed with joy at the table.","On the side, Jinchen couldn’t bear it anymore and urged, “How are we going to arrange the matter of going to the Daughter Kingdom?”","“You, little girl, are too anxious. Nephew Wushuang has just returned. There’s time to discuss later!” Muchen was afraid Jian Wushuang wouldn’t understand his intentions if he didn’t say it outright.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang quickly spoke up, “No harm in discussing now!”","Next, Muchen outlined the entire itinerary.","It was simply a departure time.","Leaving tomorrow afternoon.","Arriving at the capital of the Daughter Kingdom before nightfall.","Offering congratulations would only take one night.","This time, only three people would go from Yue Kingdom.","Led by an elder of the royal family, a Six Tribulation realm powerhouse, accompanying Jian Wushuang and Jinchen.","“Senior Muchen will take you two there. Remember to be respectful to Senior Muchen and reverent to the strong from various factions!”","Muchen added finally, “There are many strong figures going. You mustn’t be too conspicuous. As the Sacred Assembly approaches, there can be no mistakes in such matters!”","“Understood!” Jian Wushuang and Jinchen nodded together.","As the Sacred Assembly approached, Yue Kingdom was a hot topic this time.","Being too conspicuous could lead to private schemes against them, which would be unlucky.","As Jian Wushuang agreed, he also mentioned his intention to visit Shi Kingdom.","At the mention of Shi Kingdom, Jinchen’s expression changed slightly.","Muchen felt somewhat embarrassed, but Jian Wushuang didn’t mind.","“The Sword Embryo, it’s crucial. We must go!” Jian Wushuang’s tone was firm.","Muchen politely said, “If you need help, just ask!”","“Definitely!”","This time, there was nothing more to say. After a while, Muchen returned home.","Jinchen returned to her room alone.","Jian Wushuang headed to the special place in the mansion dedicated to cultivation.","The Absolute Space!","He entered into a hidden dimension.","This space was a black hole derived from his universe.","Utterly concealed.","Externally, it was a secret chamber within his mansion.","Upon entering this pocket dimension, Jian Wushuang retrieved a mustard seed.","Grasping it, he flung it out with a Thought power push, and it plummeted into the hidden dimension.","Ordinary debris was instantly devoured and absorbed by the power of the black hole.","Among these remnants, Jian Wushuang found four conches.","Above them lingered the aura of the universe.","It should be a cosmic-level pocket dimension.","Luxurious, perhaps storing too many treasures, all needing cosmic space for storage.","Jian Wushuang was quite eager.","However, he didn’t rush to open these four pocket dimensions.","Instead, he took out a black crystal from the mustard seed.","This was plundered by Zibai from the Chen family’s universe.","Let’s first open this crystal and see what treasures lie within.","With a flick of his finger, Jian Wushuang forcefully broke the seal above.","The crystal was forcibly opened.","Crack!","Embedded inside was another mustard seed.","Presumably, when that Universe Master despaired, they chose to seal all their treasures within their universe.","Unfortunately, they couldn’t escape Zibai’s plunder.","There were still many universe crystals on Zibai, but unfortunately, after burning the Origin Source and using himself to block attacks, his own body collapsed, and those universe crystals were exhausted as well.","Jian Wushuang didn’t care about those universe crystals now.","He felt a bit regretful about Zibai’s fall.","A good helper in the Five Tribulation realm!","Just like that, gone.","Now, he didn’t even have the strength to refine a chess piece.","He could only wait until the Tribulation Realm to refine those chess pieces with titles.","Exhaling deeply, Jian Wushuang, filled with endless illusions, opened the mustard seed sealed by that Universe Master.","Whoosh!","Countless treasures cascaded down in an instant.","Upon seeing these treasures, he was initially surprised, but quickly realized.","Those living in the Chen family’s universe were mostly mundane descendants of the Chen family.","Some had weak abilities or couldn’t embark on cultivation at all. If they were in the Yue Kingdom, they would probably lead very poor lives.","But it was different within the universe; it was entirely the Chen family’s territory.","Even if they couldn’t cultivate, they could still have a perfect life.","So, the treasures stored in the mustard seed were all for mortal mundane use.","There were also some treasures for Immortal use.","Although the quantity was astonishing, enough for billions to use, they were of no use to him."]},{"number":5743,"title":"Chapter 5743: Origin Stone Mountain","paragraphs":["Chapter 5743: Origin Stone Mountain","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Fortunately, there were still treasures left by the Universe Master himself.","Some well-known treasures of the universe definitely couldn’t be used, as they would raise suspicion.","The Chen family had just been destroyed.","Using the Chen family’s treasures would be foolish.","He devoured what treasures he could and destroyed what he couldn’t.","There were also some unheard-of treasures.","After all, apart from a few representative treasures, most treasures a cultivator possessed were kept hidden.","Just like the treasures he had on him.","Many people knew about his Jueyun Sword and Beast God Weapon.","But knowledge about his other treasures was scarce.","It was the same for others.","Besides the unusable treasures, he had no interest in the remaining junk.","The only usable ones were some strange items.","They must have come from the void beyond the domain, with a considerable value.","According to his estimation, they were worth over ten billion.","But for a Universe Master at the Three Tribulation realm, the actual benefits he could gain were merely ten billion.","Indeed, he was somewhat at a disadvantage.","Of course, there were still some treasures he couldn’t discern.","Three pieces of red metal, of unknown material, extremely tough, emitting a bloody aura.","He didn’t care about those.","The most important were the treasures in the Chen family’s treasury.","“Don’t give me any more mundane treasures from the mortal world!” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but lament.","With the remnants exhausted, only some prohibitive power remained in the celestial cave.","He couldn’t possibly ignore it.","With a single palm strike, he shattered the prohibition of the cave, along with its internal spatial structure.","Crash!","Before his eyes, a vibrant and colorful aura burst forth.","Upon closer inspection, it wasn’t just an aura but actual treasures.","However, there were so many of them condensed together, they appeared similar to an aura.","Though the cave was shattered, its general structure remained.","There were three main areas.","Each representing a trove of treasures.","Jian Wushuang had previously seen the colorful treasures, which were clusters of purple crystals.","“What’s this?” His breath became deep.","These treasures extended from the universe crystals.","As if they were piled up with universe crystals.","Jian Wushuang gazed around, it was like a towering mountain.","At least hundreds of billions of cubic units in volume.","Converted into universe crystals, it was an immeasurable quantity.","“Origin stones!” Jian Wushuang recalled the information he had uncovered at Qingyun Gate.","He recognized these crystals.","These were the purest source of divine power stones, greatly valued in the ancient time and space.","In Qishen Temple, they were inferior to universe crystals, but in the ancient time and space, the price of origin stones surpassed universe crystals by a hundredfold.","With so many origin stones, even a Seven Tribulation powerhouse might not have as much, yet a small Chen family actually had such a vast reserve.","“This is a real find!”","With so many origin stones, not to mention the Wine God, even an Eight Tribulation powerhouse would be greatly tempted.","Of course, most Eight Tribulation powerhouses didn’t need such treasures; they sought exotic items.","These origin stones could assist in cultivating divine power and could be absorbed during battles to restore divine power.","They were the hard currency of the Tribulation Realm and strategic resources that families needed to stockpile.","Looking at it this way, the ambition of the Chen family was not small.","To secretly hoard so many origin stones.","Jian Wushuang was eager to open the remaining two spaces.","The Second Area.","It was a valley.","The valley was filled with countless divine herbs and some exotic flowers and fruits.","Even Jian Wushuang couldn’t recognize them all.","But judging from the power emanating from above, these things held significant value.","“Hmm? Something’s off!” Jian Wushuang frowned.","There was a familiar aura on these exotic fruits and flowers, something he had just seen.","It was that bloody aura.","He casually plucked a fruit tainted with the bloody aura and popped it into his mouth.","Instantly, that aura turned into a raging force, merging into his bloodstream.","Boom!","Jian Wushuang clenched his fists, and his divine power suddenly surged.","His basic divine power had increased by a hundred.","“How is this possible?” Jian Wushuang couldn’t quite believe it.","His basic divine power was already at 200,000-fold.","This was beyond the limit of an Emperor, not even reaching 200,000-fold for a strong individual in the Two Tribulation realm.","The Emperor’s limit was 100,000-fold divine power.","He was able to break through to 200,000-fold, all thanks to Babidi.","Now, absorbing that bloody aura, he could still enhance his divine power.","It was somewhat unbelievable.","Looking around, there were countless fruits.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes gleamed.","If he ate them all, wouldn’t he be comparable to a Five Tribulations in the Emperor level?","“No, something’s wrong!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","There must be some kind of backlash.","If it were really that miraculous, then this treasure would be too heaven-defying.","How could the Chen Family obtain such a treasure?","A mere small family like the Chen Family couldn’t get such a miraculous treasure!","With such a treasure, their strength shouldn’t be what it is today.","So, there was only one possibility left.","Jian Wushuang opened all three regions.","One side was the towering Origin Stone Mountain.","In the midst lay crimson fruits.","The final area was small, with a pool of blood.","This reminded Jian Wushuang of the blood sacrifice by Hun Tian in the past.","Compared to that, his own blood sacrifices were child’s play.","The blood pool of the Chen Family sparked various thoughts in him.","Unfortunately, those of the Chen Family who should die have died, and those who should escape have escaped.","He reckoned anyone who knew the truth was killed by him.","“These fruits must have been nurtured by the blood pool. It seems the Chen Family’s plans are grand!” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","But why didn’t the Chen Family use them themselves?","And what was the purpose of cultivating these blood-red fruits?","With these doubts, Jian Wushuang stepped out of the secret chamber.","He could use the origin stones, which were unmarked.","But he had to be cautious with the rest; destroy what could be destroyed and discard what couldn’t.","Some enhancing treasures, however, could be consumed.","Now he needed to investigate some matters concerning the Chen Family.","There was only one day left before heading to the Daughter Kingdom.","It was late at night now, so he wouldn’t be able to go out when dawn broke.","He could only leave the city now and head to the ruins of the Chen Family.","With his mind set, Jian Wushuang set off immediately.","He couldn’t contain such a significant matter in his heart and wanted to understand it as soon as possible.","Because he always felt that the downfall of the Chen Family was a big threat to him.","Just before he left the city, several powerful auras arrived at the Yue Kingdom’s capital.","Jian Wushuang paid them no heed. After changing his form, he headed straight for the Chen Family’s old lair.","He wouldn’t arouse suspicion by going now.","Many strong individuals were currently at the Chen Family’s old nest out of curiosity or to gain some benefits.","When he arrived, he encountered several Tribulation Realm experts.","“Dao Friend, you’re a bit late. The royal family just made a significant discovery here and has already taken those treasures and left!” an elder sitting cross-legged on a peak, sensing Jian Wushuang’s powerful aura as he landed nearby, informed him of what had just occurred in the area."]},{"number":5744,"title":"Chapter 5744: New Discoveries","paragraphs":["Chapter 5744: New Discoveries","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The arrival was none other than Jian Wushuang.","Upon hearing the old man’s words, he thanked him in a low voice.","Then he turned and left directly.","Originally, he had intended to inquire about the progress of the investigation in this area, or if there were any discoveries.","But he hadn’t expected there to be a significant discovery.","Initially, he had hurried along, thinking that all the treasures were inside the cave.","But the Chen family had a trick up their sleeve.","Jian Wushuang hurried back with all his strength, returning to the capital in just an hour.","Thinking about the recent arrival of strong members of the royal family, his brow furrowed.","It seemed that the discovery was out of the ordinary.","If it were just some ordinary treasure, he probably wouldn’t have returned so quickly.","Although things had taken an unexpected turn, Jian Wushuang remained composed. He first restored his composure, then calmly returned to his mansion.","Then he began to contact Elder Muchen.","He was the Universe Master of the royal family, although his strength was not exceptional.","But he was indeed a pillar of the future and the brother of the Empress.","His information should be more up-to-date.","“Nephew Wushuang, you’re really quick with the news. I just received word myself. How about we go to the palace together?” Elder Muchen was somewhat surprised by Jian Wushuang’s speed in receiving the news, but he didn’t doubt it too much. When someone from the royal family discovered the treasure, it caused quite a stir, and then rushing back to the royal family immediately afterward attracted a lot of attention.","As long as Jian Wushuang maintained contact with the outside world and was aware of this matter, it wasn’t surprising.","Jian Wushuang readily accepted Elder Muchen’s reply.","If he were to go alone, it would indeed be too unusual. But if Muchen took him along, it would be different.","The two of them were going to watch the excitement.","A person with a determined demeanor.","To be safe, Jian Wushuang shamelessly dragged along Princess Jinchen.","Originally, she had no intention of going, but under his persuasion, she was convinced with astonishing arguments.","And so, the two of them set off together, meeting with Muchen outside the palace before entering together.","The palace above the clouds was incredibly solemn!","Upon entering, the three couldn’t help but feel a sense of awe.","Jian Wushuang, being perceptive, noticed that the guards were stricter than usual upon their entry into the palace.","It was hard for him not to think it was because of the Chen family’s matters.","Especially when they headed towards the main hall, the blood-red aura within him surged constantly, emanating from the blood-red fruit he had just absorbed.","Inside the main hall, the source of this aura was drawing him in.","Buzz!","Before they even entered the main hall, they sensed a powerful presence.","“Someone powerful is acting?”","The three were surprised, then quickly entered the main hall.","Without even being summoned, they charged right in.","Upon entering the grand hall, they discovered several formidable figures inside.","Eight experts at the Five Tribulation realm, and two at the Six Tribulation realm.","Of course, none of them were Universe Masters, only Scattered Tribulation experts.","In the current Yue Kingdom, there was only one Universe Master at the Five Tribulation realm, the Empress, and hardly any at the Four Tribulation.","Their entrance caused a stir.","Several sharp gazes swept over them, making it hard to breathe.","“Elder Yanlong!” Elder Muchen, seeing the situation, quickly bowed.","The oldest of the two Six Tribulation realm experts nodded slowly.","Though Jinchen was the princess of Yue Kingdom, she had never seen an elder of this level before. In a hurry, she pulled Jian Wushuang to kneel alongside her in respect.","“Please rise!” Elder Yanlong’s expression was kindly as he waved his hand towards the three.","The Empress spoke up at this point, “Since you’re here, just stand aside and observe!”","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang slowly rose and stood aside.","Only then did he notice a small transparent altar in the hall.","Inside, there was a churning green liquid.","It was nauseating to look at.","But within that liquid lay vitality.","Of course, this vitality was quite ordinary, nowhere near comparable to Jian Wushuang’s Life power.","Within this green vitality, there was also a small flesh mass.","It resembled a lingzhi mushroom.","That must be what was causing his blood and qi to surge.","Jian Wushuang stared blankly without concealing his surprise.","Patriarch Yanlong, standing at the top, noticed Jian Wushuang’s unusual gaze and asked, “Youngster, do you know it?”","Upon hearing Patriarch Yanlong’s inquiry, Jian Wushuang finally realized there were several strong figures beside him and quickly withdrew his gaze.","But as he glanced at those elders, a thought sparked in his mind, and he came up with an idea.","“In response to Patriarch, I encountered something similar in the Outer Domain. Initially found it in a mysterious realm and mistakenly consumed the surrounding fruits. Just now, upon seeing this object, I found it related to my qi and blood, hence the daze!” Jian Wushuang improvised, weaving a lie even he almost believed.","Elder Muchen, on the side, felt some discrepancies, thinking it’s no wonder Jian Wushuang is so powerful.","Daring to explore the secrets of the Outer Domain.","But then he remembered, Jian Wushuang’s identity in the Outer Domain was fake.","Can this story be true?","Truth and falsehood, no one could discern.","“Oh! To think you’re fated with it, then I’ll give it to you!” Patriarch Yanlong said, using Thought power to directly send the mysterious creature resembling Lingzhi mushroom, soaked in Life fluid, to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was momentarily stunned.","“Umm?”","“Take it if it’s given to you!” The Empress spoke now, her voice icy.","Jian Wushuang dared not say more and quickly received it with both hands.","The moment he touched it, the mysterious creature, resembling Lingzhi mushroom, began devouring his Life power.","Its appearance quickly changed from a Lingzhi shape to an oval cocoon.","After Jian Wushuang sealed his own Life power, the creature stopped transforming.","This scene astonished everyone present.","Patriarch Yanlong’s gaze flickered. He wasn’t interested in the creature in the Life fluid, only in the Life fluid itself.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s recognition of the creature, he had an idea to use Jian Wushuang’s hand to get that thing out.","He didn’t care if it was true or false.","Mainly because they were all just captivated by this thing.","Some people advocated not to act recklessly.","But he couldn’t wait.","He urgently needed the Life fluid among them.","Because he was too old.","Without vitality, he would fall into slumber.","Becoming a living dead in the king’s tomb.","The land is so beautiful; he is very attached to it.","But he hadn’t anticipated that the mysterious creature would indeed be related to Jian Wushuang and would undergo rapid changes.","Whether it was due to leaving the Life liquid or because of Jian Wushuang himself, he wasn’t sure.","He was well aware of Jian Wushuang’s mysterious background and strength as the husband of the dynasty, a connection that was likely true.","“Hmm? It’s not moving!” Jian Wushuang held the oval-shaped pupa, which was hardly moving."]},{"number":5745,"title":"Chapter 5745 Strange Life","paragraphs":["5745 Strange Life","Ile feared infusing Life power into the entity again, directly allowing it to be born.","From the force above, it seemed that the entity’s power had nothing to do with the Life force, but rather with the blood-colored aura t had just absorbed.","Life would only cause it to be born prematurely, but the blood-colored aura could make it rapidly grow stronger.","The Empress stared at Jian Wushuang, her brow furrowing slightly.","She always felt that ever since Jian Wushuang appeared before her, unrest pervaded the Yue Kingdom. She didn’t know that even the downfall of the Yongheng Kingdom was closely related to Jian Wushuang.","“Dead!” Yanlong’s gaze focused on the cocoon, speaking,","Because the cocoon’s Life force had rapidly withered away after Jian Wushuang broke it, it was about to perish.","Jian Wushuang hurriedly presented the oval cocoon. He didn’t want anything to do with it.","“It’s yours if you want it, no need to say more!” Patriarch Yanlong smiled. “I heard that this time, the two of you are going to the Daughter Kingdom. Go back and prepare carlier!”","This was to send Jian Wushuang and the others away.","However, Jian Wushuang had a certain attachment to the altar and really wanted to open it up.","But his status didn’t qualify him to do so.","He could sense that many people were eyeing the Life liquid inside.","Especially that Patriarch Yanlong.","The Empress didn’t care, the Universe Master didn’t need vitality.","But those Scattered Tribulations and Patriarch Yanlong, who were about to enter the coffin of the Tribulation Realm, really needed it!","“Us younger generation will take our leave!”","The three could only leave reluctantly.","As for the main hall, they were discussing how to distribute it.","The Yue Kingdom still had a prominent figure.","Jian Wushuang didn’t know how many Six Tribulation experts there were.","But there was only one in the Seven Tribulation realm.","The founding ancestor of the royal family.","As for the Seven Tribulation powerhouse, it was said that they had entered the royal tomb, and it was unknown if they could still be revived.","Only that bit of Life fluid, dreaming of reviving the Seven Tribulation was simply wishful thinking.","Most likely, those on the altar would benefit. But that was no longer his concern.","What he desired was still that altar.","If only his strength and status were not limited. He truly wanted to throw a bundle of Life force on the other’s face, then embrace the altar and go into seclusion for research. But now, all he had was a dying cicada pupa. Even the blood-red aura he had just absorbed had been devoured by the other party.","“Wait a minute!” Jian Wushuang had just left the palace when a sudden realization struck him.","The blood-red power on him was gone, but the increased divine power remained.","At this moment, he began to understand.","This blood-red power was the greatest. backlash.","And the source of the backlash was that pupa.","“Darn it!”","Without even saying goodbye to Elder Muchen, Jian Wushuang disregarded Jincheng and went straight back to his mansion’s secret chamber to begin a brief seclusion.","He wanted to confirm his thoughts.","Back in his paradise, shielding the infinite heavenly secrets, namely the will of heaven.","Te toyed with the pupa in his hand.","“There’s still a glimmer of life!” Jian Wushuang could sense it with his Thought power.","Even if there were no signs of life, he could forcibly revive the other party!","For such risky endeavors, he didn’t dare to do it within his Origin Source.","Of all the treasures be obtained from the Chen family, only the Origin Stone Mountain remained stored in his Origin Source.","The rest, were all in his paradise.","Swish!","A valley of blood-red.","Fruits everywhere.","Jian Wushuang threw the cicada pupa directly into the air.","A huge green river, like a galaxy, directly enveloped the pupa.","The elliptical pupa underwent another transformation.","Its form changed, but its power remained the same.","The pupa now wasn’t even an Immortal.","Otherwise, it wouldn’t have been given away so easily.","Breaking out of the cocoon!","After consuming a stream of Life power, the oval-shaped pupa broke out of its cocoon.","Transformed into a massive beetle.","Though it had enough vitality, it couldn’t undergo further transformation,","Moreover, its power didn’t increase: upon becoming a beetle, its size increased, making its movements","sluggish.","Jian Wushuang stared at the direction the creature moved in.","It was heading towards the blood-colored valley.","“We can’t let it just feast. like that!” Jian Wushuang casually bound the beetle.","Then he entered the blood-colored valley.","He began devouring the blood-colored fruits and some herbs.","His divine body began to swell madly.","As if there were no limits.","With one hand, Jian Wushuang ate the blood-colored fruits, and with the other, he transferred all the blood-colored power to the beetle.","This way, he was purely increasing his divine power.","In the span of an hour, he gained 10,000 divine power.","If this speed were known to others, it would probably suffocate them.","If it weren’t for his family secret, devouring his blood essence, he would probably burst and die.","The blood-colored aura turned extremely violent upon encountering the beetle.","But the beetle now was no longer its original self,","Jian Wushuang stared at the bound beetle under him; it bad acquired a humanoid form.","Yet, it retained the features of a beetle.","Its carapace had become shoulder guards, chest armor, leg armor, and foot guards.","Its head was the same; though humanoid, it still possessed the beetle’s unique eyes and nose bridge.","Its mouth was a hard, round shape.","“Can you speak?” Jian Wushuang felt a faint call!","He stared at the other person in astonishment.","‘Huff!’","Listening carefully, there was only a deep breath.","Despite devouring so much blood, it still had little strength left.","At this moment, it couldn’t even handle mundane matters.","This reminded Jian Wushuang of that blood pool.","If he threw this guy into the blood pool, he wondered if it could become an Emperor.","Jian Wushuang shook his head, sighing inwardly. “Torget it, your greatest use is helping me alleviate these","bloody auras.”","Whoosh!","The flow of time gradually slowed down.","While his divine power was growing rapidly.","He intended to devour all the fruits in the valley.","Let’s see how far his divine power could reach.","One year, two years, a hundred years.","Under the acceleration of time, it took him a hundred years to devour all the fruits in the bloody canyon.","During this hundred years, the body of the humanoid beetle didn’t change much, but its strength had already","broken through to Immortality.","It was even at the peak of its cultivation realm.","It was as good as a Dao Lord realm cultivator.","But this strength, in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, was no different from a real bug.","Now Jian Wushuang truly had the qualifications to be arrogant.","His basic divine power had increased to 400,000-fold.","An Emperor, with basic divine power at 400,000-fold.","It’s terrifying just to think about it.","This time, he did not need the power of the Beast. God, with this level of divine power, he was on par with","top-tier Four Tribulation experts.","Now, if he used the power of the Beast God again, the burden would be too great.","Hum!","Jian Wushuang clenched his fist slightly, and the aura of the Beast God appeared on his body.","The next moment, he gritted his teeth, wanting to use the power of the Beast God, but found that he couldn’t","mobilize the Origin Source of the Beast God at all.","“It seems a bit forced!”","He was not surprised. Now, with 400,000-fold divine power, even if he used the power of the Beast God, doubling it, it would only","amplify to 480,000-fold.","That was the real limit.","He had briefly achieved 500,000-fold divine power.","It was because of Babidi’s power back then."]},{"number":5746,"title":"Chapter 5746 Double Divine Power","paragraphs":["5746 Double Divine Power","....","Now, if he didn’t spare any cost, he could exert the power of the Beast God to reach up to 500,000-fold.","“Could it be that this beetle is related to Babidi?” Yet, upon seeing the appearance of the beetle, he felt it didn’t quite fit.","It’s also possible that it just hails from the same place as Babidi.","Then it fell into the hands of the Chen family, wanting to cultivate this kind of monster.","Jian Wushuang shook his head. “Unfortunately, its strength is too weak!”","He sighed, “What a waste of talent.”","Even if he threw it into the blood pool, at most it could reach the peak of its current cultivation realm, or even enter the Tribulation. What good would that do?","Ordinary Tribulation realm beings were mere ants.","Unless it could be cultivated to the level of a Chi Jiuxiao like what Babidi produced.","A Half-Step Nine Tribulation expert.","Of course, the Chen family didn’t have the capability to nurture it like that.","Although Babidi’s strength was weak, the secret techniques he used were special, capable of controlling many powerful individuals. Many superpowers in the Ancient Wood Continent were willing to cooperate with him.","What did the Chen family have?","Just a former Five Tribulation expert?","That was far from enough.","Even if, hypothetically, the beetle could reach that level, how would the Chen family control it?","Ordinary enslavement wouldn’t work at all.","Jian Wushuang held the beetle’s head in his hand, feeling uneasy.","He wasn’t sure if he hoped for it to become powerful or if leaving it as it was would be better.","If it became too powerful, he didn’t have Babidi’s ability to control it.","“Forget it, you’ll stay here!” Jian Wushuang directly threw it into the bloody valley.","There were still many remnants of bloody aura here, and next door was the blood altar.","Leaving it here would also continuously increase its strength!","Just sealed it off nearby.","He didn’t know that this casual act would bring such a big disaster to Yue Kingdom and even the entire spacetime.","But that was a long time in the past.","Before leaving, the beetle, still unable to stand, crawled on the ground, turned its head to look at Jian Wushuang, and growled two words!","“Xi Lu!”","Jian Wushuang left the cave, placed the mountain stone storing the cave in the jade spring in the secret room, and then hurriedly left.","Today, he still had to follow Yanlong to the Daughter Kingdom, and he couldn’t delay.","The ruler of the Daughter Kingdom was a formidable figure in the Seven Tribulation realm. There was an inexplicable connection between her and the Empress Fengchen.","Jian Wushuang was even more eager to go and see.","He also planned to settle the matter of the sword mold in the Shi Kingdom while he was at it. If Fan Tianfeng gave him trouble, he would seek another way at the Ancient Wood Sect to find a master blacksmith.","There was no need to linger in the Shi Kingdom.","He hoped Fan Tianfeng wouldn’t be so narrow-minded.","After leaving the secret room, as soon as Jian Wushuang’s aura appeared at the mansion, a figure instantly appeared before him.","“Why are you just coming out now? Don’t you know we’re going to the Daughter Kingdom today?” The person was Princess Jinchen, already dressed in formal attire, impatiently urging Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t angry; this time, he really was slow.","Hastily changing into a black robe, he followed Jinchen out of the mansion.","The two of them went straight to the eastern gate of the palace.","Grand Patriarch Yanlong was already waiting there.","Seeing the black dragon under his feet, Jian Wushuang understood why he was called Yanlong. It was probably his Dao name, not his real name.","“Patriarch Yanlong!” They both respectfully greeted him.","Feeling somewhat ashamed, Jian Wushuang couldn’t believe they had made an old man like him wait for them for so long.","“Come up quickly!” Patriarch Yanlong didn’t mind at all, still wearing a kindly expression.","Jian Wushuang noticed that the old man’s complexion was much rosier, and he seemed much younger. Most likely, he had absorbed the life essence from the altar.","As for that altar!","He dared not think too much about it, nor was there any need.","The crimson fruits had long been transformed into divine power.","“Let’s go!”","The three of them rode the black dragon, breaking through the space and entering the chaotic flows.","Although it didn’t seem very fast, in the blink of an eye, they had already left Yue Kingdom.","They were now heading towards the Daughter Kingdom.","It would only take 15 minutes to reach the Daughter Kingdom.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on the back of the black dragon, surveying his surroundings while pondering the matter of the sword mold.","The Daughter Kingdom was just a curiosity after all.","The sword mold was the real deal.","He quietly went to search for it in the Shi Kingdom without using the power of Yue Kingdom.","It was difficult to meet those famous master craftsmen.","But if he used the relationship of the royal family of Yue Country, Fan Tianfeng would find out.","What a headache.","The key was that this time, it wasn’t just Yue Kingdom going to the Daughter Kingdom.","Other powerful beings from the Ancient Wood Continent and members of the Ancient Moon Sect would also arrive.","The Universe Masters of the Seven Tribulation were not ordinary individuals.","If a Universe Master of the Eight Tribulation were to appear, it was feared that strong individuals from surrounding temporal rivers would come to pay their respects.","Eight Tribulation realm.","With their own Universe Dao Arena.","A Universe Master of the Eight Tribulation could intimidate several epochs.","Like those epochs in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Some were created by Universe Masters of the Seven Tribulation, but in every epoch, there would emerge a Universe Master of the Eight Tribulation.","For instance, the previous Universe Master of the Eight Tribulation had left the Ancient Moon Spacetime millions of aeons ago.","In the current Ancient Moon Spacetime, apart from the overt Universe Master of the Eight Tribulation in the Ancient Moon Sect, no other faction possessed a Universe Master of the Eight Tribulation.","Factions with Universe Masters of the Seven Tribulation were pitifully few.","The Ancient Wood Continent, for example, only had three Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation.","There was also a formidable figure from the Ancient Moon Sect, bestowed with the title of Marquis.","At the pinnacle of the Seventh Tribulation, possessing strength akin to a Half-Step Eighth Tribulation.","If within his own Universe Dao Arena, perhaps no one on the Ancient Wood Continent could threaten him.","Unless the Flame God brought his Dao Arena to challenge him.","When Jian Wushuang had just arrived in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he thought Universe Masters were worthless.","But now, it seemed that only the weak were worthless.","The powerful were always rare.","Whether they were Universe Masters or Emperors, it was all the same.","He couldn’t afford to learn from the weak; he aimed to emulate the strong.","Only a stroke of luck separated him from entering the Tribulation Realm.","Once he unlocked the Wanliu, a breakthrough was inevitable.","Then, he would directly ascend to the rank of Universe Master.","His power would undergo another transformation.","Not to mention the power of the Starry Sky.","Just his current divine power alone amounted to 400,000-fold.","When the time came, integrating the bones of Dao Jun into his divine body would unleash a million divine powers effortlessly.","The power of the Beast God would truly erupt only in the Tribulation Realm.","Exhaling deeply, Jian Wushuang let out a sigh.","A bright light appeared before him, splitting open a fissure.","When it reappeared, he found himself in a world with a clear blue sky and lush greenery.","Pink flowers adorned the green grass.","It was exactly like the Daughter Kingdom Jian Wushuang had imagined, except there were no women to be seen.","What would they be like?","“We’re almost there. You two little ones, stick close to me!” Patriarch Yanlong instructed. With a flash, his black dragon form instantly arrived outside a simple and small city."]},{"number":5747,"title":"Chapter 5747 Dark Heaven Expert","paragraphs":["5747 Dark Heaven Expert","....","The super cities of cultivators were incomparable.","“Is this the capital of the Daughter Kingdom?” Jinchen was the first to voice her question.","Jian Wushuang was also curious.","The city exuded no discernible aura.","It looked much like an ordinary city.","“Haha, of course. You’ll understand once you enter. The capital of the Daughter Kingdom is indeed within this mortal city!” Yanlong stowed away his black dragon treasure and led the two down a small path outside the city, walking straight into its heart.","Once inside the city walls,","Jian Wushuang and Jinchen behaved like country folk entering a city for the first time, looking around in wonder.","Patriarch Yanlong acted like an attendant, giving reminders as they walked, “Remember, within this city, you cannot use divine powers, let alone slaughter ordinary people. Otherwise, no one will be able to save you!”","“Patriarch, rest assured, we are not practitioners of the demonic path!” Jinchen replied nonchalantly.","Jian Wushuang nodded gently as well.","He was indeed not a practitioner of the demonic path; if anything, he walked the path of the heavens.","Pursuing the heavenly way.","Pursuing strength.","And pursuing Immortality even more.","His path to Immortality had already been realized.","According to his calculations, he had reached the pinnacle, mastering the complete Dao Heart.","He was truly Immortal now.","In the past, even eternity couldn’t achieve true Immortality.","Without a fully realized Dao Heart, one would still fall.","But now, Jian Wushuang could be considered to have reached the state of true Immortality.","Yet, to become the master of the universe, he would have to face tribulations.","And above the Universe Master, there might be an even greater state of Immortality.","Perhaps that was his ultimate pursuit.","Walking on the bustling streets, they each had their own reflections, especially Princess Jinchen.","She probably hadn’t experienced much of the mortal world.","As an Immortal in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, she seemed more like a worldly Immortal, having risen above the mundane mortal world.","Yet, some geniuses swiftly broke through to become Emperors without any obstacles, even becoming the Universe Master directly. Such a path wasn’t sustainable.","“Hmm?” As they walked, they suddenly noticed someone following them.","Jinchen, with her straightforward personality, felt the gaze upon her and turned to look.","At the street corner stood an elderly and a young person, or rather a youth.","With red hair and blood-red eyes, he wore a robe embroidered with strange red patterns, looking eerie.","Staring at the three of them, his eyes held a hint of greed.","When his gaze fell upon Jinchen, it grew even stranger.","Realizing he had been noticed when Jinchen turned to look, he continued to stare at her from head to toe.","Wearing a golden robe with a five-clawed golden dragon embroidered on it, it resembled imperial attire, perhaps stirring a man’s desire for control even more.","Jinchen, fiery in temperament, directly confronted him, “Bold of you! Staring at me like this, if we were elsewhere, I would have gouged your eyes out already!”","“Don’t be rude!”","Jian Wushuang frowned at the remark.","This reprimand came from none other than Patriarch Yanlong.","He unexpectedly intervened to stop Jinchen.","Glancing at the two figures in the distance, he didn’t bother with the red-haired youth but instead turned his gaze to the elder beside him, speaking respectfully, “Senior Xue Dao, long time no see!”","“Tsk tsk, who do we have here? Turns out it’s someone from the Yue Kingdom!” The elder didn’t buy it, feeling the aura emanating from Yanlong.","He sneered, then turned to the red-haired youth beside him and said coldly, “Let’s go. If you want to see, wait until we’re out of here, and I’ll snatch it back for you to use as a cauldron!”","Upon hearing this, the red-haired youth licked his lips and cast a disgustingly sinister glance at Jincheng.","This infuriated Jincheng greatly, his eyes already wide, almost bulging out.","But with Patriarch Yanlong’s intervention, she could only swallow her anger.","Jian Wushuang stood by, his face ice-cold.","Although he and Jincheng were only a nominal couple.","But in this situation, he couldn’t just stand by.","“I thought I was shameless enough, but it turns out you’re even more shameless than me!” Jian Wushuang sneered, a surge of dark energy gathering in his palm, condensing instantly with 400,000-fold divine power, and slapped towards the red-haired youth.","Although the opponent’s aura contracted, Jian Wushuang could still see through the levels of Life force that he should be a Universe Master.","And stronger than Wu Li.","At least at the peak of the Third Tribulation level.","Or even a Universe Master of the Fourth Tribulation.","With 400,000-fold divine power, even a Fourth Tribulation Universe Master should be cautious.","This is not his Dao Arena.","“How dare you, b*stard!” The red-haired youth’s face changed drastically, roaring in anger!","As the surge of dark energy came at him, he hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to strike.","Now he could only take it head-on.","Forming hand seals with both hands, a muffled sound.","The red-haired youth, a trace of blood appearing at the corner of his mouth.","He couldn’t believe that Jian Wushuang could actually hurt him.","When Yanlong Ancestor wanted to intervene, it was already too late.","Originally, Yanlong expression was serene, but now it soured.","Without his consent, Jian Wushuang’s sudden intervention displeased him greatly.","But this also concerned the reputation of Yue Kingdom, attracting the attention of many foreign cultivators.","If he went forward to apologize, he couldn’t afford to lose face!","However, he couldn’t afford to offend the other party.","Patriarch Xue Dao.","A powerhouse in the Seventh Tribulation.","Although he was a Scattered Tribulation cultivator, his strength was extraordinary, possessing top-notch power among those in the Seventh Tribulation.","Even stronger than the founding ancestor of Yue Kingdom.","If the opponent were just a Scattered Tribulation cultivator, it would have been acceptable.","But the Patriarch Xue Dao hailed from the strongest sect in the Black Heaven, the “Blood Robe Sect”.","That redhead youth, if he guessed correctly, should be the son of the current sect master.","Blood Robe Sect, an eight-star sect.","The current sect master is also the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation.","They were truly not to be trifled with.","In the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","Black and White Heavens, the most complete and powerful.","We won’t talk about the White Heaven for now, as the headquarters of the Ancient Moon Sect is located there.","The Black Heaven, which can be mentioned in the same breath, certainly wouldn’t be weak.","Moreover, the Blood Robe Sect is a demonic sect.","Stronger than the Ancient Wood Sect, and even more domineering.","Such a superpower was truly not to be trifled with.","If they wanted to destroy Yue Kingdom, they could do it with ease.","Even the Ancient Wood Sect was useless.","Although both the Blood Robe Sect and the Ancient Wood Sect were eight-star sects, the overall strength and background of the Blood Robe Sect were much stronger than that of the Ancient Wood Sect.","If the Ancient Wood Sect could fully control the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Perhaps they would be slightly stronger than the Blood Robe Sect.","But even their own treasures couldn’t be fully controlled, how could they compare to the Blood Robe Sect, which fully controlled the Black Heaven?","“You scoundrel, dare to sneak attack me!”","The redhead youth was the deputy sect master of the Blood Robe Sect.","With such an identity, in the Black Heaven, no matter who it was, they had to obediently come to him and let him play around as he pleased.","But now, someone dared to step forward and sneak attack him.","He couldn’t help but want to take action.","However, Patriarch Xue Dao grabbed his raised arm and said in a low voice, “Let’s talk outside. Don’t forget where we are, and who owns this place!”"]},{"number":5748,"title":"Chapter 5748 Big Shot","paragraphs":["5748 Big Shot","....","Although the Blood Robe Sect was formidable, the proverb “a powerful dragon cannot crush a local snake” held true, and the underworld understood this principle even better.","Engaging now would surely result in a disadvantage.","Just moments ago, he couldn’t fathom how Jian Wushuang managed to conceal his aura and still dared to ambush him.","Just as they were about to depart, a formidable figure from the Daughter Kingdom descended.","A Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation.","His countenance appeared to be in his late twenties or early thirties, yet he exuded an unusual charm.","“Esteemed guests, this is a crucial territory of our nation, one must not act rashly without permission, I hope for your understanding!”","“Purple-clad Fairy, your timing is impeccable. This is my first visit to your Daughter Kingdom, so why not lead us to pay respects to the monarch?” Patriarch Yanlong swiftly changed the subject.","Leading Jian Wushuang and Jinchen, they headed towards the Purple-clad Fairy.","Before leaving, Jian Wushuang glanced back at the red-haired youth.","His gaze indeed sparked a sense of repulsion within him.","At this moment, Jinchen’s perception of Jian Wushuang underwent some changes. He whispered, “Thank you for earlier.”","“What’s there to thank me for? Don’t tell me you think that guy took a liking to you!” Jian Wushuang retorted unkindly. “I just thought that guy had some good intentions, taking a liking to me, that’s why I intervened!”","Her tough words caused Jinchen’s recent change in perception to vanish, and she rolled her eyes at Jian Wushuang.","When the Purple-clad Fairy saw it was Patriarch Yanlong, her face lit up with joy.","“Are you Fengchen’s daughter?” the Purple-clad Fairy inquired.","Jinchen was taken aback by the question, then quickly nodded.","Seeing Jinchen, the Purple-clad Fairy was delighted, she stepped forward and grabbed Jinchen’s hand, exchanging pleasantries.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel jealous.","Why wasn’t there a fairy coming to comfort him?","He also needed someone to console him now!","Guided by the Purple-clad Fairy, the three of them broke through the clouds and entered the palace of the Daughter Kingdom.","Looking along the clouds, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but sigh inwardly, “Why do these royal families always like to build their palaces in the clouds!”","Upon entering the imperial palace, Jian Wushuang noticed distinct differences from the palace in Yue Kingdom.","The setting here seemed more attuned to the mundane.","Everywhere were various kinds of flowers, vibrant and colorful.","In the Daughter Kingdom, populated entirely by women, this wasn’t surprising.","What was peculiar was how, despite being all women, they could continue to proliferate.","Jian Wushuang had inquired about it before.","Rumors had it that the celestial maidens of old left behind a spring, drinking from which would induce pregnancy.","And only daughters were born.","Jian Wushuang pondered what would happen if a man were to drink from it.","That mental image...","Jian Wushuang dared not dwell on it.","Upon entering the palace, twisting and turning through several corridors, they arrived at a grand hall.","This seemed to be a side hall.","Many had already taken their seats.","There were thousands of thrones.","The hall bustled with activity, mostly occupied by those of the Tribulation Realm, with a few in the Fifth Tribulation realm.","There were quite a few Universe Masters present as well.","The gathering awaited the discourse of the rulers, each sharing their experiences of successful tribulation crossings.","Even Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation attended in numbers.","Jian Wushuang immediately spotted the burly man sitting at the forefront, his short hair quite contemporary, with streaks of gray at the temples, his beard likewise.","However, his face was extremely resolute.","Similar to the demeanor of Shi Jiu back then, or perhaps Shi Jiu resembled him to some extent.","Shi Xiu!","The Universe Master of Shi Kingdom, who had the most promising chance to enter the Seventh Tribulation in the current era.","He was also a formidable figure contemporary with the Ruler of the Daughter Kingdom.","They had once fought side by side, but never had it crossed their minds that one would surpass the other.","Apart from Shi Xiu, there were also several Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation realm, all of them being outstanding talents of their respective domains.","Their status was even higher than that of those at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","The forces coming to congratulate this time were either Universe Masters or those at the Tribulation realm.","Even the Scattered Tribulation cultivators were powerful beings at the Sixth Tribulation realm or higher.","Jian Wushuang, following Patriarch Yanlong, remained inconspicuous.","As Patriarch Yanlong took his seat, Jian Wushuang and Jincheng could only stand behind the throne.","Ding!","A crisp and melodious sound rang out, attracting the gaze of most people.","Jian Wushuang also followed the sound with his eyes.","Four auras soared into the sky, approaching from outside the hall.","“A big shot!”","Everyone held their breath.","Four figures.","Standing at the forefront was a middle-aged man with a beard, his complexion steady, a jade pendant hanging from his waist. Deep within his profound eyes lay hidden a great depth of scheming.","“Marquis Tie Dan!”","Sent by the Ancient Moon Temple to Ancient Wood Continent, this super powerhouse was not exactly a native of the continent.","But within the Ancient Wood Continent, they wielded immense power and had an unfathomable strength.","Rumors had it that they possessed the power of an Eighth Tribulation expert.","In the Ancient Wood Continent, the only being capable of matching them was Flame God.","The other two with Eighth Tribulation realm, had very little vitality left, making it impossible for them to act properly.","As for the Marquis Tie Dan, he was the Universe Master and not particularly interested in Babidi.","“Marquis!”","“Brother Zhu!”","For a moment, the few remaining Seventh Tribulation experts in the hall greeted each other politely as they stood up.","These Seventh Tribulation experts were either patriarchs of their respective factions or the heads of powerful forces.","However, upon seeing the Marquis Tie Dan, they were exceptionally courteous.","It was because Tie Dan was now the pinnacle Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, whereas they themselves were no longer Universe Masters.","The tribulation crossing process was still lengthy.","Even if they were to fail in crossing the tribulation, they still had a considerable amount of vitality to sustain them for countless ages.","They were poised to outlive many of the old folks like them.","And in the event of a successful tribulation crossing, they would become pioneers of a new era.","That was why many people were extremely courteous to every Seventh Tribulation Universe Master, even the eight-star sects extended their warm hospitality.","In case the tribulation crossing was successful, it would be an enormous stroke of luck.","Marquis Tie Dan glanced around with a smile and calmly remarked, “It seems I’m not too late in arriving!”","He then took a seat directly beside the main position.","Of course, the main seat was reserved for the ruler of the Daughter Kingdom.","Currently, in the Daughter Kingdom, the one welcoming everyone outside is a formidable figure at the Seventh Tribulation, also considered one of the elder ancestors of the Daughter Kingdom.","Although the Daughter Kingdom has invited Eighth Tribulation elders, there are still quite a few at the Seventh Tribulation level.","Even before the establishment of the Ancient Wood Sect, the Daughter Kingdom existed, with a history even longer than that of the Ancient Wood Sect or even the Ancient Moon Sect.","Naturally, there were many Seventh Tribulation experts born in the Daughter Kingdom.","In this era, a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation has emerged, bringing further glory to the Daughter Kingdom spanning several eras.","As various dignitaries continue to arrive, there are few seats left in the great hall.","Jian Wushuang takes the opportunity to record information about these powerful figures, preparing for future escapes.","The strongest among them was Marquis Tie Dan.","His vitality alone surpassed everyone else.","His strength reminds Jian Wushuang of the Qishen Temple.","When the Qishen’s physical body was resurrected, he also witnessed such power.","Perhaps the current Tie Dan is still slightly inferior to the Qishen Temple, but the power is already close.","The strength of the Universe Master is even more intense than what the Tribulation realm gives him.","If the Tribulation realm is a pond, then the Universe Master is an ocean.","A pond will eventually dry up.","But an ocean is endless.","No wonder Qishen was unwilling to settle with just being a Scattered Tribulation cultivator.","Now it all made sense."]},{"number":5749,"title":"Chapter 5749 The Ruler of Daughter Kingdom","paragraphs":["5749 The Ruler of Daughter Kingdom","....","Scattered Tribulations would only lead to their own destruction.","It was better to fight than to live!","Now, he was starting to agree with Qishen’s actions.","Though Qishen’s methods were likely to scheme against him, he still thought Qishen was faultless.","If it were him, he would do the same.","Other than Marquis Tic Dan, who was a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master, there were a few other Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters with extraordinary auras.","However, his body was still full of vitality.","His combat strength was probably not inferior to those Seventh Tribulation experts who had joined the Babidi. For some reason, none of the Seventh Tribulation experts that were released by the Babidi came.","Initially, he had been afraid that they would recognize him.","Unexpectedly, not one of them had appeared.","It seemed they also had their own missions.","His avatar clone had been aboard Babidi’s cosmic ship all along, seemingly inactive on the surface.","However, Babidi had gone through so much trouble to create this monster, Chi Jiuxiao. He definitely had a huge plan.","Regardless of whether it was to reignite the path of cultivation or something else, it would not remain silent. like this.","There must be some major event planned.","The less movement there was, the bigger the plan.","And when the disturbance finally erupted, it would be even greater.","That would be beneficial; the greater the commotion, the more opportunities he would have.","Currently, it seemed that the overall strength of the Ancient Wood Continent was not bad.","But compared to Chi Jiuxiao, they were far behind.","Unless an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master made a move, there was no way to stop Chi Jiuxiao.","Babadi was probably worried about this as well, so he hadn’t made a move all this while, hoping to find an opportunity.","Just as Jian Wushuang was lost in his thoughts, two familiar auras appeared outside the hall. He could hear someone complaining from afar.","“Tsk (sk, what a hassle! The redhead young man snorted disdainfully at the capital of the Daughter Kingdom. He couldn’t believe they were being made to walk in.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang and the others were being escorted.","The arrivals were none other than two members of the Blood Robe Sect who had some minor grievances with Jian Wushuang and his group.","These two individuals were not from the Ancient Wood Continent, striding into the grand hall with an air of arrogance.","Leading the way was the Xue Dao, who looked down his nose at some of the Seventh Tribulation cultivators nearby.","In their eyes, the overall strength of the Ancient Wood Continent was more than enough to rival the Black and White Heavens, the two strongest among the Nine Heavens.","As for the Ten Lands, they were crumbling and withering, hardly worth considering.","The Ancient Wood Continent was already considered relatively well-preserved.","“It’s people from the Blood Robe Sect, they’re really arrogant!”","Some Sixth Tribulation experts whispered to cach other.","It was understandable for external powerhouses to come, but no one had expected it to be people from the Blood Robe Sect.","A demonic sect!","“Ignore them, Zhu Wushi!” The Patriarch Xue Dao walked to the front, nodding only at. Marquis Tie Dan. Marquis Tie Dan was a title.","His real name was Zhu Bujue!","A Universe Master at the peak of the Seventh Tribulation.","Certainly worthy of respect.","But it seemed Patriarch Xue Dao and Marquis Tie Dan were also not on the best terms, as neither said much more than a nod.","The red-haired youth’s eyes narrowed when he saw the towering figure of Marquis Tie Dan.","It reminded him of something terrifying.","The Marquis, who had not yet descended upon the Ancient Wood Continent, was once a member of the Black Heaven.","However, he had entered the Ancient Wood Sect early on and rarely returned to the Black Heaven.","But in his youth, this Marquis was also a renowned prodigy of the Black Heaven.","Ie and the current master of the Blood Robe Sect belonged to the same generation.","They even clashed during the time when the Marquis was a prodigy.","The red-haired youth was a junior master of the Blood Robe Sect, naturally hearing rumors about the Marquis from his father.","So, there was a hint of apprehension and fear in his heart.","“Heh, your timidity is just like your father’s!” Zhu Wushi turned his head to glance at the red-haired youth and casually remarked.","This remark startled the red-haired youth, causing cold sweat to form on his forehead, not daring to utter another word.","Blood Blade Patriarch frowned. When he was still the Universe Master, Marquis Tie Dan was merely an Emperor. According to seniority, he was the elder.","But now, he was intimidating the junior master of the Blood Robe Sect. Regardless, Patriarch Xue Dao had to","step in.","A surge of violent blood qi rose, forming a blood shield that directly blocked Zhu Wushi’s gaze.","Marquis Tic Dan furrowed his brow and remarked, “Still a petty as before!”","Although he was also from the Black Heaven, he couldn’t stand those from the Black Heaven who only bullied the weak without any courage to challenge the strong.","This way, strong individuals wouldn’t emerge.","Seeing the members of the Blood Robe Sect. being put in their place, the onlookers smirked to themselves.","Sadly, this was the internal balance within the Black Heaven.","None of the strong individuals from the Ancient Wood Continent present dared to confront the Blood Robe Sect.","If the Black Heaven couldn’t do it, then the Ancient Wood Continent, would be even less capable.","Fortunately, Marquis Tie Dan didn’t belong to either side.","He wouldn’t lose face no matter how embarrassing the situation became.","Buzz!","Amidst the clamor within the hall, a waft of floral fragrance drifted in, causing everyone to pause in bewilderment.","The scent was peculiar, instantly transporting people into a state of tranquility, enveloping them in a comforting sensation, and clearing their minds.","Accompanying the fragrance, a swirl of white powder descended, swirling around the surroundings, exuding","an imposing aura.","Buzz!","Soon after, a powerful presence filled the air.","The ruler of the Daughter Kingdom had arrived!","A Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation Realm.","The crowd collectively snapped back to attention, turning to look in unison.","Some recognized this ruler, having met her before. Among those present were also some of her acquaintances,","However, they had never seen her as the ruler of the Seventh Tribulation.","Jian Wushuang stood behind the throne, his face partly obscured by it. With only one eye visible, he was nonetheless struck by the sight..","Through that lone eye, he saw a delicate woman clad in a white fairy gown, slowly approaching.","Whether","him.","t was due to the angle or something else, he couldn’t shake the feeling that she was walking toward","Her slender figure, features sculpted as if by the heavens, and skin as soft as jade.","Even with just a glance, her beauty was already breathtaking for Jian Wushuang.","Yet it was her damned aura that had everyone in the room under its tight grip.","That aura stirred within them a desire to be conquered.","Seeing her gentle gaze, he felt an urge to pull her into his embrace.","Something’s not right!","Jian Wushuang shook his head desperately, his eyes clearing as be realized that the princess of the Daughter","Kingdom was indeed heading towards him.","“How is this possible?” Jian Wushuang was both surprised and delighted.","Ile was surprised at why the other party would pay attention to him, a mere nobody.","As for the delight, he couldn’t quite express it. Perhaps it was a fleeting infatuation, suddenly stirring mundane emotions within him for some inexplicable reason.","He couldn’t harbor any ill will towards this princess of the Daughter Kingdom, only a full sense of goodwill.","Floating along with her aura, the princess of the Daughter Kingdom drifted towards him.","She stunned everyone. Many were puzzled as to why this princess would approach the Patriarch Yanlong’s side.","After all, the strength of Patriarch Yanlong was not particularly outstanding in this hall, and his background","was only average.","Everyone was very surprised!"]},{"number":5750,"title":"Chapter 5750 The Gentle Ruler","paragraphs":["5750 The Gentle Ruler","However, Patriarch Yanlong was not surprised; he was not swayed by that charming tenderness, his gaze holding a hint of respect amidst its kindness.","But in his mind, he recalled the era of yore.","The current Empress Fengchen, back when she just stepped into Immortality, had undergone little change from then till now.","They were all in the Tribulation Realm.","When he first met this ruler, she was still a little girl.","The second time they met, Empress Fengchen and she had become inseparable friends.","The last time they met, she tearfully begged him.","Seeing her again now,","Merited respectful treatment.","“Your Majesty!” Patriarch Yanlong rose and paid his respects.","Jian Wushuang and Jincheng behind him also bowed in respect.","Jian Wushuang secretly rejoiced in his heart, still awaiting the summon of this ruler.","But when the ruler approached, she calmly asked, “Uncle Yanlong, who is this beside you?”","Her gaze softened, feeling a touch of emotion upon seeing that figure, her eyes becoming even more beautiful as they fixed on the figure behind Patriarch Yanlong.","Many were astonished; they hadn’t expected this inconspicuous Patriarch Yanlong to be able to converse with the newly ascended ruler of the Daughter Kingdom.","If it had been mere courtesy, it would have been one thing.","But now, barely appearing and leaving even the Marquis Tie Dan aside to converse with a Sixth Tribulation powerhouse.","It made many envious.","Marquis Tic Dan didn’t mind; he was unaffected by any influence, still scated calmly upon the throne.","Beside him, Patriarch Kuc Dao didn’t lose his composure either.","But the red-haired youth behind him stared wide-eyed, saliva almost dribbling from his mouth.","Thankfully, Patriarch Xue Dao privately reminded him, saving him from embarrassment.","Otherwise, when everyone realized later and saw this scene, they might have thought that the people of the Blood Robe Sect had never seen a woman before!","Back to Patriarch Yanlong’s side.","After hearing that sentence, Jian Wushuang’s mind became muddled, thinking it was about himself. As thoughts of that sweet voice came to mind, a joy surged in his heart, ready to stand up straight and introduce himself.","Unexpectedly, at that moment, the ruler of the country stepped forward directly, grabbing the hand held by Jinchen, and gently remarked. “So much like Fengchen!”","...Jian Wushuang’s mind churned incessantly, but under the guidance of his Dao Heart, he gradually returned to normal.","It was only then that he recalled the matter between Empress Fengchen and the ruler of the Daughter Kingdom, and everything became clear.","Exhaling sharply, Jian Wushuang berated himself inwardly for his incompetence.","His Dao Heart once again became cold.","Jinchen was startled, not understanding what was happening.","Yet, when his hands touched the ruler of the country, he felt a warmth in his heart.","An innate fondness.","Yanlong Ancestor, standing to the side, felt awkward, then glanced at Jian Wushuang with a hint of sadness in his eyes.","“How is your mother?” the ruler of the Daughter Kingdom asked softly.","Jinchen obediently replied, ‘Everything is fine, she’s just in seclusion this time and couldn’t make it!”","‘She’s still as strong-willed as ever!”","The statement carried a hint of ambiguity.","Jian Wushuang suppressed a laugh beside them.","Perhaps only he and Yanlong knew the truth behind the words.","“Oh, right, this is a gift my mother entrusted me to give to Your Majesty!” Jinchen suddenly remembered the scroll, quickly withdrew one hand to retrieve it, and handed it over.","Seeing this, the ruler of the Daughter Kingdom’s expression brightened, carefully accepting the scroll.","This gift was the most precious.","She was also very pleased.","Afterward, they realized that all eyes were on them, with smiles in the corners of their eyes. With an apologetic tone, they said, “Apologies for keeping you waiting! Please stay a bit longer, I have something give to your mother as well,” addressing Jinchen.","Then, they gently patted Jinchen’s small head and floated away.","As they took their seat, their aura shifted from gentle to imposing.","However, the smile on their face remained warm, lacking any intimidation but exuding endless warmth.","Congratulations!","Let the ceremony begin!","Countless gifts were presented, cach allowing a brief conversation with the ruler.","Finally, it was time for speeches.","Jian Wushuang, an emperor himself, listened attentively, though much of it was beyond his understanding, he still benefited greatly.","This time, he received more than he had anticipated.","There were even some matters he wished to personally ask the ruler about.","However, given his status, perhaps he could use Jinchen’s identity to engage in conversation with them.","His divine power had now reached 100,000, surpassing even the ancient transformation under normal circumstances.","Currently, he urgently needed to merge his divine power with the Eternal Ancient Transformation. The power of the Starry Sky would no longer just amplify the Origin Source, but also amplify divine power.","In this way, the Eternal Ancient Transformation would become stronger once again.","At that time, his strength would also skyrocket.","But for now, he only had this idea, with no clue how to proceed.","If any sovereign could offer him some guidance, perhaps he could find a breakthrough.","With a base strength of 400,000-fold divine power, Jian Wushuang could push his Beast God power to its limit, reaching 500,000-fold divine power.","Even with his current usage of the Eternal Ancient Transformation, reaching such combat prowess was","difficult.","But if he could connect to divine power, the two would mutually enhance each other.","His strength would likely rival that of someone in the Fifth Tribulation, making him more than capable of facing someone like Dylan from before.","Conflict was inevitable during the Sacred Assembly.","As an Emperor, his role would be marginal at best.","Unable to directly ascend to the position of Universe Master, he had to seek secret methods to increase his","power.","The celebrations lasted for days.","Some factions with good relations to the Daughter Kingdom lingered, reluctant to leave, wanting to pay their respects to the ruler separately.","Jian Wushuang and the others naturally stayed back as well.","‘Grand Patriarch, could you tell us about the past between the monarch and the late Empress?” Jinchen pulled Patriarch Yanlong aside, eager to hear about the history between his mother and the monarch.","Patriarch Yanlong’s expression shifted, uncertain how to respond.","Empress Fengchen had never disclosed this matter to her daughter, clearly intending to keep Jinchen in the","dark","Yet this time, she wanted Jinchen to form a bond with this superlative figure.","The plan was well thought out.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel a pang of emotion.","The circumstances of Yue Kingdom forced such choices.","Patriarch Yanlong had once been against the match, yet here he was, swallowing his pride.","In the face of absolute strength, everything could be set aside.","The Empress had sacrificed her feelings for power in the past.","Now, for the sake of Yue Kingdom, she was sacrificing her dignity once again.","They shouldn’t have had any further ties.","Though Patriarch Yanlong couldn’t bear it on the surface, inwardly, he was pleased.","If Yue Kingdom could align itself with the Daughter Kingdom, it would find much-needed stability in the","future.","It would be a powerful and reliable ally.","The three were accommodated in a secluded villa by the Daughter Kingdom. The layout of the courtyard was","ordinary yet cozy.","There stood a peach tree in full blossom and a well.","Next to the tree was a small pavilion.","The trio sat within it, Jian Wushuang brewing tea in the middle.","He wasn’t curious about such matters.","Patriarch Yanlong would definitely not divulge such information, so he didn’t bother asking."]},{"number":5751,"title":"Chapter 5751: Opportunity","paragraphs":["Chapter 5751: Opportunity","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He waited quietly for the arrival of the Daughter Kingdom’s ruler.","This time, he didn’t see Fan Tianfeng among the group from the Shi Kingdom, so he figured she hadn’t come.","It was a bit disappointing.","Looks like he could only hope not to encounter her in the Shi Kingdom!","That’s what Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","Originally, according to his plan, he was ready to leave now.","But the relationship between the Empress and the Yue Kingdom seemed more unusual than he had imagined.","So he waited a little longer.","He had thought that the Empress would surely have a discussion with the strong figures of those major powers first, but to his surprise, they had just entered the small courtyard and barely brewed a pot of tea when she arrived.","The ruler of the Daughter Kingdom.","From the congratulations, Jian Wushuang also learned her real name.","Yun Zhi!","The Daughter Kingdom had no royal family.","Anyone could become the ruler.","If there were a royal family, then everyone would be an ancestor.","In the Daughter Kingdom, everyone believed themselves to be descendants of the Celestial Maiden who opened the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","It’s just that the outside world doesn’t acknowledge it.","If they did, wouldn’t the Ancient Moon Spacetime belong to the Daughter Kingdom?","The Ancient Moon Sect wouldn’t agree.","They always vehemently denied it.","Strength was still needed to speak.","If the Daughter Kingdom produced a Ninth Tribulation expert.","Or if there were several Universe Masters at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Even the sect would have no choice.","They could only admit it.","Yun Zhi, unchanged as ever, pushed open the wooden door and casually walked in like this.","Yanlong quickly got up and respectfully greeted her.","As the lord of the Daughter Kingdom, she came alone, without any airs.","“Uncle Yanlong, please don’t be polite; there are no outsiders here!” With that said, she looked at Jincheng.","Jian Wushuang, seeing this, quickly served tea and poured water.","Yun Zhi casually sat beside Jincheng, initially making him a bit uneasy. However, as they chatted, he loosened up and inquired about the past between Yun Zhi, the ruler of Yun Zhi Kingdom, and Empress Fengchen.","Jian Wushuang also listened attentively on the side, expecting the other party not to speak about it.","Unexpectedly, they did.","Yet, they veiled it with a layer of emotion.","Feeling the aura of the Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation up close, Jian Wushuang couldn’t contain the excitement in his heart. However, he still sat obediently on the side without interrupting.","Elder Yanlong felt that the topic was drifting too far, but he couldn’t say anything, so he just pretended to be dead.","“Ruler, why haven’t you had any contact with my mother for so many years since you parted ways?” Jincheng curiously asked. But after asking, she realized that this topic seemed a bit sensitive.","There must be some stories behind it, but Ruler Yun Zhi remained silent.","Upon hearing this, Yun Zhi didn’t get angry either, but instead, her gaze drifted into the distance, remaining silent for a long time.","Seeing this, Jincheng quickly apologized, blaming herself for speaking out of turn.","“It’s not your fault!” Yun Zhi shook her head, then took the initiative to change the subject, saying, “In the future, you don’t need to address me as Ruler or Queen; just call me Aunt Yun from now on!”","Jincheng was very happy to hear this and immediately called her that a few times.","Jian Wushuang had been serving tea and pouring water for quite some time, but he noticed that they still hadn’t paid attention to him. Feeling a bit anxious, he didn’t have any topic to divert to and could only wait patiently!","At this moment, Yun Zhi’s gaze shifted and noticed the karmic entanglement between Jian Wushuang and Jincheng. She then asked, “This person must be your husband, right?”","“I forgot to introduce him; he’s Jian Wushuang, my newlywed husband!” Jincheng cheerfully replied.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang once again offered tea.","Yun Zhi looked Jian Wushuang up and down, then spoke, “Talented and strong, Fengchen’s judgment is indeed accurate.”","“Your Majesty overpraises. It’s also fortunate for me to catch the Empress’s attention,” Jian Wushuang replied respectfully, finally impressing Yun Zhi.","Yun Zhi chuckled and shook her head, “No, your strength is truly remarkable.”","What began as mere courtesy turned into persistent insistence from Yun Zhi.","Jian Wushuang’s expression shifted as he realized Yun Zhi had seen through his strength of 400,000-fold divine power, no matter how much he concealed it.","“Luck, just luck!” Jian Wushuang quickly replied modestly.","Yun Zhi didn’t press further upon hearing this.","Seizing the opportunity, Jian Wushuang voiced his doubts and earnestly sought answers.","This scene pleased Patriarch Yanlong, seeing Jian Wushuang seeking assistance.","Unfortunately, Jinchen, this little girl, didn’t understand. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have wasted so much time.","Something useful should be said.","Not just for Yueguo, but for oneself too, one must strive!","See how Jian Wushuang stepped forward to seek answers for himself.","Jian Wushuang directly voiced his doubts, hoping for Yun Zhi’s explanation.","This is the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, the Divine Power Origin Source, on par with Qishen.","Such a big shot, he wouldn’t have had the chance to interact with under normal circumstances, yet now he could get free guidance.","It could be considered a great opportunity.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s doubts, Yun Zhi nodded, calmly asking, “Your divine power and Origin Source have not yet merged. To amplify each other, you need to reach the Tribulation Realm. However, secret methods can compensate for this deficiency. But judging by your current strength, you should have reached the completion-stage of the Emperor level, so there’s no need to waste time delving into such secrets. When you reach the Tribulation Realm, your divine power and Origin Source will merge. By then, you’ll gain amplification even without secret methods!”"]},{"number":5752,"title":"Chapter 5752: Pointing","paragraphs":["Chapter 5752: Pointing","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Whew!”","Jian Wushuang reverted from that form.","Indeed, it had consumed a lot of energy.","But the growth potential was much greater than that of divine power, with a different upper limit.","There was no point in trying to reason with these people, so there was no need to speak.","Just helping him find answers was sufficient.","Different paths lead to different ends; this saying held true.","“The expenditure of energy you just experienced was immense, yet you persist in your pursuit of the fusion of spacetime and divine power. It seems you possess significant opportunities. While combining spacetime and divine power is not impossible, the cost is substantial. Your current integration can be seen as addressing the lingering concerns after entering the Tribulation Realm,” calmly responded Ruler Yun Zhi.","However, Jian Wushuang persisted, stating firmly, “I will not hesitate as long as I can achieve fusion!”","“Courageous!” praised Queen Yun Zhi.","Patriarch Yanlong also looked pleased and encouraged, “Jian Wushuang, with such determination, the future Kingdom of Yue will not shackle you but instead aid you!”","Even at this moment, Patriarch Yanlong didn’t forget to paint a rosy picture for Jian Wushuang.","Jinchen didn’t think much of it at the time, only recognizing that Jian Wushuang was now stronger than her. But after becoming the Universe Master, it would be different.","She still couldn’t let go of her lingering doubts.","“Since you insist, I will tell you a method. Whether it succeeds is uncertain, and you will need a certain item, not particularly precious. I have a good friend in the Shi Kingdom; he should have quite a few of these items. If you’re in a hurry, you can visit him directly. Take this unrefined jade with you; he’ll understand when he sees it,” Ruler Yun Zhi said, then transferred the method of fusing divine power into the jade along with warmth.","Jian Wushuang received the treasure as if it were a priceless gift and hastily accepted it. “Your grace, I will never forget this kindness from the Queen. Whenever you need me in the future, Jian Wushuang will be at your service!”","He meant every word.","The favor of receiving guidance was greater than anything else, akin to that from his parents.","Though it was directed at Jian Wushuang, Yun Zhi smiled at Jinchen. “I don’t need you to serve me, just make sure you treat this girl well!” She glanced back at Jian Wushuang before adding, “Consider it a favor you owe Jinchen!”","She could see that Jian Wushuang and Jinchen had some karmic connection, but they were not destined partners. It seemed more like a formality.","She couldn’t directly inquire about it, hence the change of words.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he agreed readily. Deep down, he suspected that Yun Zhi knew that his relationship with Jinchen was just a facade.","After everyone had resettled, not long after, it seemed Yun Zhi received a message from someone. Frowning, she left first, instructing Jinchen to spend a few days in the Daughter Kingdom and then have a private conversation with her once they were both free.","Seizing the opportunity, Jian Wushuang prepared to depart for the Shi Kingdom.","He would absorb the information contained within the warm jade and prepare for cultivation.","The senior he was going to visit in the Shi Kingdom was a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation. However, he was not from the Shi Kingdom, nor was he one of the powerful beings in the Ancient Wood Continent. He was a wandering cultivator who had settled in the Shi Kingdom.","His intention was to craft a sword, which would serve Jian Wushuang’s purpose as well.","Moreover, he could leverage this senior’s help to find a divine blacksmith or craftsman.","It was truly killing two birds with one stone.","“Senior Yanlong, I’ll take my leave first and head to the Shi Kingdom. You don’t need to wait for me. I’ll be back before the Sacred Assembly arrives!”","“Alright, be careful, and if necessary, you can rely on the background of Yue Kingdom!”","Jinchen was drawn to the Daughter Kingdom, showing no interest in where Jian Wushuang was going.","However, when she heard about the Shi Kingdom, there was something peculiar in her gaze.","Jian Wushuang completely ignored it and left directly through the void.","As he departed, two others also left the Daughter Kingdom from the palace above the capital city.","These two individuals were from the Blood Robe Sect. Originally, they were trying to persuade the ruler of the Daughter Kingdom to cooperate with the Blood Robe Sect to explore a cosmic secret realm.","Unexpectedly, they were flatly rejected.","That secret realm could only be explored by a Universe Master.","There were only a few Universe Masters in the Seventh Tribulation.","And each of them had their own agenda, and they were the future of the major sects and powers.","They rarely cooperated with the outside world.","Even if they did, the Blood Robe Sect was wary.","So they set their sights on Queen Yun Zhi.","A newly appointed Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation would be easier to control.","But they were directly rejected.","Patriarch Xue Dao was quite angry.","“Hmph, such arrogance from a newly appointed Seventh Tribulation Universe Master! She will regret it in the future!”","The red-haired youth couldn’t bring himself to hate. He was deeply infatuated with the Ruler Yun Zhi.","Seeing him like this, Patriarch Xue Dao felt like killing him.","“Hmm?”","A breath passed by, and Patriarch Xue Dao became intrigued.","“It’s someone from Yue Kingdom. They’re lucky, actually knowing the Daughter Kingdom’s ruler!” Patriarch Xue Dao felt a twinge of jealousy.","Hearing about Yue Country, the red-haired youth’s gaze turned fierce.","“Elder Xue Dao, why don’t we go slaughter them and snatch that little lady away!”","A sinister fire rose in his belly, he dared not involve himself with Queen Yun Zhi.","But capturing a princess from Yue Kingdom wasn’t a piece of cake either.","Even if they took her, Yue Kingdom wouldn’t dare to pursue.","Patriarch Xue Dao was also heated up, what started as a mere outburst now seemed like a feasible plan.","After all, they weren’t from the Ancient Wood Continent.","“No, only one aura left, the little miss you’re thinking about, she probably hasn’t left!” Patriarch Xue Dao shook his head.","The red-haired youth felt disappointed, saying, “Forget it then, an old bone, I don’t want to gnaw on!”","“Tsk tsk, it’s not that old man Yanlong. It’s an Emperor, the one who targeted you, seems to be called Jian Wushuang, quite formidable!” Patriarch Xue Dao sneered.","Hearing it was Jian Wushuang, the red-haired youth’s interest was piqued again, saying, “Killing him works too, the Origin Source of a prodigy Emperor is quite delicious!”","“Chase after them!”","Patriarch Xue Dao’s aura enveloped the red-haired youth, darting into the void, beginning to track Jian Wushuang.","It wasn’t wise to make a move here.","It’s better to leave the Daughter Kingdom.","As Jian Wushuang flew through the void, he was unaware that he had been targeted.","And it wasn’t just one group.","There was another pair of eyes watching him.","The owner of these eyes, he knew.","And could be said to be very familiar with.","A pair of eyes like copper bells, a slim figure, and emerald green skin.","If not Barb Emperor, who else could it be?","At this moment, the cosmic ship, seemingly amidst chaotic time and space, had quietly arrived at the Daughter Kingdom.","Ruler Yun Zhi becoming the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation was quite sensational.","Much more than the Holy Assembly.","The Holy Assembly had some attraction to those below the Sixth Tribulation.","But to those above the Sixth Tribulation, it held no appeal whatsoever."]},{"number":5753,"title":"Chapter 5753: A Flower Withers, a Flower Blooms","paragraphs":["Chapter 5753: A Flower Withers, a Flower Blooms","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When the Sacred Assembly opened, the Wanliu Divine Tree also opened up, allowing people to visit and practice under its canopy.","It could also attract some powerful individuals.","Under the Wanliu Tree, one could absorb vitality.","It was considered a good place for cultivation.","It would attract many Seventh Tribulation experts.","As for the Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation, even those at the Sixth level didn’t pay much attention.","Unless the Wanliu Divine Tree was opened.","Otherwise, there wasn’t much worth lingering for on the Ancient Wood Continent.","Most of the time, they would explore the secrets of the Outer Domain.","Or some ancient continent ruins.","Among the Ten Lands, there were many ruins.","The ancient moon ruins that Hu Qing mentioned before were one of them.","The Ancient Moon Continent.","Once among the Ten Lands, it could rival the daytime of the Nine Heavens.","Unfortunately, it had now turned into ash.","And it had countless prohibitions.","Even Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation couldn’t explore it deeply.","The treasures obtained were also few, so fewer and fewer people went there.","The Nine Heavens and Ten Lands were vast.","There were countless secrets.","Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulations and above, as well as those of the Seventh Tribulation, would venture into them.","For Scattered Tribulation experts without hope of promotion, they would still go to places with vitality for opportunities.","But it was relatively rare.","There were many Universe Masters in the Outer Domain, and many Tribulation Realms in the Nine Heavens and Ten Earths.","This is also why Jian Wushuang encountered few Universe Masters, most of them were Scattered Tribulation experts.","In the Yongheng Kingdom, the strongest Universe Master he encountered was only at the Fourth Tribulation.","He had never encountered a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation.","If it weren’t for his marriage to the Yue Kingdom, he wouldn’t even have seen a Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation.","At most, he had contact with figures like Wu Li.","This visit to Ruler Yun Zhi, a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation, was also due to Yue Kingdom’s influence.","No wonder Elder Muchen was envious.","Many strong individuals go their whole lives without seeing a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation, let alone conversing with one.","Flying through the void, it took him two hours to leave the Daughter Kingdom.","It would take three days to reach the Shi Kingdom.","That was already considered fast.","He had no more secrets now, unleashing all his 400,000-fold divine power.","Patriarch Xue Dao, tracking behind, furrowed his brows.","He hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to truly possess 400,000-fold divine power.","Although, like Queen Yun Zhi, he was also a Seventh Tribulation powerhouse.","Yet, Queen Yun Zhi was a Universe Master.","Their perspectives and perceptual abilities were vastly different.","A Universe Master was expansive, while a Tribulation Realm was contracting.","The universe was like a blooming flower.","The Tribulation Realm was like a withering one.","That was how the world worked.","Where there’s blooming, there’s also withering.","From ancient times to the present.","Throughout the temporal river, there have appeared only three truly eternal superpowerful beings.","Encounters with such beings were exceedingly rare.","Even the Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation rarely glimpsed them.","They were like mythical creatures, seen only in legends.","Jian Wushuang dared not even imagine such distant beings.","The Spacetime Masters, as he fantasized, must belong to that level.","Roaming through the cosmos.","Nowadays, he had already begun to grasp some essence of time.","But the path of time and space remained distant.","Swish!","In the blink of an eye, his figure kept shifting within the void.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang’s main body was momentarily stunned.","He seemed to sense another version of himself.","It was his clone.","As long as they weren’t too far apart, he could sense that presence.","“How could it appear here!” Jian Wushuang was greatly alarmed!","According to his estimation, his clone, following Emperor Babidi, should have left the Ancient Wood Continent.","How did it suddenly appear near him?","At this moment, his main body was within the borders of the ‘Demon Kingdom’ in the Sixteen Kingdoms of Qingchao.","There was still some distance to the Shi Kingdom.","Feeling the aura of his clone, it also meant that Emperor Babidi was nearby.","He hastily suppressed his own aura, concealing all signs of life, then descended to the ground.","In the moment he vanished.","The two Blood Robe Sect disciples chasing behind, their gazes flickered.","Patriarch Xue Dao exclaimed, “It seems like he noticed us?”","His eyes were fixed on Jian Wushuang’s location.","Although he couldn’t probe at the moment, he had a rough idea of the position.","Hum!","His aura shook, and with the red-haired youth, he instantly arrived at the spot where Jian Wushuang disappeared.","“I can’t sense his aura anymore, how peculiar!” Xue Dao frowned.","The red-haired youth was also surprised, saying, “For an Emperor to conceal his own aura to this extent, it’s quite remarkable.”","In front of a Seventh Tribulation Realm expert, it was nearly impossible to conceal one’s presence without being detected.","Perhaps only a Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation could achieve such a feat.","So, the red-haired youth was greatly astonished!","He didn’t even have confidence that he could conceal himself from a Seventh Tribulation expert without being discovered.","If an Emperor could do it, it not only surprised him but also made him envious.","Merely being able to hide wasn’t enough.","This place was only so big.","A Seventh Tribulation expert could destroy it in an instant.","There was no escaping.","Being able to conceal oneself from powerful Seventh Tribulation individuals.","But his strength was not at the Seventh Tribulation!","Being found out would lead to death all the same.","But they didn’t know, Jian Wushuang wasn’t hiding from these two at all.","Instead, he was evading the terrifying Babidi.","Concealed as a strand of chaotic flow, Jian Wushuang surged forward along the wind’s direction.","He had long since left his original position.","Now completely concealed, he couldn’t be extensively investigated.","He still didn’t know he was being pursued by two parties simultaneously.","His greatest concern now was Babidi.","If his true body fell into Babidi’s hands, it would be over.","On the other side, Patriach Xue Dao was unaware that a super existence had passed through this place.","Standing in the void with one hand behind his back, he angrily shouted, “Humph, did you really think you could hide your presence from me? I know you’re here!”","This angry shout caused the entire Demon Kingdom to tremble.","The strong of the Demon Kingdom appeared one after another.","But no one dared to investigate.","“Patriarch, is it a Seventh Tribulation expert?”","Among the kings of the Demon Kingdom, a group of Tribulation Realm experts awaited the Patriarch’s command.","Facing the sudden appearance of a strong opponent, they were also very flustered.","“Don’t panic, it shouldn’t be targeting our Demon Kingdom. Just pretend we didn’t see anything!”","The Patriarch chose to remain silent.","He himself was also a Seventh Tribulation expert, but there was too little vitality in his body now, and the cost of making a move was too high.","As long as any unfamiliar strong didn’t threaten the capital, he wouldn’t take action.","As for the Universe Masters of the Demon Kingdom, there were only a few, and the strongest were only at the Fourth Tribulation, not even comparable to the Yue Kingdom.","It was a low period.","They were simply not qualified to offend a Seventh Tribulation expert who still had a lot of vitality.","Patriarch Xue Dao also completely disregarded the Demon Kingdom.","If they dared to come, he would not hesitate to kill a fellow Tribulation Realm expert.","A Seventh Tribulation expert clinging to life posed less threat than a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation.","Inside the cosmic boat.","Babidi and Dylan were both in the control room, and at this moment, they were in the Demon Kingdom.","Their target, however, was not this place, but the Daughter Kingdom.","That angry shout just now had alerted this terrifying presence."]},{"number":5754,"title":"Chapter 5754: Mistake","paragraphs":["Chapter 5754: Mistake","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Babidi had encountered many things in his life, but never before had he encountered someone so fearless.","“Keke, to actually be able to discover the cosmic ship, his strength is impressive!” Babidi exclaimed as he shook the strange vessel in his hand.","At that moment, he thought Patriarch Xue Dao was referring to the cosmic ship.","It wasn’t surprising that he misunderstood. The cosmic ship, though still deep within the void, could be seen by any Universe Master of Fifth Tribulation or higher with just a casual observation.","So, it was normal for Patriarch Xue Dao, at the seventh Tribulation Realm, to have noticed it.","It hadn’t been long since Patriarch Xue Dao failed his tribulation.","His vitality was still abundant.","Far from reaching the point where he needed to slumber.","His combat power was on par with that Seventh Tribulation expert from the Ancient Wood Sect.","Dylan stood behind Babidi, his eyes filled with killing intent as he observed Patriarch Xue Dao in the crystal ball. “Ignorant fool!”","Dylan, now strengthened again by Babidi, was terrifyingly powerful.","Even facing Patriarch Xue Dao, this peak Seventh Tribulation expert, he had a chance of winning.","Now, Babidi had created the rudimentary pathway, dedicated to the cultivation of Scattered Tribulation experts.","Dylan was the first.","Apart from Chi Jiuxiao and Hun Tian, Dylan was Babidi’s strongest warlord.","With his greatly enhanced strength, Dylan was eager to showcase his power.","Patriarch Xue Dao before him now seemed like a suitable opponent. So, he earnestly requested, “Respected Lord Babidi, please let me battle that man. Just give me the time it takes for an incense stick to burn, and I will slay him!”","“Heh, you’re quite confident in your strength!” Babidi sneered coldly, then nodded. With a flick of his finger, he drew a circle around Dylan’s feet, and Dylan disappeared from the control room.","Whoosh!","In the void, the cosmic ship came to a halt.","Emperor Hun Tian and the others sensed a surge of energy rising and emerged from the secret chamber. Jian Wushuang’s clone was no exception.","Through the huge floor-to-ceiling windows, they could see the void outside.","Jian Wushuang was taken aback when he saw the people outside.","“It’s him!” Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief when he saw the other person’s face. It seemed that Babidi wasn’t targeting him.","However, he didn’t expect Babidi to suddenly appear here.","It should be related to the Daughter Kingdom, because Babidi shouldn’t make such a big fuss over a Seventh Tribulation powerhouse now.","The strength of Chi Jiuxiao could definitely rank in the top three across the entire Ancient Wood Continent.","A Half-Step Ninth Tribulation expert.","Even if he encountered the peak Eighth Tribulation Universe Master, he wouldn’t be afraid.","Even within the right Universe Dao Arena, he would have the power to fight.","With such a powerful helper, Babidi shouldn’t bother with these petty thieves.","What could someone like Xue Dao do? Babidi could even wipe out the entire Black Heaven.","And now Babidi actually sent Dylan to fight!","Many people were puzzled.","They were aware of Dylan’s strength, at most Seventh Tribulation.","It’s likely to face many opponents.","But when they sensed the surging energy, they all understood.","Babidi’s technique had already been created.","Because Babidi’s strength was continuously rising.","But there was no vitality within him...","This already indicated the problem.","“Babidi, my lord!” Emperor Hun Tian looked towards the core cabin.","Now, they no longer felt lost; instead, they saw endless possibilities in their future.","Once they obtained this method, they would rise again.","Especially Emperor Hun Tian.","He already possessed the strength of the Eighth Tribulation, and once he obtained the method to continue cultivation, he could easily step into it.","Even an average strength in the Eighth Tribulation would be much stronger than before.","And they could continue to grow stronger.","At this moment, they all felt joy in their hearts.","They had made the right choice.","Aligning with Babidi was indeed correct.","They were the first group of powerful individuals to join Babidi, and they would be heavily nurtured in the future.","This method would enable them all to have the possibility of entering the Eighth Tribulation realm.","One Dylan now possessed the top power of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Hum!","In the outer void.","Dylan was dressed oddly, similar to Babidi’s style, with blue skin behind him, partially grown antennae on his forehead, and pointed ears.","His appearance made Patriarch Xue Dao’s gaze change.","Seventh Tribulation!","But when he looked at Dylan now, he could only see Dylan’s ordinary Seventh Tribulation realm strength.","Although he was somewhat surprised, he remained calm, thinking Dylan was a strongman from the Demon Kingdom.","“Humph, are you a strongman from the Demon Kingdom?” Patriarch Xue Dao looked down on Dylan, not taking him seriously.","The red-haired youth also arrogantly raised his head.","An ordinary Seventh Tribulation. There was indeed nothing to fear.","Dylan watched the two of them, but there was no change in his expression.","Seeing Dylan’s lack of response, Patriarch Xue Dao furrowed his brow, then turned to the red-haired youth and chuckled, “Looks like he’s a fool!”","“Haha!” The red-haired youth laughed arrogantly.","Buzz!","Patriarch Xue Dao drew out his blood blade, his figure continuously rising. With his left hand, he casually condensed a wave of million-fold divine power and threw it towards the continent below.","“If you want to stop me, you can act at any time!” Patriarch Xue Dao said indifferently.","With his peak power in the Seventh Tribulation Realm, apart from a few Universe Masters and the Flame Spirit in the Ancient Wood Continent, he feared no one.","Even the Divine Wood King didn’t intimidate him.","Dylan clenched his fists, ignoring the arrogant Patriarch Xue Dao, and began to unleash the power of Death within him.","The power of Death surged madly, and his divine power kept erupting.","“Hmm?” Patriarch Xue Dao was stunned.","He could clearly see Dylan’s strength, he was not a Universe Master despite being in the Seventh Tribulation.","According to reason, no matter how much vitality one had inside, it shouldn’t be possible to erupt again.","How was the other party continuously growing stronger?","Just like a Universe Master.","“It’s impossible!”","However, Dylan paid no attention, and his divine power surged from 1 million-fold directly to 1.5 million!","“Phew!” Sensing the surging divine power within him, Dylan felt an endless sensation, driving him almost insane.","Patriarch Xue Dao was completely shocked!","His voice trembled as he said, “1.5 million divine power?”","In the Seventh Tribulation realm, the baseline was always above 1 million divine power.","1.5 million-fold divine power wasn’t considered much.","But Dylan’s burst was extremely consuming of vitality.","Patriarch Xue Dao didn’t dare to play around like this, but he didn’t know that Dylan was now completely relying on the power of Death, not vitality.","At this moment, Dylan smirked, extending two fingers and speaking to Patriarch Xue Dao for the first time.","“My peak is 2 million divine power!”","Heavens!","Patriarch Xue Dao was greatly astonished, then he remembered something and sneered, “My peak is still 3 million!”","Clearly, he was somewhat unwilling to believe it. 2 million divine power was the normal divine power of a Universe Master in the Seventh Tribulation realm.","His current divine power could also reach up to 1.8 million, which was considered the top combat power in the Sventh Tribulation.","Back when he was a Universe Master, the norm was over 2 million, and reaching a peak of 3 million was not a problem."]},{"number":5755,"title":"Chapter 5755: Super Dylan","paragraphs":["Chapter 5755: Super Dylan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, at the Seventh Tribulation realm, without the blessing of the universe, reaching 2 million divine power was still somewhat difficult.","If it were during the collapse of the universe, it would be different.","Now, he couldn’t even do it himself, so naturally, he didn’t believe Dylan could do it either.","He regarded Dylan as a strongman of the Demon Kingdom, somewhat disdainful.","Even though Dylan had erupted with a divine power of 1.5 million.","“To deal with Scattered Tribulations like you, 1.5 million is already enough!” Dylan’s words had just fallen when he attacked directly.","His figure involuntarily burst forth, directly transforming into a size of 10,000 feet.","Otherwise, it would not be enough to bear divine power exceeding 1 million unless it was an origin or an extremely special physical body.","Like a Special Life Form.","Patriarch Xue Dao immediately shouted angrily, tossing the red-haired youth into the chaotic flow of time and space, reminding him, “That kid should have escaped. You go chase after him. Leave this person to me!”","“Patriarch, be careful!” The red-haired youth replied indifferently, calmly going to chase after Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s avatar calmly watched this scene.","While his true body appeared at the border of the Demon Kingdom, casually stopping.","He was waiting, waiting for that red-haired youth.","A universe master at the fourth tribulation realm had nothing to fear.","When the time came, he would lead the other party into the Shi Kingdom, away from Babidi, and it wouldn’t be too late to make a move.","He already found the other party unpleasant, so it was a good opportunity to practice.","He hadn’t used his 400,000 divine power yet.","Watching Dylan and Patriarch Xue Dao erupting against each other was extremely exciting.","Jian Wushuang’s true body waited while observing through his avatar.","In the void above.","Bursts of white aura exploded.","Two 10,000-feet figures moved around like ghosts, flashing in all directions.","Jian Wushuang watched the lively scene, but he couldn’t track the landing points of the two men’s every move.","Can only watch the excitement.","Emperor Hun Tian and the others, however, watched with excitement.","“Dylan’s divine power, although not fully unleashed, is supported by the power of Death, making his divine power limitless. In contrast, that top expert of the Seventh Tribulation, his vitality simply cannot sustain such a huge consumption, he will only grow weaker and weaker. Dylan, on the other hand, has adapted to the current divine power and started to suppress the opponent!” Hun Tian explained beside them.","The others nodded frequently.","Jian Wushuang, an Emperor, could understand when spoken to, but couldn’t comprehend what he saw.","He could only see the afterimages left behind after each exchange between the two.","Now, this void was almost entirely filled with afterimages.","Countless, in the hundreds of thousands.","Each afterimage was an image left behind when the two clashed.","Because the speed was too fast, it even affected time, causing their figures to break through the spatial dimensions to another place.","But the shadows remained in their original positions.","Time couldn’t catch up.","The power of 1 million divine power was indeed terrifyingly powerful.","Jian Wushuang was shocked by what he saw.","The current battle was unlike the one in the Eternal Kingdom.","When the Soul Heavenly Emperor made a move back then, when he was accumulating power, Jian Wushuang could see clearly and even sense the terrifying aura of the Eighth Tribulation.","But now it was different, now it was two equally strong experts battling.","The previous time in the Yongheng Kingdom was a one-sided crushing.","“Look, Dylan has unleashed again!”","The crowd’s gaze shifted once more.","Jian Wushuang desperately searched. This time, Dylan stopped his movement, crossed his hands, then raised them towards the sky.","With a loud shout, the surrounding void, countless afterimages, shattered in an instant.","“Hah!” Dylan’s body crackled with electricity, contracting as power surged through him.","2 million units of divine power, all laid bare.","Patriarch Xue Dao gasped for air, his breath ragged. In the brief time they’d been locked in combat, the intensity of their clashes made him feel as though he was pouring out his entire reservoir of divine power.","Such battles had become rare for him since the collapse of his universe.","It was exhilarating, yes, but at the same time, he was astounded by Dylan’s recklessness.","An onslaught without regard for his own life.","He seemed utterly indifferent to his own survival.","From disdain to shock!","Now, Patriarch Xue Dao was beginning to feel a sense of despair.","“You are a Universe Master!” Patriarch Xue Dao, in a panic, struggled to maintain his breath. His chest heaved, and with a sour taste rising in his throat, he coughed up a mouthful of blood.","After Dylan’s complete eruption, he approached Patriarch Xue Dao slowly, paying no heed to the latter’s astonishment, and muttered to himself, “The time of a joss stick is almost up!”","Swish!","Though his pace seemed leisurely, his speed was astonishing. With a single punch, he shattered the blood robe that had coalesced around Patriarch Xue Dao’s body.","Plop!","Patriarch Xue Dao’s pupils contracted as his divine power continued to decline.","From 1.8 million, it dwindled to 1.5 million.","With this mouthful of blood expelled, it dropped to around 1 million.","Before he could react, another fist struck him squarely in the face.","This blow rendered Patriarch Xue Dao completely powerless.","“Die!” Dylan resembled a demonic god in the midst of slaughter, unstoppable and oppressive.","In his hands, a crimson diamond realm materialized, thrusting directly towards Patriarch Xue Dao’s chest.","In that moment, Patriarch Xue Dao exhausted all his aura, desperately attempting to block.","The blood blade was held against his own chest.","Simultaneously, he activated a communication treasure, informing the Blood Robe Sect of the events at this location.","Inside Black Heaven.","The Master of the Blood Robe Sect, the top Seventh Tribulation expert and one of the foremost Universe Masters of the current generation.","He’s also the father of a red-haired youth.","“What? Xue Dao is in mortal danger, and my son is there too!” The Master of the Blood Robe Sect frowned deeply.","The strongest eight-star sect in Black Heaven.","The ruler of the Blood Robe Sect.","The strongest family, the master of the Ye Family.","His eyes flickered at this moment, and the next moment, he used a communication token to inform another super strong individual in the Ancient Wood Continent, someone with whom he had some ties.","The only one who could help him now was that person.","Though somewhat reluctant, as a top elder of the Tribulation Realm and his son were both still in the Ancient Wood Continent!","If Xue Dao died, his son would die too.","The news spread.","Ancient Wood Continent.","Daughter Kingdom.","In a delicate courtyard, a slender middle-aged man saw the contents of the token and his eyes twitched.","“Ye Lingyun, you’re also asking for my help?” Marquis Tie Dao revealed an imperceptible smirk.","Back then, the two of them fought fiercely, with him constantly pummeling the young master of the Ye Family, the top family of the Black Heaven.","It was because of this incident that he was marginalized by the strongest family in Black Heaven and had to come to the Ancient Wood Continent.","Although he joined the Ancient Moon Sect and wasn’t afraid of trouble.","But Black Heaven was completely controlled by the Ye Family, and even the Ancient Moon Temple couldn’t do anything about it.","So he volunteered to come to the Ancient Wood Continent.","Ye Lingyun!","He didn’t consider the other party as an opponent.","But the other party always regarded him as one.","He never expected that this time, they would seek his help.","“I’ll be out for a while. Wait here. If any of the rulers of kingdoms come, tell them I have some business and need to leave for a few days!” Marquis Tie Dan instructed, then tore through the void and left the Daughter Kingdom directly.","It was almost as if he instantly arrived in the void of the Demon Kingdom.","Swish!","Huh?","“Not good!”","Hun Tian and others reacted the fastest.","But they were inside the cosmic boat and couldn’t directly go out.","At this moment, Babidi also noticed the newcomer, pointed his finger, and directly took Hun TIan and others out of the cosmic boat."]},{"number":5756,"title":"Chapter 5756: Marquis to the Rescue","paragraphs":["Chapter 5756: Marquis to the Rescue","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Without needing any command, Hun Tian took the lead and directly intercepted Marquis Tie Dan.","Seeing the many powerful beings suddenly rushing in, Marquis Tie Dan exclaimed, “What a lively scene!”","“Brother Zhu, are you well?” Hun Tian’s voice was cold, far from a friendly greeting.","It sounded more like a provocation.","He had long been displeased with Marquis Tie Dan.","Now, with the assistance of Babidi’s power, he could finally kill his adversary.","He was well aware of Marquis Tie Dan’s strength, being at the peak of the Seventh Tribulation or even a Universe Master.","Compared to his current power, there wasn’t much of a difference.","Relying solely on his current strength, he lacked the confidence to kill his opponent.","But don’t forget, within the cosmic ship, there was a super existence.","“Chi Jiuxiao!”","If Chi Jiuxiao was willing to take action, a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation wouldn’t count for much.","It all depended on what Babidi would do.","As long as Babidi nodded, Chi Jiuxiao would definitely take action.","Accompanied by Jian Wushuang, he tried to keep himself at the back of the crowd, restraining his aura, not daring to show himself.","He wondered if Marquis Tie Dan would notice him.","But Patriarch Xue Dao knew him.","If he were recognized, it would be troublesome.","Fortunately, Dylan had just made a ruthless move, leaving Patriarch Xue Dao barely clinging to life, so he probably wouldn’t bother with him anymore.","On the other side, the unsuspecting red-haired youth continued his pursuit.","By now, both individuals had entered the territory of the Shi Kingdom.","It was also the moment for him to make his move.","As for the battlefield above the Demon Kingdom, he could sense that Babidi had no intention of recklessly killing on sight, especially when it came to the Universe Master.","Emperor Babidi seemed disinterested, particularly considering that Marquis Tie Dan was a formidable figure of the Ancient Moon Sect. Killing him would stir up trouble beyond measure.","Though Babidi and Chi Jiuxiao were not afraid, causing unnecessary trouble by stirring things up now wasn’t ideal.","His plan remained the top priority.","So, upon seeing the other party’s arrival, he immediately charged forward.","Even if Xue Dao wouldn’t die, he would still take him away eventually.","It was just a matter of time.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t want any part of this.","It would be best to kill them both and leave quickly.","He didn’t want to be recognized.","Babidi confronted Marquis Tie Dan with his men.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang, along with the red-haired youth, darted into a treacherous area within the Shi Kingdom, much like walking a dog.","This place was known as Fallen Phoenix Valley.","Legend had it that a primordial true spirit being had fallen here.","That being was a naturally born Universe Master, immensely powerful, even more so than the nine great Beast Gods of the Moro Spacetime.","Each of them was at the Seventh Tribulation.","But regardless of how powerful these primordial spirits were, they all eventually fell into the hands of stronger individuals.","For the human race, that stronger individual was the Patriarch of the Shi Kingdom.","During his peak, slaying such primordial spirits was relatively simple.","When a primordial spirit being fell, their physical body and the essence of their divine power would merge into the valley where they fell.","The Fallen Phoenix Valley came into existence from then on.","After countless epochs of exploration, there were hardly any secrets left here.","Not to mention the Universe Master, even Emperors rarely ventured here.","It was simply vast.","This attracted many to come and test their luck.","Jian Wushuang chose this place to conceal himself.","The forbidding law rules here couldn’t stop his steps.","He recklessly surged forward, shattering the space around him.","The red-haired youth chased from behind, watching Jian Wushuang as he maneuvered through perilous terrain, thinking he had reached a dead end, unaware that this was to be his final resting place.","“Kid, there’s no escaping. If you stop now, I might consider taking you in as my pet!”","The red-haired youth laughed arrogantly, as if he were hunting, effortlessly pursuing Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang, flying ahead, glanced back, feeling he had reached the limit.","He had already reached the deepest part of Fallen Phoenix Valley.","The red-haired youth chased from behind, watching Jian Wushuang as he maneuvered through perilous terrain, thinking he had reached a dead end, unaware that this was to be his final resting place.","“Kid, there’s no escaping. If you stop now, I might consider taking you in as my pet!” The red-haired youth laughed arrogantly, as if he were hunting, effortlessly pursuing Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang, flying ahead, glanced back, feeling he had reached the limit.","He had already reached the deepest part of Falling Phoenix Cliff.","Even peak experts couldn’t enter this place.","In the past, there had been Tribulation Realm experts who came here, as well as some weaker Universe Masters.","But not anymore.","And he wasn’t afraid of being seen by outsiders.","Swish!","Jian Wushuang bent his legs, abruptly halting his movement, then slowly straightened up, not turning around immediately. In the blink of an eye, the red-haired youth caught up.","Facing away from his pursuer.","His hand kept trembling, ready to draw his sword at any moment.","This battle would reveal their true strength.","“No place left to run!” The red-haired youth raised his head arrogantly, his face ice-cold.","Clang!","Crack!","Click!","A series of sounds rang out simultaneously. Jian Wushuang drew his sword in an instant, his toes lightly tapping the ground as his body leaned back, the Jueyun Sword already in his hand.","His divine power surged to four hundred thousand in an instant.","It all happened so quickly. Jian Wushuang utilized the true essence of time, causing time to momentarily stop in Falling Phoenix Cliff.","The Universe Master at the Fourth Tribulation, the deputy sect master of the Blood Robe Sect, couldn’t react in time. By the time he wanted to draw his sword to defend, his gaze had already started to drift away.","His physical body shattered in an instant.","A burst of blood mist erupted, leaving him completely stunned.","The blood mist reconstructed his body, a pinnacle secret technique of the Blood Robe Sect.","However, he hadn’t expected that today, facing an Emperor, he would immediately resort to using the blood mist—a technique typically reserved for life-threatening situations.","“You!” The red-haired youth, having reformed his body, pointed at Jian Wushuang, still gazing at his broad back.","“What sword did you just use?”","The red-haired youth was dumbfounded!","He couldn’t believe Jian Wushuang could be so powerful.","He had encountered the strongest Emperors of the Black Sky, who could rival the Universe Masters in general.","Their divine power peaked at 250,000.","But Jian Wushuang exceeded 400,000.","In that momentary eruption just now, he surpassed 500,000.","It was simply unbelievable.","He was even more powerful than some great divine officials.","Swish!","Clang!","Jian Wushuang shook his arm, wielding the decisive cloud with ease.","Glancing sideways, he said coldly, “Just an ordinary Eternal Treasure!”","The red-haired youth couldn’t believe it; he felt Jian Wushuang was trying to deceive him. He kept his gaze firmly fixed on the Jueyun Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","But the sword seemed nothing special. Clearly, the other party didn’t recognize the vitality within the Wanliu Willow Forest, so they hadn’t noticed anything.","As he scrutinized the armor on Jian Wushuang’s body, he froze. “Innate Origin Source! You actually possess a Universe Treasure of Innate Origin Source!” The red-haired youth seemed to grasp why Jian Wushuang was so powerful.","Jian Wushuang, however, scoffed, shaking his head in response. “Is this all the insight a Lesser Sect Master of an eight-star sect possesses?”","To him, it was merely a Beast God Weapon; nothing to fuss over.","There used to be many treasures like this in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, but with the passage of time, very few remain intact.","Locations like the Fallen Phoenix Valley here were where primordial beings had perished, wasting both their physical bodies and their origins.","Otherwise, it would have been a treasure even more potent than a Beast God Weapon.","“Hmph, lucky arrogant brat!” The red-haired youth abandoned his worry and panic, appearing even more composed now.","Jian Wushuang also began to feel uneasy."]},{"number":5757,"title":"Chapter 5757: Black Heaven, Ye Clan’s “Ye Yunxiao”","paragraphs":["Chapter 5757: Black Heaven, Ye Clan’s “Ye Yunxiao”","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The young master of an eight-star sect shouldn’t be so useless.","Even a Universe Master at the Fourth Tribulation might have some kind of backup plan that could unleash great power.","It was definitely not as ordinary as before.","“Remember, I am Ye Yunxiao of the Black Heaven’s Ye Clan!” After the red-haired youth finished speaking, he wrapped his arms around each other, and the red meridians on his forehead instantly throbbed.","The surrounding divine power aura also became strange.","It was actually gathering on Ye Yunxiao’s body.","A Universe Master at the Fourth Tribulation Realm only had about 400,000 divine power.","However, at this moment, the other party’s divine power had already soared to 450,000.","Jian Wushuang was calm at first, but as his opponent’s divine power continued to rise, he was especially shocked.","It wouldn’t be strange at that time.","The other party was a lesser sect master. If he didn’t have something good to play, wouldn’t he be a good-for-nothing?","He was completely confident that he would be able to deal with anything within 500,000 divine power. He could even fight with more than 500,000 divine power.","“I won’t watch you become stronger!” Jian Wushuang struck out with his sword again and flew backward. Sword Intent shaped as a flower swept out and shattered the void ppace and the Origin Source of this place.","The condensed divine power was also shattered by the tip of his sword.","Bang!","A hard object blocked his Jueyun Sword.","Jian Wushuang frowned and turned around.","A blood-colored light barrier appeared on Ye Yunxiao’s body.","The power of the upper portion was extremely terrifying, exceeding a million-fold divine power.","“Woah!” Jian Wushuang was shocked when he saw that. Then, he reacted.","It was a protective barrier that could withstand a million divine power.","It was not that Ye Yunxiao had a million divine powers.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t even have time to run.","“Keke...You must have been shocked!” Ye Yunxiao did not forget to mock Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang steadied himself and said coldly, “It’s just a turtle shell. All you can do is hide inside it!”","“Haha!” Ye Yunxiao laughed maniacally when he heard this, as if he had heard a huge joke.","His divine power continued to rise until it reached a limit. He stopped laughing and his eyes were filled with killing intent. He stared at Jian Wushuang and said, “You are so naive and cute. This is my father’s divine power. I don’t need my father’s divine power to kill you. Mine is enough!”","“Do you second-generation heirs like to talk big?” Jian Wushuang was stubborn.","However, cold sweat broke out on his back. It was as he had expected.","The other party indeed had a powerful trump card.","The blood shield of a million divine power could not only block attacks, but it could also be used by Ye Yunxiao as an offensive tool.","This was a little terrifying.","If the other party had wanted to kill him directly, wouldn’t he have died on the spot just now?","No!","Jian Wushuang shook his head.","This divine power did not belong to Ye Yunxiao, so it was limited.","He had to consume this power. Otherwise, when Ye Yunxiao realized that he could not defeat him and used this divine power, he would be finished.","1 million-fold divine power.","It was nothing to Hun Tian and the others. In fact, they could only be considered as entry-level experts.","But to him, it was enough to feel despair.","Even though he could unleash 500,000 divine power at his current limit, he was still an ant in front of a million divine power.","An ant trying to shake a tree!","He would use the ant’s power to consume the tree.","Jian Wushuang put away the Jueyun Sword and rolled his eyes. From his pupils, one could see a blue flame surging.","In the next moment, the blue aura around his entire body rose.","“Eternal Ancient Transformation!” Jian Wushuang clenched his fists.","At his peak state, he was only comparable to 500,000 divine power.","However, the power of the Starry Sky was a big boost for him now.","It was much more cost-effective than consuming divine power.","Moreover, his Origin Source was the Starry Sky Origin Source, so it was naturally more convenient to use the power of the Origin Source.","“What is this?” Ye Yunxiao also noticed Jian Wushuang’s transformation, but he did not feel that Jian Wushuang had become very strong. He was in a similar state as before.","Only the color of his hair and the aura on his body had changed.","This aura replaced divine power.","The power of the Starry Sky erupted, and the divine power retreated.","This made Jian Wushuang very distressed.","If divine power amplified the Starry Sky, and the Starry Sky amplified divine power.","His 500,000 divine power could be used as 1 million divine power.","Unfortunately, he could not grasp it now.","Queen Yun Zhi had also said that this cultivation technique was too heaven-defying.","There was no hope for an Emperor.","However, after the Tribulation Realm, Jian Wushuang had to master this secret skill.","Otherwise, his divine power would suffer in the future.","Not being able to have both was also a kind of pain.","He had Dong Jun’s remains.","Dong Jun’s identity was very likely to be a Starry Sky expert.","The seed he had left in the Starry Sky back then.","He was even stronger than Qishen.","At least at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","After fusing with Dong Jun’s remains, he would eventually become a super expert with divine power.","He cultivated divine power and Origin Source energy at the same time.","They needed to combine.","However, it wasn’t combined into Divine Power Origin Source.","The Origin Source of divine power was reversed.","Jian Wushuang clenched his fist, which contained infinite power.","Boom!","A fist shadow exploded.","It directly hit the blood shield.","However, when it hit the blood shield, there was no change.","“An ant trying to shake a big tree. You overestimate yourself!” Ye Yunxiao snorted coldly and continued to gather the surrounding divine power.","He only needed a few breaths to successfully condense it.","Now that he had condensed half of it, his divine power had already soared from 430,000 to 500,000.","At his limit, 550,000 or even 580,000 was not a problem.","He believed that this power was enough to kill Jian Wushuang.","If it was just this trump card, Jian Wushuang was not afraid.","However, he was afraid that this blood shield would eventually turn into a blood saber or a blood sword and kill him in one move.","If one punch wasn’t enough, then a hundred punches, ten thousand punches!","In his current state, it only took him an instant to throw out a trillion punches.","Boom!","The fist shadows that were continuously blasted out hit the blood shield solidly.","1 million divine power, no matter how hard it was, began to waver.","Ye Yunxiao was so shocked that his jaw almost dropped. He found that Jian Wushuang’s power seemed to be limitless. He kept on unleashing his full power without weakening.","“It seems that pure attacks are useless!” Jian Wushuang found that he could only shake it but not consume it, so he decided to use another method.","He recalled the move that Hun Tian had used in Yongheng Kingdom.","He gathered his strength with both hands.","Weng!","He pressed his hands up and down, instantly condensing a ball of terrifying blue power.","This blue energy was only the size of a fist.","When he injected the power of the Starry Sky again, it instantly became ten times larger.","Jian Wushuang squeezed his hands hard and shrunk them into a dot.","Then, he injected the power of the Starry Sky again.","This repeated tens of thousands of times.","The blue energy was extremely pure!","Deep blue!","This power was at least 100 times stronger than the Starry Sky Power on Jian Wushuang’s body.","Ye Yunxiao, who was in the blood shield, was unmoved. At this moment, he had not realized that something was wrong.","“Hahaha, I didn’t expect to succeed!” This was the first time he did this. He did not expect that he would secretly learn Hun Tian’s special technique."]},{"number":5758,"title":"Chapter 5758: Fallen Xue Dao","paragraphs":["Chapter 5758: Fallen Xue Dao","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He pushed with both hands and directly threw out the blue ball of light.","A blue pillar was instantly exposed.","It directly hit the blood shield.","Boom!","This time, the absolutely violent power directly shook the blood shield out of its original position.","Ye Yunxiao was so surprised that he almost stopped to consider using his father’s power to kill Jian Wushuang.","However, before he could hesitate, another light ball appeared behind him. By the time he reacted, Jian Wushuang had already condensed hundreds of dark blue light balls and threw them all to Ye Yunxiao.","At this moment, he did not dare to withdraw the blood shield and attack Jian Wushuang.","“How can you have so much strength?” Ye Yunxiao was about to go crazy.","The light ball in Jian Wushuang’s hand kept appearing. He said indifferently, “Although I’m not as big as you, I don’t lack power!”","After saying that, he threw another dark blue ball of light over.","This move was to shoot the rat for fear of the vessel.","Ye Yunxiao didn’t dare to use the power of the Blood Shield to attack Jian Wushuang.","To be safe, Jian Wushuang condensed tens of thousands of dark blue light balls.","Ye Yunxiao, who was in the blood shield, was about to go crazy.","“Are you done?!” He looked around at the terrifying dark blue balls of light, and his heart trembled.","If it wasn’t for the blood shield, he wouldn’t have needed so many dark blue light balls. He would have been seriously injured with just a few.","He would die if he took ten.","Jian Wushuang had already condensed more than 10,000 of them.","And he didn’t seem to have any intention of stopping.","He was completely panicking.","His strongest trump card was the blood shield formed by a million divine power.","This one million divine power could not only form a blood shield but also blood needles.","Defending and killing.","But now, he was trapped by Jian Wushuang.","The moment he turned the blood shield into a blood needle, he would most likely exchange his life with Jian Wushuang.","However, if he continued to wait like this, there was a high chance that he would be finished.","“Patriarch Xue Dao, save me!” He shouted desperately in his heart.","However, Patriarch Xue Dao couldn’t even protect himself right now. How could he have the time to save him?","At the same time, he received news from his father, Ye Lingyun.","“What?”","Patriarch Xue Dao was killed.","When he received the news, he almost cried.","A Seventh Tribulation Patriarch was finished just like that.","He instantly thought of Jian Wushuang.","The mysterious man who appeared to stop them thought that he was Jian Wushuang’s helper.","“Don’t even think about it. Xue Dao is finished. No one can save you!” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","Xue Dao had already been killed by Dylan.","Marquis Tie Dan was on par with Hun Tian. He actually had the battle prowess of a Half-Step Eighth Tribulation expert.","This was beyond his expectations.","However, Iron-guts had already been defeated.","It seemed like he was entrusted by someone to save Ye Yunxiao.","However, he did not expect that Ye Yunxiao would chase after him by accident.","Everything was the will of the heavens.","He failed to scheme against others, but he was schemed against instead.","Now that the other party had no reinforcements, he was even less anxious. Just like that, he continuously condensed the dark blue light balls.","Ye Yunxiao was in complete despair.","He wanted to send a message to his father, but he was killed by an Emperor.","He was too ashamed to say it.","“You forced me! Die!” The blood-red lines on Ye Yunxiao’s forehead exploded. “All of you have to die! We’ll be buried together!”","He instantly put away the blood shield and shot out thousands of blood needles at Jian Wushuang.","When Jian Wushuang realized it, he thought to himself, ‘Not good!’","He also instantly detonated all the dark blue light balls.","Without the protection of the blood shield, Ye Yunxiao would definitely die.","However, there were ten thousand blood needles, and each of them had a million divine power.","In the midst of the exploding Starry Sky power, he didn’t slow down and rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","Fortunately, the power of the Starry Sky had worn down the divine power of the blood needle.","From 1 million to 800,000.","In the end, there were only 700,000 left in front of Jian Wushuang.","Even so, Jian Wushuang couldn’t withstand 10,000 blood needles!","At this moment, he used almost all the tricks he could think of.","“Skysight Heavenly Chessboard!” Jian Wushuang pressed down with one hand and a chessboard rose from the billowing waves and instantly appeared under his feet.","“One Thought Universe!”","An oval universe appeared on the entire Fallen Phoenix Valley and condensed almost instantly.","9,000 black holes and 9 secret realms.","It was extremely spectacular.","This foundation had already surpassed that of a Universe Master at the Fourth Tribulation realm.","Jian Wushuang shouted angrily and the Beast God Weapon on his body exploded to the extreme.","He used his hands to block in front of him.","He allowed the blood needles to rush over.","Puff!","The blood needle ignored his divine body and pierced through it.","“Ah!”","Jian Wushuang was seriously injured almost instantly.","Countless Life power was ready to be used, and it recovered the moment he was seriously injured.","There were 10,000 blood needles.","If he had been a little faster, the two blood needles would have been able to kill him.","“Beast God Power!” Jian Wushuang couldn’t care less.","Forcefully using the power of the Beast God under the power of the Starry Sky.","His divine power erupted completely.","The two of them forcefully gathered together.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power instantly broke through 500,000.","“Damn it!” He would still not be able to obtain the slightest bit of amplification. He would only be able to multitask.","But now, if he didn’t explode, he would be finished.","He could only endure it.","Fortunately, the Beast God Weapon was able to withstand it.","It was just that twice the Beast God Power wasn’t enough.","“Twofold!” Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth.","His divine power rose again.","580,000 divine power.","His divine body was about to collapse.","“Burn the divine body!”","Buzz!","600,000 divine power.","Jian Wushuang’s entire body was on the verge of shattering.","This time, even if he didn’t die, he would be heavily injured and fall into a deep sleep.","Even the power of Life could not do anything.","However, each of the 10,000 blood needles had the power of 700,000 divine power.","Just 600,000 divine power was still unable to stop it.","Fortunately, with the completion of the One Thought Universe, it could reduce its power by 10 percent.","This allowed him to stabilize his footing slightly.","“No, I still can’t hold on!” Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth and saw the flashing blood needles through the gap between his arms.","He knew that the blood needle was too fast. It didn’t even leave any afterimages. Every flash was like a teleportation.","Puff!","Several blood needles pierced through his divine body at the same time, leaving several bloody holes.","He circulated his Life power crazily, but he was still unable to fill the hole.","Jian Wushuang roared and spread his arms.","“Threefold the power of the Beast God!”","Buzz!","The blood-colored aura suddenly soared.","His basic divine power was 400,000.","The threefold increase in Beast God Power was an increase of 300,000 divine power.","At this moment, he directly took the blood needle head-on.","One Thought Universe was also at full power.","The Temporal Treasure under his feet changed.","He originally thought that he wouldn’t be able to withstand three times the Beast God Power, but he didn’t expect the Origin Source in the Temporal Treasure to stabilize him.","Jian Wushuang finally heaved a sigh of relief.","He pressed down on the blood needle with one hand and directly shattered the divine power inside the blood needle.","“Break!”","Boom!","His Origin Source completely erupted, and the power of the Starry Sky suddenly rose to a new level.","With the enhancement of the Temporal Treasure Origin Source, his strength had increased by several times.","This was the most dangerous battle he had ever fought since he became an Emperor.","He had completely used all his trump cards."]},{"number":5759,"title":"Chapter 5759 General’s Armor","paragraphs":["Chapter 5759 General’s Armor","The Jueyun Sword had just been shattered, and his divine body was also covered in wounds.","What completely caught him off guard was his ability to activate the chessboard.","Standing above the chessboard, he condensed a battle armor on his chest with the word ‘General’ inscribed on it!","“General!”","The word crazily absorbed his essence, gathering chess pieces under his feet.","He now possessed the battle armor of the General.","Some blood needles that hadn’t been shattered rushed towards him but couldn’t pierce through the armor.","Moreover, the power was reduced by half.","Seven hundred thousand divine powers of blood needles stuck to the armor of the General, weakening the attack he received by half.","That is, 350,000 divine power.","Completely unable to threaten him.","The wings of the Candle Dragon on his back shook, directly shattering all those blood needles.","“A Temporal Treasure, I can actually unleash the power of a Temporal Treasure!” Jian Wushuang himself found it unbelievable.","Initially, he used the chessboard to observe the essence of the internal chess pieces.","Later, with the Emperor, he could devour the essence of the pieces with titles.","Because of the power of Life, he could even revive the pieces with titles.","However, these were not the powers of the treasure itself.","Only now did he manage to activate a certain secret method on the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","The battle armor of the General.","Reducing the attack by half.","And being able to guard his divine body.","Otherwise, his divine body would have collapsed just now.","“Teacher Xuan Yi, why have you handed this item over to me?” Jian Wushuang’s mind raced with possibilities upon receiving such a powerful treasure.","In truth, most of the benefits brought by the chessboard were supplementary.","This was the first time its power had been unleashed, and Jian Wushuang hadn’t expected it to be this potent.","Such a powerful treasure, there were probably few like it in the entire temporal river.","Moreover, this kind of treasure, he hadn’t heard of anyone being able to forge it.","Perhaps those three ancient beings could forge it.","But encountering such figures was rare, let alone having them forge a treasure for you.","Teacher Xuan Yi leaving him this treasure probably had significant implications.","This treasure definitely held many secrets.","Even just the insignia of the armor was so formidable, capable of reducing attacks by 50 percent.","And it disregarded the opponent’s strength.","Previous treasures could still weaken attacks by 99 percent.","But they weren’t just ordinary treasures.","Even the Emperor could easily destroy them, if faced with the 700,000 divine power of the blood needle, their aura could probably shatter such treasures.","But the insignia armor was able to perfectly weaken attacks and remain unharmed.","From this perspective, this kind of armor was at least a treasure of the Sixth Tribulation or higher.","It was a bit regrettable that this kind of armor couldn’t be taken out, as it was condensed from the chessboard.","When using it, the chessboard had to be taken out.","General, Marshal, God!","If it were a Marshal’s rank armor, Jian Wushuang dared not imagine it.","If his speculation was correct, the titles corresponded to the Fifth to Seventh Tribulation realms.","So, the title of ‘Marshal’ was likely armor of the Eighth Tribulation realm or above.","The title of ‘God’ would be the Ninth Tribulation realm.","They were treasures that had existed since ancient times.","In theory, the Heavenly Skysight Chessboard was a spacetime treasure, but it could condense armor of similar levels.","This was much stronger than what the First True King had introduced initially.","No wonder he was Teacher Xuan Yi.","Jian Wushuang was shaken!","Deep down, he even thought that perhaps Teacher Xuan Yi was even more formidable than those ancient figures.","He seemed to live in the future but could come to this spacetime to teach him.","This made him immensely yearn for the future world.","He didn’t know where that world was.","Maybe deep in the Starry Sky, perhaps in the river of time and space.","He was getting impatient to see it.","Strength!","It must be improved immediately!","Jian Wushuang clenched his fist.","This time, he had almost perished again.","The Emperor was considered a strong being in the end of the river of time and space, but in a higher-level spacetime like the Ancient Moon Spacetime, it was completely inadequate.","Only by becoming the Universe Master could he stand firm.","It was close!","He would be able to achieve it soon.","With the assistance of the Heavenly Skysight Chessboard, his Origin Source breakthrough was very fast, and he had also grasped the true meaning of time. He just needed to condense the Origin Source of spacetime.","Once the Spacetime Origin Source was condensed and integrated into the universe, he could transcend tribulations at will.","To the level of the Universe Master.","He also had the powerful artifact, Beast God Weapon.","His combat power would be even more terrifying.","Thinking about the Beast God Weapon, Jian Wushuang finally withdrew the power of the Beast God. The extreme state just now had placed a heavy burden on him. If it weren’t for the battle armor with the title badge guarding his divine body, he would have been finished. At the moment when the power of the Beast God disappeared, the aura on his body also turned white. The divine body began to fall apart.","700,000.","Even the Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation might not be able to withstand it. This time, he had indeed been too reckless.","“Whew!”","Bathed in the vitality, he completely recovered.","The Life power surged from his body like a spring.","If those Scattered Tribulations were to see it, there would be no place for him in the entire river of time and space.","That’s also why he had been hiding so diligently since arriving in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Once he became the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, there would be no need to hide anymore.","By then, those Scattered Tribulation experts wouldn’t dare to attract his attention, and he could use vitality to build a huge power. Of course, that’s all in the future.","The Seventh Tribulation was still too far away.","“Surprisingly, there are still things left behind!”","Jian Wushuang saw several treasures floating in the distance void.","They hadn’t been damaged by his Starry Sky power. They must not be ordinary items.","Jian Wushuang casually collected them—several treasures marked with the emblem of the Blood Robe Sect.","He couldn’t use them, but he could devour them.","Now that he already had 9,000 black holes as his origin, after swallowing these powerful treasures, he could advance towards a complete universe.","If time permitted, he would have wanted to break through ahead of schedule.","“The Sacred Assembly, Wanliu!”","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment.","Still, he had to wait.","The opportunities were not enough.","Relying solely on these treasures, he could break through, but without significant treasures, it would be difficult.","He wasn’t lacking treasures now, but he was lacking some secret techniques—his self-created peak secret techniques.","The Starry Sky Chronicles and the Ancient Eternal Transformation were his trump cards.","Although the power of the Beast God was powerful, it was still too single-minded.","Since he was in the spacetime of the Divine Power Origin Source, he needed to get a few divine power secret techniques.","Unfortunately, these techniques were not passed down publicly.","He wasn’t in a sect but in a noble family.","Even if it was the royal family of Yue Kingdom, they wouldn’t pass on their family secrets to him!","He had to buy them.","Fortunately, his current value was not bad. The source stone mountain was enough for him to squander.","“Let’s go!” Jian Wushuang cleaned up the battlefield and prepared to leave.","But just as he was about to leave, the Life power that had just appeared suddenly escaped his control and all drilled into the ground.","This startled Jian Wushuang.","He quickly descended from the void.","“Is there something strange?”","Jian Wushuang frowned. The fact that it could absorb his Life power, and he couldn’t stop it himself, was concerning.","Fortunately, it was just absorbing some leaked Life power."]},{"number":5760,"title":"Chapter 5760: Pink Meatball","paragraphs":["Chapter 5760: Pink Meatball","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If he could absorb the life force within him, that would be incredible.","If that were the case, he would have started fleeing long ago.","But merely absorbing external life force hadn’t threatened him yet.","“Let’s go take a look!” Jian Wushuang’s curiosity was piqued.","This was the Fallen Phoenix Valley.","He hadn’t heard of such a thing happening here!","Even the Scattered Tribulations disdain coming here.","What could it be?","Jian Wushuang shrank his figure and followed the stream of life force, drilling into the ground.","Puff!","Entering underground, the density of the soil exceeded Jian Wushuang’s imagination.","With his current strength, diving tens of thousands of feet was already somewhat difficult.","In other words, ordinary pinnacle experts couldn’t even do it within a hundred feet.","His current norm was 400,000 divine power.","This level of power was enough to overlook the Fourth Tribulations Realm.","Yet diving 10,000 feet made him struggle.","But that diverted life force was still diving deeper.","Originally, he didn’t feel any threat.","But now he hesitated.","Anything that could be at such depths, be it human or otherwise, had extraordinary strength.","He had to be careful.","With all his 400,000 divine power bursting forth, his speed increased once again, catching up to the diverted Life power.","He dived another 5,000 feet.","The pressure made Jian Wushuang’s complexion turn pale.","The density below was increasing.","It was almost comparable to a treasure.","Diving into a treasure would be too uncomfortable.","“Beast God’s power!” Jian Wushuang uttered in a low voice.","Relying solely on divine power was somewhat futile.","“Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","He instantly reached his peak state, a blue aura enveloping his body as he surged downward.","This time, there was no resistance as he directly caught up with the stream of Life power.","Only ten feet away.","There was no fear of it slipping away.","20,000 feet!","30,000 feet!","Soon, he reached Jian Wushuang’s peak once again.","He dared not delve deeper.","Not only because of the immense consumption but more importantly, whatever could survive at this depth was undoubtedly stronger than him.","Perhaps it was a stroke of luck.","He didn’t dare to gamble on his courage.","When it was time to give up, he must.","He had more opportunities and no need to waste time here.","Sometimes, one must learn to give up actively.","If facing his opponent, he would fight with all his might.","But in a situation like this, he didn’t need to take it seriously.","It was time to go.","Just as he was about to leave, his body suddenly relaxed, and all pressure disappeared.","“What’s this?” Jian Wushuang was startled, then realized he had entered a space.","It was like a natural underground cave.","The walls around were extremely smooth.","What should have been a dark cave became lush and green after the infusion of Life power.","The green light illuminated the darkness of the cave.","Jian Wushuang could now see the scene ahead clearly.","The cave wasn’t large, only 100 feet in length and width.","Barely able to stretch his legs, Jian Wushuang found himself in the center of this space, witnessing a familiar scene.","Within green vessels lay something, a presence that sparked recognition.","“Could it be this coincidental?” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but recall the beetle he encountered in Yue Kingdom.","Yet, the inhabitants of these vessels weren’t insect-like; they resembled eggs more than anything else.","Seeing an egg triggered an instinctual response in Jian Wushuang, fearing it might be a divine egg, reminiscent of his encounter with Chi Jiuxiao and Frolasa.","Fortunately, he carried the token of the Giant God Clan, a precaution against Babidi discovering his true identity.","According to Frolasa, this token would grant him esteemed guest status among the Giant God Clan, hopefully even affecting Chi Jiuxiao.","The prospect of controlling Chi Jiuxiao, a Half-Step Nine Tribulations powerhouse, was enticing, especially since he was under Babidi’s influence.","What Mie Sheng? What Qishen Temple?","Even if Qishen himself resurrected, it will end in death.","Jian Wushuang entertained these thoughts but knew they were mostly futile.","Babidi’s control over Chi Jiuxiao, facilitated by some stellar secret method, rendered Jian Wushuang’s token ineffective beyond restraining Chi Jiuxiao from direct confrontation.","Yet, even this seemed sufficient; without Chi Jiuxiao’s assistance, Babidi was nothing more than a regular Tribulation Realm cultivator, inferior to the Third Tribulation Universe Masters.","Unfortunately, there were too many strong individuals around him at the moment.","Otherwise, he could have taken action against Babidi.","Unfortunately!","Around Babidi, there were Dylan and several other super beings like Hun Tian.","He didn’t have the opportunity to make a move.","So he dared not dwell on it.","He merely noticed another egg once again.","He thought about obtaining some secret techniques from Babidi to turn this egg into a powerhouse like Chi Jiuxiao.","“I may be overthinking it!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head .","He stepped towards the green vessel.","His Life power had already penetrated inside.","Unlike the humanoid beetle, the creatures in this vessel seemed to grow stronger with just Life power.","The beetle required a bloody aura.","In essence, both were monsters.","The round fleshy mass in the vessel looked tender and pink.","After absorbing his Life power, it swiftly reached the peak of Immortal from a mortal level.","This exceeded Jian Wushuang’s expectations.","The growth rate was much faster than that of the beetle.","He once again infused some Life force into it, and this time, the round mass of flesh broke through the Emperor without any hesitation.","It seemed as if the Emperor’s restraints didn’t exist at all.","Apparently, it was indeed different from cultivators.","These creatures had no constraints.","There was no need for cultivation; they only needed sufficient vitality to become stronger.","Jian Wushuang suddenly seemed to realize that there might be no limit to the strength of these creatures.","But who created them?","Jian Wushuang pondered, unconsciously channeling his Life force outward.","The pink mass of flesh absorbed it all without any hesitation.","Jian Wushuang raised his hand and tapped the flesh ball. It was soft, posing no threat.","Hum!","While there was no immediate threat, the aura emanating from it had reached the Tribulation Realm.","“This is too fast!” Jian Wushuang dared not feed it further.","He couldn’t subdue such a thing. If it grew too powerful, it would endanger him.","Yet, despite possessing Tribulation Realm strength, the flesh mass showed no signs of change.","Unlike the creature discovered in the Chen family’s possession.","At least that one had transformed from a cocoon into a bug, ultimately taking on a humanoid form.","However, this lump of flesh showed little change.","“Fallen Phoenix Valley, it seems this creature has some connection to the primordial beings from before!”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","After carefully scanning the space once more, he prepared to leave.","There was nothing else here, only this lump of flesh.","Taking it with him would only bring trouble.","It might be better to leave it here.","As he prepared to depart, his courage grew.","He scooped the pink lump of flesh out of the container.","The moment he scooped it out, there was a subtle change in the surrounding space.","However, Jian Wushuang failed to notice it."]},{"number":5761,"title":"Chapter 5761: Sword Immortal Tonghe","paragraphs":["Chapter 5761: Sword Immortal Tonghe","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This change also affected that vessel.","The power of prohibition from above was still shattered.","This power was only useful for the pink mass.","The scooped pink mass, however, showed no sign of any change.","Jian Wushuang held it in his hand, examining it carefully once again.","After not finding anything special, he attempted to mold the mass.","He molded it into a humanoid shape.","Yet, with its pink exterior, round belly, and a thick strand of flesh hanging from its head, it didn’t resemble a person at all.","He casually tossed it aside, losing all interest.","He couldn’t make sense of this thing.","Ancient Moon Spacetime was so vast.","There were too many secrets.","He didn’t have time to unravel them all.","For now, it was best to hurry to the capital of Shi Kingdom.","With the recommendation from Queen Yun Zhi.","He needed to create techniques again, forging the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","That would be a complete upgrade.","The current Eternal Ancient Transformation only enhanced the Origin Source.","The super variation would enhance his overall combat power.","50 times the normal state wouldn’t be an issue.","Even if he couldn’t succeed now, he had to achieve it in the Tribulation Realm.","Otherwise, he would be too disadvantaged in terms of divine power in the future.","Swiftly breaking through the soil layer, Jian Wushuang glanced back at the place and silently murmured, “I hope you never appear!”","This remark was directed at that lump of flesh.","Unlimited frenzied growth would be too terrifying.","The power of an ordinary Tribulation Realm couldn’t break out of this place.","Spending a lifetime here would be fine.","Otherwise, it would be a disaster.","That beetle from the Yue Kingdom also needed to be dealt with sooner.","All of them were disasters.","The unknown power was too terrifying.","It couldn’t be left unchecked.","Whoosh!","Space tore apart.","Jian Wushuang flashed away.","The reason for not killing that pink flesh ball was also to avoid unnecessary trouble.","After all, the other party couldn’t come out anyway.","He had to use peak strength to enter the 30,000-feet layer of earth.","That lump of flesh had no Life force replenishment, and now it was just an ordinary Tribulation Realm, unable to escape at all.","So, there was no need to kill it.","Just leave it there.","But his good deed this time had brought out an unmatched monster.","It was a disaster for the Ancient Wood Continent and even the entire spacetime.","This also led to the emergence of a remarkable existence.","But that’s a story for later.","Jian Wushuang left Fallen Phoenix Valley without causing any disturbance.","So, he quietly entered the capital of the Shi Kingdom.","A stone city lying in the depths of the mountains.","From a distance, it looked like a colossal wilderness beast, peacefully asleep.","Jian Wushuang’s slender figure seemed tiny outside the massive city.","His divine power concealed, his true strength hidden.","An ordinary Emperor, he had entered the capital of the Shi Kingdom.","“Sword Immortal Tonghe?” Jian Wushuang toyed with the token given to him by Queen Yun Zhi, while searching for this Tonghe who could help him.","The other party was also a supreme expert in swordsmanship, albeit with divine power as their strength.","Their paths were similar.","He might as well take the opportunity to exchange pointers with them.","A sword duel!","In the royal capital, within the northern district.","A gathering place for wandering cultivators and external powerhouses.","Chaotic, bloody, filthy.","This was what Jian Wushuang saw and heard.","It took him three days in the capital to finally locate the mansion where his target resided.","In the process, he also gained some insight into the Shi Kingdom’s strength and common knowledge.","The Shi Kingdom was founded in the primordial era.","Its first Emperor naturally became its patriarch.","A powerhouse at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Still alive to this day.","He was also the close friend of the Flame God.","Together, they established this superpowerful kingdom.","However, while the Flame God continued to advance, the Shi Kingdom’s patriarch had reached his limit.","Yet, with the support of the Flame God, the Shi Kingdom remained mighty.","Among the Sixteen Kingdoms of Qingchao, even with the addition of some secret realms within the Ancient Wood Continent, it remained the foremost power.","If it weren’t for the presence of formidable figures within the Ancient Wood Sect, the Shi Kingdom could easily be deemed the foremost power.","In this era, although lacking a Universe Master in the Seventh Tribulation realm, there were three in the Sixth Tribulation realm alone.","Besides the prominent Shi Xiu, there were two others: one serving as the honored guest of the Shi Kingdom, much like Jian Wushuang, and the other, a disciple of the Flame God in the Flame God Kingdom.","This generation of the Ancient Wood Sect might have struggled to produce even one Seventh Tribulation Universe Master if not for the emergence of a certain Holy Maiden undergoing her tribulation.","Whether she would succeed remained uncertain.","If she did, it could stabilize several more eras. Otherwise, the Ancient Wood Continent might see upheaval in the future.","Jian Wushuang sat atop a high place, observing the chaos in the northern city.","He understood why the Shi Kingdom held such power—it accepted all, regardless of alignment.","As long as one possessed sufficient strength, they could join the Shi Kingdom. Even a transcendent Sword Immortal could settle here for long cultivation.","There must have been some allure to the Shi Kingdom beyond just the influence of the Flame God.","A Sword Immortal, a Universe Master at the pinnacle of the Sixth Tribulation, surely found something compelling in this place.","It was hidden in the chaos of the northern city.","Jian Wushuang left the teahouse and casually hailed a flying carriage on the street.","After tossing out several hundred universe crystals, he spoke, “Go Heavenly Mansion, Tianfu!”","“No problem!”","Although the northern city of the capital was chaotic, it still had some rules.","You could kill.","But it required the intervention of the Shi Kingdom, allowing both parties to fight fairly.","Flying in the airspace was prohibited, a strict order; going against it meant death.","Initially, there was a Seventh Tribulation cultivator who dared to defy it but was ultimately slain by the hands of the Flame God.","After that, no one dared to provoke the rule.","The Heavenly Mansion, Tianfu!","It wasn’t someone’s individual mansion.","It was a utopia located in the northern city.","Here, there was no chaotic order, only strict rules.","Upon arriving, Jian Wushuang could feel a sense of majesty.","There were very few people on the main street.","Most of them were ordinary Emperors, like servants.","Tianfu South.","House Number 7, Street A.","Jian Wushuang arrived outside the mansion, looked at the signboard, and nodded.","“This should be the place!”","The residence of Tonghe Sword Immortal.","He hadn’t expected it to be so low-key.","The mansion at House Number 7 wasn’t spacious.","It covered only about a hundred miles.","If the Universe Master were to use his divine power, it would only be the size of a palm.","Jian Wushuang had just approached when a restraining force stopped him.","There were no guards at the door.","Jian Wushuang could only wait there.","After feeling the warmth of the jade pendant, the restraining force hesitated for a moment before the gate opened.","“Esteemed guest, please come in!” The voice came from nowhere.","Jian Wushuang felt a bit strange but still entered.","Once inside, he realized that the one who had spoken to him earlier was actually a statue.","Nevertheless, he still politely bowed and said, “Please inform Senior Tonghe that Jian Wushuang is here to pay respects!”","“Please wait a moment!” The stone statue’s rigid face twitched.","After a short while, it spoke again, “My master is in the front hall. Follow the path ahead, and you’ll find it!”","Jian Wushuang thanked it and proceeded towards the inside.","This Sword Immortal Tonghe was indeed peculiar.","Inside the mansion, there wasn’t a single person.","All guests were received and welcomed by a stone statue."]},{"number":5762,"title":"Chapter 5762: Dark Brilliance Crystal","paragraphs":["Chapter 5762: Dark Brilliance Crystal","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation was also an overlord.","It was normal for him to have some strange fetishes.","Perhaps he didn’t like the dust in the mortal world.","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and went straight to the guest hall.","“Junior Jian Wushuang greets Senior Tonghe!” He didn’t go in directly, but greeted them first.","There was still a need for respect when asking for help.","“Come in!” An old voice sounded from the guest hall.","Jian Wushuang walked into the guest hall carefully.","This place was extremely gloomy and cold.","After entering the guest hall, he saw an old man with a huge skeleton. He was several feet tall and sat on the main seat.","In the darkness, there were only a few sword lights.","It was indeed strange.","Jian Wushuang walked forward, took out the warm jade, and told him his intention.","He really didn’t want to stay here any longer.","It was too dark.","“Queen Yun Zhi has broken through to become the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation. I have been remiss in not offering congratulations. I will assist you with your task, which can be considered as my congratulations to the Queen!” Tonghe Sword Immortal cleared his throat, appearing peculiar but speaking with great humility.","He still treated Jian Wushuang as an equal.","Jian Wushuang was relieved.","Whoosh!","Sword Immortal Tonghe handed a piece of dark metal to Jian Wushuang.","The metal was pitch-black, even darker than the night.","It was unclear what kind of material it belonged to.","According to Queen Yun Zhi’s instructions, fusion seemed almost impossible.","Rumors had it that the dark and light could merge at a certain moment.","Not to mention two kinds of power.","This dark metal was the necessary material for creating the secret method.","The Dark Brilliance Crystal!","It wasn’t metal at all.","It just looked like it.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t expected it to go so smoothly, so he hurriedly bowed to express his gratitude.","“You don’t need to be so polite. Back then, Ruler Yun Zhi was kind to me, this is nothing!” Tonghe explained. “With your current realm, since you can be entrusted by Ruler Yun Zhi, you must be extraordinary. In the future, you might even reach my level.”","His words were straightforward.","Jian Wushuang still humbly declined, hastily saying, “I am just a mere Emperor, how could I dare to imagine becoming the Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation.”","He was truly modest.","His ambitions soared higher than anyone else’s.","Even if it were the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, he wouldn’t accept it.","He believed he would become such a powerful figure.","That was the mindset of a strong individual.","“You don’t need to be modest. I can see that you are concealing your true strength, still a swordsman!” Tonghe Sword Immortal spoke bluntly, directly pointing out Jian Wushuang’s concealment.","Jian Wushuang naturally wouldn’t hide it.","With a divine power of 400,000, he didn’t care anymore.","Speaking of swordsmanship.","The two of them found a common topic.","The two of them had a common topic.","Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to inquire about some matters regarding divine power swordsmanship.","He gained a lot from it.","Of course, he was more focused on researching the method of integration.","The ultimate ancient transformation after fusion.","That was his peak secret technique.","The Starry Sky Chronicles in the Emperor’s hands was not truly the strongest.","It was only when he reached the Tribulation Realm and fully mastered some of the Origins sources of Spacetime that a qualitative change occurred.","A sword breaking through space was Emperor level.","If it broke through time, then it would reach the pinnacle of the universe.","That was the terrifying aspect of spacetime.","Compared to pure divine power, he had more methods.","“Senior, I wonder if we can spar?” Jian Wushuang said embarrassedly.","To think that he could say that he wanted to spar with a Sixth Tribulation expert.","Tonghe was stunned for a moment before a smile appeared on his face.","However, he was even more excited.","Swordsmen were the most combative.","Especially sparring with fellow cultivators.","Seeing Jian Wushuang as a decent junior, he was also itching to get his hands on him.","However, Jian Wushuang was an Emperor, and he was a Universe Master, so he couldn’t say anything.","However, at this moment, crisp footsteps could be heard from outside the guest hall.","Judging from her footsteps, she was a woman.","“Grandpa!” Before she arrived, he heard a bell-like smile.","Jian Wushuang turned around in surprise.","He had never expected Tonghe to have a granddaughter.","There was no such person in the information he had gathered.","Sword Immortal Tonghe smiled when he saw Jian Wushuang’s surprise.","“Ming’er, why are you here?!” Tonghe stood up, his face exposed to the sword-light.","Only then did Jian Wushuang see the other party’s appearance clearly.","The girl named Ming’er was also surprised to see Jian Wushuang.","“Grandpa, who is he?” he asked.","With such a straightforward personality, it seemed that she was his biological granddaughter.","Although Sword Immortal Tonghe doted on his granddaughter, he did not answer directly. Instead, he said to Jian Wushuang, “Don’t take offense, Wushuang. This is my granddaughter!”","“Junior wouldn’t dare. It’s my fault for coming so abruptly this time. I didn’t know Senior had a granddaughter, and I didn’t prepare any greeting gifts!” Jian Wushuang waved his hand hurriedly.","But as soon as he said this, he regretted it.","That young lady said very impolitely, “Since you don’t have any gifts, then just give me a few hundred million universe crystals. I don’t have any hobbies. I just like universe crystals!”","“Of course, of course!” Jian Wushuang treated it as pocket money for a junior.","He casually took out tens of thousands of cubic units of origin stones and placed them into another mustard seed before handing it over to the other party.","Tonghe felt a headache coming on.","This had a lot to do with his granddaughter’s background.","“Universe crystals?” The young lady was stunned when she saw the origin stones. She then said in surprise,” These don’t seem to be universe crystals!”","Jian Wushuang was speechless. He didn’t expect that he could say that.","Tonghe hurriedly explained. “Lass, these are origin stones. Each cube is worth 10,000 universe crystals!”","“Ah! Thank you, Senior!” The girl exclaimed and bowed respectfully to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang swallowed his saliva. This eccentric character was really unique.","A few hundred million universe crystals was just a matter of pinching a fingernail to Sword Immortal Tonghe!","Why was it that the young girl before him acted as if she had never seen anything before?","And from the looks of it, she was very surprised that he could really give her a few hundred million universe crystals.","She looked happy.","Jian Wushuang began to suspect Sword Immortal Tonghe of being stingy.","Why did such a doting granddaughter act like a mutt?","But then, Tonghe sent a voice transmission to explain everything.","This also made him understand why Tonghe had chosen this relatively low-key estate, as well as why there were no servants in it.","It turned out that Ming’er had been left behind by Sword Immortal Tonghe’s son in the mortal world.","Unity was focused on pursuing the Dao, and his son wanted to follow in his father’s footsteps.","He had been adventuring in the mortal world, but he had accidentally teleported to the Ancient Wood Continent.","Unfortunately, his aptitude was not good enough.","At the Immortal realm, it was already the peak.","He wanted to return to his hometown.","But in his world, he had never even heard of the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","After coming to the Ancient Wood Continent, he heard that the the ruler of Shi Kingdom had a Teleportation Formation that allowed him to go anywhere."]},{"number":5763,"title":"Chapter 5763: Li Ming’er","paragraphs":["Chapter 5763: Li Ming’er","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He came to the Shi Kingdom with a mindset of giving it a try.","An Immortal, wandering in the Outer Domain.","Heading towards the Shi Kingdom.","The journey could probably fill a book.","Especially surviving to reach the Shi Kingdom, that was truly defying fate.","It seemed all his luck in cultivation was spent on the road.","Unfortunately, upon arriving at the Shi Kingdom, he couldn’t activate the teleportation array.","Eventually, he gave up hope.","However, his journey was not in vain.","He met his fellow traveler and settled down in the capital of the Shi Kingdom.","But neither of them were Emperors, making survival difficult.","During a mining expedition, the couple met their end together.","They left behind a daughter, the current Ming’er.","When her parents perished, Ming’er was still an ordinary mortal.","Abandoned on the streets, unnoticed by anyone.","Luckily, she had a good appearance.","She was sold to the Heavenly Palace Tianfu and became a maid.","Enduring hardships since childhood.","For survival, for freedom.","She constantly gathered universe crystals, serving tea and water to those big shots, arranging celestial banquets.","Only for a handful of universal crystals as tips.","Because with enough universal crystals, she could buy her freedom.","So, even now, she remained as greedy as ever.","She didn’t even accept the universal crystals given to her by Sword Immortal Tonghe.","In her world, those were for her people, not something she earned herself, so there was no sense of accomplishment in keeping them.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang began to understand.","Though Sword Immortal Tonghe didn’t explicitly state it, he understood too.","The life of a maid was worthless.","Even if she saved up enough universal crystals, she couldn’t escape her cage.","Facing his seventh tribulation, Sword Immortal Tonghe’s cultivation stagnated. Returning to his homeland, he found his only son missing.","Utilizing his bloodline connection, he traced it back to the Shi Kingdom.","In the end, he only found his granddaughter alive.","Seeing his young granddaughter serving tea and performing menial tasks, he was filled with immense rage.","But after recognizing each other as grandfather and granddaughter, he pleaded on behalf of those who had oppressed and suppressed her.","The cage remained unbroken.","It needed to be broken by oneself.","Afterward, Sword Immortal Tonghe understood.","His granddaughter was unwilling to leave the Shi Kingdom, so he settled there.","No wonder there were no servants in the mansion.","Because the young girl would buy batches of servants, only to grant them their freedom afterward.","Great kindness!","Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly.","It was unclear whether this young girl was lucky or unlucky.","On the one hand, she had such a grandfather, a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation, a huge backing.","On the other hand, she had suffered a tragic childhood.","She should have been a lively and arrogant young lady, full of vitality.","But instead, she had become such a miserable sight.","“Li Ming’er!” Jian Wushuang called out.","The girl turned around, about to bow to him again, but he stopped her with a hand.","He looked at the girl and said with a smile, “Girl, I’m going to spar with your grandfather later. Let’s see who can win, guess right and there’s a reward!”","“Wow, really?” Li Ming’er couldn’t believe it.","She was just an ordinary person, unable to gauge Jian Wushuang’s strength, nor did she know who her grandfather was.","In her world, both of them were super strong.","At first, she was a little excited, rubbing her hands together, then she said, “I bet on you to win!”","Jian Wushuang couldn’t believe it and pointed at himself.","Li Ming’er nodded in confirmation.","This caught Jian Wushuang off guard.","Was it because he had just given her a favor, she thought he could win?","But then, through a faint Thought power, Jian Wushuang heard Li Ming’er secretly communicating with Sword Immortal Tonghe.","She was planning to let this esteemed Universe Master at the peak of the Sixth Tribulation intentionally lose to an Emperor.","This amused him and seemed rather ridiculous.","Sword Immortal Tonghe blushed, but still indulgently nodded.","For the sake of his granddaughter, losing to an Emperor wasn’t out of the question.","“Alright, let’s get started!” Li Ming’er, not knowing where, brought a small stool and took out some golden brown pastries from her pocket, eating while waiting for the two to start.","Sword Immortal Tonghe raised his hand, and the guest hall instantly transformed into a snowy mountain.","Li Ming’er was momentarily stunned, then her face lit up with joy. She carefully tucked away the pastries and began playing with the snow on the ground.","Childlike innocence.","“Elder, please forgive me!” Jian Wushuang slightly bowed.","With a flick of his finger, Sword Immortal Tonghe exerted his divine power outward. That withered finger instantly emitted a golden light.","“I’ll suppress my divine power to around 100,000. This is the limit for an Emperor. Come at me!”","With a forceful movement of his right hand, Jian Wushuang conjured a divine sword with blue flames.","The Jueyun Sword, which had accompanied him for a long time, was already broken.","He felt embarrassed to bring out a broken sword to compete with such a powerful figure.","So he resorted to using a formless sword.","The formless sword condensed from the power of the Starry Sky was no less powerful than a Universe Treasure.","100,000-fold divine power surged.","Jian Wushuang’s brow twitched.","Pure divine power, indeed, could crush even Sword Immortal Tonghe.","But the augmentation of swordsmanship was no joke.","Each sword of Sword Immortal Tonghe contained over 500,000-fold divine power.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t rely on his Beast God’s power and had to be cautious.","A finger represented a sword.","Swish!","An invisible blue divine sword, like ripples in the void, calm yet extremely cunning.","Although the Sword Qi of Sword Immortal Tonghe was powerful, it couldn’t touch Jian Wushuang.","He could entangle but couldn’t actively attack.","For a moment, there was a stalemate.","“Young Friend, give it your all!”","As soon as Sword Immortal Tonghe said this, he pointed upward, countless ripples emerged, then turned into numerous Sword Qi, sweeping towards Jian Wushuang like a tidal wave.","The core strength of this tide definitely exceeded 500,000.","With each step forward, the power would multiply.","Jian Wushuang dared not retreat and could only confront it head-on.","Hum!","His fists clenched, the blue divine sword horizontally in front of him, he shouted explosively, divine power surging instantaneously.","Now his strongest combat power was still his divine power.","Because there was too much enhancement from the Beast God Weapon!","All thanks to the armor condensed by the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","Capable of guarding his divine body.","“Beast God’s power!” Originally, doubling the Beast God’s power had already reached its peak.","But now he was fully exerting triple.","The armor operated madly, the chessboard appeared under his feet, and the divine power instantly exceeded 600,000.","Finally, it stopped at around 680,000.","With just a light wave of the blue divine sword in front of him, that incoming tide was instantly extinguished.","Sword Immortal Tonghe’s eyes widened in shock, the Emperor’s body shattered instantly.","Without suppression, he was a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation.","Although Jian Wushuang’s move was powerful, for a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation, he could easily break it with a casual move.","But Sword Immortal Tonghe didn’t think so.","Jian Wushuang was just an Emperor!","He was a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation.","If he were a Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation, perhaps he wouldn’t need to suppress his divine power, he could exchange blows with Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":5764,"title":"Chapter 5764: Fan Tianfeng?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5764: Fan Tianfeng?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“I lost!” Sword Immortal Tonghe admitted defeat when he exerted all his strength.","Jian Wushuang also absorbed the power of the Beast God effortlessly.","At the moment of losing his General’s armor, his divine body was already trembling.","If it weren’t for the armor, his divine body would have collapsed long ago.","“Senior’s swordsmanship is magnificent. This time, I have truly gained some insights!” The recent exchange was enlightening for him. It was rare to have the opportunity to spar with someone at the Sixth Tribulation.","He also gained an understanding of the techniques of those super-strong individuals.","Especially the division of divine power.","1 million divine powers were considered a significant threshold.","Exceeding a million divine powers could disrupt the Ancient Wood Continent itself, making one a formidable force in the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","The Seventh Tribulation experts were not wrong in their assertions.","Only when one reached 1 million divine power could they be considered strong.","The Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation could achieve 1 million divine powers.","Within their own Dao Arenas, they could even unleash up to 1.5 million divine power.","Without sufficient vitality, one couldn’t unleash 1 million divine power.","Generally, the divine power of the Sixth Tribulation ranged from 700,000 to 1.5 million.","If not counting the Universe Masters, and only considering the Tribulation Realm, then the maximum would be 1.5 million.","For instance, Patriarch Xue Dao could unleash 2 million divine power.","Although he was a Scattered Tribulation cultivator, due to abundant vitality, he possessed the top combat power among Seventh Tribulation experts.","Comparable to ordinary Universe Masters.","Ruler Yun Zhi had just broken through the Seventh Tribulation, becoming a Universe Master.","At present, her divine power should be around 2 million.","But if it were within her own universe, he feared she could unleash over 3 million divine power.","Jian Wushuang trembled inwardly.","3 million divine power.","What did that represent?","And there was the peculiar figure of Hun Tian.","Although he was a Scattered Tribulation of the Seventh Tribulation, he possessed special secret techniques, staining the entire Yongheng Kingdom with blood.","Capable of erupting with around 5 million divine power, much stronger than the titled experts of the Seventh Tribulation.","Of course, Marquis Tie Dan was not in his own universe Dao Arena.","If in his own Dao Arena, he wouldn’t fear Tun TIan in the slightest.","But the previous battle was not in Marquis Tie Dan’s stronghold.","He had suffered a loss.","However, this loss was nothing to him.","At most, he would lose some face.","Emperor Hun Tian was different.","The power he gained from blood sacrifice would only diminish slowly.","The Marquis’ power, on the other hand, was blessed by the universe, flowing endlessly.","The reason Hun Tian was in a hurry to perform was mainly because of the method created by Babidi.","If he could, like Dylan, have the essence of Death and need no vitality to enhance his divine power, then he would truly be of the Eighth Tribulation.","Not only the Hun TIan yearned for it, but all Scattered Tribulations coveted this power.","This exposure was a signal.","It was a signal.","According to Babidi’s itinerary, it seemed he was preparing to meet Ruler Yun Zhi.","However, he encountered Tie Dan by chance.","Although Dylan was no match, he still displayed terrifying strength.","This news would probably reach the Ancient Moon God Clan.","Babidi’s intentions puzzled him.","Perhaps significant events would unfold in the not-so-distant future.","Jian Wushuang dared not ponder on it now.","What he needed to do was to become a Tribulation Realm expert.","Otherwise, not to mention saving the Qishen Temple, he might even perish himself.","The matter of the sword base had to be settled as soon as possible.","In the Heavenly Mansion Tianfu.","He took out some more origin stones and gave them to Li Ming’er before bidding farewell.","Originally, he had planned to inquire about the divine blacksmith, but upon second thought, this matter always revolved around Fan Tianfeng.","It was better to discuss it.","Contacting her was also simple.","Both of them were in the same country, and they could easily communicate using the tokens that Zhen Ling refined, as they were not far apart.","The Divine Kingdom of the Flame God was right next to the capital.","Jian Wushuang could directly communicate, and Fan Tianfeng would receive it.","Three days later.","He arrived at the busiest teahouse in the northern city, quietly waiting for Fan Tianfeng to appear.","The two had agreed to meet here,","But he didn’t know if Fan Tianfeng would show him this face.","“Her luck, why is it so good!” Jian Wushuang shook his head with a bitter smile.","If he were a descendant of a divine spirit, he would still be valued.","Then there wouldn’t be these kinds of things.","Just cultivating would be enough.","Opportunities would be brought to him.","This kind of good thing, unexpectedly encountered by Fan Tianfeng.","It’s frustrating to say it out loud.","So far, he had only encountered Fan Tianfeng.","He knew that Hu Qing was in the Ancient Moon Ruins. He had encountered Hu Qing’s clone.","But Hu Qing even advised him not to go to the Ancient Moon Ruins.","The more he said that, the more curious he became.","As for the others.","Originally, he didn’t think highly of them.","But seeing how well Fan Tianfeng was doing.","He didn’t dare to underestimate the others either.","Except for that unfortunate fellow Wu Zuo, their luck shouldn’t be too bad.","Thinking of Wu Zuo, at the distant edge of the Ancient Moon Spacetime, in a certain universe secret realm... He could not help but feel frustrated and furrowed his brow.","He was indeed very unlucky.","He had just reincarnated into the Ancient Moon Spacetime and ended up in a dangerous place.","But he unexpectedly obtained the inheritance of a great power within this danger.","Now he was in seclusion practicing.","Unfortunately, he couldn’t leave this secret realm.","Unless he became the Universe Master.","Speaking of bad luck, it was quite the unfortunate situation.","This secret realm was well-known throughout the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","“The Wu Hua Secret Realm!”","It was distant from the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands, quite remote indeed.","The ten individuals from the Qishen Temple each had their own fortunes and were continuously moving forward.","Among them, some were strong while others were weak.","But their luck was extraordinary.","Strong ones like Hu Qing, for instance, were directly trapped in the Ancient Moon ruins.","Forget about fortunes, they couldn’t even ensure their own safety.","Jian Wushuang didn’t fare much better.","On the other hand, among those with average strength were Wu Zuo and Fan Tianfeng.","These two individuals.","They were the peak existences of the Qishen era.","Being able to reach the Tribulation Realm was already considered good.","But since entering the Ancient Moon Spacetime, their realms and fortunes kept plummeting. In a vague sense, these two also became children of destiny.","Inside the teahouse, Jian Wushuang had many thoughts.","Recalling the Qishen Temple also brought thoughts of Mie Sheng.","For a moment, pressure surged.","And at this moment, a familiar aura descended, walking straight through the door.","It was Fan Tianfeng.","This time, she came alone, without any accompanying guards.","Jian Wushuang felt a bit surprised.","He had thought Fan Tianfeng would show off in front of him, but he didn’t expect her to be so low-key this time.","It was quite a good start.","“Please!”","Jian Wushuang turned from the window and sincerely invited Fan Tianfeng to take a seat.","Both of them sat down facing each other.","Before he could speak, Fan Tianfeng took the lead and said, “If there’s something, just say it!”","“So straightforward?” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel that the person in front of him was quite different from before."]},{"number":5765,"title":"Chapter 5765: Never Forgotten","paragraphs":["Chapter 5765: Never Forgotten","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s slightly skeptical gaze, Fan Tianfeng let out a cold laugh.","“You don’t think I really forgot where I came from, do you?” He lifted his teacup, took a sip, then explained, “This tea comes from a small country far from here. Strong individuals specifically pick it there, and despite its low price there, it holds high value in the Shi Kingdom. You’ll see when you pay!”","Tea might be expensive, but it still grows from the ground.","Just like Fan Tianfeng, whose status was now high.","All thanks to walking out of the Qishen Temple.","How could he forget?","“Good!” Jian Wushuang’s face brightened, then he continued, “Since you put it that way, I won’t hide it. I do need your help this time!”","Then he proceeded to explain about refining sword bases or blanks.","Along with that, he also disclosed matters concerning the Holy Assembly.","Since the other party was being so candid, he wouldn’t hold back either.","You treat me as your own, naturally, you’re one of us too.","Jian Wushuang saw through it all.","At this point, empathy was needed.","“The Wanliu Divine Tree!” Fan Tianfeng didn’t show much interest upon hearing it, then shook her head in response, “I’m not interested in that. I plan to seclude myself for a while. I’m confident about the Tribulation Realm, and becoming the Universe Master in a short time isn’t difficult. By then, I’ll bring back a group of strong individuals.”","Returning here, Jian Wushuang knew exactly where he was.","Initially, he had thought of trying to persuade her.","But seeing the other party’s firm attitude, he decided not to say anything more.","For now, it was best to go along with things when asking for favors.","“You don’t need to worry about alerting the enemy!” as if reading Jian Wushuang’s mind, Fan Tianfeng sneered, “This time I return, I bring with me experts of the Tribulation Realm. Even Patriarch’s clone will accompany me to Qishen Temple. That Mie Sheng is only a Half-Step Seventh Tribulation, even with Temporal Treasures like the Temple of World Annihilation, won’t be able to stop us!”","Temporal Treasure!","Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow.","It seemed that Fan Tianfeng also knew about the Temporal Treasures.","Things that even Ancient Moon Spacetime didn’t possess.","Those Temporal Treasures were probably brought out by Mie Sheng from the Higher Heavens.","And Mie Sheng came from the Starry Sky.","Thinking of this, the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard in Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source surged.","This treasure probably also came from the Starry Sky.","That would also explain why Xuan Yi was a powerful figure from the Starry Sky.","It all made sense now.","No wonder Fan Tianfeng was so eager to return.","Most likely, it was also to seize the Temporal Treasures.","Zhen Ling had warned Fan Tianfeng before that Qishen Temple ultimately belonged to her.","Zhen Ling almost said this to everyone.","This time, they took it seriously.","Fan Tianfeng led strong individuals to go.","Killing Mie Sheng was a small matter.","Snatching the Temporal Treasure was a big deal.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t have brought so many strong individuals.","Even the Flame God’s clone would go.","This Flame God, possessing top-notch power in the Eighth Tribulation.","The divine power avatar clone, as long as it’s well maintained and has sufficient divine power.","It’s no less powerful than the true body.","At the very least, it’s also the power of the Eighth Tribulation.","Maybe he could really eliminate Mie Sheng.","But if Mie Sheng were really eliminated, his cycle of spacetime would be over.","The Origin Source of the Starry Sky, the Samsara Spacetime.","This was the strongest path he could think of.","Once he mastered the Samsara, he was afraid he could break free from the Tribulation Realm.","And directly reach a higher level.","“No!” Jian Wushuang suddenly thought of Jiang Shang.","She also had the power of Life, although he didn’t know where it came from.","But she had a slightly weaker power of Life than him.","It shouldn’t be innate.","Even if it’s acquired, if Mie Sheng were to step back and devour Jiang Shang, he would be qualified to master the power of Samsara.","A backup plan!","Jiang Shang was a backup plan.","Mie Sheng was always steps ahead. How could he not foresee the coming changes?","This time, with Fan Tianfeng returning with strong allies, the odds of success were slim.","Thinking about it, Jian Wushuang decided not to dwell on it.","Advising the other party might just be interpreted as jealousy!","Whoever returned first and could defeat Mie Sheng would take control of several Temporal Treasures.","The temptation was irresistible.","These were treasures rumored throughout the Starry Sky.","Even the nine core spacetimes might not have them.","Jian Wushuang decided not to mention it.","He simply reminded to beware of Mie Sheng.","It was a courteous remark, after all.","“I have a recommendation letter here from the top divine craftsman of the Shi Kingdom, renowned not only in the Ancient Wood Continent but also across the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime. It should be enough for you to craft a sword!” Fan Tianfeng handed the letter to Jian Wushuang and added, “Don’t be too full of yourself. I simply think that Jueyun Sword of yours is too flashy!”","Jian Wushuang clicked his tongue.","He hadn’t even spoken yet.","But since she was so straightforward, he wouldn’t hold back either.","Carefully taking the recommendation letter, he stashed it away.","Besides this matter, he found there wasn’t much to talk about with the other party.","After exchanging a few pleasantries, Fan Tianfeng seemed reluctant to leave.","Watching her struggle to find the right words, Jian Wushuang seemed to understand.","The things he outwardly possessed were probably not of interest to the other party.","Only the Beast God Weapon could hold its own.","But it wasn’t suitable for Fan Tianfeng.","Candle Dragon, the Beast God, was of the element gold.","Fan Tianfeng, on the other hand, was a descendant of the Flame God.","He had seen the records of that Flame God divine spirit.","It looked like a nine-legged bird.","Anyway, it had nothing to do with the space of gold.","Apart from the Beast God Weapon, the only treasure he had on the surface was the Jueyun Sword.","Emperor Jueyun.","And the previous Fan Feng, they were also sisters.","It seemed the other party wanted the Jueyun Sword.","No wonder she was so polite when she came here.","When she heard about making a sword blank, she even directly recommended the best divine craftsman.","So it was all about that sword.","Jian Wushuang drew out the Jueyun Sword from behind.","Its Origin Source had been repaired by him, but the cracks were still there.","Seeing him draw the sword, Fan Tianfeng couldn’t help but look up.","Originally, she wanted to remain calm.","But seeing the cracks on the Jueyun , she stood up directly, angrily saying, “How did this sword break?”","“When I fought, it took a blow for me, and it broke!” Jian Wushuang’s tone was full of regret.","The Jueyun Sword had been with him for some time.","It could be said to have witnessed his process of becoming an Emperor.","It also assisted him in using the Starry Sky Chronicles.","His most powerful sword technique so far.","But now, he rarely used it.","Simply because the Jueyun Sword’s capacity was too weak.","Sword!","What a pity.","The wielder!","Even more so.","If Emperor Jueyun could be revived, she would be an extraordinary figure in this era.","The most powerful Emperor in the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime, that great High Priest.","He was on par with Emperor Jueyun.","But the original Emperor Jueyun was in a mediocre place like the Moro Spacetime.","If she had been in the Ancient Moon Spacetime or one of the Nine Great Spacetimes.","Her achievements wouldn’t have been weaker.","Seeing Fan Tianfeng so excited, Jian Wushuang was still somewhat uncomfortable.","The two were sisters, but also enemies.","Why did she care so much now?"]},{"number":5766,"title":"Chapter 5766 You Should Cherish It!","paragraphs":["5766 You Should Cherish It!","Feeling a bit unsettled, Fan Tianfeng’s expression changed slightly, her voice turning icy as she said, “Since you’ve obtained it, you should cherish it.”","Jian Wushuang didn’t argue this time; indeed, that was the case. But in that situation back then, he couldn’t possibly use his own body to resist the blood needles!","“I heard...” Jian Wushuang didn’t finish his sentence but handed over the Jucyun Sword.","His intention was clear. He knew the relationship between the two.","This sword could also be considered a family heirloom.","It should be returned to Fan Tianfeng.","Fan Tianfeng didn’t refuse. After taking the Jucyun Sword, she turned and left directly.","When she reached the threshold, she glanced sideways slightly and softened her voice, “In the Shi Kingdom, if you need help, you can contact me anytime!”","“No need to be polite!” Jian Wushuang replied loudly,","Watching her leave, he then took out the letter of recommendation, contemplating the matter of forging sword blanks.","These past few days, he had also received some news from the northern city.","The castern city of the royal capital.","Almost belonging to the influence of the Flame God Kingdom,","It was also the birthplace of the craftsmen and Forgemasters.","Previously, without a recommendation, he couldn’t go there.","But now he could go and take a look.","A casual visit to the eastern city.","Jian Wushuang arrived gracefully.","In comparison to the northern city, the cultivators here seemed like a world apart.","Here, it was akin to heaven.","On the main streets, one could hardly walk a few steps without encountering a Forgemaster clad in dark red robes.","Adorning their chests were badges of varying insignias.","The most common of forgemasters held the rank of ninth grade.","Immortal cultivators, or even Emperors, could easily step into their ranks.","To reach the eighth grade of Forgemaster required the strength of an Emperor, as without it, one couldn’t even master the tools.","The majority of Forgemasters seen on the streets were of the ninth and eighth grades.","After walking for quite some time, they reached the busiest street.","There, they spotted several seventh grade Forgemasters, as well as one of the sixth grade. The Zhu Rong Avenue.","The busiest street in the eastern city.","Ilere, there were at least a thousand shops opened by Forgemasters.","Each had its own banner flying high.","Forgemasters, almost cach one, had carved out their own territory.","To be able to open a shop on this street required being a Forgemaster of the sixth grade or higher,","In other words, within the entire capital city, there were thousands of Forgemasters of the sixth grade or higher.","Possibly even more.","This was because, from the information they had gathered, within the top-tier Forging Halls on this street alone, there were at least dozens of Forgemasters of the sixth grade or higher presiding.","The actual number was several times greater.","Thinking back to the days in the Qishen Temple, where even the goat-horned elder was a Forgemaster, probably of around the sixth grade.","However, he had already fallen.","Fallen in the spacetime of the Original Universe.","Unable to be resurrected.","In the beginning, it was already the final glance.","After a long exhale, he continued walking forward. The Forging Halls were split into A, B, C, and D.","Ile didn’t fancy it.","Even the top few shops of Grade A had only Grade B or lower Divine Forgemasters.","Fan Tianfeng recommended to him the number one Divine Forgemaster of the Ancient. Wood Continent.","It was a renowned brand.","Only one shop like this existed on the entire street.","The weakest Divine Forgemaster inside was at the sixth grade.","And even a sixth grade here could only do menial tasks.","Outer disciples started from the fourth grade.","Inner disciples generally started from the third grade, or even the second grade.","Only when reaching the first grade could one become a direct disciple.","In the entire Shi Kingdom there wines only a few first grades","Almost all were disciples of this great master.","Even the master called Jiu was a disciple of this presence.","And he was only an inner disciple, not a direct one.","This great master had only three direct disciples.","Rumor had it that each of them was in the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Seventh Tribulation realm experts!","Even the master forger was in the Seventh Tribulation realm.","To make peers bow down in admiration, one could imagine.","How attractive this heritage was.","But. Jian Wushuang was no longer interested in forging.","“Here it is!” Jian Wushuang glanced up and prepared to step inside.","Just then, he heard a familiar voice.","And a very familiar aura.","Jian Wushuang turned to look, seeing a rustic girl, followed by a group of smiths, pouting at the back. From a distance, they didn’t seem to belong together.","But he could tell there was","connection,","Initially not intending to pay attention, as he listened carefully, he understood everything.","He hadn’t expected this stingy girl to be so generous at this moment.","“Sure, this is two billion universe crystals. I knew we could gather them!” Li Ming’er","exclaimed, her eyes shining brightly.","One of the young Emperors who had strayed from the group looked at her with surprise,","quickly asking where she got them from.","But seeing the strange explanation from the girl, he didn’t inquire further and just took","them directly.","Without any politeness.","Freeloading to this extent made Jian Wushuang somewhat uncomfortable.","“Minger, I’m really grateful to you this time. I need these universe crystals to accompany my","master to the Lu Shen Temple for study!” The young man’s cultivation was profound, and he spoke without a hint of embarrassment.","Li Ming’er smiled and said, “It’s nothing. I’ll just ask for more when I meet another senior in","the future!”","The young man touched the medal on his chest, the number indicating eighth rank.","He was an Emperor.","But Li Ming’er was merely an Immortal.","Jian Wushuang frowned. Even when he was enjoying the hospitality of Yue Kingdom, he","wasn’t this presumptuous.","This kid could lie without batting an eyelid.","If Elder Tonghe found out, he would surely be punished severely.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t intervene directly in such matters.","He made a mental note to deal with it later when the opportunity arose.","“Dear Guest, please wait!”","Jian Wushuang was about to enter the grand hall with the divine emblem,","He was stopped by a man in a purple robe.","There was a symbol of fifth rank on his chest.","But even inside the temple, he was just a low-ranking guard.","Jian Wushuang didn’t say much, just stopped and handed over the letter of","recommendation.","The man, upon seeing the emblem of the Flame Spirit, paused, then his expression turned","Lo surprise.","He couldn’t discern Jian Wushuang’s cultivation level, but he saw the letter of","recommendation.","In his heart, he was convinced that Jian Wushuang was definitely someone important.","“Senior, please follow me!” The man in purple robe hastily called out, leading Jian Wushuang","to a resting place, then he himself went towards the depths of the temple with the letter of","recommendation.","The temple only had one visible layer on the surface.","But underground, there were several levels.","Menial workers only had access to the first three levels.","The fourth underground level was off-limits. When the purple-robed youth reached the entrance to the fourth level and handed the letter to an inner disciple, he returned to the","main hall.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, sat quietly in a high position, savoring the finest tea.","The guy who had just deceived Li Ming’er outside was now following several sixth-grade","Divine Forger into this place.","However, they didn’t even have a place to sit; they just stood in a corner against the wall.","The lead elder seemed to be the master who had deceived Li Ming’er.","Jian Wushuang’s gaze remained fixed on that person,","Thinking about how to teach him a lesson.","The source stones he had given to her were now wasted in a scam by the other party.","It was despicable.","A crime worthy of death."]},{"number":5767,"title":"Chapter 5767 You Can’t Live off Women","paragraphs":["5767 You Can’t Live off Women","An Imperial Emperor was not good at learning.","Learn to live off a woman.","How despicable.","The purple-robed young man who had gone to report to the higher-ups jogged to Jian Wushuang’s side and found him staring at a group of people at the corner of the wall.","Ile thought that Jian Wushuang was annoyed. I le hurriedly scolded, “Who brought these people here? Send them away quickly. Can’t you see that there are honored guests here?” His tone was completely different from when he spoke to Jian Wushuang.","He was like a strict and cold Divine Forger.","Hearing the purple-robed young man’s words.","A few grade 6 handymen hurriedly apologized and then walked toward the group of people angrily.","Jian Wushuang stood up and interrupted him. “Forget it. These people are fated with me. Let them stay!”","When the purple-robed youth heard this, his expression changed drastically. He squeezed out an amiable smile.","“Since they are Senior’s friends, then bring them to the first level to observe!”","“But there are still people queuing up ahead!” A servant who had just joined the temple was a little stubborn and interrupted the purple-robed youth.","“What?” The purple-robed youth’s expression changed.” Then chase them away. Don’t let these small fries in the future”","“This!” The grade 6 servant was a little hesitant.","“Ilurry up and go!” The purple-robed young man felt that his dignity was somewhat ineffective and immediately shouted.","The people in the corner were so frightened that their faces trembled.","“You guys, wait a moment. After the people on the first level are cleared, you will be allowed to go and observe. There is tea here. Help yourselves!” The purple-robed youth forced a smile and waved at everyone.","Jian Wushuang was shocked!","The people who welcomed and sent him off were really different!","Her expression changed faster than the sky.","“Senior, the elder sent a message saying that he wants to bring you to the ninth level!” The purple-robed young man bowed and said carefully.","This fifth-grade and above Divine Forgemaster was at least a Universe Master in the Third Tribulation realm.","He was actually so humble.","Didn’t they say that all Divine Forgemasters were arrogant?","So that set was for the weak,","Ilis strength was something that the other party could not see through.","He must have thought that he was a powerful Universe Master.","In addition, the recommendation letter came from the Fire God.","This was the top of the Shi Kingdom.","Who would dare to be careless?!","“Lead the way!” Jian Wushuang stood up with his hands behind his back.","He had also experienced the treatment of a powerful existence.","As he walked past the few Divine Forgers who came to observe, Jian Wushuang glanced at the young man who had deceived Li Ming’er,","Then, he followed the purple-robed youth into the underground Forging Hall.","After he left.","Only then did the people in the corner heave a sigh of relief.","“Who is that senior just now? How could a fifth-grade and above Divine Forgemaster of the Divine Hall be so respectful to him? Could he be a universe master at the Fifth Tribulation realm?”","“I don’t think so. Even a Universe Master in the Fifth Tribulation doesn’t need to be treated like this by the people of the Divine Temple. Maybe he’s a prodigy from some big force!” The young man who had deceived Li Ming ‘er recalled Jian Wushuang’s gaze and secretly vowed to become such a person in the future.","However, if he didn’t stop, a person like Jian Wushuang would be sent to meet the Celestial Maiden of Ancient Moon Spacetime.","After entering the underground hall, Jian Wushuang realized that the structure and density of the ground were the same as at Fallen Phoenix Valley.","Each level here was 100,000 feet tall.","Entering the third level was his limit.","However, there were nine floors here.","The first three levels were only for outer sect disciples.","After the fourth level, they would become inner disciples.","The seventh level only had personal disciples.","The eighth level, apart from a certain powerful existence, no one else could enter.","This time, he was going to enter the ninth level.","That was 900,000 feet below the capital.","It was naturally impossible for the entire Imperial City to have such a mystery.","Just by being able to develop to a depth of 900,000 feet.","It was likely that this place had been opened up by the Flame God.","Only an Eighth Tribulation expert could develop so deeply.","When he reached the fourth level, another woman led him.","He hadn’t sensed anything from the first three levels.","However, after reaching the fourth level, he felt a burning sensation.","As a result, the Divine Forgerss here were all wearing very cool clothes.","For example, the Divine Forger who guided him.","There were only a few pieces of cloth on his upper body.","It didn’t look big, and it was made of a special material. It should be used to avoid the heat.","All the treasures refined here were Universe Treasures, so the flames required were","naturally very powerful.","It was normal to wear less.","This place could be considered an important place in the Divine Temple.","Jian Wushuang avoided looking around.","Instead, he stared at the woman leading the way.","Although it was not very elegant, he had no choice but to respect the Temple.","“Senior, there will be a senior brother leading you to the seventh floor. I will send you here.","When you return, there will be a senior brother here to receive you!”","Jian Wushuang coughed and thanked him.","He followed the third guide.","The seventh level didn’t have that scorching feeling. Instead, it felt a little cool.","And there was no one there.","He looked around and saw that there were some closed secret chambers.","The place they passed by was only a narrow path,","Entrance to the eighth level.","No one received him.","“Fellow Daoist, this is all I can do. After you enter, just keep walking forward and you’ll see","the entrance to the ninth level!”","“Thank you so much!” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands.","This was a personal disciple.","A Seventh Tribulation expert.","Even though he wasn’t a Universe Master, he was still an incredible existence.","Naturally, he had to be polite.","After thanking the personal disciple, he walked straight to the eighth level.","After entering, he realized that it was a completely sealed space.","“Keep walking?” Ile felt a little cheated.","There was no path here.","How could he keep walking?!","It was endless darkness at the end.","Just as he was at a loss, the sound of metal colliding rang out around him.","Jian Wushuang looked in the direction of the voice.","A pair of red eyes appeared in the darkness.","Buzz!","The pair of red eyes let out a buzzing sound, and then countless red eyeballs appeared in","the area.","Jian Wushuang was also shocked.","He felt that he had been deceived by Fan Tianfeng.","The other party was still so petty.","The owners of these red eyes were demonic beast puppets.","Each of them had the power of a Universe Master.","They were at least a Universe Master at the peak of the Third Tribulation realm.","This combat strength was not weak.","Each puppet had close to 300,000 divine power.","If it wasn’t for his unique Origin Source, he wouldn’t have been able to sense the divine","power of the puppet.","“They won’t attack me, right?” Jian Wushuang laughed at himself.","There were at least 8,000 puppets here.","It would be bad if they surrounded him.","Ilowever, just as he thought of this...","Those puppets seemed to have gone crazy as they charged at him.","Their divine power was about the same as his, about 300,000.","But the material was special!","The material of each puppet could withstand more than 400,000 attacks.","Jian Wushuang had tested it himself."]},{"number":5768,"title":"Chapter 5768 Puppets","paragraphs":["5768 Puppets","Because just now he unleashed a punch with 400,000 divine power, hitting the puppet, only","to see it being pushed back, unable to cause any damage.","Moreover, he also discovered that there were inscriptions within the space here.","Equivalent to those on the puppet.","That means these puppets can form battle formations.","Under normal circumstances, he quickly found himself unable to withstand it.","If another battle formation is deployed, it would become even more difficult for him.","“Beast God’s power!”","A dark red aura erupted from him, instantly reaching 500,000 divine power.","The surrounding aura was enough to push back those puppets.","“Tsk tsk!” Jian Wushuang felt confident.","He didn’t believe that. Fantian Feng would really make a move against him,","Most likely, it was to settle the score from Yue Kingdom.","Take the opportunity to give him a lesson.","Sure enough, it was as he had expected.","On the ninth floor, there was an old man with white beard sitting on a throne, holding a small ball in his hand.","Although it looked like an inconspicuous little ball, it was a treasure capable of shaking the entire Ancient Wood Continent.","Because this little ball could manipulate the puppets on the eighth floor.","The eighth floor had a total of 9,000 puppets with 300,000 divine power each.","And 900 puppets with 500,000 divine power.","From bottom to top.","There were 90 puppets with 700,000 divine power.","9 puppets with a million divine power.","A total of 9999 puppets.","These puppets, just placed there, possessed the power of Seven Tribulation realm,","If they formed a battle formation, it wouldn’t be an exaggeration to say they rivaled Eight Tribulation realm experts.","At least they had the power of a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation.","This could indeed shake the entire Ancient Wood Continent.","“This little guy is interesting!” The old man held the small ball and had already begun to mobilize the 900 puppets with 500,000 divine power.","When he received the letter of recommendation, he was quite surprised. It was from his teacher.","Only after reading its contents did he realize whose intention it carried.","This young master was remarkable, even the Flame God paid great attention to him,","Since he had sought his help, it was only natural to lend a hand.","Mainly because Fan Tianfeng held the secret of the Temporal Treasure.","The old man was also curious about the Temporal Treasure and wished to observe it firsthand.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have teased Jian Wushuang.","Even though Fan Tianfeng’s status was special, he couldn’t directly command a Seventh Tribulation realm powerhouse.","Moreover, the identity of this old man was that of the number one Divine Forgemaster in the Ancient Wood Continent.","“Lian Xing!”","The number one Divine Forgemaster of the Ancient Wood Continent.","His status was comparable to that of an Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouse.","Even Eighth Tribulation experts treated him with respect.","Moreover, his strength was extraordinary. Ile had once severely injured a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation.","The treasures he possessed, just the ones known publicly, all held the power of the Eighth Tribulation.","In the entire Ancient Wood Continent, he could be ranked among the top five super experts.","The first spot was hard to determine.","Although the Flame God was formidable and didn’t rely on the power of Life, when facing the ancient Divine Wood King, he wasn’t very confident.","He could spar and win.","But in a life-and-death struggle, it was different. Who knew what cards the ancient Divine Wood King still held.","These two Eighth Tribulation realm experts were naturally the strongest in the Ancient Wood Continent.","Behind them was Marquis Tie Dan.","Titled powerhouses were generally at the same limit as their peers.","The top three, whether in origin or strength, were extraordinary,","For Master Lian Xing to rank among the top five was also quite remarkable.","After all, he was not a Universe Master.","“Wow, what formidable strength!” Lian Xing, one of the top five powers in the Ancient Wood Continent, marveled at Jian Wushuang, who was surrounded by attackers, with a look of","astonishment on his face.","Merely sensing it, he could perceive an infinite power within Jian Wushuang.","This was partly due to his own eyes, augmented by a precious treasure, or else he wouldn’t","be able to discern Jian Wushuang’s true strength.","That boundless power was the aspiration of many.","Jian Wushuang, an Emperor, was surrounded by a group of 300,000 puppet forces, yet he remained composed. Even Lian Xing couldn’t help but be amazed.","“I’d like to see how strong your limits are!” Lian Xing pointed a finger, and within the dark chamber, a large batch of puppets was revived once again.","At this moment, although Jian Wushuang in the chamber remained calm and his strength hadn’t diminished, his Thought power had begun to decline.","With the decline of Thought power, his power of All Things and Life powers would weaken.","Boom!","The formless sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand flew out, transforming into countless sword auras that pushed back the puppets once again surrounding him.","“Senior, if you want to test me, why not do it in one go? Save some divine power for","yourself, after all, I am just an Emperor.”","Jian Wushuang stood with hands behind his back, composed, but his last sentence was exceptionally loud.","In reality, he had no assurance whatsoever.","With so many puppets continuously attacking him, how could he endure?","It would be better to be straightforward and talk directly with whichever Divine","Forgemaster was in charge.","Ile didn’t believe the other party couldn’t see that he was just an Emperor.","Even Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation realm could discern it.","Though the Scattered Tribulation of the Seventh Tribulation lacked the Origin Source of","the universe, their vision should still be intact, right?","Just treat him as a Tribulation Realm cultivator.","They didn’t need to go so far in a test for an Emperor.","No need for such formality.","Of course, he couldn’t say it was Fan Tianfeng’s personal vendetta.","In reality, Fan Tianfeng didn’t have such intentions either.","It’s just that his strength aroused some curiosity about refining stars.","As soon as Jian Wushuang finished speaking...","In the silent darkness, a pair of huge red eyes ignited, much larger than those of the","puppets.","Then, a human face appeared.","The puppets who were about to attack Jian Wushuang stopped in their tracks. “Kid, your mouth is as sharp as your strength!” Lian Xing didn’t get angry at Jian Wushuang’s little scheme just now; instead, he seemed somewhat impressed, with a sense of favoritism","towards a promising junior.","Jian Wushuang quickly clasped his fists in salute and said, “Junior doesn’t dare!” “Haha, no need to be so formal. Since you’re recommended by the Young Master, you’re one","of us!” Lian Xing chuckled. “But wanting me to refine a sword blank for you isn’t that casy!”","This statement twisted something inside Jian Wushuang, but his expression remained","unchanged.","“Senior, feel free to ask!”","Lian Xing said indifferently, “You don’t need to be nervous. Regardless, I will refine a sword","blank for you, but the blanks of Universe Treasures vary in quality. Even if the Young Master recommended you, and I agreed to this request, I haven’t promised to refine the strongest sword blank for you. Do you understand?”","“Junior understands!” Jian Wushuang’s attitude became more respectful this time.","A sword blank!","Of course, he wanted the strongest one.","Ordinary goods simply didn’t catch his eye.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have gone to such lengths and even had to ask Fan Tianfeng.","If he could get Lian Xing to fully refine a sword blank tailored to his own Sword Dao, it","would naturally be the best.","“Now that you understand, let me be frank. I have high hopes for you, whether it’s your strength or your character, you have the potential to become a top-tier powerhouse. I can see you reaching the Sixth Tribulation Universe Master in the future!” Lian Xing’s words","were bold.","Sixth Tribulation Universe Master.","Jian Wushuang naturally felt confident.","But to have others evaluate him.","Even though he was so outstanding now, it was difficult to stand out among the Emperors."]},{"number":5769,"title":"Chapter 5769 Battle of Limits (1)","paragraphs":["5769 Battle of Limits (1)","The Tribulation Realm was fundamentally different from the Emperor, much like the Emperor was to the Dao Lord.","The Emperor was free from any Heavenly Dao constraints and external pressures.","But the Tribulation Realm was different.","Not only did one need to undergo tribulation, but also maintain one’s own universe.","As for maintaining the universe, he didn’t fully understand it yet.","But undergoing tribulation?","He was acutely aware of how brutal it could be.","Otherwise, there wouldn’t be so many Scattered Tribulations across the Ancient Wood Continent.","With so many sects in the seven star sect, almost all still had experts at the Seven Tribulation.","Yet, the Universe Masters at the Seven Tribulation Realm were scarcely enough to count on one hand.","The first five tribulations were manageable.","But beyond the Sixth Tribulation, it became incredibly difficult.","Who knew how many prodigies had been trapped?","Although Jian Wushuang was confident, he understood this point clearly.","As for others’ evaluations, he wasn’t as confident as himself.","For someone like Lian Xing to acknowledge his chance of reaching the Sixth Tribulation was already highly regarded.","How many Sixth Tribulation were there in the entire Ancient Wood Continent?","Probably not more than double digits.","Lian Xing’s eyes flickered as he continued, “IIere’s the deal. I have a puppet here, at the peak of the Fifth Tribulation. But it requires a constant supply of divine power. If infused with a million units of divine power, it can reach a Half-Step Sixth Tribulation strength!” “I luh?” Jian Wushuang was momentarily stunned. A IIalf-Step Sixth Tribulation with a million divine power. Neither seemed like something he could contend with!","“I laha, although I have high hopes for you, I don’t think you can unleash such power!” Lian Xing understood Jian Wushuang’s misunderstanding and explained, “Initially, I’ll infuse it with 500,000 divine power internally. If you defeat it, you’ll receive a Heaven-ranked sword blank, While not particularly precious for the Tribulation Realm, there are no more than five individuals outside who can refine a Heaven-tier sword blank!”","Jian Wushuang listened attentively, his heart filled with anticipation.","A puppet with 500.000 divine power wasn’t something he could easily deal with at his","current level; that would be presumptuous to think.","But defeating it? That wasn’t a problem at all.","With just the amplification from the Beast God’s power alone, he could prevail.","It was definitely not a problem.","The Heaven-tier sword blank.","It was the future treasure of the Heaven-tier Universe Treasure.","Capable of growing to the Seventh Tribulation.","Most ambitious geniuses sought their family’s assistance to invite a Divine Craftsman to refine a Heaven-tier treasure blank, becoming their universe’s Origin Source divine weapon. The classification of Universal Treasures differed from ordinary treasures.","There are Treasures, Innate Treasures, and Eternal Treasures,","They were classified as ordinary, superior, peak, and complete.","But Universe Treasures are different.","They are classified by tier.","The weakest is the Human-tier Universe Treasure.","Within one’s own Origin Source universe, it can only develop up to the Third Tribulation.","It is also the weakest type of Universe Treasure.","This is because most Tribulation Realms cannot become Universe Masters.","Human-tier Universe Treasures are also the easiest to refine, even wandering cultivators have the ability to purchase such treasure blanks.","Above the Human-tier is the Earth-tier.","Earth-tier Universe Treasures can develop up to the Fifth Tribulation.","But to refine them, one needs a Divine Forgemaster of at least the fourth grade, which is generally inaccessible to ordinary people.","Of course, if there are enough universe crystals, they can be bought in some shops.","These are treasures that one can obtain with money.","They can’t be considered too precious.","Above the Earth tier was the Heaven-tier.","Heaven-tier Universe Treasures cannot be bought with money alone.","One also needs background and connections.","The upper limit is the Seventh Tribulation.","For most people, the pursuit ends at the Seventh Tribulation.","If, during the mundane period, one smoothly ascends to become an Immortal, harboring","grand ambitions.","Wanting to reach the peak.","In their eyes, Emperor, Tribulation Realm might not mean much.","But on the path of the strong, there are setbacks everywhere.","Jian Wushuang pondered deeply within himself, questioning whether his journey had truly","been smooth sailing.","With a bitter smile, he shook his head.","It’s only through experiencing setbacks that one truly comes to understand oneself.","In the mundane realm, during the smooth times, he had ambitions as vast as the heavens.","But without a clear goal, ambition becomes boundless.","However, upon reaching the Immortal Realm, even maintaining one’s Dao Heart might prove difficult.","Ultimately, becoming an Emperor was a threshold.","Only then would one realize that achieving such a status was already commendable.","Even after becoming an Emperor, the resources for cultivation often required one’s own efforts, demanding immense courage.","Divine artifacts were common in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, but elevating one’s divine power to the level of a complete Emperor was no easy feat.","Even descendants of prestigious clans had to strive on their own.","Family geniuses relied on their own potential and perseverance to earn the assistance of their clans. Not every scion had access to boundless resources.","To aspire to become the Universe Master, one needed not only divine power but also mastery of the fundamental realm,","Without achieving perfection in space, how could one hope to grasp the universe?","This was not merely a matter of resources. It depended on innate talent and personal cultivation. Families couldn’t offer assistance in this regard.","For most, the journey might end at the level of Emperor.","To become a Tribulation Realm expert or even the Universe Master required facing the vicissitudes of the world, toughening the mind long ago and setting the lofty goal of reaching the Seventh Tribulation.","Heaven-tier Universe Treasures.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, feeling a sense of satisfaction wash over him","momentarily.","But thoughts of Qishen Temple, the Original Universe, and the world he had once called home during his mortal days crept into his mind, causing him some hesitation, For others, reaching the Seventh Tribulation was a monumental goal, but for him, it fell","short. It wasn’t just about the limits; the crucial factor was the blessing of the universe. The reason why the Universe Treasure of Heaven-tier was dubbed as such lay in its ability","to harness the power of one’s own universe.","It was crucial for future combat prowess.","It had to be the strongest. Above the Heaven-tier lay the Divine-tier, a realm untouched by anyone.","The Universe Treasures of the Eighth Tribulation realm experts were all of Divine-tier","caliber.","Many strong individuals believed that the limit of the Divine-tier might even surpass the Universe Treasures, possibly reaching the Ninth Tribulation.","As Jian Wushuang pondered this, he began to speculate.","Although the Ancient Moon Spacetime was more formidable than the former Moro","Spacetime, it lacked a Temporal Treasure.","Otherwise, it wouldn’t be unaware of the existence of such a treasure.","The reason why the Moro Spacetime possessed a Temporal Treasure was also due to the","existence of Mic Sheng back then.","From Babidi, he learned that Mie Sheng hailed from the Starry Sky. It was highly likely that. Shen Ling of the Moro Spacetime were brought by Mic Sheng.","The Temporal Treasures inside were probably all acquired by Mie Sheng from the Starry","Sky.","Temporal Treasures transcended the universe. Among the nine great spacetimes, perhaps only those three ancient beings possessed such treasures.","As for the Ancient Moon Spacetime, it was highly probable that they didn’t have one.","Even the top existence like Lian Xing didn’t know about the Temporal Treasures. Even if","they did exist, they probably hadn’t surfaced yet.","The Skysight Heavenly Chessboard within him was one such Temporal Treasure.","Now, he had just begun to grasp some clues.","Some of the innate chess pieces contained within were already extraordinary, and now he","had touched upon the General Armor.","Relying solely on the special properties of the General Armor, it was no less impressive than","the Divine Beast Weapon.","Such extraordinary treasures required careful handling in the future.","They must not be discovered by others.","Once noticed by some powerful beings, it would spell disaster."]},{"number":5770,"title":"Chapter 5770 Battle of Limits (2)","paragraphs":["5770 Battle of Limits (2)","Whew!","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, maintaining his composure as he said, “Senior, with your","skill, you should be able to refine a Divine-tier Sword Embryo!”","His request was significant.","The upper limit of Heaven-tier was simply insufficient for him.","If he couldn’t even surpass the Seventh Tribulation realm, he might as well be dead.","For him, the Seventh Tribulation could only barely sustain himself.","The threat from Mic Sheng was not that simple.","Originally, he thought the Seventh Tribulation might suffice.","But from the beginning until now, after learning about Mie Sheng’s origins, he felt that the other party’s request might not be so simple.","Naturally, the strength was even more complicated.","If Mic Sheng was just a Half-Step Seventh Tribulation powerhouse from Moro Spacetime.","Even now, as a Universe Master, he wouldn’t worry,","With his strength, he didn’t need to reach the Seventh Tribulation. Even a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation could easily deal with Mie Sheng.","But the other party’s origins were too significant.","Coming from the Starry Sky.","That was a place everyone yearned for but couldn’t enter.","It’s not easy to come out, and it’s impossible to go in.","In Ancient Moon Spacetime, he had not yet found any records of the Starry Sky. Perhaps his current strength was insufficient to see information about the Starry Sky. Or perhaps, the strong from the Nine Great Spacetimes couldn’t enter the Starry Sky. The Starry Sky was still somewhat distant to him.","For now, becoming a Tribulation Realm was the priority.","After hearing his words, Lian Xing raised his eyebrows slightly, his expression somewhat surprised but not overly so.","“A Divine-tier Sword Embryo is not something you can encounter at will. It’s not related to my forging technique, but to the owner of the Sword Embryo. In any case, it’s very complicated!”","Jian Wushuang listened in a haze of confusion, wanting to ask further questions but being interrupted by the other party.","“You better defeat that puppet first. If you manage to defeat it, more will be added one","after another. The second round will have two puppets with 500,000 divine power each, and the third round will have four. If you can reach the fifth round, then we can talk about the Divine-tier sword blank or sword mold!” Lian Xing finished speaking and then dispersed his giant head.","In the depths of the underground chamber,","Lian Xing’s true body sat slanted on a chair, his eyes slightly narrowed. In front of him floated a crystal ball, displaying the image of Jian Wushuang.","“This kid has quite the ambition, daring to think about the Divine-tier sword mold!” Lian Xing shook his head.","He recalled the complexity of creating Divine-tier molds, which was no less than crafting an entire universe.","The most crucial point was the immense cost involved.","It required too many precious treasures.","In his view, Jian Wushuang, as an Emperor, simply couldn’t afford it.","He couldn’t possibly let Jian Wushuang provide the materials himself!","To lend a hand meant providing both effort and materials.","He wasn’t Jian Wushuang’s father, so there was no reason for him to do so.","If Jian Wushuang could make it to the fifth round, then he would consider it.","Otherwise, even if he had high hopes, he wouldn’t help Jian Wushuang like this anymore.","Throughout endless ages, he had seen too many promising juniors.","At best, Jian Wushuang could rank in the top three.","Among Emperors, Jian Wushuang might be the most promising one he had seen.","But among the Universe Masters, it was different.","Initially, he had even seen potential in a Fifth Tribulation Universe Master.","Talent could be said to have crowned the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","After cultivating for an era, he broke through to become the Universe Master.","In just ten eras, he became the Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation.","But then!","The Sixth Tribulation couldn’t be overcome.","The first five tribulations had been too smooth.","Coupled with the immense power of the Origin Source of the universe and ample divine power, he could withstand cach tribulation head-on.","By the fifth tribulation, the prodigy thought he could still resist, but the Heavenly Dao delivered a harsh slap.","Sometimes, being too defiant isn’t good.","Tribulations arise naturally.","The tribulation that grows in the depths of the heart is the most terrifying.","His gaze shifted to the crystal ball,","Ile waited quietly for Jian Wushuang’s eruption.","Inside the pitch-black chamber,","Jian Wushuang held his sword with one hand.","The formless sword, forged by the power of the Starry Sky, was no less powerful than the","Jueyun Sword.","“The fifth round!” Jian Wushuang didn’t have much confidence in his heart.","The first round was one puppet.","Each round doubled.","Fifth round, 16 puppets.","Each with 500,000 divine power.","Equivalent to 16 Fifth Tribulation powerhouses.","Although he had numerous cards in hand now, he was still just an Emperor!","Under normal circumstances, an Emperor with 400,000 divine power might be the only one","in history.","But with greater power comes greater responsibility,","Ile had to fight!","The power of the Beast God could increase his divine power to 500,000.","He hadn’t mastered the Eternal Ancient Transformation yet.","If he could combine the power of the Starry Sky with divine power, That is, the fusion of Origin Source and divine body, this test wouldn’t be anything.","He had known it beforehand; he had gone into seclusion for a period of time. Without the improvement of the Eternal Ancient Transformation, even if he reached the peak state, he would only be comparable to a practitioner with 550,000 divine power.","Passing the second round was feasible, but there might not be much opportunity","afterwards.","In the normal state, for the first round, the Eternal Ancient Transformation needed to be","elevated to the peak state for the second round.","For the third round, he might have to reveal all his cards.","Ile still had the One Thought Universe and the Starry Sky Chronicles.","These two were useful against practitioners but not much against puppets.","The One Thought Universe was fine; it could amplify his own essence, but it couldn’t.","cunnrose hocquen it was dealing not with practitioners but with nunnote","As he calculated his combat power in his mind, the puppet had already started to move.","Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth, unable to care about much else.","He could just use the armor again if necessary.","Reaching the ultimate limit of 600,000 divine power.","He didn’t believe it.","Every time, he broke through under the greatest pressure.","This time, he hoped he could break through again.","Jian Wushuang directly withdrew the formless sword.","He went to meet it bare-handed.","The collision of pure divine power reverberated through the secret room.","This puppet was different from the puppets here.","It should have been individually refined by Lian Xing.","Its appearance was also peculiar.","Smooth all over, without a single scam, its entire body was more symmetrical than humans.","Skin combined with white and purple, incredibly smooth.","Jian Wushuang’s fist struck the puppet’s face, and his figure almost couldn’t stand steady.","His punch did not weaken the puppet’s strength. On the contrary, when the opponent’s","punch hit his abdomen, his body quickly collapsed.","After all, he was still a practitioner.","He knew pain.","Fortunately, everything went as he had planned.","500,000 divine power was just right now.","He just wanted to test the puppet for now.","Next, it was time to exert himself,","Jian Wushuang smiled at the puppet, and stretched out his palm firmly. “Senior, I’m also","going to use 500,000 divine power now!”","“Ah!!!”","Jian Wushuang clenched his fists, and the aura on his body instantly turned red, with divine","power increasing by tens of thousands.","430,000!","460,000!","490,000!","Seeing this scene, there was a hint of surprise in Lian Xing’s eyes.","At the same time, he also saw the Beast God Weapon on Jian Wushuang.","He saw through it at a glance.","The complete form of the Beast. God Weapon.","A pair of crimson feather wings wrapped around a black inner armor.","To the left of the inner armor was a red left arm."]},{"number":5771,"title":"Chapter 5771 Battle of Limits (3)","paragraphs":["5771 Battle of Limits (3)","The crimson claw of the Candle Dragon stood out prominently.","Finally, there was a still-beating heart!","The Heart of the Beast God.","When Lian Xing looked over, he took a closer look.","Little did he know, he had already fallen into a giant eyeball.","It was the second core, the Eye of the Beast God.","“An innate prehistoric Universe Treasure!” Lian Xing was greatly surprised.","Ile didn’t expect Jian Wushuang to possess an innate Universe Treasure.","And it seemed that Jian Wushuang had not fully mastered this Universe Treasure.","Upon careful observation, he realized that this innate prehistoric Universe Treasure was the treasure of the Seventh Tribulation.","To fully unleash all its power, Jian Wushuang would need to be at least a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation.","Otherwise, it would be impossible to fully control it.","“Interesting!” Lian Xing found it more and more amusing.","He had initially thought that Jian Wushuang had used some forbidden technique to enhance his divine power.","Little did he know it was because of the prehistoric Universe Treasure.","This was genuine personal strength.","While ordinary people might think he relied on a prehistoric Universe Treasure, to a Divine Forgemaster like Lian Xing, an innate prehistoric Universe Treasure, especially one of the Seventh Tribulation, would be unable to unleash its full power even if it were given to someone of the Tribulation Realm.","Jian Wushuang, an Emperor, possessed the ability to activate the innate Universe Treasures, which truly represented his strength.","“Seems like the first two rounds went smoothly!” Lian Xing nodded, speaking to himself,","According to his plan, if Jian Wushuang could pass the first two rounds, he would personally finance the creation of a Heaven-tier sword blank for him.","If he could reach the third round, he would craft a top-grade I leaven-tier sword blank.","The fourth round would warrant a complete-stage Heaven-tier sword blank.","The fifth round!","He hadn’t decided yet.","If Jian Wushuang really made it through and insisted on the Divine-tier, he would consider","it.","But the materials wouldn’t come free.","Perhaps he would make Jian Wushuang pay a certain price.","In any case, the Divine-tier entailed too much; it wasn’t that easy.","It was usually the strong ones from the Eighth Tribulation who sought him out to refine the Divine-tier of sword blanks. Afterwards, those strong ones from the Eighth Tribulation nurtured them into Universe Treasures of the Eighth Tribulation,","Some of the universes of these strong ones in the Tribulation Realm had already perished into Scattered Tribulations, requiring them to seek the Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation to nurture them.","The cost for this was even greater.","Usually, it was the Universe Masters who came to him for crafting; Scattered Tribulations","were rare.","After all, the Scattered Tribulations of the Eighth Tribulation rarely engaged in battles, rendering the Universe Treasures useless.","But no matter how you looked at it, the treasures of the Divine-tier corresponded to those super-strong individuals in the Eighth Tribulation.","For Jian Wushuang, an Emperor, to seek him out for crafting, it seemed a bit like child’s play.","Lian Xing toyed with the sphere in his hand, continuing to observe.","Meanwhile, on Jian Wushuang’s side, his body was slightly bent, fists clenched tightly, veins bulging on his forehead.","The power within him reached its peak.","500,000 divine power!","“Hah!”","Jian Wushuang roared, his power stabilizing completely at 500,000.","A crimson flame enveloped his entire body, his eyes turning red.","The puppet, devoid of consciousness, regardless of Jian Wushuang’s surging power, charged once more.","This time, Jian Wushuang stood firm, merely raising two fingers. As the puppet rushed forward, the tips of his fingers erupted with a terrifying force, condensed from his divine","power.","The horrifying column of energy crashed directly into the puppet, pushing it out of Jian Wushuang’s sight and into the darkness.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang suddenly turned around.","The puppet emitted no aura, visible only to his naked eyes.","But the strength brought by that divine power was palpable.","In the instant he turned he saw the nunnet charging again","It transformed into a streak of light, intending to ram Jian Wushuang with its rounded head.","Yet Jian Wushuang showed no intention of dodging, instead reaching out with both hands to block the powerful impact.","Embracing the puppet’s head, he delivered a knee strike directly to its abdomen, causing a","large bulge to form behind the puppet.","That was the result of his knee strike.","Boom!","Without giving the puppet any time to adjust, Jian Wushuang followed up with a powerful elbow strike, then grabbed the puppet’s arm and tossed it into the air. A terrifying force gathered in his abdomen and erupted, hitting the puppet squarely.","In the instant the force erupted, Jian Wushuang soared into the air, his speed surpassing space itself, touching upon time.","His speed exceeded the power he unleashed. Just as the puppet was struck, he had already reached its side.","With a smirk, Jian Wushuang flashed behind the puppet, locking it from behind.","His own body transformed into a black hole.","A cosmic black hole.","A stream of black aura continuously emanated, enveloping the puppet before beginning to","devour it.","After a series of attacks, the puppet’s divine power had begun to wane.","This time, there was hardly any resistance to its devouring.","Bound and immobilized, the puppet’s divine power continued to diminish rapidly,","decreasing by a staggering 50,000 in no time.","Watching the spectacle, Lian Xing shook his head.","There was little hope left.","With a drop of 50,000 divine powers, the puppet was left with only 450,000 divine power,","while Jian Wushuang still possessed 500,000 divine power.","Although the difference was a mere 50,000 divine power, the gap in combat prowess was","immense.","500,000 divine power marked the threshold of the Fifth Tribulation, an insurmountable","chasm for those at the Fourth Tribulation.","The disparity was almost infinite.","Jian Wushuang felt he had toyed enough.","He loosened his grip, releasing the puppet.","Scizing its newfound freedom, the puppet paid no heed to its diminishing divine power and","swung a fist at Jian Wushuang’s face.","Thunk!","The fist collided with Jian Wushuang’s face, producing a metallic clank.","Jian Wushuang simply held his ground, absorbing the blow with his face as if it were a","breeze, devoid of any sensation.","Perhaps if the puppet had its peak divine power of 500,000, it could have pushed him back.","But with only 450,000 left, it posed no threat, incapable of inflicting any harm. With a casual tilt of his chin and a hand poised, Jian Wushuang directed a burst of energy towards the puppet’s face, instantly sending it plummeting into darkness.","That blow was more than sufficient to deal with it.","Indeed, after he repelled the puppet, two more appeared in the central area of the next","chamber.","They looked identical, with the same level of divine power, all fueled by Lian Xing’s energy.","This time, Jian Wushuang didn’t dare to let his guard down.","There were too many variables to consider in this battle. The two puppets didn’t immediately attack but instead observed Jian Wushuang closely.","Then, in an instant, the two puppets soared into the air at lightning speed, one following the other, stacking up as they descended upon Jian Wushuang.","Furrowing his brows, Jian Wushuang sensed a significant change with the appearance of the two puppets."]},{"number":5772,"title":"Chapter 5772 Battle of Limits (4)","paragraphs":["5772 Battle of Limits (4)","In the first round, when only one puppet appeared, there was hardly any need for coordination; it simply launched into battle.","But when two puppets emerged, they surprisingly employed tactics.","It was a tactical coordination between the two.","This time, Jian Wushuang felt a bit flustered.","Not to say he was in dire straits, but he found himself in a tough fight.","Before they got close, the two puppets instantly separated.","From Jian Wushuang’s perspective, he only saw one puppet charging towards him.","The coordination between the two puppets, one in front and one behind, was seamless.","In a true life-or-death struggle, the coordination between these two puppets would surpass that of cultivators.","As the two puppets appeared before him, they split apart in an instant, closing in from both sides.","He could only deal with them using both hands.","Dealing with two puppets was not just twice as difficult.","Boom!","Jian Wushuang gathered his aura and directly repelled the attack.","“Beast God Domain!” Jian Wushuang muttered softly.","A surge of red aura swept over.","In an instant, it turned the tide of battle.","Although the range of the Beast God’s power was small, it precisely corresponded to the space here.","At the same time, his divine power was also amplified.","But the amplification wasn’t very significant.","However, there was one advantage; wielding twice the power of the Beast God wasn’t as","strenuous.","Although he had been handling it with ease before, now, with the weakening effect, it became almost negligible to him.","There was no pressure whatsoever.","Ilis attacks became even more fierce in an instant.","They were no longer as cumbersome as before.","Whoosh!","Swiftly, he struck!","Since the start of the confrontation, Jian Wushuang and the two puppets had been locked in a triangular formation.","The distance between Jian Wushuang and the puppets was much greater than the distance between the two puppets.","Breaking through individually was completely impossible.","His speed was only slightly faster than the puppets.","If he focused on one puppet, the other could instantly catch up.","Because the distance between him and the opponent was always far greater than the distance between the two puppets.","“I need to figure out a way to trap one of them!” Jian Wushuang pondered tactics in his mind.","The puppets coordinated perfectly with each other, but Jian Wushuang had his own tactics.","He wasn’t just some inexperienced kid.","Combat talent wasn’t something innate.","As soon as the thought crossed Jian Wushuang’s mind, he became alert.","His body began to retreat instinctively.","Eventually, he disappeared into the darkness.","Both puppets paused for a moment, then steadily advanced.","Their speed wasn’t particularly fast.","They were also wary of Jian Wushuang’s potential deceit.","Once Jian Wushuang entered the darkness, he indeed had his own tactics.","Ile concentrated power into his hands.","This time it wasn’t divine power.","It was the pure power of All Things.","This power came entirely from the Origin Source.","Ile couldn’t sense the puppets’ aura, but they could sense his position based on his Origin Source.","In the darkness, Jian Wushuang surrounded himself with two clusters of power formed by the convergence of All Things.","With a single hand, he pushed one cluster of the power of All Things, which instantly surged out of the darkness.","The two puppets dispersed to avoid it.","They kept their distance.","The power of this strike was considerable. Although the puppets lacked self-awareness, they possessed extremely advanced combat skills. Sensing the power, they immediately","dodged.","“Now’s the time!” Jian Wushuang’s figure flickered, seizing the moment when the two puppets were separated to strike out.","Watching the battle, Lian Xing sneered and muttered to himself, “A mere parlor trick!”","Sure enough, the next moment, just as Jian Wushuang was about to approach one of the","puppets, the two puppets closed in again.","This time, their burst of speed surpassed Jian Wushuang’s.","It seemed they could still unleash divine power.","Jian Wushuang witnessed the scene without a hint of surprise, instead revealing a victorious","gaze.","Swish!","Just as the two puppets were about to join forces and attack Jian Wushuang, they found him descending, leaving the puppets grasping at empty air.","But Jian Wushuang wasn’t idle this time.","In the instant his figure descended, a huge aura of All Things burst out from the darkness.","It directly hit the two puppets.","Its power was a hundred times greater than the first energy beam of All Things.","The divine power of the two puppets plummeted suddenly.","Jian Wushuang didn’t intend to give the opponents much time. Seizing the moment when","the puppets fell, he struck.","Attacking in a scattered manner.","With a punch, he condensed a divine power exceeding 500,000.","In a one-on-one battle, the puppets were no match for him.","In just a breath, he dealt with one puppet.","By the time the other puppet reacted, he had already freed up his hand.","Following the same routine, in the blink of an eye, he resolved the last puppet.","All of this took no more than three breaths.","Lian Xing, who was watching, swallowed hard.","His gaze completely changed.","Top-tier combat ability!","Invincible at the same level! Boundless potential!","The fusion of the three.","At this moment, Lian Xing had a feeling.","He felt that Jian Wushuang might be the one destined for this era.","The harbinger of the next great age.","A super powerhouse to pioneer the future era.","At first, he thought Jian Wushuang might just be a passing wave in this era.","But now, he realized he had underestimated him.","All beings were like water.","The major powers were those colossal ships.","The towering waves represented the Eight Tribulation realms.","Within those waves were the foamy crests, signifying the Seven Tribulation realms.","Now, he believed Jian Wushuang could become the Universe Master of the Seven","Tribulation.","As for the Eighth Tribulation, he didn’t dare to speculate.","That required some luck.","No one dared to assert anything about it.","At this moment, he even forgot to initiate the third round.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang in the secret chamber remained composed, adjusting his breath","while calmly waiting for his next opponent.","The tactics he just employed could only be used once; using them again would be","meaningless and ineffective.","Besides, he still had some hidden cards.","There was no need to stick to a single strategy repeatedly.","Doing so would diminish his creative ability and adaptability.","For Lian Xing, this was a test of Jian Wushuang.","For Jian Wushuang, it was not only a test but also a form of cultivation.","A rare opportunity for sparring.","Naturally, he had to seize it.","Concealing his divine power, Jian Wushuang concentrated divine power in both hands.","Four figures instantly appeared.","Five powerful forces intertwined.","The great battle resumed.","“Beast God Domain!” Jian Wushuang erupted the Beast God Domain once again, surrounding the surroundings","with crimson flames.","One against four puppets.","It was actually a bit simpler than he had imagined.","Two puppets could still take care of each other.","But with four puppets, there were some difficulties in coordination.","While battling these puppets, Jian Wushuang also noticed this.","He focused on attacking one puppet alone, aiming to defeat them one by one.","Any other puppet that approached him was blasted away by him.","For a while, the battle situation became increasingly favorable for Jian Wushuang,","But just then, those three puppets suddenly stopped moving.","Jian Wushuang’s speed also slowed down.","For a moment, he didn’t know what the opponent meant.","Swish!","The three puppets just glanced at Jian Wushuang and then retreated directly into the","darkness.","Jian Wushuang’s brow furrowed, and he looked down at the puppet that had been knocked","down, feeling a hint of unease in his heart!"]},{"number":5773,"title":"Chapter 5773 Battle of Limits (5)","paragraphs":["5773 Battle of Limits (5)","Sure enough, as expected, a powerful force was pouring out.","“Uh-oh!”","The puppet was about to self-destruct!","At this point, it was impossible to withdraw.","Jian Wushuang could only choose to confront it head-on.","The Candle Dragon Armor operated frantically, while the Candle Dragon Feathers enveloped his entire body.","A scorching wave of heat rushed in, followed by a terrifying burst of divine power. A self-destruct with 500,000 divine power.","This was no joking matter.","At the same level of divine power, one might even perish.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang had the Beast God Weapon.","He wouldn’t perish.","Confronting the divine power’s self-destruction head-on, Jian Wushuang’s Life power continued to restore itself.","Once the puppet finished self-destructing, only an empty shell remained.","It had lost all its power.","“Did they self-destruct on their own, or was someone controlling them?” Jian Wushuang pondered, lowering his head. He began to suspect whether some senior practitioner of Lian Xing was playing a prank on him.","Otherwise, why would the puppet self-destruct?","Too bad!","With his life force, even if his power was weakened, he could instantly recover.","It was truly useless against him.","It wasn’t Lian Xing’s intention either.","The puppet’s self-destruction was actually a tactic.","It was just unfortunate timing for Jian Wushuang to encounter the situation, and he didn’t follow through with the tactic to its end.","Any formidable opponent without vital life force would have fallen for that move.","It was precisely because Jian Wushuang possessed vital life force that he didn’t worry about the tactic at all, hence he had no defenses against it.","He thought he could easily secure victory by catching an isolated opponent off guard.","Moreover, battles with cultivators rarely involved self-destruction, unless in absolute","despair.","In situations like several cultivators of similar strength ganging up on one person, there was even less need for self-destruction.","Thus, Jian Wushuang didn’t have many defenses in place.","This was also something Lian Xing had foreseen.","Now, Jian Wushuang stood intact and unharmed, not even a hint of his strength diminished. “How did he withstand that?” Lian Xing’s eyes widened, staring at Jian Wushuang as if beholding a monster.","Then, he thought of the innate Universe Treasures.","But even so, Jian Wushuang shouldn’t have come out of it unscathed!","It wasn’t just him who was astonished.","The other three puppets emerging from the darkness also paused in bewilderment. Jian Wushuang himself began to wonder if he had been too ostentatious just now. After all, there was a top-level expert of the Seventh Tribulation staring at him! He had to give the other party some face.","He couldn’t afford to be too relaxed.","Otherwise, suspicions might arise.","Ilis trump card lay primarily in his vital Life power. While control over the power of All Things was also crucial, he hadn’t used much of it recently. Even if it were discovered, it wouldn’t matter much, as mastering the power of All Things wasn’t difficult for him.","The power of those who defy the heavens is something to behold.","As one reaches the Tribulation Realm, the reliance on the power of All Things diminishes.","Comparatively, the Origin Source of the universe condenses All Things.","Yet, the power of All Things was still needed.","The power of Life was the greatest reliance, something no one could master.","As for the power of the Starry Sky, it is the strongest force in battle, yet it remains undiscoverable.","To outsiders, this force appears no different from ordinary power.","Only those who wield it understand its true strength.","“Since that’s the case, let’s end this!” Jian Wushuang thought.","The second round should come to a close.","There’s no need to prolong this.","His power remains undiminished, sooner or later it will be suspected.","It’s better to end it quickly.","“Eternal Ancient Transformation!” Jian Wushuang roared in anger.","The aura around him instantly turned blue.","Including his hair and clothes.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang struck in an instant.","Both his power and speed received a significant boost.","Even though three puppets besieged him, they couldn’t gain any advantage.","Instead, they were overwhelmed by him.","In less than the time it takes for an incense stick to burn, the divine power on the three puppets had almost been depleted.","Boom!","“Whew!” Jian Wushuang exhaled a breath, and the three puppets had fallen.","The third round ended!","On Lian Xing’s side, there wasn’t much confidence left.","Five rounds.","Perhaps Jian Wushuang could truly make it through.","In the fourth round, eight puppets appeared.","Even facing eight puppets in their peak state, Jian Wushuang only felt some pressure.","This pressure swiftly diminished after he exerted his will.","Although the other trump card, the Starry Sky Chronicles, wasn’t very useful against these","puppets.","But the amplification of strength through swordsmanship was considerable.","This time, he once again condensed the formless sword.","One against eight!","Wherever the divine sword passed, Sword Qi soared into the sky.","Slash!","Ilack!","Stab!","With a perfected sword technique, executed with unparalleled fluidity, Jian Wushuang","reveled in the midst of it.","Unbeknownst to him, he effortlessly defeated a puppet.","With one less puppet, his fighting force diminished by one-tenth.","These puppets found themselves trapped once again.","As they attempted to self-destruct in exchange for injuries, Jian Wushuang skillfully evaded","their attempts.","These puppets, not being cultivators, still attempted to use similar tactics.","If not for someone keeping an eye on him, he wouldn’t even need to evade.","However, to conceal his Life power, he couldn’t afford to be too conspicuous.","Thus, evasion became his strategy.","In the end, all eight puppets met their demise at the tip of his sword.","In this battle, he exerted 80 percent of his strength.","Without employing the Eternal Ancient Transformation, he could utilize three times the power of the Beast God, with the potential for amplification of divine power.","With a complete cruption, handling 550,000 was no issue.","Of course, this wasn’t his limit yet.","The most formidable treasure, he had yet to utilize.","The armor condensed by the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard!","That was his current greatest reliance.","Once he used the armor, his divine body would have no restrictions.","Ile could utilize five times the power of the Beast God.","However, he worried about exposing the Temporal Treasure.","Risking exposure of the Temporal Treasure for the sake of a sword embryo wasn’t a deal he","was willing to make.","He didn’t like to engage in situations where he might lose something good while trying to","gain something else.","The fifth round!","16 puppets descended instantly.","Lian Xing was also eagerly anticipating this, his gaze fixed on Jian Wushuang, wanting to","witness his true limit.","He could sense that Jian Wushuang hadn’t truly exerted all his strength.","Faintly, it seemed he could discern Jian Wushuang’s reservations.","“Kid, let me see your strongest move!”","The impending battle was about to begin.","16 puppets surrounded Jian Wushuang.","While Jian Wushuang seemed to have his eyes closed slightly, it appeared that the puppets","were surrounding him, but in reality, his Sword Qi had already encircled them.","Swish!!!","In an instant, he acted.","The puppets surged forward directly.","Jian Wushuang remained calm. He leaped into the air, wielding his sword with both hands,","fiercely thrusting downward.","16 puppets simultaneously retreated.","However, behind them, there was nothing but condensed Sword Qi.","There was no room for escape.","Sword Qi pierced from behind.","Divine sword, slashing through the air head-on.","A single strike would surely hit its mark.","Boom!!!","All 16 puppets were shaken back.","Unfortunately! The power was too dispersed.","Not enough to harm the puppets.","Just a simple pushback.","The puppets adjusted their bodies and charged once more.","This time, Jian Wushuang could only confront them head-on.","Fortunately, he had the Wings of the Candle Dragon.","Relying on speed, he could barely contend with these puppets after the wings pushed them","back.","But at this rate, he had no chance at all.","Dragging it out would only lead to defeat.","Ile possessed infinite Origin Source and divine power."]},{"number":5774,"title":"Chapter 5774: Battle of Limits (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5774: Battle of Limits (6)","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It couldn’t be marked with an era!","If it were, Lian Xing might not only refuse to refine the sword blank for him, but might also refine him instead.","It had to be resolved quickly.","16 puppets.","Each with 500,000 divine power.","Even top-tier experts of the Fifth Tribulation would find it troublesome.","Moreover, puppets were unlike cultivators.","Cultivators could be suppressed.","But puppets had no fear.","Instead, under Lian Xing’s command, they would surely be relentless.","Jian Wushuang’s gaze drifted into the distance. With a thought, he instantly withdrew from the encirclement.","The puppets, however, seized every opportunity. Seeing Jian Wushuang trying to escape, they once again surrounded him.","Buzz!","16 puppets. Suddenly, from their depths, a hand stretched out, swiftly extending like sixteen tentacles, rushing towards Jian Wushuang.","Just as Jian Wushuang steadied his posture and attempted to change his attack, he was startled by the sudden appearance of these tentacles.","It left him somewhat helpless.","They couldn’t be broken through.","Even the divine sword couldn’t cut them.","The structure of the puppets was not rigid but rather somewhat soft.","Flexibility countered rigidity.","The fierceness of the Sword Dao was completely restrained.","“Damn it!” Jian Wushuang, unable to break through, could only rely on speed to maneuver.","But in doing so, he fell right into the hands of those puppets.","Click, clack!","Several puppets emitted a chilling, stiff laughter, sending shivers down Jian Wushuang’s spine.","With a swift movement, Jian Wushuang dodged several arms, only to realize something peculiar.","Unbeknownst to him, he had returned to the center of the secret chamber.","Yet, tentacles emerged from all directions.","Surveying his surroundings, he noticed that all the puppets had disappeared into the darkness, leaving only their scattered limbs.","Just as a sense of foreboding gripped him, the darkness surrounding him dissipated in an instant, replaced by strands of white condensed light.","The arms continued to assail Jian Wushuang relentlessly.","Jian Wushuang had no time to ponder. He could only prepare himself to resist and face whatever came next.","“It seems I have to resort to using the General Armor!”","Initially, he thought that by pushing himself to the limit, he could trigger another burst of power.","However, it seemed that the Emperor’s potential had been fully tapped out.","There was no more latent power to draw upon.","If not for the blood power of the Chen family, his divine power would be at most 200,000.","But with the General’s Armor, even if he had a foundation of 400,000 divine power, he could only unleash the peak power of Fourth Tribulation.","Now, his peak lay in the General’s Armor.","“Phew!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","Scales appeared on his body one after another.","The General’s Armor began to envelop his entire body, embedding itself into his flesh.","Externally, there were no visible changes.","These were the inner layers of the General’s Armor, protecting his divine body from collapsing.","It was precisely because of this inner layer that he could unleash five times the power of the Beast God.","When the inner layer appeared, Lian Xing in the underlying layers did not detect anything special.","But the subsequent outer layer made Lian Xing furrow his brows.","It was as if he had discovered something within.","The General’s Armor was divided into inner and outer layers.","This was something Jian Wushuang had recently discovered.","The inner layer guarded the divine body, while the outer layer protected the flesh.","Together, they merged into one, guarding alongside the Origin Source.","He could weaken attacks.","Even stronger than the Beast God Weapon.","It was his biggest trump card now.","And it could cooperate with the Beast God Weapon.","Allowing him to unleash five times the power of the Beast God.","Of course, five times was a bit exaggerated. He had only reached that limit in the face of death.","Now, using it four times was enough.","One-fold increase: 50,000.","Four-fold would be 200,000.","Plus the basic divine power of 400,000.","He would have 600,000 divine power.","“The power of the Beast God!”","Jian Wushuang roared angrily, and a huge disc appeared under his feet.","That was the totem of the Beast God.","As for the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, he did not use it.","If it appeared, he feared that Lian Xing would notice.","Moreover, the amplification given to him by the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard was too small now, and it was also very difficult to use.","He could only fully exert its power when he reached the Universe Master level.","Now, just using the armor was enough.","With four times the power of the Beast God, the armor could fully withstand it.","Jian Wushuang’s body, from being strong, instantly swelled, muscles on his arms and chest bulging instantly.","That was such a powerful force.","So much so that, even though his divine body was fine, his physical body was almost bursting.","Luckily, there was still armor protecting him.","Jian Wushuang’s eye sockets were filled with bloodshot veins.","White light condensed around him, erupting in an instant.","Fortunately, he had prepared in advance and unleashed his trump card first.","Otherwise, those white lights crashing towards him would have left him not just injured but severely so, beyond the capacity of even his life force to replenish.","Jian Wushuang pushed both hands forward, then his whole body burst with a dark red energy, forming a protective shield around himself.","The barrage of white light crashed against the shield, unable to breach it.","He had learned this technique from a scion of the Blood Robe Sect.","However, his divine power was almost limitless.","No matter how long he resisted, he would be unharmed.","The divine power of that scion was limited, relying on others.","Boom!","Ignoring the attack of the white light.","This scene caused Lian Xing, among the lower ranks, to furrow his brows.","Jian Wushuang’s strength exceeded his expectations.","In the fifth round, he hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to make it through.","Although he favored Jian Wushuang, he wouldn’t craft a Divine-tier sword blank for him, just a mere Emperor.","Crafting Divine-tier sword blanks was reserved for Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation, or even powerful beings of the Eighth Tribulation.","To craft one for an Emperor, what was that about?","Even if one didn’t consider the required materials.","Just based on one thing.","An Emperor like Jian Wushuang couldn’t endure the need for the host’s essence blood.","The required essence blood could almost drain Jian Wushuang dry.","And that’s not all.","Crafting Divine-tier sword blanks required a complete Sword Dao.","Where would he get that from?","He didn’t believe Jian Wushuang’s Sword Dao could withstand it.","He couldn’t just borrow it!","The Dao must not be lightly passed on.","Everyone understood that.","So, he didn’t want Jian Wushuang to craft Divine-tier sword blanks.","The cost was too high.","It would be better to wait until the eighth Tribulation Realm to craft them.","But Jian Wushuang’s ambitions were high, his vision even higher.","Who knew how long it would take to reach the Eighth Tribulation.","Right now, he needed to increase his combat power.","Leaving aside the threat of Qishen Temple.","Just considering the current Ancient Wood Sect.","The Wanliu Divine Tree.","For an Emperor like Jian Wushuang to face these opportunities.","It was too demanding.","The Super Ancient Transformation, he needed to explore it.","There was a great possibility that it wouldn’t help him when he reached the Emperor Realm.","The Emperor Realm.","Jian Wushuang’s strongest card against cultivators was still the Starry Sky Chronicles.","So he needed the most powerful sword blank.","Also, within the Wanliu Divine Tree, there were opportunities to break through the Tribulation Realm and reach the realm of Universe Master.","But before entering the Ten Thousand Willows, he was still an Emperor, so he had to enhance his strength without leaving any room for error.","If he didn’t fight now, he would be the one to die in the future.","16 puppets surrounded him.","Jian Wushuang remained unmoved.","The white light dissipated.","Before darkness descended, Jian Wushuang began to move."]},{"number":5775,"title":"Chapter 5775: Hunting Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 5775: Hunting Time","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","On the walls around him, he saw the puppets removing an arm, while underneath them, there was a huge circular opening.","It was from there that the white light burst forth.","Now was the moment for him to hunt.","Swoosh!","Jian Wushuang dashed to one of the puppets just before darkness descended, crushing its head with his crimson arm, deep within his palm.","Though they could regenerate, it still required divine power.","He only needed to deplete the divine power of these puppets.","In an instant, one was dealt with.","In the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang defeated nine puppets.","The remaining seven puppets, attempting to reinstall their arms, were not given the chance by Jian Wushuang.","Even after fully recovering, the seven puppets still posed some threat.","It was better to take advantage of their greatly diminished strength and eliminate them completely.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang clenched his fist, directly condensing a blood-red sphere about to burst.","He threw it towards the remaining puppets.","Buzz!","The crimson sphere was born again in his palm, raining down on the puppets like a storm of pear blossoms.","The terrifying explosions shook the secret chamber.","But Jian Wushuang had no intention of stopping.","He continued to deplete his divine power until half was consumed.","Half of 600,000 divine power amounted to 300,000.","It would take time to replenish 300,000 divine power even with the power of All Things.","“Whew!” Jian Wushuang gasped heavily.","The crimson blood balls dispersed the darkness, allowing Jian Wushuang to see the puppets.","They were all embedded in the walls, their bodies devoid of the gloss of divine power.","Only then did he relax and retract the armor into the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","Subsequently, the amplification of the Beast God’s power disappeared.","Dragging his weary body, he landed on the ground.","He had removed the Eternal Ancient Transformation when he used the General’s Armor.","Although it was somewhat troublesome, there was no other way now.","Only when the Eternal Ancient Transformation is able to amplify the Divine Power Origin Source would he not need to go through such trouble.","Once the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation was created, his divine power would merge with the Origin source, and the amplified divine power was beyond his imagination.","A simple Eternal Ancient Transformation, merely amplifying the Origin Source, could increase his combat power tenfold.","If the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation was used, he dared not imagine!","Guided by the Sword Immortal Tonghe and with treasures in hand, he had been pondering.","The bottleneck lay in becoming a Tribulation Realm expert or the Universe Master, only then could he unleash the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","But now, it was hopeless.","Fortunately, he had the armor, greatly enhancing his strength, with plenty of cards up his sleeve, and determination towards the Sacred Assembly.","He would definitely activate the Wanliu, where his opportunity to become the Universe Master.","Jian Wushuang calmed his mood, and his divine power continued to recover.","Glancing at those dilapidated puppets, a smile crept onto his lips.","“It’s over!”","The voice was faint, but it made Lian Xing’s true form personally descend.","Along with it came a throne cast in white jade.","Sitting on the throne, Lian Xing raised his hand, trembling, and said, “Is this your hidden strength?”","Jian Wushuang nodded without hesitation.","The outburst just now was indeed his strongest combat power.","Although he could still unleash five times the power of the Beast God, the burden was too great, and the divine power that could be exerted was limited.","Five times the power of the Beast God was only suitable for him to use briefly in extreme situations.","It was not suitable for the recent battle.","So, his combat power just now was already his peak.","“Senior, I think it’s time we had a discussion!”","Jian Wushuang stared at Lian Xing, genuinely afraid the latter might go back on his word, pondering whether to offer him some more benefits.","But then he thought again, although he had many treasures on him, there were some treasures that couldn’t be taken out.","There was no need to mention the Temporal treasures.","The Beast God Weapon was one of his most potent treasures, so naturally, it was out of the question to give it away.","What remained was Dong Jun’s skeletal remains, containing the divine power he had integrated into them, which also couldn’t be offered up.","He possessed the Life power crucial for dispersing the tribulation, but it wasn’t suitable for others.","Moreover, his Life power was at the level of an Emperor.","It could aid in averting common tribulations, but reviving those above the Sixth Tribulation required an immense accumulation of Life power over countless years, which would inevitably expose him.","For someone like Lian Xing, of such stature, it was akin to the situation with Qishen’s physical body back then.","It would likely take the Life power of an entire epoch, a time and courage he didn’t possess.","The remaining treasures, even if brought out, wouldn’t interest the other party.","Some of the Chen family’s treasures might fetch a few billion universe crystals at best.","However, the Origin Stone Divine Mountain could be presented. It was enough to make a Seventh Tribulation expert’s heart race.","With this in mind, Jian Wushuang took out the Origin Stone Divine Mountain.","“Senior, this Origin Stone Mountain was obtained by me accidentally while exploring the Outer Domains. Due to my weak strength, I have never dared to bring it out. I’ve heard that this kind of origin stone can maintain the Universe Origin Source. I am willing to offer it up, only asking for a Divine-tier sword blank or embryo in return!”","Jian Wushuang said, then handed over the white mountain peak, which had been reduced in size countless times, to Lian Xing.","Seeing this Origin Stone Mountain, Lian Xing was indeed somewhat surprised.","However, it wasn’t because he was surprised at how precious the Origin Stone Mountain was.","For him, it wasn’t really anything special.","What surprised him was that Jian Wushuang, an Emperor, actually had an Origin Stone Mountain.","But then again, considering Jian Wushuang’s strength, which was not weaker than that of an ordinary Fifth Tribulation expert, it wasn’t really that surprising.","Instead, Jian Wushuang’s words amused him, and he couldn’t help but laugh, saying, “Haha, Jian Wushuang, this Origin Stone Mountain might tempt other Seventh Tribulation experts, but for me, it’s just an ordinary mountain!”","Joking aside, he was the number one Divine Forgemaster in the Ancient Wood Continent, ranking among the top few in the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","There were countless people seeking his craftsmanship for forging treasures.","They all started from the Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation.","Those Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation had immeasurable wealth.","When it came to a Divine Forgemaster like Lian Xing, the treasures they produced were among the top in the Seventh Tribulation.","What was an Origin Stone Mountain compared to that?","Even if you gave him ten more, Lian Xing wouldn’t care.","The Universe Treasures of the Eighth Tribulation he possessed were all complete sets.","If he needed treasures, all he had to do was say a word, and countless people would rush to offer them to him.","Going to take a treasure from an Emperor would damage his reputation.","Jian Wushuang blinked, understanding it now.","The treasures he offered were not enough.","But there was no other way.","He had even more powerful treasures that were enough to make Lian Xing, and even experts of the Eighth Tribulation, envious.","But their importance to him exceeded that of the Origin Source divine sword.","“Never mind. Since I’ve promised to help you forge the sword blank, I won’t take your treasures. However, this Divine-tier sword blank is not as easy to forge as you think!” Lian Xing smiled bitterly before explaining the process of forging the Divine-tier sword blank."]},{"number":5776,"title":"Chapter 5776: Primordial Stones","paragraphs":["Chapter 5776: Primordial Stones","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang listened, somewhat bewildered by the vague explanations.","Though he didn’t fully grasp it, he had a rough idea.","It seemed that Lian Xing was concerned about the backlash he might suffer from assisting him in refining stars.","Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief at this realization.","For him, this was nothing to worry about.","“Senior, my decision is firm. I hope you will grant my request!” Jian Wushuang clasped his hands together in a respectful salute.","Seeing this, Lian Xing regretted somewhat having informed Jian Wushuang about the matter concerning the Divine Grade Sword Billet.","It appeared he was fully committed to his course of action.","After a brief pause, Lian Xing stroked his beard, then relented.","“Fine, since you are so determined, I will make an exception and craft for you an unparalleled divine sword!” Lian Xing declared, but furrowed his brow as he added a condition.","“But you must agree to one request of mine!”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang was startled at first, then resolutely declared, “Even if it’s not just one condition, even if it’s ten or a hundred, I’m willing!”","“Haha, there’s no need to be so eager with your words. My condition is quite serious!” Lian Xing laughed heartily.","Jian Wushuang was puzzled. “Could it be that Senior has some peculiar preference?”","“Ridiculous boy, what nonsense are you thinking!” Lian Xing blushed, then hastily said, “My request is actually quite simple. Once you possess the divine sword, don’t let its power go to waste!”","Upon hearing this request, Jian Wushuang relaxed and pledged to ensure that the fame of the divine sword would spread throughout the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Lian Xing smiled faintly.","He didn’t think Jian Wushuang was boasting.","To shake the Ancient Moon with fame!","Even a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation could achieve it.","He truly acknowledged Jian Wushuang’s potential and strength.","The Seventh Tribulation might not be beyond reach.","Upon reflection, he thought it would be quite good to craft a Divine-tier sword embryo or blank for an Emperor, mainly because of Jian Wushuang.","In the future, when Jian Wushuang truly became a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, shaking the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he would wield the divine sword crafted by Lian Xing.","It’s also a good story.","“A sword blank, huh? I need to check the treasury to see if we have enough materials!” Lian Xing started to get a headache right after agreeing.","He had plenty of materials, but it seemed he had no leftovers suitable for the sword blank.","If the materials were insufficient, he would have to purchase some during the day.","It was somewhat troublesome.","During the day, within the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands, lay the most powerful cosmic mystery.","It was also the oldest mystery.","The Ancient Moon Sect was situated within the White Heaven.","However, it did not interfere with the internal forces of the White Heaven.","The eight-star sects, which ruled the White Heaven, still had complete control over it.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang didn’t know yet that he wouldn’t even need to go out for materials. He asked, “Senior, what materials are needed to forge a Divine-tier sword blank? I can buy them in the city!”","“Tsk tsk, it seems you don’t quite understand the power of Divine-tier sword blanks. Those materials are affordable only to an Emperor like you. Don’t bother thinking about it. This time, I’ll cover all the materials, but it’ll take some preparation time!” Lian Xing found Jian Wushuang’s words somewhat amusing.","Jian Wushuang felt a warmth in his heart.","He hadn’t expected that on their first meeting, not only would the other person offer to help him forge a Divine-tier sword blank for free, but he wouldn’t even need to provide materials.","This favor was significant, and he needed to remember it.","In the future, when he achieved higher levels, he would have to repay it.","“Oh, by the way, the capital is going to hold a special auction recently. You should come with me to take a look. Some special treasures will be useful to you when you become the Universe Master, treasures that you won’t hear about outside!”","“Treasures I won’t hear about outside?” Jian Wushuang was intrigued.","Lian Xing said calmly, “These treasures are usually bought by superpowers for their geniuses. They are extremely precious, and even one of them might cost several pieces of primordial stones!”","“Primordial stones?”","Forget about those treasures, he hadn’t even heard of this seemingly special primordial stone.","“Haha, that’s right. As an Emperor, you probably haven’t heard of primordial stones. Generally, only Universe Masters possess such things. They are condensed within the universe and can only be condensed by Universe Masters. In one epoch, a Universe Master of the Third Tribulation can only condense one, while a Universe Master of the Fourth Tribulation can condense ten. Similarly, a Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation can condense 100,000 of them. Now you understand its value!” Lian Xing explained patiently.","“Jian Wushuang froze at the mention of 100,000 stones.","If that was the count, then they were truly invaluable.","Even the weakest Universe Master required an entire era to condense one.","An Eighth Tribulation Universe Master could condense 100,000 of them, but there were only a few of those in existence.","In history, there had been many, but in this current era, there were likely only a handful.","“Just now, the Source Stone Mountain you brought out is worth about 3,000 primordial stones!” Lian Xing was afraid Jian Wushuang couldn’t grasp it, so he provided a reference.","With this, Jian Wushuang gained better understanding.","A Sixth Tribulation Universe Master needed three eras to condense 3,000 primordial stones.","The value was indeed significant.","No wonder even Seventh Tribulation would covet it.","Of course, when referring to the Seventh Tribulation here, it meant the Scattered Tribulations.","A Seventh Tribulation Universe Master could produce 10,000 primordial stones within an era.","“So, what’s the use of these primordial stones?” Jian Wushuang’s curiosity grew.","Being so precious and exclusive to Universe Masters, they must serve some purpose he didn’t know.","Soon, he asked.","Lian Xing patiently explained.","These primordial stones were calculated based on the universe’s own accumulation.","For instance, an ordinary Seventh Tribulation Universe Master could produce 10,000 primordial stones, which was merely a baseline.","Then, there was the matter of their own accumulation.","No one would tell the truth.","A powerful Seventh Tribulation Universe Master could produce 30,000, even 50,000 primordial stones within an era.","But how much they produced, only they knew, and they naturally wouldn’t flaunt it.","It concerned their own strength.","The strong always hid themselves.","Just like Jian Wushuang, if it wasn’t necessary for him to seek help, he wouldn’t reveal his true strength.","The more cards one held, the safer they were in the cultivation world.","As for the uses of primordial stones, there were many.","Firstly, they were produced by the universe and could nourish it in return.","If one was injured, the universe would also suffer damage, and these primordial stones would be a great aid in recovery.","However, such an act was somewhat wasteful.","Until absolutely necessary, no one would use primordial stones to heal.","Their greater use was in facing the tribulations.","Every tribulation required a large reserve of primordial stones.","This was almost a consensus among all Tribulation Realms.","Primordial Stones were about accumulation.","The more one accumulated, the greater their assurance in overcoming tribulations.","Many Universe Masters who suppressed their own tribulations didn’t just refrain from crossing them because of insufficient strength."]},{"number":5777,"title":"Chapter 5777: Supreme Law Rules","paragraphs":["Chapter 5777: Supreme Law Rules","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The primary reason was the Primordial Stone.","With an ample supply of Primordial Stones, during the crucial moments of tribulation, stabilizing the Universe Origin Source with these stones would ensure a successful passage through the tribulation.","Failure in tribulation would lead to the universe’s ruin.","This was because tribulations targeted the universe condensed by cultivators, not the cultivators themselves.","The universe was meant to be the highest law rule, the origin of all things.","Cultivators, by condensing the universe, were defying this natural order.","Hence the tribulations.","Tribulations targeted the universe; dispersed tribulations couldn’t condense the power of Life and were also targeted by the highest law rule.","It was a form of minor punishment.","After achieving perfection in the Dao Heart, the Emperor was the best endpoint tailor-made by the highest rule.","However, there were individuals who defied the natural order by condensing the universe.","They stole power from the supreme law rules.","Thus, tribulations occurred.","This was the origin of tribulations.","Upon understanding this, Jian Wushuang began to contemplate his own universe.","No wonder every time he manifested the One Thought Universe, he felt a subtle sense of unease.","And no matter how high his strength reached, there was always a burden when manifesting the One Thought Universe.","It turned out to be because of the highest law rule.","Defying the natural order.","The Emperor’s complete-stage.","Perhaps the complete-stage as the Emperor was the best outcome.","If that were the case, he would be invincible by now.","Unfortunately, there was the Universe Master.","How about the level above the universe?","Jian Wushuang thought of those ancient and enduring powerhouses.","They should have surpassed the Universe Master.","Weren’t these individuals even more against the natural order?","Why would they exist permanently?","Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","Lian Xing seemed to perceive something.","In fact, he wasn’t clear either.","But he knew many powerful beings, including some Universe Masters at the Eighth Tribulation.","According to what he knew, those ancient existences seemed to be drawn by a force, existing across the Nine Great Spacetimes. They were said to be invincible, yet not entirely so.","Because they rarely intervened in the Nine Great Spacetimes.","Their status was high, but their influence was weak.","They hadn’t even lifted a finger.","They were extremely mysterious.","Of course, this was all hearsay.","He recounted this matter.","Jian Wushuang listened attentively.","At the same time, he began to take precautions.","The river of the Nine Great Spacetimes held too many secrets.","The source of spacetime was the Starry Sky.","What lay at its end?","Perhaps even the Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation didn’t know.","Only those ancient existences were aware.","Jian Wushuang snapped out of his reverie, no longer pondering these matters.","He was just an Emperor, knowing about it wouldn’t serve much purpose.","Later, he inquired about Primordial Stones from Lian Xing.","He thought of his own Universe Origin Source.","The foundation of his universe now.","It was a whopping 9,000 black holes.","Divided according to the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","The foundation of a Universe Master in the Third Tribulation was only 1,000 black holes.","When he became a Universe Master, he probably would condense at least 10,000 black holes.","That’s ten times that of an ordinary Universe Master.","How many Primordial Stones would he condense?","Perhaps, in the future, he wouldn’t lack Primordial Stones anymore.","His path through the Tribulation Realm became smoother.","Along with it came even more formidable tribulations.","Lian Xing held a sphere in his hand and said, “There are still a few days left until the auction. Prepare yourself first. When the time comes, follow the information on the token I gave you and wait where you’re supposed to!”","“Got it!” Jian Wushuang replied and without further ado, bid farewell and departed.","He descended from the higher layers all the way back to the first.","As he emerged, Lian Xing’s outer disciple approached him with great respect.","Jian Wushuang naturally exchanged pleasantries.","Then, he thought of the artisan who had deceived Li Ming’er.","He asked one of the outer disciples, “Brother, do you know the young man in the purple robe?”","“I... I don’t actually know him, but if Brother Jian has any business with him, I can call him over!” The disciple gestured for a servant to fetch the young man who had deceived Li Ming’er.","Jian Wushuang was somewhat speechless.","At the same time, he gained a clear understanding of the hierarchy among these artisans.","Lian Xing’s disciples were the most renowned artisans in Shi Kingdom and even across the Ancient Wood Continent.","They held extremely high status.","The visiting artisans were even lower in status than the servants here.","However, once they left this place, they were esteemed guests in various families.","The identity of an artisan was highly coveted.","When the young man in the purple robe heard the servant say that a distinguished guest wanted to speak with him, he squeezed out a smile and approached.","Jian Wushuang felt a sense of disgust upon seeing his face.","He had even deceived a young girl for cosmic crystals.","He really wanted to throw this person into the nearby furnace and see if his face was thicker than the flames.","“I’m Gu Shun, greetings, sir!” Gu Shun showed extreme deference and caution in front of Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang revealed a faint smile, pretending to be interested, and asked, “Gu Shun, tell me, what’s your relationship with Li Ming’er?”","“Li Ming’er!” Gu Shun was momentarily confused.","After a moment’s thought, he remembered the girl he had just given universe crystals to.","“Sir, Li Ming’er and I have no significant relationship, just ordinary friends!” Gu Shun responded quickly, trying to clear any suspicion.","Li Ming’er had suddenly given him a lot of cosmic crystals, and he was curious how she had obtained them.","He was also afraid they might have been stolen.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s question, he was afraid of getting involved and quickly distanced himself.","Jian Wushuang avoided eye contact and turned to a woman who had come with Gu Shun. With a single glance, he discerned the karmic threads between the two. He said calmly, “I see. There’s nothing more to say then. I had thought Ming’er was your partner, turns out she’s just a common friend.”","Gu Shun was momentarily bewildered. Quickly, he changed his tune, “Senior, actually Miss Ming and I have known each other for a long time. We both served in the same mansion when we were young...”","Without waiting for him to finish, Jian Wushuang turned and walked away. To him, Gu Shun was just a minor figure, not worth paying much attention to. Finding an opportunity to kill him would be enough.","After leaving the refining workshop, the auction was still a few days away. Jian Wushuang didn’t know what to do in the meantime. He wandered around the city for a while before finding a relatively secluded tavern to stay nearby.","He waited quietly, letting time pass. At the same time, he delved into the details of the Super Ancient Transformation technique. Although becoming Emperor seemed hopeless now, he still had to plan for the future.","Just as he felt these days were about to pass by in a hurry, news came quietly from Yue Kingdom.","It was from Wu Li and Elder Muchen, one after the other, sending him a message.","Seeing the content of the message, Jian Wushuang was somewhat surprised. The mansion gifted to him and Jinchen by the royal family of Yue Kingdom had been destroyed!","It was suddenly destroyed by some unknown force. Many cultivators in the city were even killed. The perpetrators were nowhere to be found.","Now the strong members of the royal family were investigating the ruins but couldn’t find any clues.","“Could it be Babidi?” Jian Wushuang couldn’t sit still."]},{"number":5778,"title":"Chapter 5778: Monster’s Growth","paragraphs":["Chapter 5778: Monster’s Growth","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He could only think of one formidable opponent targeting him, and that was Emperor Babidi.","If Babidi knew about his true self, he wouldn’t let him off easily.","But then he thought, if that were the case, Babidi would surely try to control his clone.","His clone had always been by Babidi’s side.","“Who is it?” Jian Wushuang furrowed his brow.","Perhaps it wasn’t him?","But Jinchen was even less likely.","Moreover, Jinchen should still be in the Daughter Kingdom.","Who could be targeting him?","Or perhaps targeting Jinchen.","“Could it be because of the royal family?” Jian Wushuang puzzled over it endlessly!","After hastily replying, he also fell into a tense state.","Waiting quietly for the investigation by the royal family’s experts.","Being able to conceal his own whereabouts, kill so many cultivators without anyone noticing, and destroy the mansion.","Jian Wushuang suddenly widened his eyes.","He thought of that beetle.","That thing, it was alive.","And it was inside the mansion.","Could it be magic from it?","If that were true, then he was in big trouble this time.","He had always felt that the bug was not simple.","It could continuously evolve.","And as long as there was the power of blood, it seemed there were no bottlenecks, it could keep mutating.","If that were the case, then it all made sense.","The majority of those killed cultivators had no relationship with the royal family. They were just insignificant individuals.","Thinking this, Jian Wushuang felt some regret. If only he had known, he would have eradicated that thing earlier.","At the same time, he thought of the pink meatball underground in Fallen Phoenix Valley.","Once the sword blanks were refined, he planned to return to Fallen Phoenix Valley and destroy that pink mass.","The pink mass resembled the beetle. Both absorbed power and continuously grew stronger. It was likely the work of one person. What a calamity!","As for the beetle, it was probably evolved to the Tribulation Realm by now, which was not his concern anymore.","Thankfully, it wasn’t targeting him specifically.","If it ran away, so be it.","Even if it became a Tribulation Realm, it wouldn’t be invincible.","The more people he killed, the more likely he would be hunted down and killed by super strong individuals.","He didn’t need to worry about it.","However, the pink mass had not yet fully grown. Although trapped underground, who knew if it might escape or if it would be better to destroy it.","But he didn’t know the horror of that bug. It had no bottleneck, an infinite growth potential.","Yue Kingdom.","Miyue Villa.","A bloody sweep!","The once prosperous villa, once boasting thousands of emperors and countless immortals, now lay in ruins.","Several Tribulation Realm powerhouses used to reside here. It was a paradise for cultivators.","But now...","Scattered corpses and lingering bloodstains.","The master of the villa was pinned to a wall.","Looking along the wall, corpses littered the ground.","Crack!","The sound of bones breaking echoed.","A humanoid monster casually trampled the shattered bones on the ground. Its tail raised, with a sharp bone spike at the end.","The bone spurs were embedded in a corpse, their crimson energy seeping into the monster’s body.","Excitedly, the monster spread its hands, its eye sockets narrowing as its power surged.","Its strength now rivaled that of a Fourth Tribulation cultivator.","Absorbing several third tribulation realm experts in the area had smoothly propelled it to the Fourth Tribulation realm.","Though not human, it possessed a profound intelligence beyond that of humans.","Its wise eyes spun rapidly.","Most of the Tribulation Realm experts it absorbed were lone cultivators, without any backing. Their deaths went unnoticed and unattended.","“Gurgle!” A strange sound emanated from the monster’s mouth as it abruptly turned its head upwards.","Then, with an extremely restrained aura, identical to Jian Wushuang’s, its figure vanished in a flicker towards the Mieyue Mountain Villa.","The moment the monster disappeared, a crack appeared in the sky above the area.","A woman wearing a tall crown and a golden robe emerged from the crack.","She!","Exceedingly noble.","Peerlessly cold.","Every move she made was enough to send shivers down the spine of cultivators.","The Empress of Yue Kingdom.","The universe master of the fifth tribulation realm.","She came here, only glancing briefly at the tragic scene below, her expression slightly moved. It wasn’t out of pity for those lone cultivators.","It was out of concern.","Ever since her daughter’s mansion was destroyed, within three days, inexplicably, a hundred Tribulation Realm experts had fallen in the entire Yue Kingdom.","The number of Emperors was countless.","Half of these hundred tribulation realm experts were First Tribulation realm, followed by Second Tribulation cultivators.","This area was of the Third Tribulation realm.","At this rate, wouldn’t it be threatening fourth tribulation realm cultivators in no time?","Some people weren’t worried.","But as the Empress of Yue Kingdom, Fengchen, felt uneasy.","However, every time she sensed that evil aura, just as she rushed over, it vanished without a trace.","At such a speed, she managed to escape her Thought power grasp.","Either she possessed unparalleled speed or exceptional strength.","In either case, why should she fear her?","There was a high probability that she possessed some sort of secret technique to conceal herself.","This time, the Empress was certain of her thoughts.","Just as she descended, she waved her hands, and countless red sleeves flew out from behind her, striking down on the Miyue Manor below.","In an instant, everything within billions of miles around was reduced to rubble.","After another Thought power search yielded nothing, Fengchen gave up.","She tore through the space with his hand and left the place.","Meanwhile, deep beneath the earth’s crust, the humanoid monster curled into a ball.","Feeling the terrifying aura of the Empress departing, it opened its eyes once more.","Then, with lightning speed, it left the area.","And then it went in search of its next target.","Although it had no bottlenecks, during its weaker moments, it needed to evade those stronger than itself.","In the first few days, it could act recklessly, but now that it had attracted attention, it needed to be cautious.","It was time to change locations.","Yue Kingdom!","It remembered.","When its strength was sufficient, it would engulf the entire Yue Kingdom.","Above the Ancient Moon Spacetime, on a tiny planet.","The time and space here were completely separate from the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","It was like an independent spacetime.","There was only this one planet.","Whoosh!","This planet had a diameter of only a dozen miles, extremely small.","And its layout was very simple.","Above the planet, there was a peculiar house.","Outside the house, there were grasslands and a few narrow paths.","Invisible sunlight poured down.","The place was extremely warm.","On the grassland, a monkey frolicked freely.","And the sound of breathing came from a chubby figure with blue skin.","He had blue skin all over, wore a black robe, and had two tentacles on his forehead.","The chubby figure, snoring loudly, was completely unremarkable, with hardly any aura about him.","But his identity was not simple.","Few people knew about him.","Every nap he took was measured in epochs.","Extremely low-key.","But at this moment, a force was calling him!","“Hmm?” The chubby blue figure rubbed his nose and woke up from his slumber.","The force pulling him made him unconsciously look down at the Ancient Moon Spacetime below.","“The Wu Hua Secret Realm!”","The source of the power."]},{"number":5779,"title":"Chapter 5779: Mysterious Auction","paragraphs":["Chapter 5779: Mysterious Auction","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Shi Kingdom.","After dealing with matters from the Yue Kingdom, Jian Wushuang had no intention of cultivating. He had planned to further comprehend the Dao of the Sword and completely perfect the Starry Sky Chronicles for the future path. However, the incident with that monster dampened his spirits entirely.","Fortunately, time passed quickly. In just a few days, everything seemed to change.","One day, before dawn had even broken, Jian Wushuang found himself standing alone outside a secluded alley in the eastern part of the city, waiting for Lian Xing.","According to the address on the token, this was the place.","It all seemed rather mysterious.","Unlike the auctions he had attended in the past, this place was not grand or ostentatious.","Not only was it secluded, but it was also very quiet.","Figures as prominent as Lian Xing would come here.","And the treasures traded here were valued in Primordial Stones.","The threshold was high, to say the least.","The weakest participants were probably Universe Masters.","And not just any Universe Masters, but likely those equivalent to Wu Li, the weakest among the Ten Great Families’ Patriarchs in the Yue Kingdom.","In this place, however, he was just an inconspicuous figure.","After all, only someone like Lian Xing could attend such auctions.","There were probably many Universe Masters at the Six Tribulation or Scattered Tribulation experts attending.","As for Jian Wushuang, being an Emperor, he didn’t stand a chance.","He could only wait patiently for Lian Xing to arrive.","He didn’t have to wait long.","Suddenly, a crack appeared in the bluestone pavement of the alley, startling Jian Wushuang.","As the bluestone slab disappeared, a dark hole with stone steps was revealed.","Just as Jian Wushuang was at a loss, a crisp sound of footsteps came from below.","Soon, Jian Wushuang saw a pale-faced, withered old woman ascending from below.","Judging solely from her aura, she was at least a Four Tribulation expert.","However, she was not a Universe Master, just a Scattered Tribulation expert.","Although her strength was not formidable, her appearance was quite frightening.","“Keke, esteemed guest, please follow me!” The old woman saw Jian Wushuang and spoke without moving her lips, her hands tucked into her sleeves.","Jian Wushuang was taken aback for a moment, then attempted to mention Lian Xing’s name.","But upon further thought, such a mysterious auction, with its entrance underground, was likely intended to conceal identities.","Jian Wushuang refrained from questioning and obediently followed the old woman underground.","Descending the stairs made of blue stones, they walked for the time it takes to burn a stick of incense.","Remarkably, their pace wasn’t leisurely; they didn’t just step down one step at a time, but rather each step equated to a hundred.","From top to bottom, Jian Wushuang descended at least a million steps.","This place was at least 10,000 feet below the surface.","In such profound depths, Jian Wushuang didn’t anticipate finding a palace built by someone.","As he entered, the hall was already filled with people.","Upon his entry, the blue stone steps leading to the hall vanished. The entire hall seemed to float in mid-air, devoid of spatial fluctuations in the surroundings. It was as if this place was disconnected from the Shi Kingdom altogether.","Jian Wushuang didn’t dwell on it; since he was here, he patiently waited.","The old woman escorted him to a relatively prominent throne before departing, informing him that the auction would commence before dawn.","This puzzled Jian Wushuang; being underground, how would they know if it was dawn or not?","Just as he pondered this question, he noticed a crystal ball on the table in front of the throne.","90 percent of it was black, with the remaining ten percent white, indicating the current time outside.","“So miraculous!” Jian Wushuang gently touched it, feeling its unique material without understanding how it was crafted.","He surveyed the surroundings with his Thought power, feeling overwhelmed by the powerful auras.","Half of the experts present were Universe Masters, while the other half were Scattered Tribulation experts.","Most of the Universe Masters were at the Fifth Tribulation, the pinnacle of power in the Yue Kingdom.","Among the Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation, there were quite a few.","As for those in the Scattered Tribulation, the weakest among them were only at the Fifth Tribulation.","This threshold, it could be said, was extremely high.","Yet, he didn’t recognize a single one of these powerful beings.","Sitting there was somewhat boring.","Just as he was about to close his eyes and wait quietly for the auction to begin, a familiar aura wafted from afar.","Following that, many strong figures in the hall began to speak up.","“Brother Tonghe!”","“Tonghe Sword Immortal!”","“Li Changsheng!”","Jian Wushuang also followed their gazes.","The person who had arrived was none other than Sword Immortal Tonghe, who had a connection with him.","Li Changsheng!","He didn’t come alone, though; he brought someone with him. It was his granddaughter, Li Ming’er.","Seeing the other party walking towards him, Jian Wushuang quickly got up and respectfully said, “Senior Tonghe!”","“Ah, Wushuang, you’re here too!”","Tonghe didn’t seem too surprised; he believed that Jian Wushuang had the strength and background to participate in such an auction.","And it wasn’t just talk; Jian Wushuang’s background was indeed not small. Although not as exaggerated as his strength. But in the entire Ancient Wood Continent, he was considered a top figure.","He was the husband of the princess of the Yue Kingdom and the guarantor of the Daughter Kingdom’s ruler, who was the daughter of the newly promoted Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation.","Plus, now he had also become acquainted with Lian Xing, the top Divine Forgemaster of the Ancient Wood Continent.","The strong figures he knew were all top-notch.","The surrounding strong figures, seeing Tonghe Sword Immortal chatting with a junior, began to ponder.","“Wushuang?”","“Could it be the Jian Wushuang of the Yue Kingdom, the unmatched swordsman?”","Someone furrowed their brows."]},{"number":5780,"title":"Chapter 5780 No Need To Work Too Hard","paragraphs":["5780 No Need To Work Too Hard","It’s just something that couldn’t be said.","Even if said, no one would believe it.","An emperor, along with a Universe Master at the brink of the Fourth Tribulation, attempting to unlock the Wanliu.","That’s just absurd.","Thinking everyone is like the former Divine Wood King.","Although helping the Empress seize the position of the Holy Maiden was just a facade.","But taking advantage of this opportunity, Jian Wushuang also wanted to understand more about some of the strong individuals during the Sacred Assembly.","It is rumored that the venue for the Sacred Assembly is an independent space.","And Wanyan is within it.","If he and Wu Li open the Wanliu, and are besieged, the first to discover them would be those strong individuals attending the Sacred Assembly.","All of them are Universe Masters.","Although there are emperors among them, their role in the Sacred Assembly is minimal. Just an auxiliary role.","In terms of combat power, it’s still those Universe Masters.","He learned this from Tonghe Sword Immortal.","Just the strong contenders for the position of the fighting Holy Maiden from the Shi Kingdom participating in the Sacred Assembly this time, there are three.","All of them are Universe Masters at the Fifth Tribulation.","Jian Wushuang was secretly surprised upon hearing this!","And these are just the female Universe Masters.","If they can gather three Fifth Tribulation Universe Masters, then within the power of the entire Shi Kingdom, there must be at least a dozen Fifth Tribulation Universe Masters.","In the entire Yue Kingdom, there’s only one Empress.","The disparity is beyond comprehension.","Two of the three Universe Masters are at their peak, while the other one is in consummation.","All of them are outstanding contenders in the qualification battle for the Holy Maiden position this time.","Belonging to several of the top contenders to win the Holy Maiden position.","Although Empress Fengchen is also among them, her background is inadequate.","And she has too few helpers.","There probably won’t be many Universe Masters worth mentioning.","Moreover, the Sacred Assembly will result in casualties.","Each Sacred Assembly claims a large number of strong individuals.","If victorious, there will naturally be many benefits.","The Holy Maiden will settle in the Ancient Wood Faction, bringing along her trusted strong individuals.","If Empress Fengchen became a candidate, then Jian Wushuang and those like Wu Li would not only gain resources and treasures within the Sacred Assembly.","They would also bask in the glory of Empress Fengchen and become the core of the Ancient Wood Sect.","There would be even more treasures.","That’s why there were so many strong individuals swarming around.","The benefits of the holy gathering were plentiful.","The glory of the Ancient Wood Continent, was now just a fig leaf.","Every year, some strong individuals would emerge during the Sacred Assembly and be recruited by the Ancient Wood Sect.","Just like Queen Yun Zhi, who had once practiced in the Ancient Wood Sect with Empress Fengchen.","Although they eventually returned to their own factions.","Externally, however, they represented the Ancient Wood Sect.","When Sword Immortal Tonghe mentioned the holy gathering, there was some envy in his","tonc.","He wasn’t from the Ancient Wood Continent, so he wasn’t qualified to participate.","“Jian Wushuang, with your strength, I believe you can influence some of the battles. When the time comes, don’t go overboard, prioritize your own interests. That Empress from your country, her ambitions are not to be underestimated!” Tonghe’s words were heavy.","Jian Wushuang just nodded, without replying.","Ile didn’t know whether that empress was ambitious or not, but prioritizing his own interests was definitely not a problem.","He wouldn’t foolishly devote himself to the empress.","He would do his best, that’s all.","The most important thing was the opportunity within Wanliu.","Ile didn’t care much for the opportunities in the holy gathering.","They weren’t very helpful.","Right now, he wasn’t actually lacking treasures, he lacked opportunities for inheritance.","And some rare treasures.","In the past, he used to worry that he didn’t have enough treasures.","But now!","His Origin Source enhancement was almost complete.","With pieces on the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, he could devour them at will.","And after becoming the Universe Master, he could even devour those with titles.","In a short period, he wasn’t lacking in Origin Source treasures.","If he needed more, he’d just buy them. After all, in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, where divine power reigns supreme, Origin Source treasures were quite inexpensive.","As for divine power.","He was even less in need of it.","With the skeleton of Dong Jun.","Initially just sensing its aura, he could significantly increase his divine power.","Later, with the help of the power of blood-red, after swallowing all the surface aura, his","divine power reached 400,000.","After becoming the Universe Master, he would devour the entire skeleton.","Not to mention, before reaching the seventh tribulation realm, he didn’t lack treasures to","increase his divine power.","At present, he had a clue about the sword blanks he lacked.","Ile could sort it out before the Sacred Assembly.","Externally, he was already saturated.","The only thing lacking was time for cultivation.","Since arriving in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, it had only been over 10,000 years.","In this short time, he hadn’t had the chance to cultivate at all.","If it weren’t for the recent huge breakthrough in divine power.","His strength hadn’t changed much.","Before the Sacred Assembly, he didn’t have much time for cultivation.","Even with time acceleration, there wasn’t enough time to cultivate anything significant.","Unconsciously, the crystal ball on the table had only a trace of white left.","Signifying that dawn was approaching outside.","But Jian Wushuang still hadn’t seen Lian Xing’s figure.","Just when he thought the other party wouldn’t come, a sound came from outside.","Then, all the strong figures in the hall fell silent.","Whether it was the Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation or the Scattered Tribulation","strongmen of the Seventh Tribulation realm, they all showed a respectful look and looked","towards the outside of the hall.","A big shot was descending!","A simple, rustic-looking elderly man with a healthy complexion strolled into the hall, a smile","gracing his face.","Upon entering the grand hall, he couldn’t help but mutter, “Finally made it!”","With these words, many sycophants hurriedly chimed in, “It’s an honor for us to have Senior","Lian Xing grace us with his presence!”","The newcomer was indeed Lian Xing.","The reason for his tardiness was actually because of Jian Wushuang.","Just these past few days, he had made a trip during the day to gather the necessary materials.","The rest would be available at this auction.","Although he had the qualifications for direct exchange, it wasn’t necessary.","Even at the auction, no one dared to vie with him.","Lian Xing casually strode to the forefront throne and took his seat.","As he sat down, the crystal ball on the table completely lost its white luster.","The auction was about to begin.","But at that moment, another person descended outside the hall.","The newcomer’s aura was very weak.","Compared to the strong ones inside the hall, it was like that of a baby.","Although the aura was weak, the disturbance caused upon entering the hall was not","insignificant.","“Tan Tianfeng!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes twitched.","He thought Fan Tianfeng had already left.","He didn’t expect her to show up at this auction.","Upon seeing the first young master of the Shi Kingdom, the expressions of the crowd","changed.","She was the strongest descendant of the Shi Kingdom in the Ancient Wood Continent, at","the Eighth Tribulation.","Moreover, she was the most valued descendant.","She would become the master of the Flame Kingdom in the future.","Fan Tianfeng’s status was much higher than those prodigies of the Shi Kingdom’s royal","family.","Otherwise, she wouldn’t have such prestige. With just a letter, she could prompt Lian Xing","to assist Jian Wushuang in refining the sword.","On the high platform in the grand hall, the phantom of a woman in red appeared.","Seeing Fan Tianfeng, her brow furrowed.","She too was a descendant or successor of the Flame God.","But compared to Fan Tianfeng, her status was much lower.","Although there weren’t many successors of the Flame God, there was still a significant","difference."]},{"number":5781,"title":"Chapter 5781 Sky Lantern","paragraphs":["5781 Sky Lantern","Fang Tianfeng’s position in the Flame God Kingdom was second only to the Divine Spirit, the Flame God.","This status demanded respect even from the current Lord of the Shi Kingdom.","As Fang Tianfeng entered the grand hall, she casually scanned around before finding a scat.","Her demeanor and attitude exuded an air of superiority.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel a twinge of envy.","In his heart, he couldn’t help but sigh, “If only I had half her charm!”","The thought of her soon heading to the spacetime river where the Qishen Temple was located made him envious.","Reincarnation was truly an art.","Obviously, he wasn’t very successful in this aspect.","He wondered how the others were faring.","Hu Qing had warned him not to go to the Ancient Moon Ruins.","But enough about Fang Tianfeng.","What about the others?","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","Perhaps the luck of the others was also good.","Under the operation of the supreme law rules, they might all have bright futures.","Wu Zuo and the others were not lacking in talent.","With a little entry into some major powers, they could become geniuses.","Becoming the Universe Master wasn’t difficult.","It was just hard to find.","Ilis current reputation only circulated in the Ancient Wood Continent and didn’t affect the entire realm.","But it would soon change; he was about to make a name for himself in the Ancient Moon.","Once the Wanliu was unlocked, his reputation would surely skyrocket.","At that time, if the others were doing well, they could also seek refuge.","However, he didn’t know that the others might not be doing as well as him,","For example, Wu Zuo.","At this moment, he was trapped in the Wu Hua Secret Realm.","And he encountered unprecedented difficulties.","In this dilemma, he also unexpectedly met a truly influential figure!","..","“Ladies and gentlemen, I am Feng Jiuwu. I will be hosting this auction. The rules remain the same as before. You can settle with Primordial Stones or with treasures of equal value. When encountering essential treasures, you can also bid by lighting the sky lantern!”","Sky lantern?","Jian Wushuang was a bit puzzled upon hearing this.","Luckily, Sword Immortal Tonghe was sitting beside him.","He learned about the function of the sky lantern from the other party.","Once the sky lantern is lit, it means endless bidding.","It only stops when no one else bids.","In other words, once the sky lantern is lit, there’s no need to bid oneself. Just watch others bid, as it will always outbid them.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang thought to himself, only a fool would light the sky lantern.","However, Sword Immortal Tonghe casually remarked, “The first time I participated, I once lit the sky lantern. That treasure was extremely useful to me, even a chance to break through the Seventh Tribulation. For that treasure, I even sold several epochs of my life to the Shi Kingdom!”","“Selling life?” Jian Wushuang was quite surprised.","“There’s nothing to be surprised about. At that time, I couldn’t produce so many treasures and Primordial Stones. In the end, it was the strongmen of the Shi Kingdom who guaranteed it for me. I got that treasure, and then repaid the favor by fighting for the royal family of the Shi Kingdom several times!” Tonghe spoke plainly.","But only he knew that during those battles, he almost perished.","He even killed a Universe Master of the same level.","The battles of the Shi Kingdom were not the conflicts of the Ancient Wood Continent.","They were the contests over Outer Domain secret realms.","There were many Outer Domain secret realms!","But most were occupied by some major forces.","Only some extremely dangerous secret realms, which even the superpowers couldn’t suppress, remained unclaimed.","Such as the Wu Hua Secret Realm and the Ancient Moon Ruins.","These secret realms, no one dared to touch.","For a superpower like the Shi Kingdom, internal battles were meaningless; the resources of the Ancient Wood Continent were so scarce.","Usually, battles were for the external contest of Outer Domain secret realms.","Hearing about the rumors of the secret realms, Jian Wushuang’s heart stirred.","He had learned a lot about the Outer Domain regions in the past.","The so-called Outer Domain regions were places beyond the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","They were extremely dangerous, with many natural secret realms.","Even Universe Masters would venture there.","Naturally, there were many opportunities.","If it weren’t for Wu Li’s plan, he would probably have gone to the Outer Domain regions. But","with Wu Li’s plan, unlocking the Wanliu was the best choice.","Because the dangers within the Wanliu were relatively smaller.","Venturing into the Outer Domain posed much greater risks.","Even Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation faced the threat of demise.","The Wanliu Divine Tree was different; the danger lay in how to confront the strong individuals of the Ancient Wood Continent upon venturing out.","Internally, the risks were not as significant.","At least there were no competitors.","In the Outer Domain, within some universe secret realms, there were many old monsters.","There were also many unique life forms.","For an Emperor like him, even if his strength could rival that of the Fifth Tribulation, going there was extremely dangerous.","The Tonghe chuckled lightly before continuing, “You’ll understand when you succeed in the future. The dangers in the Outer Territories also represent opportunities!”","Jian Wushuang nodded in agreement.","Behind every crisis lay immense opportunities.","Just like his current situation.","Facing the formidable Mie Sheng also presented the opportunity to control the cycle of","reincarnation.","Even Mie Sheng coveted it greatly.","Coming from the Starry Sky, seeking the Master of Life.","If he could defeat Mie Sheng, he could devour the Master of Death, control reincarnation,","and grasp spacetime.","It was even possible to surpass the Universe Masters.","Just like those ancient existences.","With confidence comes determination.","Jian Wushuang clenched his fists.","The auction officially commenced at this moment","Feng Jiuwu waved his hand casually, and a huge jade pillar appeared on the high platform in","the hall.","At the top of the pillar, an object was floating at this moment. “Esteemed guests, this treasure is the heaven-defying supreme treasure from the Wu Hua Secret Realm, the Qingyan Divine Water. All Universe Masters are aware that during the Fifth Tribulation, the Cataclysmic Flame Divine Mountain will descend into the Universe. Origin Source. With this item, that tribulation will no longer be a tribulation!” After Feng Jiuwu’s introduction, many Universe Masters of the Fourth Tribulation turned their","attention.","The Universe Master transcended his own tribulation, not just his personal ordeal, but also the tribulation of the universe itself.","The fundamental universe also experiences tribulations.","Ordinary personal tribulations can be anticipated, and one wouldn’t attempt to transcend them without confidence.","However, the supreme tribulation within the fundamental universe is different. It requires not only personal strength but also the strength of the universe’s Origin Source.","If the Origin Source of the universe cannot withstand it, even immense divine power is","futile.","Most practitioners of divine power in the Ancient Moon Spacetime are not strong in Origin","Source.","So for them, personal tribulations are not difficult.","It’s the supreme tribulations of the universe that pose a challenge.","This reminded Jian Wushuang of Qishen.","Qishen failed in his tribulation, yet the Origin Source of the fundamental universe persisted.","Later, it evolved into Qishen Temple.","Qishen, who cultivated the Origin Source, fell under his personal tribulation, but the","fundamental universe did not perish.","He could have chosen to transcend as a scattered tribulation, but it would have required","abandoning the Origin Source of the universe.","For the sake of the fundamental universe, Qishen would rather sacrifice his own universe.","He was truly ruthless.","But perhaps the reasons behind it were not as simple as they seemed.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, was different.","His personal tribulations corresponded to the intensity of his divine power.","His divine power now surpassed even the Origin Source.","While the supreme tribulation within the Universe Origin Source was formidable, it still","couldn’t compare to the Starry Sky evolved from the Extreme Dao.","The first universe was about to illuminate."]},{"number":5782,"title":"Chapter 5782 Worldly Desires","paragraphs":["5782 Worldly Desires","Once the universe coalesced successfully, it became a perfect cosmos with myriad black holes, owned by the Origin Source of the Starry Sky.","The Supreme Tribulation wasn’t as terrifying for Jian Wushuang as one might think.","He balanced both aspects.","Jian Wushuang was the “Tribulation” of these myriad realms.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been so confident.","The first five tribulations were as simple to him as drinking water.","The difficulty arose after the sixth tribulation.","But there was always a way.","Now, he had treasure capable of breaking through the Fifth Tribulation Universe Master.","In the future, there would be treasures for the Sixth Tribulation as well.","Of course, while treasures played a significant role, one couldn’t ignore oneself.","Nor could one underestimate the supreme law rules.","Everything was subject to change.","The first item up for auction was a heaven-defying treasure for a Fourth Tribulation Universe Master.","For a moment, many strong individuals bid one after another.","Among them were even those of the Seventh Tribulation.","Even if they couldn’t use it themselves, they could pass it down to their descendants.","Such treasures were rare.","The Wu Hua Secret Realm was inaccessible to ordinary people.","And even fewer could come out once they entered.","This Qingyan Divine Water was within the innermost part of the Wu IIua Secret Realm.","Without the strength of a sixth Tribulation Universe Master, one couldn’t obtain it.","Some people might go their whole lives without encountering such a treasure. Naturally, it was highly treasured.","The items auctioned here had no low prices.","As long as one bid, it was likely to be the corresponding price for the treasure.","But scarcity of the treasure was undeniable!","Next to Jian Wushuang sat Tonghe, who also called out a price at this moment.","“10,000 primordial stones!”","The previous bid was seven thousand, and Tonghe directly added 3,000 primordial stones. Many Fourth Tribulation Universe Masters fell into despair.","As for those of the Third Tribulation, their value might not even reach 5,000 primordial","stones.","Although, in one era, the Universe Origin Source could at least produce one primordial stone as a minimum.","However, who would hold onto treasures without using them?","Whether it’s purchasing treasures, secret techniques, or even nurturing one’s own Universe Origin Source, it all revolves around the primordial stones.","For an ordinary Universe Master, being able to produce 5,000 primordial stones is already quite impressive.","That requires 5,000 epochs to condense.","Even a Universe Master at the Fourth Tribulation needs 500 epochs.","That’s still a relatively long time.","Seeing Senior Tonghe making a bid, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but ask curiously, “Is Senior preparing this for Miss Ming’er?”","“I laha, that little girl still has worldly desires. When she’s had her fill of playing, this treasure should come in handy!” Tonghe chuckled.","It makes sense.","Li Ming’er is the only relative of Tonghe. The day her worldly desires fade away might be when she embarks on the path of cultivation.","Naturally, Tonghe has to prepare in advance.","In this place, a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation is also a top figure.","But those crazed Universe Masters at the Fourth Tribulation have already begun selling off their assets.","“I bid 9,000 primordial stones, plus a treasure from the Fifth Tribulation!” A Fourth Tribulation Universe Master sitting further back shouted loudly.","Once someone starts selling treasures, others follow suit.","The value of treasures from the universe is actually not that high.","The real value lies in the treasures nurtured by oneself,","A treasure from the Fifth Tribulation is considered good if it’s worth 3,000 primordial stones.","The subsequent bids kept rising.","Tonghe also made several consecutive bids.","But in the end, it wasn’t acquired.","It was bought by a crazed Fourth Tribulation Universe Master.","This Universe Master is at the pinnacle of the Fourth Tribulation, with less than 100 epochs","left before transcending the tribulation.","During this time, they have been searching everywhere for treasures to aid in transcending the tribulation.","It was also luck that they encountered the Qingyan Divine Water here.","They practically emptied their coffers, spending 99,000 primordial stones to obtain this Qingyan Divine Water.","He left hastily right after snapping the picture, not out of fear of being watched but because he was anxious to prepare for his tribulation crossing.","In this place, attendees entered the auction through different passages. Jian Wushuang entered through a narrow alley, while others came from various parts of the city.","As long as their routes differed and their auras were concealed within the city, nobody could detect them. That’s why some dared to risk their entire fortune.","The first item up for auction was a significant one, likely to fetch a high price.","The subsequent items, though precious, lacked the exceptional quality of the first, so their","prices remained within the range of several thousand primordial stones.","Even if it reached several thousand primordial stones, Jian Wushuang didn’t have the means","to bid. He could only watch.","“The ninth item up for auction, a spatial crystal!”","This item was the supreme material for crafting treasures.","Many attendees were Divine Craftsmen, and they began bidding fervently.","Divine Craftsmen and Forgemasters were valued much higher than individuals of the same","level, so very few outsiders dared to compete.","Just a single piece of spatial crystal fetched a high price of ten thousand primordial stones.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes gleamed with envy.","Spatial crystals were rare formations condensed from cosmic bodies, considered crystallized manifestations of the universe, and the toughest material in existence.","The value of just one piece equaled 10,000 primordial stones.","Jian Wushuang carefully examined the treasures from the Chen family, which he had once found impenetrable. He had even inspected them at the workshops of the Shi Kingdom, While they were cherished treasures, they were not exorbitantly priced.","Moreover, the Chen family only had one Universe Master, and their reserves of primordial","stones were almost useless, not even enough for their own use as a Universe Master.","So, he couldn’t find a single primordial stone among them.","Next time, if they were to undertake such a task again, they would have to deal with those","Universe Masters.","Scattering Tribulation was too impoverished.","Every Scattering Tribulation. before becoming one. surely squandered all their treasures on the Universe Origin Source, only to fail in crossing the tribulation, naturally losing","everything,","All of them were penniless.","Except for the Divine Forgemaster.","Even though Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up at the sight of those treasures, it was of no use.","“No one else is bidding, so this spatial crystal..” Before Feng Jiuyu could finish her sentence,","she was interrupted by a hoary voice.","It was Lian Xing! The strongest Divine Forgemaster of the Ancient Wood Continent.","Lian Xing slowly raised two fingers and spoke, “I bid 20,000!”","As soon as this statement was made, the entire venue fell silent.","No one dared to bid again.","Even the strong ones at the Seventh Tribulation level shrank back.","As for those Divine Forgemasters, almost all of them knew Lian Xing, regarding him as the","top Divine Forgemaster of the Ancient Wood Continent.","The ancestor of them all.","Who would dare to vie with Lian Xing for materials?","In fact, Lian Xing could have just bid one Primordial Stone at the beginning, and no one","would dare to compete.","Background, strength, wealth,","All utterly overwhelming others.","Who would dare to contend?","Even if an Eighth Tribulation expert came, they might not prevail.","Lian Xing’s wealth was beyond the reach of ordinary people.","One person could match a superpower.","Just the puppets Jian Wushuang encountered, their value was beyond what a Seventh","Tribulation expert could afford.","Feng Jiuwu, the auctioneer, upon seeing Lian Xing’s bid, appeared rather relaxed, and","directly began the final bidding.","After three calls, there was no response.","The spatial crystal fell into Lian Xing’s hands."]},{"number":5783,"title":"Chapter 5783 Shy in the Pocket","paragraphs":["5783 Shy in the Pocket","The auction continued.","Along with the spatial crystals, several subsequent treasures were also materials for refining.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t heard of some of them before, so he simply watched.","At this point, he didn’t hold much hope anymore.","Even if there were treasures to help him break through to the level of Universe Master, the prices would likely be exorbitant.","He simply couldn’t afford them.","The treasures he had gathered from the Chen family couldn’t even compare.","Only the Origin Stone Mountain was worth considering.","The other treasures didn’t hold much appeal for a Universe Master.","Among the treasures he acquired from the Chen family, although there were several, they were all at the level of the Third Tribulation.","The only treasure at the Fourth Tribulation was one that the Chen family openly displayed.","He had long since devoured its essence, rendering it useless.","Even if he could sell it, its value probably wouldn’t exceed 100 primordial stones.","Universe Treasures.","Those below the Fifth Tribulation were almost worthless.","Of course, for an Emperor, their value would be considerable.","However, with Jian Wushuang’s increasing strength, his perspective had to evolve gradually. He couldn’t remain fixated on the Qishen Temple Era.","During that time, he lacked much insight.","But things were different now that he had entered the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","The places he frequented and the people he encountered were all significant figures.","Whether in the Yue Kingdom, the Daughter Kingdom, or the current Shi Kingdom, he knew quite a few powerful individuals.","Beside him was Sword Immortal Tonghe, a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation.","Though not one of the strong figures of the Ancient Wood Continent, he was still a prominent figure here.","A Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation was almost equivalent in status and strength to a dispersed tribulation powerhouse at the Seventh Tribulation.","Lian Xing was a well-known figure.","Throughout the Ancient Wood Continent, hardly anyone was unaware of him.","Through interactions with these individuals, he gained much knowledge and insight, broadening his horizons.","It was like getting an carly introduction to the circle of Universe Masters and learning a lot about them.","From the subsequent auctions, he learned a great deal.","For example, among the treasures auctioned later, there were two items particularly beneficial for crossing the tribulation.","One was the Heavenly Dao Spiritual Qi condensed from the space of gold.","This treasure actually intrigued him quite a bit because it would be extremely useful when breaking through to become a Universe Master.","The golden rule corresponded to the laws of space.","The Heavenly Qi condensed by the golden law rules.","That was the power required when mastering the universe in the Third Tribulation,","It could enable the strong in the Third Tribulation to quickly grasp the universe. Unfortunately, this treasure was snapped up by Fan Tianfeng at a very high price. With countless primordial stones, Jian Wushuang simply couldn’t afford it.","Fan Tianfeng’s move to acquire this treasure most likely meant he was preparing for a breakthrough.","She used to cultivate the Origin Source of Spacetime.","Now she’s specializing in divine power, but the foundation of the Origin Source hasn’t been neglected.","The first three tribulations are too easy for Fan Tianfeng now.","So the treasure she’s preparing is also essential for mastering the universe.","Once she breaks through, she’ll probably soon face the highest tribulation,","By swiftly passing through the first three tribulations, she’ll directly master the universe in the Tribulation Realm,","The first three tribulations focus on one’s own divine body, which is nothing for someone as wealthy as Fan Tianfeng.","Jian Wushuang is the same.","Once he becomes a Tribulation Realm expert, he can swiftly pass the tribulations and reach","the Third Tribulation Realm, directly mastering the universe.","Only after becoming the Universe Master would the Universe Origin Source face the highest tribulation.","The highest tribulation was divided into seven types.","After mastering the universe, there was a minor tribulation, which is about space, namely,","gold!","Fourth tribulation: Wood","Fifth tribulation: Fire","Sixth tribulation: Water","Seventh tribulation: Earth","Eighth tribulation: Mastery of Time","If the first seven tribulations are still about space.","Then the eighth tribulation, for cultivators, is like a dimensional strike.","Directly shifting from space to time.","This is fine for Origin Source cultivators.","But for those cultivating divine power, it’s a huge gap.","This is also why there are so few Tribulation Realm experts in Ancient Moon Spacetime.","The Eighth Tribulation was exceptionally rare.","So many cultivators pursue the so-called “one force breaking ten thousand law rules”.","Breaking the highest law rules, ascending through divine power to become revered was a feat no one had accomplished.","In the Ancient. Moon Spacetime, this feat had never been witnessed throughout the ages. Even Jian Wushuang himself wasn’t entirely sure of it.","His greatest confidence lay in his temporal path.","His own divine power was sufficient to withstand the tribulations of the divine body.","The primordial tribulations posed no great challenge to him.","This was the benefit of dual cultivation.","Entering the Tribulation Realm, he didn’t need to suppress anything during tribulation","crossings.","The first five tribulations would pass smoothly.","However, achieving the Tribulation Realm was somewhat difficult.","Although the universe space formed around him, he lacked comprehension of time.","Merely devouring the Origin Source wasn’t enough; he needed to cultivate insight. Currently, he could only ponder over the chess pieces within the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard and derive understanding from them. I lis progress wasn’t slow anymore. Ile had already comprehended the true meaning of time; he was just a step away from mastery. Once he grasped this mastery, he could enter the Tribulation Realm. Amidst the myriad opportunities, he hoped to find what he needed.","These thoughts lingered in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","This auction was his last chance.","He simply didn’t have enough primordial stones to purchase the auxiliary treasures.","He could only watch helplessly as Lian Xing and Fan Tianfeng sporadically bought materials for treasures, sparking envy in him.","Perhaps, after becoming the Universe Master, he wouldn’t lack primordial stones anymore.","An ordinary Universe Master of the Third Tribulation could nurture anywhere from one to","ten primordial stones in an era.","This was heavily influenced by the essence of the universe.","But he was different. By the time he became the Universe Master, his Universe Origin Source would likely surpass that of his peers by an immeasurable amount. Moreover, he could rapidly advance to become a Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation","realm.","In the Ancient Moon Spacetime, a Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation realm typically produced 100 primordial stones in an era.","With his foundational strength, a hundredfold increase was not an issue.","That would be 10,000 primordial stones in an era.","Although it seemed like a long time, even an Emperor could typically undergo hundreds or","thousands of eras in a single seclusion.","At that moment, his wealth would multiply.","He wouldn’t be in such an awkward situation now.","Buzz!","A pulling force emanated from the auction stage, causing Jian Wushuang to furrow his brow","slightly.","Then, his pupils began to contract.","At this moment, Feng Jiuwu once again brought out an item for auction.","“The Nine Tribulations Tower, originating from the Ancient Moon Ruins!” Initially, many people didn’t pay much attention to this nine-layered tower, but when they","heard about the Ancient Moon Ruins, they all turned their heads.","The Ancient Moon Ruins were the most formidable secret realm within the Ancient Moon","Spacetime.","It was rumored to contain the inheritance of the heavenly maiden.","But no one could enter its core.","Not even the inner circle could penetrate it.","Even the outer circle required a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation to enter.","In other words, this item must have been brought out by at least a Universe Master of the","Sixth Tribulation Realm.","An item from the Ancient Moon Ruins.","This meant that its price would reach an extremely high figure.","Those weaker than Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation basically had no chance. “I bid 50,000!” A middle-aged man in a black robe stood up directly."]},{"number":5784,"title":"Chapter 5784 Nine Tribulations Tower","paragraphs":["5784 Nine Tribulations Tower","The aura emanating from him revealed the presence of an ancient figure at the Seventh Tribulation.","Though he was a Scattered Tribulation expert, he still possessed considerable strength.","Jian Wushuang was momentarily stunned, thinking to himself, “These people don’t even know the purpose of the Nine Tribulations Tower, yet they dare to bid?”","At the same time, a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation also spoke up!","“I bid 180,000 primordial stones!”","Goodness!","180,000 primordial stones.","This price.","It was already the highest bid at the auction.","180,000 primordial stones.","Sure enough, being a Universe Master meant having deep pockets.","With the serious decline in power due to being scattered across realms and lacking the primordial stones condensed from the Universe Origin Source, they couldn’t compete with the Universe Master in terms of wealth.","After reaching 180,000, the price fell into a brief calm.","Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to ask Sword Immortal Tonghe, “Senior Tonghe, does the Nine Tribulations Tower have any special function?”","“Tsk tsk, Jian Wushuang, it’s your first time attending this kind of auction, you may not know, but whenever treasures from the Ancient Moon Ruins come out, nobody really knows their functions. Most of those put up for auction are things even the owners can’t figure out, they just want quick cash. Those who truly understand them wouldn’t put them up for auction. The treasures from the Ancient Moon Ruins are the lowest grade Universal Treasures, and there are even innate primordial Universe Treasures!” Sword Immortal Tonghe tapped his fingers on the armrest of his throne, his gaze fixed on the Nine Tribulations Tower, contemplating whether to make a move.","The treasures that came out of the Ancient Moon Ruins were extremely mysterious. Almost like special treasures.","Few people would put them up for auction,","Even if they couldn’t figure them out themselves, they wouldn’t want them to spread to the outside world.","Otherwise, if someone else grasped them and realized they were losing out, they’d be furious.","The Nine Tribulations Tower being put up for auction probably meant that the person behind it urgently needed primordial stones.","Hearing Sword Immortal Tonghe’s explanation, Jian Wushuang once again looked at the Nine Tribulations Tower.","If that was the case, perhaps he wasn’t very interested.","He wasn’t in dire need of treasures.","Having the Beast God’s Weapon was enough.","With so many trump cards of his own, sometimes treasures could become a burden,","But when the Nine Tribulations Tower appeared in the hall, the Skysight Ileavenly Chessboard within his origin stirred!","The two seemed to have some kind of connection.","This made Jian Wushuang consider whether he should intervene and buy the Nine Tribulations Tower.","Observing the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, it was a treasure of spacetime. The value of the Nine Tribulations Tower would double if it resonated with the Temporal Treasure.","Most importantly, the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard was the treasure left to him by Master Xuan Yi.","Maybe the Nine Tribulations Tower also had a connection with Teacher Xuan Yi,","This forced him to take a risk.","Of course, not to snatch it.","But to buy it with his own money.","Primordial stones!","He didn’t have any.","But he possessed the Life power that drove all Scattered Tribulations crazy.","He could transform All Things into life.","Only he could do it.","The Life force at the level of an Emperor, as long as refined, could help those scattered tribulations restore their divine bodies.","It was time for him to take a gamble.","He just couldn’t blatantly reveal it.","He had to carefully plan it out.","“There it is!” Jian Wushuang’s mouth curled up, and the avatar within the Universe Origin Source took out a piece of finger.","It was loosened from Dong Jun’s skeleton.","Originally, he was reluctant, but there was no other way.","He had to take a gamble.","A piece of Dong Jun’s finger.","It was already very valuable.","Just this piece of finger, even if given to those strong at the Sixth Tribulation, to absorb.","It could enhance their divine power by about 100,000.","This was a substantial enhancement.","Those strong at the Sixth Tribulation, even Scattered Tribulations, also had about 700,000","divine power.","An increase of 100,000 meant 800,000.","It was a whole new level of improvement, multiplying their combat power several times","over.","In an auction, t would easily fetch 200,000 primordial stones.","Of course, these 200,000 were far from enough.","The severed finger perhaps could have been contended for by the experts of the Sixth Tribulation, as the Life power it contained was potent enough to attract even those at the Seventh Tribulation, including Lian Xing himself.","However, the Life force couldn’t be openly displayed.","With a swish, the power of All Things began to converge, then transformed into the essence","of Life.","The Emperor-level Life force condensed once more, reaching the level of the Tribulation","Realm.","Repeatedly, the well-condensed Life power was injected into this severed finger.","Inside the hall, the auction continued.","The price of the Nine Tribulations Tower had reached 300,000.","Now, only the Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation and Scattered Tribulation experts","of the Seventh Tribulation were bidding.","Others had lost the qualification to compete.","It wasn’t because their financial resources couldn’t keep up.","Their ambitions couldn’t.","Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation vied for it!","They aimed for future transcending tribulations.","Scattered Tribulation experts of the Seventh Tribulation contested for their own strength","and to maintain their status and family.","What did the scattered experts of the Sixth Tribulation have?","They had power, they had family, but they weren’t superpowers. Even if the Nine Tribulations Tower’s power defied the heavens, acquiring it would still be like holding onto a","hot potato.","So, there was no need to vie for it.","“Fight for it, and preferably stall for a bit longer!” Jian Wushuang’s temples bulged, his whole","body stiffened.","This was a side effect.","Forcing and rapidly converting Life power had repercussions on oneself.","It wasn’t like when he revived Fuego, proceeding calmly and steadily.","Now he was too rushed, even more so than during battles.","He needed to condense Life power that would entice the Scattered Tribulation experts of","the Seventh Tribulation.","Otherwise, bringing it out wouldn’t hold much value.","Using the remains of Dong Jun as the host, the powerful force of Life gradually gathered.","It took almost the time for an incense stick to burn.","However, the number of strong bidders was dwindling. Some of the peak forces’ experts had stopped bidding altogether,","From the side of the Shi Kingdom’s royal family, the bid had reached 460,000 primordial","stones.","“Brother Shi Xiu, you should prepare for your tribulation. It’s better to let this Nine","Tribulations Tower belong to me!”","“500,000!” After speaking, the elder who spoke first offered a price surpassing that of the","Shi Kingdom’s royal family.","500,000 primordial stones.","Even for a Seventh Tribulation, it would require 50 epochs.","Crucially, even the Shi Kingdom’s royal family lacked a Universe Master at the Seventh","Tribulation.","For Shi Xiu to condense it himself would require several hundred epochs.","This was already a sky-high price.","Shi Xiu tapped the armrest of his throne, not out of hesitation but to contact several","ancestors of the royal family to discuss the value of the Nine Tribulations Tower.","Now, the bidding was no longer an individual’s decision.","Behind him were the strong members of the royal family.","Shi Xiu was on the verge of his tribulation, requiring a lot of primordial stones. Ile didn’t","need to spend a large sum on a treasure whose use was unknown.","But the royal family was wealthy!","Now, he represented the royal family.","As long as those ancestors were willing to pay, securing it was no problem.","This was the Shi Kingdom.","Ranked first among the 16 Kingdoms of Qingchao, it was a superpowerful divine nation.","Their financial strength was unmatched.","Snap!","The sound of fingers tapping the stone throne echoed, and Shi Xiu received the command from the ancestors, giving him confidence in his heart."]},{"number":5785,"title":"Chapter 5785 Shi Xiu’s Tyrannical Ways","paragraphs":["5785 Shi Xiu’s Tyrannical Ways","Looking at the old man who made the bid, he said leisurely, “Brother Liancheng, you’re old, you shouldn’t take this risk anymore.”","“800.000!”","Shi Xiu quoted a price directly, raising it to the highest.","He raised it by a full 300,000 primordial stones.","Liancheng, a strong figure at the Seventh Tribulation, didn’t look too good.","He wasn’t a strong figure from the Ancient Wood Continent, but from the Black Heaven. He was also an ancestor of a force.","Within his family, there was a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation.","Securing the Nine Tribulations Tower, even if he couldn’t use it himself, he could give it to the Universe Master of his family.","But to really contend for it.","He couldn’t compete with the royal family of Shi Kingdom.","Originally, he thought it was Shi Xiu contending for it. Now, seeing Shi Xiu bidding as if it cost nothing, he understood that the royal family of Shi Kingdom had made a move.","It was uncontestable.","“I leh, kid, don’t end up with it in your hands!” Liancheng sneered, then closed his eyes.","Consider it giving up.","Feng Jiuwu, who was hosting the auction, also understood that there shouldn’t be anyone bidding among the strong figures in the hall.","The royal family of Shi Kingdom was sure to win.","No one would dare to provoke them.","As for malicious bidding.","That would offend people.","In fact, Lian Xing could also contend for it.","If he had the financial resources.","The Shi family had a vast business, but also many people.","A large group of strong figures to support.","Lian Xing was different, he was alone.","As for those disciples, not only did he not need to support them, but the disciples also had to show filial respect to him,","Moreover, the profits from the Divine Casting Workshop he established were terrifyingly high.","The key was that he didn’t need to personally craft treasures.","His disciples were enough.","Those disciples could only get thirty percent of the primordial stones.","The rest went into Lian Xing’s hands.","Still, there were countless people trying to come in before and after.","But looking at Lian Xing, there seemed to be no intention to bid.","Perhaps he wasn’t interested in this treasure.","In fact, Lian Xing had once crazily collected dozens of treasures rumored to have come from the Ancient Moon ruins, but none of them were usable.","Based on his inspection, he found some strange treasures, all of which were just decorations. Utterly useless. Consequently, he didn’t persist further, thus refraining from making a bid this time.","There was actually another person in the hall capable of bidding. And once they did, the royal family of Shi Kingdom had to consider whether they should compete.","That person was Fan Tianfeng.","Her current status granted her the capability to contend.","However, Fan Tianfeng was currently uninterested in these treasures.","What mattered most to her was breaking through to become the Universe Master and then returning to the Qishen Temple.","She had reached a point where she no longer cared about treasures.","“Friend Shi Xiu bids 800,000. If no one else bids, the Nine Tribulations Tower will...”","Before Feng Jiawu finished her sentence, Jian Wushuang raised his arm, signaling to wait. He was going to make a bid.","“I have a treasure to mortgage for auction!” Jian Wushuang spoke directly.","Upon seeing Jian Wushuang’s bid, many people were stunned.","Most of them didn’t even recognize Jian Wushuang.","The Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation could see through Jian Wushuang’s cultivation and realized he was just an Emperor, causing a slight frown,","There were only two Emperors in the hall.","It would have been normal if Fan Tianfeng had bid, but for Jian Wushuang, a random Emperor, to dare to bid was truly surprising.","It left many people bewildered.","Even Sword Immortal Tonghe beside him hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to counterbid. Lian Xing also stared at Jian Wushuang in astonishment, secretly speculating whether Jian Wushuang would really put up for auction the treasure that enhanced divine power.","He knew Jian Wushuang had the Beast God Weapon, and the value of that treasure was indeed considerable.","At least, it was a universe treasure of the Seventh Tribulation.","However, this seemed too risky.","An Emperor auctioning off strange treasures?","There was no necessity for that.","Either he was foolish or it was related to the Nine Tribulations Tower.","“Could it be?” Fan Tianfeng looked at Jian Wushuang.","She was the one in the hall who understood Jian Wushuang the best.","Also hailing from the Qishen Temple, Fan Tianfeng couldn’t help but admire Jian","Wushuang’s strength.","Despite having countless resources for cultivation, she was still no match for Jian","Wushuang.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s bid probably indicated he had truly seen through the secrets of the Nine Tribulations Tower.","Shi Xiu, seeing that he was actually contending with an Emperor, shifted his gaze, speculating about Jian Wushuang’s background and the powerful figure behind him.","He couldn’t believe that an Emperor could discern the uniqueness of the Nine Tribulations","Tower.","At this moment, the powerful figures of the Shi Kingdom’s royal family also informed Shi Xiu of Jian Wushuang’s identity.","Shi Xiu realized the connection between Jian Wushuang and his grandson, which piqued his interest even more.","After a brief investigation, he learned about the powerful individuals Jian Wushuang had","befriended.","The newly ascended Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, Yun Zhi.","The reclusive Sword Immortal Tonghe, Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation, residing in","the Shi Kingdom.","The number one Divine Forgemaster of the Ancient Wood Continent, Lian Xing.","The more he inquired, the more surprised Shi Xiu became.","Jian Wushuang, a mere son-in-law of Yue Kingdom, had actually befriended such super","strong individuals simultaneously.","And it was indeed true.","Due to his affiliation with Yue Kingdom, Jian Wushuang first befriended Queen Yun Zhi.","Subsequently, through Queen Yun Zhi, he got to know Sword Immortal Tonghe.","Their relationship deepened as both practiced the Sword Dao.","As for Lian Xing, gratitude went to Fan Tianfeng.","But it also owed to his own efforts.","If his strength hadn’t been extraordinary and gained Lian Xing’s favor, he wouldn’t have","been recommended to attend such auctions.","Before becoming a son-in-law of Yue Kingdom, Jian Wushuang had already defeated Shi Kingdom’s genius, Shi Jiu.","It wasn’t just luck; the most crucial factor was his strength."]},{"number":5786,"title":"Chapter 5786: Auction of Life Power","paragraphs":["Chapter 5786: Auction of Life Power","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Her own strength was not remarkable, but when it came to appraising treasures, she was truly unparalleled.","Otherwise, she would not be presiding over the auction.","“The vitality is so pure!” Feng Jiawu exclaimed in surprise.","This time, even the Universe Masters were stunned.","The power of Life.","At the pinnacle of wood!","The vitality found only among the Wanliu, the vitality most needed for the Scattered Tribulation.","Jian Wushuang also feigned surprise, incredulously asking, “There’s still vitality in this severed finger?”","“Friend, you may not be in the Tribulation Realm, so you might not be very sensitive to the power of Life. There is indeed vitality in this severed finger, but it’s obscured by divine power. Even Universe Masters would find it difficult to detect!” Feng Jiawu explained slowly, though inwardly, she felt a twinge of jealousy towards this fortunate lad.","This was the power of Life!","The power that could drive the Scattered Tribulation mad.","For instance, ‘Liancheng’, the Seventh Tribulation powerhouse who had previously contended for the Nine Tribulations Tower.","He had completely lost interest in the tower now.","Compared to vitality, all treasures were nothing but rubbish.","What was most important for the Scattered Tribulation?","Improving strength?","That was simply impossible.","Just surviving was considered lucky.","Buying treasures, venturing out, wasn’t it all just to acquire items that could sustain vitality, to maintain combat strength?","In the face of the purest vitality, what did sustaining life even mean?","This was about increasing life.","Increasing life meant being able to return to the peak period.","Divine power would naturally skyrocket.","A hundred benefits, without any harm!","Some of the Scattered Tribulation participants couldn’t contain their excitement anymore, urging, “Feng Jiawu, why don’t you extract the vitality from that severed finger so that we can bid for it!”","Liancheng sneered coldly, his voice resolute. “No need for that. I’ll offer one million primordial stones, along with this severed finger, to seal the deal!”","“One million?”","The Scattered Tribulation experts in the Sixth Tribulation were now stirred.","In truth, one million wasn’t much. If one lacked enough primordial stones, they would sell off unnecessary treasures. They’d even sell the necessary ones, if need be.","“I’ll offer 600,000 primordial stones, plus a Universe Master treasure from the Seven Tribulation!”","The one making the offer was a strong expert in the Six Tribulation.","They even brought out treasures from the Seven Tribulation. It seemed they were willing to mortgage their key treasures, which was indeed insane.","But this was just the beginning.","Following that, Scattered Tribulation experts continued to bid.","In an instant, it soared to two million primordial stones.","Although Jian Wushuang knew deep down that bringing this out would cause a frenzy of contention, he hadn’t anticipated the bidding to reach such heights.","Two million primordial stones already?","Even Shi Xiu, who originally contested for the Nine Tribulation Tower, had now placed a bid, and it was dominating the scene.","Clearly, they had received intel from within the royal family.","The power of Life.","It was related to the strength and life-and-death battles of Scattered Tribulation experts.","Naturally, they would vie for it.","Don’t forget, the wealth within major families was controlled by Scattered Tribulation experts.","Take, for instance, the royal family of the Shi Kingdom.","Among the Universe Masters, Shi Xiu was the strongest.","But he was only in the Six Tribulation.","He simply couldn’t bear the brunt of the situation.","Still, it required the suppression from ancestors at the Seventh Tribulation, even up to the Eighth Tribulation, to quell all parties.","So, the power of this Life must be obtained.","In each auction, whenever the power of life appeared, someone would bid fervently for it.","It was a must-win situation.","Those below the Sixth Tribulation had no qualification to make bids anymore.","Soon, it was the Seventh Tribulation, and various forces were madly scrambling for it.","Jian Wushuang himself hadn’t expected that the Life power he had just infused would be so valuable.","He was equally astonished.","Fortunately, some people believed the reasons he fabricated.","Sword Immortal Tonghe even envied him, saying, “Jian Wushuang, you’re really lucky. The divine power contained in this severed finger is already valuable, and the Life power within can even assist Eighth Tribulation experts. Its value is immeasurable!”","“But how come I didn’t notice it!” Jian Wushuang pretended to be clueless, playing his part well.","He intentionally acted as if he knew nothing.","And he even went on to inquire about the power of Life.","If anyone were to doubt Jian Wushuang, they would probably suspect that he had obtained some treasure trove from a mighty figure.","They would never imagine that Jian Wushuang could wield the power of Life.","Currently, aside from a few individuals within Qishen Temple, no more than five people knew about his Life power, excluding the oaths taken by several members of the Giant God Clan.","The remaining ones were!","Zhen Ling of Qishen Temple!","The archenemy Mie Sheng!","And the last one, in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Babidi!","These three.","Two of them hailed from the Starry Sky.","And one of them wasn’t even human.","They were just true spirits condensed by the Origin Source of Qishen.","Each one was extraordinary.","Even the super-strong in Ancient Moon Spacetime, despite being at the Eighth Tribulation, couldn’t believe that someone could wield the power of Life.","However, he could only do such a thing once.","If he were to reveal the power of Life again, everyone would probably conclude that he had obtained a super-secret treasure trove.","At that time, he would be like a mobile treasure trove, and it was likely that super beings would come to suppress him.","Then he probed the soul and gained more Life power.","Jian Wushuang naturally wouldn’t do such a thing a second time.","The first time was an adventure.","The second time would be courting death.","Even though he had a second Nascent Soul, he wouldn’t dare to be reckless.","The second Nascent Soul had a miniature reincarnation.","It could be considered a trump card left for future confrontations with Mie Sheng.","If he won, he would control the reincarnation smoothly.","If he lost, the second Nascent Soul would flee.","Of course, he didn’t want to lose.","The treasures on his main body were too important.","The primordial Starry Sky derived from the evolution of the Extreme Dao could be said to be one of a kind.","Not to mention the divine body, just the loss of the supreme treasures would be difficult for him to bear.","Without the Beast God Weapon, without the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","Then his combat power would be greatly reduced.","If it weren’t for the power of the blood color and the divine power enhancement bestowed by Babidi that time.","He would only have up to 100,000 divine powers now.","Without the Beast God Weapon enhancement, he would only be comparable to an Emperor in the Tribulation Realm.","Without comprehending the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, he would break through to the Universe Master, not knowing when it would happen.","So he couldn’t afford to lose, nor could he take risks in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","He could only act dumb with all his might.","Whether others believed it or not, he was almost convinced himself.","“It’s already three million primordial stones!” Jian Wushuang widened his eyes, his joy beyond words.","In his heart, Jian Wushuang was still secretly evaluating Lian Xing.","This Ancient Wood Continent’s number one Divine Craftsman was also a powerful Scattered Tribulation expert.","Although he didn’t lack Life power much.","But facing such pure Life force he brought out, he should also be tempted.","If the other party also joined, he could earn a little more.","Just as he was looking forward to it.","On the side of Shi Xiu, he reached out his hand and said indifferently, “I, Shi Xiu, will light a sky lantern today, continue!”","As soon as these words were spoken.","Many people in the hall fell silent.","The sky lantern was lit.","Naturally, there was no need to bid again, it was already implicitly the highest bid.","Their bids were meaningless.","Unless it was bankruptcy of the royal family of the Shi Kingdom.","They could then buy this Life power.","So no one dared to bid again.","Jian Wushuang was somewhat speechless, wouldn’t this push the price down?"]},{"number":5787,"title":"Chapter 5787: Fan Tianfeng’s Price","paragraphs":["Chapter 5787: Fan Tianfeng’s Price","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At the same time, he was also looking forward to someone daring to compete with the Shi Kingdom’s royal family.","Unfortunately, no one made a sound this time.","Lian Xing didn’t have any intention of bidding.","Just when Jian Wushuang felt that there was no hope, a voice broke the silence in the hall.","“I bid 10 million primordial stones!”","Jian Wushuang knew the bidder!","Fan Tianfeng.","After bidding, he glanced at Jian Wushuang.","Fan Tianfeng’s bid caused the experts in the hall to be stunned.","Outsiders all knew that the Flame God and the Shi Kingdom were practically tied together.","He didn’t expect to have an internal conflict.","Shi Xiu’s expression was also a little ugly.","10 million primordial stones.","He couldn’t even afford it.","Some of the experts from the Yue Kingdom’s royal family were also somewhat puzzled by Fan Tianfeng’s bid. They were also somewhat angry.","Although the descendants of the Flame God were not unique Special Life Forms, they would still have a tribulation and a supreme tribulation.","However, there was only one Seventh Tribulation expert in the entire clan.","Most of the experts under the Flame God were disciples.","There were very few experts among the descendants.","He wasn’t too optimistic either.","Although the only Seventh Tribulation expert failed to transcend the tribulation, with the help of the Flame God, his strength remained at its peak.","There was no need for Fan Tianfeng to fight for the Life power here.","Feng Jiuwu was also feeling a little awkward at this moment. She was even more jealous of Fan Tianfeng for being able to use the treasures in the Flame God Kingdom at will.","10 million primordial stones was the net worth of an average Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation.","As long as the sky lantern was not extinguished, it would be endless.","After Fan Tianfeng reported 10 million, Shi Xiu remained unmoved.","He only passed on what had happened here to the royal family.","10 million primordial stones was indeed a huge fortune to an individual.","However, for a royal family that had existed for countless years.","This was nothing.","The main reason was that Fan Tianfeng’s bid was targeted at the royal family.","An Emperor?!","They were just ants.","However, she had the Flame God behind her, so they had to take her seriously.","Now, everyone knew that the Flame God was the number one expert of the Ancient Wood Continent.","The Divine Wood King was about to die of old age.","The old ancestor of the Shi Kingdom was not much different.","Only the Flame God could live forever.","Because it was a Special Life Form.","There was no tribulation.","However, there was no Origin Source Universe.","They were the purest divine power cultivators.","With advantages, there would be disadvantages.","The Flame God didn’t have an Origin Source universe, and its comprehension was poor.","The Eighth Tribulation realm was basically the limit.","In terms of battle strength, he could still suppress Scattered Tribulants.","If he really encountered an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master, he would basically be trampled on.","Universe Masters at the Eighth Tribulation could absorb their universe source into their divine bodies.","This was something that only an Eighth Tribulation expert could do.","Basically, he was fighting while bringing along a Dao Arena.","His strength had almost undergone a qualitative change.","This was also the terrifying aspect of an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","Jian Wushuang was different from ordinary Universe Masters. Even though he was in the Third Tribulation, he could keep the universe in his body as long as he condensed it.","Or rather, it was stored in the Starry Sky.","This was also one of the benefits of the Extreme Path.","The uniqueness of the Eighth Tribulation created a huge faction that possessed the power of an Eighth Tribulation.","And a deep foundation.","This was also the reason why the Shi Kingdom could become the number one Divine Kingdom among the Sixteen Qingchao Kingdoms.","They even suppressed the Ancient Wood Sect.","This was because of the Flame God.","Now that Fan Tianfeng did not give the Shi Kingdom face, the Shi Kingdom really had no choice.","No one knew what Fan Tianfeng was thinking.","The few Seventh Tribulation Ancestors of the Shi Kingdom’s royal family were a little restless.","If the Flame God needed this Life force, they would not dare to fight for it.","But nobody told them anything beforehand!","Now, the Shi Kingdom was already in a dilemma.","Jian Wushuang didn’t know what Fan Tianfeng was up to.","He never expected that Fan Tianfeng would actually help him this time.","Fan Tianfeng sat on her throne, her expression unmoved. She did not care about the Shi Kingdom’s royal family’s opinion at all.","She was indeed helping Jian Wushuang this time.","It was not because of her relationship with Jian Wushuang.","Instead, it was because she felt that this feeling of being high above was very wonderful.","Just raising his hand was enough to drive an Emperor like Jian Wushuang crazy.","10 million primordial stones.","At the same time, he was not afraid of the Shi Kingdom’s royal family.","“Tsk, tsk, Jian Wushuang, what matters is background, not strength!” Fan Tianfeng looked at Jian Wushuang and sneered in her heart.","Jian Wushuang nodded excitedly.","If he knew what Fan Tianfeng was thinking, he would probably vomit blood.","What a mad woman.","Although Shi Xiu’s expression didn’t change, he was disgusted by this method.","He was a Universe Master, the hope of Shi Kingdom, and he didn’t rely much on Flame God.","Unlike the Scattered Tribulant experts in the royal family, they were not like Flame God.","If Flame God really wanted this Life force, the old guys from the royal family would probably give it to him with both hands.","Thinking of this, Shi Xiu made up his mind.","He had to become a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation.","Or even the Eighth Tribulation.","To rebuild the glory of the Shi Kingdom.","There was no need to rely on a Special Life Form.","On the stage, although Feng Jiuwu was embarrassed, she was also very dissatisfied with Fan Tianfeng’s actions.","However, she was a successor of the Flame God. The superiority of a successor of a divine being made her feel that this matter was not too much.","What was the Shi Kingdom’s royal family?","Without the Flame God, the current Daughter Kingdom would be able to suppress the Shi Kingdom.","Not to mention surpassing the Ancient Wood Sect.","The other experts in the hall all had ulterior motives.","They were also guessing whether the young master of the Divine Kingdom’s malicious bid was a signal for the Flame God to part ways with the Stone Kingdom.","Most of them were just watching a joke.","The weakening of the Shi Kingdom was good for everyone.","Naturally, he enjoyed it.","He even wanted to see Fan Tianfeng continue bidding.","Jian Wushuang felt that it was enough.","He would be satisfied with 10 million.","Not only could he buy the Nine Tribulations Tower, but he could also participate in the subsequent auction.","He wouldn’t even be able to use them all up when he became a Universe Master.","The hall was silent for the time it takes for an incense stick to burn.","Fan Tianfeng stopped bidding.","The finger that contained the power of Life fell into Shi Xiu’s hand.","As for Shi Xiu, he paid 10 million primordial stones.","10 million!","Even though they were all primordial stones from the royal family.","But Shi Xiu was a member of the royal family.","His heart ached a little.","He had only prepared 20 million primordial stones for the seventh tribulation.","This time, he spent 10 million.","He was still a little dissatisfied.","Fortunately, Fan Tianfeng did not raise the price again.","Otherwise, he would really vomit blood.","Shi Xiu had obtained the treasure.","Jian Wushuang received 10 million primordial stones.","His excitement was not fake.","He really didn’t expect that this Life force could be sold for such a price.","This had already exceeded the value of the power of Life itself.","If one wanted to blame someone, it was Shi Xiu who had to light the sky lantern.","He had spent millions of primordial stones for nothing.","The auction for the Life force had ended.","The bidding of the Nine Tribulations Tower continued.","This time, Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate. He pretended to be a nouveau riche and directly offered 3 million."]},{"number":5788,"title":"Chapter 5788: Seize","paragraphs":["Chapter 5788: Seize","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone fell silent.","Shi Xiu also refrained from making a bid.","Compared to the Nine Tribulations Tower, the power of Life seemed more tangible.","If he bought it and it turned out to be just a decoration, he would incur a huge loss.","Now that Jian Wushuang made a bid, many thought he had gone mad.","An Emperor didn’t have much concept of the primordial stone.","He made a bid of three million without hesitation.","Perhaps acquiring the primordial stone had been too easy for him.","Jian Wushuang didn’t see anything wrong with the price.","With his relationship with Master Xuan Yi, even if it were 30 million, he would still take it.","Maybe this Nine Tribulations Tower was no less significant than the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","The key was the word “Nine Tribulations” and its nine layers.","It was enough to set people’s imaginations ablaze.","After winning the bid, Jian Wushuang directly stored it within the Origin Source Universe without even placing it in the mustard seed space.","He just couldn’t shake off the feeling of unease.","He wanted to quickly confirm the resonance transmitted by the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","But with so many people around, it wasn’t easy to explore directly.","It wouldn’t be too late to study it later once he left.","He still had seven million primordial stones left on hand. Perhaps there would be more suitable treasures for him to contend for in the future.","Below the Seven Tribulations, hardly anyone could surpass him.","Unfortunately, most of the items auctioned next were of no use to him.","They were all bought by the Universe Masters.","He couldn’t afford to be too ostentatious. Even with a large sum of money, he couldn’t buy everything.","It would be too wasteful.","The primordial stone was of great help to the Origin Source Universe.","He could also keep some for himself to stabilize his own universe after stepping into the Universe Master realm.","So, he didn’t bid much for the subsequent items.","There were a few instances in between where he made bids, lest it seemed he didn’t attach importance to the Nine Tribulations Tower.","Only a few bids were made, but none of them secured any treasures.","Soon, the auction was nearing its end.","Feng Jiawu also announced the three most anticipated treasures of this auction.","All three items were to be auctioned together.","They were categorized as A, B, and C.","The final treasures had their own starting prices.","The one labeled as A had the highest starting price.","A whopping 1 million primordial stones.","It’s worth noting that in this auction, without the appearance of the power of Life and the Nine Tribulations Tower, it was difficult to fetch a price exceeding 1 million.","And this was just the starting price.","The first item, labeled as A.","“The Tome of Thick Earth!”","This was an innate Origin Source treasure.","It was the most crucial treasure during the crossing of the seventh tribulation.","Once this treasure was obtained, there was at least a 10 percent increase in the chances of crossing the seventh tribulation.","It corresponded to the highest tribulation.","The seventh supreme tribulation, the tribulation of the Origin Source Universe, was governed by the law rule of water.","It required the Origin Source of earth to deal with.","This Tome of Thick Earth was the key treasure.","As soon as this treasure appeared, it caused a sensation.","Inside the hall, there were several Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation.","And their backgrounds were extraordinary.","The price instantly began to skyrocket.","Soon it reached 5 million.","Although it was insane, Scattered Tribulation experts could only watch helplessly.","So, they shifted their gaze to the second item.","Title: The Auction of Primordial Finger of the Great Wilderness!","Auction code: “Primordial Finger of the Great Wilderness!”","It was a secret technique at the peak of the Tribulation Realm.","Starting price: 800,000 primordial stones.","It was a pinnacle masterpiece created by a Tribulation Realm Universe Master.","There was only one opportunity for learning.","Once learned, the jade slip containing the technique would shatter.","The appearance of this technique caused quite a stir among Universe Masters of the Five Tribulations Realm.","With a starting price of 800,000 primordial stones, even Universe Masters of the Five Tribulations Realm gritted their teeth and contended for it!","For the scattered strong of the Tribulation Realm, there was a feeling of tears flowing as they watched.","Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation Realm were busy contending for the Heitu Legacy.","They were not interested in this technique.","If they passed their seventh tribulation and became Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation Realm, why bother learning someone else’s technique? They could create their own.","Jian Wushuang was not interested in this technique.","He didn’t need it himself.","His divine power was enhanced by the Beast God Weapon.","In swordsmanship, he had the Starry Sky Records waiting for him to create his own peak technique.","There was no need for him to learn from others.","On the other hand, Sword Immortal Tonghe beside him was contending for the Heitu Legacy.","And it seemed that he even pawned his own treasures.","The current highest bid had already exceeded ten million.","And it was still rising.","A Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation Realm.","That was already one of the top-notch experts in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Whether they were independent cultivators or major powers, they were all vying for it.","If an independent cultivator became a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation Realm, they could establish their own sect.","If a major power produced a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation Realm, they could instantly rise to the top.","With a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation Realm, they could also expand their territory wildly.","This would lead to rapid development for families and sects.","A force with a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation Realm was almost invincible.","Because within their own domain, a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation Realm possessed the combat power of an Eighth Tribulation Realm.","As long as they didn’t provoke Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation Realm, they were unbeatable.","And in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation Realm were almost like mythical creatures, rarely seen.","Most of them had left Ancient Moon Spacetime.","It took quite a bit of luck to provoke an Eighth Tribulation expert.","Therefore, within Ancient Moon Spacetime, the Universe Masters of the Seventh Tribulation were almost invincible.","Thus, facing the Tome of Thick Earth, these Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation were all excited, wishing they could risk everything.","Several Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation even raised their bids to astronomical levels.","They staked their entire worth.","They could always venture into secret realms and vie for treasures if they lost their treasures, but the Tome of Thick Earth would only appear once in an era.","It had to be obtained.","“Everyone, isn’t this a bit too much?” Bloodshot streaks flashed in Shi Xiu’s eyes.","The current price had exceeded two million primordial stones.","To the extent that even the second secret technique had been auctioned off.","The standoff continued.","As soon as Shi Xiu spoke, a universe master of the Sixth Tribulation sneered, “What? Isn’t the Shi family grand enough to not care about these things!”","If this weren’t an auction, these Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation would probably come to blows.","This treasure could be auctioned off.","The person who obtained it would most likely be a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation or a Scattered Tribulation expert who didn’t have any backing.","Otherwise, it wouldn’t be put up for auction.","Any powerful expert with backing would leave it for their descendants.","Shi Xiu knew that this time, things were going to get serious, so he didn’t waste any time.","He raised his bid as well.","But this time, no one gave him face.","The price was directly inflated to 50 million primordial stones.","In the end, Shi Xiu, from the royal family of Shi Kingdom, secured the Tome of Thick Earth for 50 million primordial stones.","If a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm were to condense it, it would take 50,000 epochs.","There would be consumption in between.","There would still be cultivation.","And they would need to purchase some precious divine power treasures to enhance their divine power.","Storing 50 million primordial stones was extremely difficult.","50 million was an astronomical figure even for a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation.","Shi Xiu, who was already at the peak of the Sixth Tribulation realm, indeed needed this treasure.","If he could successfully cross the tribulation.","Shi Kingdom would have a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","There would be no need to rely on the Flame God anymore."]},{"number":5789,"title":"Chapter 5789: Ancient Monastery","paragraphs":["Chapter 5789: Ancient Monastery","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Moreover, the value of a Universe Master in the Seventh Tribulation was far more than just 50 million primordial stones.","Aside from the enhancement in combat prowess, there was also the opportunity to break through to the Eighth Tribulation.","Undoubtedly, most powerhouses coveted this chance.","The Scattered Tribulation experts were even more envious.","That’s also why, initially, the top ten Seventh Tribulation powerhouses joined forces to besiege Babidi.","Wasn’t it all for a glimmer of hope?","As the auction of the Tome of Thick Earth concluded, this auction itself was also drawing to a close.","Now, only one treasure remained.","Starting bid: 500,000 primordial stones.","The post-natal Universe Treasure.","Though not an innate Universe Treasure,","This post-natal Universe Treasure was crafted using the essence blood of a Special Life Form in the Seventh Tribulation.","Its value was also considerable.","Its upper limit was also in the Eighth Tribulation.","But its current power was only around the Fifth Tribulation.","It required 500,000 divine power to activate.","It could be considered as a second treasure suitable for Universe Masters in the Fifth Tribulation.","Apart from the personal ultimate treasure, one could also cultivate some other ultimate treasures.","This ultimate treasure was quite good.","At least its upper limit was high.","Its power was also formidable.","Comparatively, it was crafted using the essence blood of a Special Life Form in the Seventh Tribulation.","Of course, it couldn’t compare with the Beast God Weapon.","This Universe Treasure, crafted from the essence of that Speical Life Form’s blood, was merely a fraction of its potential.","Jian Wushuang’s Beast God Weapon, however, was empowered by the complete essence of a primordial Beast God. In terms of origin, its potential far surpassed that of this Universe Treasure.","Thus, Jian Wushuang remained uninterested in the final treasure.","“The Ancient Monastery Jade Urn!” Feng Jiuyue announced from the high platform.","The Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation below had no need for it, nor did they find it necessary to cultivate another treasure to enhance their combat prowess. They preferred preparing for the seventh tribulation.","However, for Universe Masters of the Fifth Tribulation realm, the situation was different. They still had a considerable need for increased power.","The crisis of the sixth tribulation was far less daunting than that of the seventh.","To enhance their strength, they had to venture out.","The Ancient Monastery Jade Urn was particularly suitable for Universe Masters of the Fifth Tribulation.","On the grand hall, many powerful beings had already begun to depart. Most of the Scattered Seventh Tribulation masters had left, as well as many Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation.","The struggle for the final treasure was mainly among Universe Masters of the Fifth and Fourth tribulation.","There wasn’t much spectacle to behold.","At this moment, Lian Xing also rose to leave. However, before departing, he transmitted to Jian Wushuang, “Kid, this treasure suits you very well. You better acquire it!”","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows slightly.","Suitable for him?","The Ancient Monastery Jade Urn.","Although it was crafted from very unique materials and classified as a Universe Treasure, it might not necessarily suit him, an emperor!","The main function of this urn was to store one’s own divine power and release it internally during battles with strong opponents, without depleting one’s own divine power.","It was a single-use treasure that could be reused.","However, the stored divine power was limited, requiring replenishment after each use.","Standard cultivators naturally find replenishing their divine power quite fulfilling.","However, Jian Wushuang wasn’t your average individual.","This line of thought suited him quite well.","However, the current bidding had already surpassed a million.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t keen on squandering such a large sum of primordial stones on what could be considered a trivial purchase.","If this Ancient Monastery Jade Urn could store Origin Source, he would definitely acquire it.","His aim was at the Origin Source, not divine power.","In the future, he probably wouldn’t lean too heavily towards divine power.","Therefore, he wasn’t inclined to divert his attention towards nurturing this treasure.","With the Beast God Weapon and the General Armor, most of his treasures were invaluable in terms of divine power.","There was no need to purchase this jade pot.","However, he didn’t immediately refute Lian Xing.","Instead, he inquired through voice transmission, “Senior, what special features does this jade urn have?”","Jian Wushuang wasn’t foolish.","If Lian Xing claimed it had significant uses, he might as well let him explain what those were before making a decision.","If persuaded, he would buy it.","If not, he wouldn’t lose anything.","It was practically a win-win situation.","For others, Lian Xing wouldn’t spare much effort.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s doubts, Lian Xing didn’t conceal anything and revealed his insights.","There was another unique aspect of this Ancient Monastery Jade Urn that Feng Jiuyu didn’t mention.","Because mentioning it was equivalent to not mentioning it at all.","That was the connection between the power of the jade pot and the Origin Source.","In reality, the strongest Origin Source resided within this Ancient Monastery Jade Urn.","The stronger the Origin Source, the more astonishing the stored divine power.","Lian Xing was aware that Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source far surpassed that of ordinary individuals.","Hence, the recommendation.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime was predominantly a realm of divine power.","Therefore, Feng Jiuyu didn’t elaborate much on the Origin Source.","Explaining it to these people would be of little use.","Because it wasn’t crucial.","However, this aspect was much more significant for Jian Wushuang.","It also gave him a reason to take action.","“1.8 million!” Jian Wushuang slowly raised his hand, stating his price.","Instantly, a solemn expression fell upon the faces of the strong within the hall.","A Fifth Tribulation Universe Master from the Shi Kingdom rose directly, his voice filled with anger, “Jian Wushuang, you, a mere Emperor, think you can contend with us just because you have primordial stones? Be careful not to lose your life!”","This Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation was also a disciple of Stone Xiu, a core member of the royal family, naturally aware of Jian Wushuang’s dealings with Shi Jiu.","Moreover, having previously refrained from retaliating against Fan Tianfeng’s malicious bidding and seizing the opportunity to teach him a lesson!","But now, facing Jian Wushuang, this Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation found him truly formidable.","Engaging in combat with him would undoubtedly be a mismatch.","However, it was impossible for the other party to oppress him solely based on strength.","He stood up as well, casting a sideways glance and weighing the mustard seed in his hand, saying, “Dao Friend, if you find my offer problematic, feel free to continue bidding. Why bother having a conflict with me? Or perhaps you can’t produce 1.8 million primordial stones?”","“A mere Emperor dares to speak arrogantly! If it weren’t for your stroke of luck, obtaining the power of Life, where would you get so many primordial stones!”","Jian Wushuang sneered coldly, sitting back on his chair, casually remarking, “Don’t forget, that power of Life was bought by your royal family. If you’re unwilling, you can return it!”","This statement caused the face of the Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation to flush red.","Indeed, the power of Life had been purchased by the royal family.","And now, it might even be in the hands of several venerable ancestors.","Such pure power of Life might even be offered to the first ancestor within the royal family.","An Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouse.","However, Jian Wushuang knew best about the power of Life he had condensed himself.","That power of Life could greatly assist Universe Masters of the Seven Tribulation.","But it was utterly useless for those of the Eight Tribulation.","It was like a drop in the ocean.","Of no significant use.","In the past, the Dao Lord could help those of the Sixth Tribulation.","Now, the Emperor assisted those of the Seven Tribulation."]},{"number":5790,"title":"Chapter 5790 Yuan Blank (1)","paragraphs":["5790 Yuan Blank (1)","When he reached the Universe Master, perhaps he could gather the Life force to restore the strength of the Eight Tribulation experts.","This power was much more terrifying than what he possessed now.","The Universe Master from Shi Kingdom, a Fifth Tribulation expert, realized that there was no point in wasting words to intimidate Jian Wushuang.","He simply turned and left.","The treasures he used, he had to buy them himself.","At this moment, relying on the family was unreliable.","If everyone depended on the family to cover for them, it would have collapsed long ago. Only the top figures within the family would mobilize the entire clan for cultivation. Not everyone was like Fan Tianfeng.","Jian Wushuang was curious about what aspect of Fan Tianfeng had caught the attention of the Flame God.","She was treated like this.","It had only been a little over 10,000 years since entering the Ancient Moon Spacetime, yet in this short time span, the Flame God had established such a status for Fan Tianfeng.","This woman was extraordinary.","For 1.8 million primordial stones, he acquired the Ancient Monastery Jade Urn.","With the auction officially over, Jian Wushuang nodded to Fan Tianfeng before leaving.","He didn’t speak, but there was gratitude in his gesture.","If there was a chance, he would see Fan Tianfeng again before leaving Shi Kingdom and try to share as much information as he could.","He couldn’t watch her walk into death.","From Ancient Moon Spacetime to Qishen Temple.","He didn’t know how many epochs or how many spacetimes he needed to cross.","During this period, Fan Tianfeng could become a Universe Master.","Even with several Seven Tribulation Realm experts and the Flame God’s avatar, he felt there was no possibility of defeating Mie Sheng.","Mie Sheng seemed to be his fate. Apart from him, no one could defeat him.","Leaving the auction hall and ascending the stone steps, Jian Wushuang appeared in a certain courtyard in the southern city.","To his surprise, Lian Xing was waiting for him.","“It seems you’ve acquired the ancient monastery!” Lian Xing nodded approvingly.","Jian Wushuang hurriedly expressed his gratitude, “Many thanks for your guidance, Senior. Obtaining this treasure is entirely thanks to your discerning eye!”","Flattery costs nothing.","At this moment, it would be remiss not to butter him up a bit.","Lian Xing waved his hand casually, saying, “It’s a trivial matter. Come with me; the materials are ready, and we can start refining the Divine-tier sword blank!”","Jian Wushuang nodded in agreement.","The two departed together.","This time, they directly entered the core of the ninth level.","The Purgatory World.","The temperature here was so high it could melt the universe.","Jian Wushuang could only withstand it by erupting with five hundred thousand units of divine power through the Divine Beast Armor.","“The flow rate here is very slow; one year outside is equivalent to ten thousand years here!” Lian Xing continued, “To refine the Divine-tier sword blank, I’ll need 30,000 years. Can you endure it? This is just the beginning!”","Jian Wushuang’s resolute gaze remained unchanged.","He could endure hardship.","Even at a thousandfold speed.","Ile hadn’t noticed.","It meant that the spatial stability here was exceptionally strong.","It had merged with time.","Rather than the simple formations he had set up.","Although the flow rate was high, it wasn’t stable.","To refine artifacts here, one must ensure the stability of space.","Lian Xing had paid a considerable price for this.","This time, Jian Wushuang was in a hurry to refine the sword blank here.","“Let’s begin!”","Lian Xing manipulated the flames, starting to merge the materials.","This step was the simplest.","The materials didn’t just melt into liquid like ordinary substances.","It was Jian Wushuang’s first time witnessing such a superb technique.","He was quite astonished.","All the materials ultimately transformed into primordial spiritual energy, floating in the sky.","It was intangible.","Lian Xing also began to focus intently, muttering, “Gather!”","The aura twisted and began to continuously contract inward.","From this alone, Jian Wushuang could discern the mysteries within the space, vividly","manifested.","The inwardly contracting aura was continuously suppressed.","The pressure of the aura began to shatter the space.","The strength of the power exceeded ordinary imagination.","A Divine-tier sword blank.","How could it be so simple?","Some of the subsequent techniques.","Made Jian Wushuang gasp in astonishment.","Originally, he thought he might become a genius in refining if he persevered.","But now, it seemed he wouldn’t have that opportunity.","For the past 10,000 years, he had been mostly watching.","For millennia, Lian Xing repeatedly compressed and restrained the aura.","Finally, it formed a crimson gas.","It already had the shape of a sword.","“Jian Wushuang, catch it. Within 10,000 years, do not let your mental strength dissipate, or","else all previous efforts will be wasted!”","With a flick of his finger, Lian Xing sent the red sword shadow towards Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s figure remained still, but his mental force surged out of his body.","Using his mental force, he condensed a pair of enormous palms, grasping the Sword Qi.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang instantly sensed that his Thought power force was rapidly depleting.","“So, this is the test of will?”","It seemed a bit...","...childish.","“Ah!”","“Ha!”","With a sudden burst, Jian Wushuang directly unleashed the Eternal Ancient Transformation.","In this place, divine power was necessary to withstand the temperature contained within","the flames.","Mental force also depended on the strength of the origin.","The power of the blue Starry Sky surrounded him.","It propelled Jian Wushuang to the peak state.","Mental force strengthened once again.","Lian Xing’s eyes flickered as he murmured, “Is this your confidence?”","He believed in Jian Wushuang, in that unstoppable self-assurance.","With absolute confidence and strength at the same level, he was the absolute future","powerhouse.","“Endure it. As long as your Thought power withstands the test of 10,000 years, you’ll be","halfway to success!” Lian Xing reminded from the side.","Jian Wushuang remained silent, simply gripping onto that Sword Qi.","His stubborn expression even earned admiration from Lian Xing.","It required immense perseverance and willpower.","The bitterness of it all, only Jian Wushuang knew, which was why Lian Xing had initially","tried to persuade him.","Not everyone could endure this kind of torment.","Eight Tribulation powerhouses naturally wouldn’t mind.","But Jian Wushuang was just an Emperor!","Why would an Emperor go to such lengths?","No one knew... Perhaps some wouldn’t understand why the fate of an entire spacetime fell upon an","Emperor, such a tragedy.","But Jian Wushuang never lost confidence because of it, nor did he ever complain, even","when Zhen Ling used him as bait.","He turned this unjust fate into his own tribulation, using his strength superior to his peers","to mask the responsibilities he shouldn’t have borne...","10,000 years.","In the blink of an eye.","Under the cleansing of mental force, the Sword Qi had already merged with him.","The effect had been achieved.","Lian Xing wasted no time.","He took the Sword Qi from Jian Wushuang’s hand and then drew out an ordinary divine.","sword with its scabbard.","It appeared ordinary, but this divine sword was forged with the hardest spacetime crystals.","Those below the Seventh Tribulation couldn’t destroy it.","Of course, it wasn’t invincible.","It couldn’t destroy the sword itself, but it could disrupt the Origin Source within.","And the Origin Source within was the Sword Qi that Jian Wushuang had cleansed for 10,000","years.","The Sword Qi entered the scabbard, and its power erupted.","However, while the Sword Qi merged with Jian Wushuang, it didn’t merge with the divine","sword.","This required Lian Xing’s methods.","By fusing the two together.","It could be successful by 70 percent.","The rest depended on how Jian Wushuang would recognize its ownership.","At that time, Jian Wushuang would need to suppress the divine sword with his own Origin","Source.","The time needed for Lian Xing was very short."]},{"number":5791,"title":"Chapter 5791 Yuan Blank (2)","paragraphs":["5791 Yuan Blank (2)","After several years, Jian Wushuang successfully merged the divine sword with Sword Qi.","It was like infusing an ordinary divine sword with an Origin Source.","Jian Wushuang Look a deep breath,","The Divine-tier sword blank was immediately successful.","This divine sword would accompany him throughout his life.","A hum resounded once again.","A bloody hue descended from the sky.","“The sword blank has formed; the rest is up to you to refine!”","Lian Xing showed a hint of fatigue.","He had never been so tired refining Divine-tier blanks before.","This time was indeed somewhat special.","Jian Wushuang’s purified Sword Qi seemed inexplicably powerful, almost causing a mishap.","This also aroused his curiosity about Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source.","How had he cultivated to possess such a formidable Origin Source?","He had heard that the cultivation methods from other spacetimes differed from those in Ancient Moon Spacetime.","He faintly speculated that Jian Wushuang might have obtained techniques from another spacetime, but he hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to come from such a distant spacetime","river.","When the pressure fell on Jian Wushuang once again, this time, he had to catch the divine sword with his own hands because this divine sword had a physical form now.","As he grasped the divine sword, his Dao Heart began to tremble.","A powerful force directly impacted the depths of his soul.","Jian Wushuang’s brow furrowed slightly, but he still held on firmly.","It was the final step of refining the Divine-tier sword blank-infusing it with his own Origin Source, suppressing the Origin Source of the divine sword, a process akin to acknowledging ownership.","However, countless individuals had stumbled at this step.","Simultaneously, there were benefits.","The stronger one’s Origin Source, the more potent the Origin Source of the divine sword would become.","Jian Wushuang held the divine sword while infusing his own Origin Source into it.","In an instant, the Origin Source of the Starry Sky poured in, and Jian Wushuang’s mind","became clear and bright.","A huge Starry Sky map unfolded.","In the Starry Sky, a divine sword transformed into nine blades.","Five of them formed the River of Time.","The remaining four were embedded in the Starry Sky.","“Unexpectedly, my Starry Sky Chronicles resonates!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t expect such a pleasant surprise.","The pinnacle secret techniques he had been continuously creating were now taking shape in an instant.","The current state of the sword was not like him entering the Origin Source of the divine sword, but rather the sword entering his own Starry Sky Origin Source.","Standing at the peak of the Starry Sky, four sword shadows were embedded in it.","He couldn’t move.","But he could sketch the five divine swords in the River of Time below.","These five sword shadows were continuously devouring his Starry Sky Origin Source.","Unfortunately, absorbing those Origin Source was like a drop in the bucket to him, trivial and insignificant.","Originally thought to be more difficult, now it seemed easier than brushing off dust with telekinesis.","It was simply not challenging for him,","Ile could even take advantage of this opportunity to create his own Starry Sky chart.","Originally, a Starry Sky chart was just a drawing.","Now, he had to depict the first sword.","“Life!”","The Origin Source of All Things condensed!","Jian Wushuang delved into enlightenment.","He began to contemplate deeply.","This sword, like when he first created the Starry Sky Chronicles, wasn’t meant for killing","enemies.","It was for all living things.","Just embedded in the Starry Sky, not truly falling.","Although his Starry Sky Chronicles made him unbeatable with a sword, it had never truly tasted blood.","It only froze the strong in the painting and was later slain by other means!","Life was the Origin Source of this sword.","With his previous accumulation, Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and silently recited, “The first sword, it is life, and it is also a new beginning!”","The first sword move was complete!","He began to comprehend the second sword move.","Now, he could at least comprehend five strands of Sword Qi.","In the Starry Sky Chronicles, he sketched out five sword moves.","“The first sword, Life!”","“And for the second sword, let’s call it Death!”","Jian Wushuang finished speaking, and a black mist appeared at his brow, as if Mie Sheng had","possessed him.","Suddenly, he gained a whole new understanding of the power of Death.","This was also thanks to his second Nascent Soul in the Qishen Temple.","Although it was far away and the second Nascent Soul had been in seclusion, unable to extricate itself, some of its mysteries had been absorbed into his main body.","And thus, the second sword move was formed.","“Death!”","“Life!”","The two conflicted with each other.","Seemingly incompatible like water and fire.","Yet, they complemented each other.","Moreover, the power generated by their opposition was at least hundreds of times stronger","than either sword move alone.","The power of the first and second sword moves was actually the same.","It’s just that they had different functions.","The first sword move, Life, excelled at binding strong enemies.","The second sword move, Death, excelled at killing enemies.","After becoming familiar with the principles contained within the first two sword moves, Jian","Wushuang began to depict the third sword move, “Reincarnation!”","“I create life, but I also journey with death!”","The mark on his brow began to change, eventually condensing into two identical fish.","Black and white.","Yin and yang slaughter.","The Reincarnation Sword, complete!","Although it had been created.","Using it was another matter altogether.","Because the burden was too heavy.","He could barely execute the first sword move.","The second sword move was out of reach.","Even if their powers were equal, he couldn’t manifest it.","Unless he reached the level of Universe Master.","And possessed the Origin Source of the universe.","As for the third sword move, according to his estimation, the origin needed to reach the","power of 10,000 black holes to be executed.","Right now, his Origin Source couldn’t even support Reincarnation.","It couldn’t even support Death; he could only create more power within the perfect","formation of the universe.","But now, his desire surged uncontrollably, flooding his mind.","Continuously perfecting his Starry Sky Chronicles.","This feeling was wonderful.","Unconsciously, he created such a pinnacle secret technique.","“The first sword born from Life!”","“The second sword travels with Death!”","“The third sword unites yin and yang, sending ants into Reincarnation!”","Jian Wushuang was very satisfied, looking at his Starry Sky Chronicles.","Once again, he wielded his sword and muttered to himself, “Spacetime?”","The path of his origin followed the orthodox way of spacetime.","Although he had condensed the Starry Sky.","But before achieving the Starry Sky, he had to at least reach the stage of mastering","spacetime.","This was unavoidable.","The fourth sword move formed instantly.","Countless fragments, sword shadows, growth, Sword Dao, memories.","All scenes kept retreating.","Jian Wushuang seemed to traverse his own timeline.","Finally returning to reality.","“Spacetime, complete!”","The five sword moves in the Starry Sky Chronicles.","He comprehended four of them. Only the last one was missing.","From the beginning, he had a goal.","The last sword move must be the cycle of Spacetime!","This was also laid out from the foundation of Life.","Nine Sword Qis entered the Starry Sky.","Four Sword Qis were embedded in the Starry Sky, which he couldn’t comprehend.","Only when he reached a higher realm could he comprehend them.","Now, the five Sword Qis depicted in the Starry Sky records were enough for him to roam","freely within the Universe Master.","The first sword move, Life, he could already execute when he was Emperor. Previously, without a clear goal, its power was enough to slay a Third Tribulation expert.","Now that he had comprehended it completely.","His power had skyrocketed.","With the Emperor’s Origin Source, he might be able to kill a Fourth Tribulation expert.","It’s worth noting that previously, his strength relied solely on the Beast God Weapon and","the Eternal Ancient Transformation.","He had forgotten about the strongest. Sword Dao."]},{"number":5792,"title":"Chapter 5792 Yuan Blank (3)","paragraphs":["5792 Yuan Blank (3)","Now he reorganized the sword dao, creating the complete Starry Sky Five Swords.","His combat power soared directly, which was expected.","If it weren’t for the change in his divine power due to the blood-colored power, his combat power would probably still be in Sword Dao.","But this change became normal after he became the Universe Master.","Ilis basic divine power of 400,000 was nothing among the Universe Masters.","Even the Scattered Tribulation realm experts had a basic divine power of 400,000.","In the future, he would still rely on Sword Dao.","The Extreme Dao condensed all things into one, which was the Origin Source of Sword Dao. Jian Wushuang’s innate dao was also Sword Dao.","And only with the trump card of Sword Dao could he feel at ease.","With the five sword moves formed, he would become invincible at the Universe Master level.","Just as he condensed his fifth Sword Intent, the entire Origin Source began to tremble, even the Starry Sky was shaking.","Jian Wushuang was startled.","Ile quickly retreated, but upon second thought, this was his own Origin Source Starry Sky. Where could he retreat to?","He immediately began to use his Thought, power to investigate his own Origin Source, trying to see where the problem was.","Only after he delved deeper did he realize.","The four strands of Sword Qi embedded in the Starry Sky were actually continuously devouring his own Origin Source Starry Sky,","The Sword Qi changed from dark red to light blue.","Looking back at the universe about to be illuminated.","In the universe Starry Sky Chronicles, the five sword moves he comprehended and created had also turned blue.","They were devouring his Starry Sky power.","The Origin Sword sword blank also evolved into the Origin Source of the Starry Sky.","At this moment, outside.","Lian Xing was staring incredulously at Jian Wushuang.","He found that the Divine-tier sword blank he had just refined was undergoing a","transformation.","It seemed that because of Jian Wushuang’s origin, some kind of advancement had occurred. “The legends are true, treasures above Divine-tier can indeed be created!”","Lian Xing’s mouth widened in amazement.","He hadn’t expected that his one act of kindness could actually refine the peak of his life.","At this moment, everything was worth it.","The pinnacle of a Divine Forgemaster!","Though it lasted but an instant.","It was all because of Jian Wushuang’s fundamental issue.","Yet, it was enough.","In the end, it could be said that this divine sword was forged by him.","After his astonishment, Lian Xing began to ponder, eventually shaking his head and muttering to himself, “Regardless of your future accomplishments, today we have forged a karmic bond!”","Now, when he looked at Jian Wushuang, there seemed to be no limit.","Because it had already surpassed his understanding.","In any aspect, he couldn’t fathom the depths of Jian Wushuang,","That’s why he felt there was no limit to Jian Wushuang’s achievements.","Anyway, the karmic bond was established.","The stronger Jian Wushuang became, the better it was.","This way, he could also bask in the glory.","It would also save face when spoken of.","Within the Starry Sky, the Origin Source still trembled.","The nine strands of Sword Qi continued to devour.","Four strands of Sword Qi were embedded in the Starry Sky, devouring even more fiercely. Jian Wushuang was almost going mad.","The Origin Source of the Starry Sky was the grand vision he had painted for the future. There could be no mistakes.","He could only steel himself and break into the vast expanse of the Starry Sky, Standing beneath the magnificent four strands of Sword Qi, he felt incredibly insignificant. If the first five sword moves could make him roam as the Universe Master, then these four further sword moves had already surpassed the Universe Master.","Jian Wushuang looked at the sixth strand of Sword Qi, observing it carefully from top to bottom, before murmuring to himself, “With this sword technique, even the ancient times","can be challenged!”","If one day, he could unleash the sixth sword move, he would dare to battle the three ancient","beings of the nine great spacetimes.","This wasn’t arrogance, but confidence.","The sixth sword move was too powerful.","As for the three Sword Qis behind it, he couldn’t even comprehend them.","Or perhaps it was more accurate to say he couldn’t quite understand them,","And they kept growing stronger.","Devouring vast amounts of Starry Sky power, Jian Wushuang felt a sense of unease creeping into his heart.","It was as if a mischievous child worried about being caught by an adult.","The more he thought about it, the more Jian Wushuang felt as if there was a giant eye staring at him from the depths of the Starry Sky!","Buzz!","Perhaps it wasn’t just his imagination.","Jian Wushuang gazed into the depths of the Starry Sky, and at the same time, the depths of the Starry Sky seemed to gaze back at him.","In the outer realms of time and space, within the Origin Source, amid the stars, a giant eye opened within the Starry Sky, peering towards the river of time flowing towards its end.","With just one glance, it pierced through space and time.","After seeing Jian Wushuang, the eye closed again.","As this giant eye closed, Jian Wushuang’s oppressive feeling from before dissipated within","the Origin Source, and he breathed a sigh of relief.","Ile noticed that the Origin Source was no longer trembling; it had returned to calmness.","The four Sword Qis had turned deep blue.","It seemed they had absorbed enough.","“Thank goodness!”","Jian Wushuang wiped the cold sweat from his forehead.","Returning to his illuminated universe, a blue divine sword floated before him.","With its blue scabbard and icy-blue blade, a surge of killing intent washed over him.","A peerless weapon of great slaughter.","Jian Wushuang sheathed the sword.","As the divine sword returned to its scabbard, it stirred a roar akin to a dragon’s cry.","Examining the patterns on the scabbard once more, Jian Wushuang frowned.","Originally, there were only some simple patterns on the scabbard.","But now, there was an extra eye, a rather terrifying one.","The eye was large and lifelike.","Within its pupil, there was a figure standing on a towering mountain, facing away from him,","Their features were indiscernible.","“Could it be formed from the power of the Starry Sky?” Jian Wushuang puzzled over it, but","he had no way to verify it. Perhaps even Lian Xing wouldn’t know,","Ile could only set aside this thought.","The sword was complete.","This trip to the Shi Kingdom had been fruitful!","Swoosh!","Gripping the sword sheath with one hand, Jian Wushuang departed from his own Origin","Source Starry Sky.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s return to consciousness, Lian Xing understood that Jian Wushuang","had succeeded.","This time, there were no surprises.","Jian Wushuang faced the other party with a calm expression, thinking that this trial wasn’t as difficult as anticipated. He spoke, “Senior, the divine sword is complete!” “Not bad, not bad. Let me see how this sword blank turned out!” Lian Xing reached out to take the divine sword. However, when he tried to draw the sword, he felt a chill in his heart as he realized he couldn’t activate the divine sword.","For a moment, he felt a bit embarrassed and shocked!","It was even more formidable than he had expected.","Ile couldn’t even draw it out himself; most likely, only the master of the divine sword could","do so.","But in front of a junior, failing to draw out even the sword blank he had crafted was truly unacceptable.","He quickly came up with an excuse for himself and instructed Jian Wushuang. “This is your destined treasure. You must be the one to draw the sword. It’s a rule. Even though I crafted it, I cannot draw it out!”","With that, he handed the hilt to Jian Wushuang, indicating for him to draw it out and have a","look.","Jian Wushuang actually believed it and quickly said politely. “This sword is crafted by Senior’s hands. There’s no need for such formality, Senior”","But seeing the other party insist repeatedly, he genuinely began to respect Lian Xing from","the bottom of his heart!","Truly deserving of being the number one Divine Forgemaster in the Ancient Wood Continent, not only was his craftsmanship unparalleled, but his demeanor was probably","enough to overshadow a large group of Seventh Tribulation experts. Thinking about those Seventh Tribulation powerhouses who had joined forces with Babidi,","and then looking at Lian Xing, the difference was like night and day.","Clang!","The divine sword was unsheathed, its icy blue blade sending chills down one’s spine! “Please, Senior!” After Jian Wushuang drew the divine sword, he held the hilt with one hand, pointing the sword tip downward and offering it to Lian Xing."]},{"number":5793,"title":"Chapter 5793 His Best Work","paragraphs":["5793 His Best Work","Lian Xing looked at the surface of the divine sword, feeling a surge of saliva in his mouth, his face filled with an even wider smile.","“This is a masterpiece!”","How could he not be excited?","His palms even sweated a little. To avoid dirtying the hilt, he rubbed his hands against his clothes!","This small detail was noted by Jian Wushuang, who thought to himself, “Attentive person!” But in the next moment, as he handed the sword hilt to Lian Xing and let go, Lian Xing dropped to the ground from mid-air at the fastest speed.","The ice-blue divine sword floated above the flames.","No matter how hard Lian Xing tried, he couldn’t pick up the divine sword.","Jian Wushuang was startled too and quickly descended, coming to Lian Xing’s side, and asked with concern, “Senior, are you okay?”","“Cough cough!” Lian Xing quickly let go, then turned around, hiding Jian Wushuang from view, coughed twice into his fist, and said, “It’s nothing, just didn’t expect this sword to be quite special. You should put it away quickly!”","Jian Wushuang also felt there was something wrong with the divine sword.","When it was in its sheath, Lian Xing could easily pick it up, but after pulling it out and handing it to Lian Xing, he couldn’t lift it.","He casually picked up the hilt, forming a conjecture in his mind.","It must be because of the hilt.","It only recognizes the power of the Starry Sky.","So outsiders can’t pull it out.","With this in mind, when Lian Xing held the hilt just now and was asked to pull out the sword, it was probably just a trick played on him.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but smile wryly.","After sheathing the divine sword, he carried it behind his back.","The Sword Dao of the Starry Sky comes from Nie Yuan’s Sword Dao.","Ile had once mocked the other party for carrying a broken sword.","But now he had inherited this aspect of Nie Yuan.","Carrying the divine sword.","The sword never leaves his side!","In order to dispel the recent awkwardness, Jian Wushuang earnestly said, “Senior Lian Xing, this sword has yet to be named. I, being of limited talent, would appreciate it if Senior could bestow a name upon it!”","“Since you are so sincere, then I will make an exception and suggest one for you!”","Lian Xing was quite pleased.","He hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to ask him for a name.","If it were someone else, perhaps he wouldn’t have felt this way.","But this treasure he had just forged was extraordinary, especially after witnessing the chilling divine weapon with its icy blue blade.","It was definitely surpassing any previous divine treasures he had crafted.","Naming such a treasure was also his honor.","So Lian Xing pondered carefully for a moment.","Then his eyes lit up as he thought of a name!","“A sword of myriad tribulations, Wanjie!”","It symbolized enduring through myriad calamities!","“Let’s call it the Wanjic Sword!” Lian Xing announced.","Jian Wushuang silently repeated to himself, “Wanjie Sword!”","Back when he was at the Dao Lord realm, there was a sword technique known as Wanjie.","However, at that time, he didn’t understand the concept of the Tribulation Realm.","Now, hearing this name, it sounded quite fitting for him after becoming the Universe Master.","“Thank you, Senior, for the name!” Jian Wushuang was quite satisfied.","Originally, he didn’t think names were very important, so he didn’t pay much attention to them.","Lian Xing smiled faintly, “Well, now that the divine weapon is complete, I won’t keep you any longer. I believe we’ll meet again soon!”","“Farewell!”","The Sacred Assembly was approaching.","Knowing that Jian Wushuang was going to participate, Lian Xing didn’t try to detain him. He had just obtained the sword blank.","Ile still needed to familiarize himself with it and create his own sword techniques.","He didn’t know yet that Jian Wushuang had already created the perfect cosmic secret technique. It’s just that his current strength was weak, so he couldn’t display it. Jian Wushuang also understood that Lian Xing had his best interests at heart, even though he had already created the pinnacle technique of swordsmanship.","However, he couldn’t give up on the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation technique.","He had to perfect it as much as possible so that he could directly unleash it after becoming the Universe Master.","Moreover, he still had two treasures on him that he hadn’t researched yet: the Nine Tribulations Tower and the Ancient Monastery!","Now, there was only a year or two left until the Sacred Assembly.","He also needed to go to the Ancient Wood Sect in advance.","This left Jian Wushuang with less than a year of time.","He needed time to comprehend, requiring the flow of time to speed up; otherwise, time","would truly not be enough.","He bid farewell to Lian Xing.","Ile had originally planned to meet with Fan Tianfeng again and have a detailed discussion, even if it was just for a day, it would have been enough.","But when he tried to contact Fan Tianfeng, he found out that she had already closed herself off to breakthrough into the Tribulation Realm. She wouldn’t be able to come out in a short","time.","Ile could only use the token given to him by Zhen Ling to remind Fan Tianfeng.","The strength of Mic Sheng was not just superficial.","The horror of Death was far from simple.","Sometimes, being too clear about certain things would only make others disbelieve.","It was better to be subtle, at least making the other party think and consider his words, so that they would remember them for a long time.","If he had taken people with him, it might have ended up benefiting Mie Sheng even more, pushing their strength further.","The top ten experts of Qishen Temple had originally only had eyes on Hu Qing, but now Jian","Wushuang was unwilling to give up on any of them.","Maybe their fates weren’t that bad after all.","They all had means to deal with Mie Sheng,","Take Wu Zuo for example.","Currently trapped in the Wu Hua Secret Realm, Wu Zuo caught the attention of a true","heavyweight.","It wasn’t malicious.","Among the ten individuals who entered the Ancient Moon Spacetime, Wu Zuo was the","slowest to advance in strength.","His early luck was somewhat inferior to Fan Tianfeng’s.","But even with lesser luck, opportunities for cultivation were not lacking.","It’s just that Jian Wushuang’s strength increased too rapidly, with each opportunity","perfectly timed, causing his strength to soar rapidly.","In reality, Wu Zuo’s progress was already quite fast, it’s just not as obvious compared to Jian","Wushuang.","But this time, being targeted by someone significant, his breakthrough period had arrived.","Everyone was striving.","Hu Qing, in the core area of the Ancient Moon Ruins, also did not give up.","There were also Zhen Wuyang, Tongtian Buddha, and the ancient superpowers Dongsheng","and Wanyan from the Original Universe.","These people all had significant opportunities.","They were all extremely confident about the future.","Fan Tianfeng, in particular, was the first to return to the Qishen Temple.","Departing from the capital of Shi Kingdom, he did not use the teleportation array.","There were no teleportation arrays established between the kingdoms.","After all, they were considered hostile relations.","Establishing teleportation arrays would just be giving the enemy an opportunity to invade,","right?","So Jian Wushuang could only fly.","Fortunately, his speed was fast enough.","He could also teleport through some teleportation arrays between small cities.","Returning to Yue Kingdom would only take about a month.","Before leaving the Shi Kingdom, he once again came to the Fallen Phoenix Valley.","Then he directly sneaked underground.","He left a national mark before.","Following the mark, he quickly reached the previously made opening.","Descending all the way.","But when he arrived at that narrow space.","He found it completely empty inside!","As if the pink flesh lump didn’t exist at all.","This shocked him immensely!","“Could it be, it also escaped?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed.","He looked around.","Cold sweat ran down his back.","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows, thinking of that monster. “They really are from the same","kind of group!”"]},{"number":5794,"title":"Chapter 5794 Disappeared","paragraphs":["5794 Disappeared","If it were really like this.","His two previous pardons would be considered great offenses.","It wasn’t that he was making a big deal out of it; in truth, both of these monsters were just too extraordinary.","He didn’t know who their creator was.","Since he couldn’t find them now, he could only return to Yue Kingdom first.","After returning to Yue Kingdom, he first went to the Wu Residence and learned from Wu Li about the destruction of his own mansion.","After inquiring again, he had already concluded that it was the work of that beetle-like","monster.","That blood pool, I’m afraid, has already been consumed.","Wu Li was just about to discuss the matter of the Sacred Assembly with him again, but Jian Wushuang hurriedly bid farewell.","For him, there was nothing more to discuss.","Some things, unless they’re right in front of you, no amount of discussion would be useful. Now his strength was strong enough.","Wu Li, this ally of his, was also a bit behind.","He couldn’t be considered a threat, but he wasn’t a qualified teammate either.","After leaving the Wu Residence, he returned to a recovered Princess’s Mansion. Just as he entered the mansion, he saw elder Muchen.","“Elder Muchen!”","He had just entered the mansion, and the other party was about to leave, so they bumped into each other like this.","Seeing Jian Wushuang, elder Muchen smiled and quickly said, “Nephew Wushuang, you’ve finally returned. The Sacred Assembly is about to come, and three months later we will set off for the Ancient Wood Sect. It’s best not to leave Yue Kingdom during these days!” Only three months remained.","It was indeed somewhat rushed.","Fortunately, his Starry Sky Chronicles had already pioneered cosmic secrets.","There were only two treasures left to explore.","Using time acceleration, there was still enough time.","After exchanging a few words with Elder Muchen, he sent the latter into the Immortal Mansion and watched as he disappeared from view.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","There was some doubt in his heart.","When Wu Li saw him, he talked a lot about that strange creature.","How come Elder Muchen didn’t mention a word?","This made him feel that the royal family must know something and deliberately suppressed this matter.","Thinking of this, he planned to ask his nominal wife, Jinchen.","Unfortunately, she was in seclusion.","Just now when Elder Muchen came, he probably got the cold shoulder.","Unable to inquire, he didn’t persist.","Casually summoning a maid, he asked her to lead him back to his room.","The reconstruction of the royal mansion was still unfamiliar to him.","After twists and turns, the maid led him to a secluded courtyard.","Jian Wushuang was quite satisfied with this. The layout of the small courtyard suited his taste so much that he casually threw out tens of thousands of universe crystals, rewarding the maid.","Seeing so many universal crystals, the maid quickly bowed and thanked, “Thank you very much, Sir!”","“Alright, you have nothing else to do, you may leave!” Jian Wushuang waved his hand, set up a barrier, and then entered the courtyard.","Entering the room in the courtyard, he took out a cave heaven treasure, pupa, which lay on the table as he entered.","It seemed as if there was no one in the room, returning to peace.","Inside the cave heaven world,","small cicada","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on a patch of green grass, with two treasures laid out in front of him.","The Nine Tribulations Tower!","The Ancient Monastery Jade Urn!","The former was connected to the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, which he was most looking forward to.","The latter’s function was not small either.","It could reveal another hidden card.","“Whew!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, first picking up the Ancient Monastery Jade Urn. After playing with it in his hand for a while, his mental force entered the Ancient Monastery Jade Urn. In just an hour, he became familiar with the usage of this treasure.","Next was refining the Ancient Monastery Jade Urn.","This might take a long time.","He had to slow down time.","Slower than the normal flow outside, by a million times.","This way, it would be easier to maintain.","And he could fully focus on cultivation.","After doing all this, he used the Origin Source of the Starry Sky to refine the Ancient","Monastery Jade Urn.","Although this Ancient Temple Urn was only a post-natal Universe Treasure, the pressure of refining it was not small.","Fortunately, his Origin Source was strong enough.","After spending several years, he successfully refined the Ancient Monastery Jade Urn.","What remained was storing divine power.","If he wanted to store the most powerful divine power, he had to elevate his divine power to","its strongest.","“The power of the Beast God!”","Jian Wushuang placed the jade urn on the ground and stood up.","At the moment he stood up, a set of black armor spread out from his flesh, emitting crackling sounds, instantly enveloping his entire body, and then disappearing again into his","flesh.","Only Jian Wushuang knew that this was the divine body integrating with the armor into his","flesh.","At this moment, he also had enough confidence.","“Five times amplification!”","Buzz!","The power of the Beast God crazily twisted at this moment, and a dark red divine power","instantly enveloped his whole body.","The divine power jumped directly from 400,000 to 600,000.","With four times the power of the Beast God, it could amplify to 600,000.","Now with five times the power of the Beast God.","At the very least, it was 650,000 divine power.","It had reached the standard of the strength of a Universe Master in the Fifth Tribulation.","The threshold for Scattered Tribulation experts in the Tribulation Realm was 500,000, with","the peak reaching 600,000.","However, the peak strength of a Universe Master in the Tribulation Realm was much","greater.","Take, for example, Empress Fengchen.","Iler divine power probably exceeded 600,000","It might have even reached 800,000.","Because Jian Wushuang had witnessed the wrath of Empress Fengchen, that sense of oppression was much stronger than that of an ordinary Scattered Tribulation experts. That’s also why she had the confidence to contend for the position of the Holy Maiden, After all, she was a peerless genius of the same era as Queen Yun Zhi. Nowadays, Queen Yun Zhi has reached the level of a Universe Master in the Seventh Tribulation.","With Empress Fengchen being so competitive and strong-willed, how could her strength be","lacking?","Even though she was still a Universe Master in the Fifth Tribulation, her strength was extraordinary, far beyond those of the same level.","The eruption of a Universe Master was not something those Scattered Tribulation experts","could compare to.","Currently, Jian Wushuang’s strength could easily defeat most Scattered Tribulation experts","in the Fifth Tribulation, but he didn’t have much confidence against a Universe Master in the Fifth Tribulation.","However, he had obtained this Ancient Monastery Jade Urn.","If he were to truly confront a Universe Master in the Fifth Tribulation, it was hard to say","who would emerge victorious.","Ile exerted all his strength, injecting the divine power within his body into the Ancient","Monastery Jade Urn,","For an ordinary divine power cultivator, it would probably take a very long time.","But Jian Wushuang possessed the power of All Things.","The power of All Things not only could transform into Life but also was the essence of","divine power.","With a total of 650,000 divine power in his body, he could inject a maximum of 450,000 at","once.","Any more than that, and it would harm his Origin Source.","After injecting divine power into the Ancient Monastery Jade Urn, his divine body instantly","felt emptiness.","A sense of void almost caused him to collapse.","His vision dimmed.","He quickly employed the power of All Things to rapidly replenish his divine power.","Although the nearly infinite power of All Things could replenish the massive void, it still","took the time of an incense stick burning.","This was already quite fast.","If it were an ordinary divine power cultivator, even with the use of treasures like the","universe crystal and the primordial stone to supplement divine power, it would still take a","long time.","Once he had fully recovered to his peak, he injected divine power into the urn again."]},{"number":5795,"title":"Chapter 5795 Refining the Ancient Monastery Jade Urn","paragraphs":["5795 Refining the Ancient Monastery Jade Urn","It was still 450,000 divine power.","Adding it up, the two injections into the ancient temple pot should have accumulated 900,000 divine power.","Unfortunately, divine power wasn’t calculated that way.","When the basic divine power was 10,000, the treasure needed to increase it to 100,000 divine power was fundamentally different from what was needed to raise it from 100,000 basic divine power to 200,000 divine power.","Two injections of 450,000 divine power.","Now, there were only 500,000 divine powers inside the ancient urn.","It only increased by 50,000.","This was not only due to the stacking of divine power.","More importantly, although the Ancient Monastery Jade Urn stored divine power and could be injected into it, a lot of divine power also transformed into the Origin Source of the jade urn, used to maintain its power.","Jian Wushuang remained calm about this.","At worst, he would inject it a few more times.","At most, it would only take a few days.","The third time, it increased to 520,000.","The fourth time, 530,000.","Starting from the fifth time, each time only increased by a few thousand.","After a hundred times, each injection only contained tens of divine power.","Now, there were 700,000 divine powers stored in the ancient temple pot. Further increases would be very difficult.","But this was enough.","For most Universe Masters of the Fifth Tribulation, it would be difficult to withstand 700,000 divine powers.","Only someone like Empress Fengchen, with her extraordinary power of the Fifth Tribulation Realm, could withstand it. For dealing with ordinary Universe Masters of the Fifth","Tribulation, it was sufficient.","This was not his only trump card; there was no need to pursue the limit too much. When his basic divine power increased again, he could raise this limit further.","If it weren’t for his Origin Source, the Ancient Monastery Jade Urn might have only stored its maximum divine power once in the hands of an ordinary divine power practitioner, When facing strong opponents, having an extra maximum attack could double the chance of winning.","One mustn’t underestimate it.","Jian Wushuang carefully sealed the Ancient Monastery Jade Urn and stored it within himself.","In case of crisis, he only needed to summon the jade urn to release its internal divine power and directly strike down his opponent.","It was simple and straightforward.","Jian Wushuang quite liked it.","There weren’t many requirements, which was the best part,","Unlike the Beast God Weapon, which, although powerful, had high demands on oneself.","As for the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, it was even more so.","He hadn’t completely mastered it yet.","At first, he comprehended the chess pieces on the chessboard, and then he mastered the Origin Source within the pieces, devouring all the internal Origin Source.","This allowed his own Origin Source to be better perfected, enabling rapid breakthroughs. Just this alone brought great benefits to Jian Wushuang at the time.","After mastering control over the essence, he began to refine it and revive the chess pieces. He could obtain a decent helper.","But currently, the combat power of the revived chess pieces couldn’t keep up with him. So they were useless.","After awakening the General Armor later, he began to pay attention to the chessboard again.","The General Armor not only could guard his divine body from shattering but also could resist divine power attacks, weakening them by 99 percent.","This was the most heaven-defying treasure at present.","However, he always felt that the Heavenly Chessboard had not been developed to its","extreme.","There must be other uses for it.","But his strength was not enough, so it hadn’t been triggered.","Now the Heavenly Chessboard resonated with the Nine Tribulations Tower, making him feel that perhaps he could start with the tower to uncover the true function of the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","At the same time, he also needed to see if there was any relationship between the Nine Tribulations Tower and Teacher Xuan Yi.","If there was a connection, he would hit the jackpot.","Dragging the small tower with one hand, Jian Wushuang couldn’t feel anything special about it.","He began to use his telekinesis to explore the Nine Tribulations Tower.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang frowned, realizing that things seemed different from what he had","expected.","There was resonance, but when his telekinesis entered the Nine Tribulations Tower, he found that there was nothing inside the small tower.","Not even Origin Source.","From its material, it seemed to be a treasure above Eternal Treasures.","But without internal Origin Source, it lacked power.","It was even inferior to Eternal Treasures.","It was just like those rumors after all.","Rumors had it that the Ancient Moon ruins often yielded treasures, yet those who found","these treasures were unable to use them.","After passing through several hands, it was ultimately deemed nothing more than a","decoration.","So, many initially approached this treasure with a sense of hope, hoping to take a chance.","If they guessed right, it could be an extraordinary treasure.","At the very least, it was a treasure of the innate universe.","Perhaps even stronger.","However, there were no records of Temporal Treasures during the Ancient Moon Era.","It was probably weaker than Temporal Treasures.","But even so, it was worth the gamble for those strong enough,","Because in the past, the Ancient Moon Sect’s leader had once inadvertently infiltrated the inner perimeter of the Ancient Moon Ruins and obtained an extraordinary treasure.","Pushing through, they reached the peak of the Eighth Tribulation. Unfortunately, they ultimately failed the tribulation, leaving no physical or divine power, simply perishing.","That era was brief but extremely glorious.","At that time, the leader of the Ancient Moon Sect had waged battles in other spacetimes.","They surpassed nine Universe Masters who had reached the peak of the Eighth Tribulation and even killed six of them.","In one fell swoop, they elevated the Ancient Moon Spacetime to an unattainable height. Initially, everyone believed that as long as those ancient eternal beings didn’t appear, the leader of the Ancient Moon Sect was invincible.","Many also hoped that the leader of the Ancient Moon Sect could successfully pass the tribulation and reach the Ninth Tribulation.","Unfortunately, they failed in the end.","Time was short.","From growth to peak.","The leader of the Ancient Moon Sect only lived for 100,000 epochs.","This time was brief even for some Seventh Tribulation beings.","Yet, it was the lifetime of a legendary strong individual.","Jian Wushuang thought of Hu Qing.","Hu Qing was at the Ancient Moon ruins.","But who knew what was happening there now?","Why was he warned not to go there in the first place?","Was it dangerous?","Everyone knew about the dangers of the Ancient Moon Ruins.","Even Universe Masters at the Seventh and Eighth Tribulation could only wander around the","Outer Domain.","Just some of the dangers on the Outer Domain were enough to cause the downfall of the","Universe Master of the Tribulation Realm.","But there were also many treasures.","Danger and rewards were equal.","There were still many strong individuals who ventured forth to explore.","That legendary sect master, who entered the inner circle of the Ancient Moon Ruins when","he was weak, had always been a legend.","Relying solely on strength seemed impossible to breach.","Jian Wushuang felt somewhat disdainful about this. Unable to enter through strength alone? That’s just pathetic.","Divine power!","Confidence that one’s strength can surpass myriad laws.","Fearless.","Unyielding in battle.","On this point, he rather admired that Broly.","It was a pity that the opponent cultivated the Dao of Transformation. If he had followed the","path of divine power, he might not have been weaker than the Dao of Transformation.","The world is ever-changing!","Just like his current situation.","Faced with the treasure emanating from the Ancient Moon Ruins, he was at a loss.","But that resonating feeling never disappeared.","Jian Wushuang refused to believe it was impossible. This time, he unleashed his Origin","Source to explore.","However, after going around in circles, he still couldn’t enter the Ninth Tribulation Tower.","It was then that he thought. Perhaps he needed to take out the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","With this in mind, he didn’t hesitate. He directly took out the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard","from his Origin Source.","A mist-shrouded chessboard, with a small tower floating above it."]},{"number":5796,"title":"Chapter 5796: Entering the Nine Tribulations Tower","paragraphs":["Chapter 5796: Entering the Nine Tribulations Tower","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After the two overlapped, Jian Wushuang once again used his Thought power to explore.","But as his Thought power touched the Nine Tribulations Tower, a violent aura directly pushed him back.","His divine body began to fragment.","He suffered some considerable injuries.","Despite the injuries, Jian Wushuang smiled.","The stronger, the better.","This also confirmed his speculation.","This Nine Tribulations Tower indeed had some connection with the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","And the auras of the two were converging.","The converging aura continuously rose, floating in the sky of the cave world.","A magnificent bridge appeared.","Jian Wushuang looked up at the huge bridge, which emanated a terrifying power.","His gaze shifted, and when he looked behind the bridge, Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Vaguely, he saw a huge nine-story divine tower towering behind the bridge.","This time, he didn’t need to use Thought power to enter.","He could just walk in.","After healing his injuries, he cautiously walked towards the Nine Tribulations Tower.","All of this seemed like an illusion, the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard and the Nine Tribulations Tower, on the surface, had already overlapped.","The atmosphere was forged by the auras of these two treasures.","But Jian Wushuang was willing to explore.","Step by step, he crossed the bridge and arrived at the foot of the Nine Tribulations Tower.","Looking up, he couldn’t see the top of the tower.","It soared into the clouds!","“Indeed extraordinary, its power is not weaker than the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard!” Jian Wushuang exclaimed in his heart.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime had never produced any Temporal Treasures.","Could it be that those artifacts passed down were all Temporal Treasures?","Jian Wushuang unconsciously shook his head.","If that were true.","Then Temporal Treasures would be like cabbages.","This was the River of Time.","Not the depths of the Starry Sky.","If it were said that there were many Temporal Treasures within the Starry Sky, he believed it.","Since arriving in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he had come to understand.","The so-called Nine Great Spacetimes were actually upstream spacetimes.","Because they were close to the Starry Sky, their overall strength was much stronger than the midstream and downstream.","But in terms of inheritance and treasures.","It’s not necessarily the case.","The inheritance of the Qishen Temple, on the contrary, was more suitable for him.","Moreover, there were Temporal Treasures in the Qishen Temple.","Although they were left behind by the shattered Higher Heavens, they existed after all.","Not like the Ancient Moon Spacetime, where not a single one had appeared.","The Nine Tribulations Tower, it was considered the first one!","And it ended up in the hands of Jian Wushuang, an outsider.","At the base of the tower, a massive golden gate blocked Jian Wushuang’s path.","With a single palm thrust, a burst of energy exploded, directly hitting the golden gate.","The golden gate opened in response.","Everything went smoothly.","So smoothly that Jian Wushuang felt a bit uneasy.","But he pressed on regardless.","Within the Nine Tribulations Tower, a strange aura emanated, almost like it was drawing him in involuntarily.","As he stepped inside, Jian Wushuang felt an unprecedented sense of ease, even his mood improved.","That feeling of complete relaxation also boosted his combat power slightly.","Clasping his fists, he felt a surge of energy, everything felt different.","He moved his body casually, feeling much more agile.","At this moment, he began to observe his surroundings.","The interior of the tower was unusually spacious.","The colors were dull!","In the center, there was a faint white pillar of light.","Upon closer inspection, it turned out to be natural light filtering in from above.","Nothing special about it.","For now, it seemed the Nine Tribulations Tower was only peculiar in its environment.","It didn’t seem to serve any other purpose.","But he wasn’t in a hurry.","It was the same when he obtained the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard initially.","The more powerful the treasure, the harder it was to comprehend.","Just as he was thinking this, reality slapped him in the face.","Within the white pillar of light, a figure suddenly appeared, startling Jian Wushuang.","Seeing the figure, he quickly stepped back.","His right hand reacted swiftly, gripping the sword hilt behind him, ready to confront the figure within the light pillar at any moment.","“Welcome to the Nine Tribulations Tower!” A stiff voice emanated from the figure within the light pillar.","The figure became more and more tangible.","It allowed Jian Wushuang to see the other’s appearance clearly.","Wearing a flamboyant mask, hair streaked with gray, and dressed in unusual attire.","A style he had never seen before.","The Nine Tribulations Tower originated from the Ancient Moon Ruins, perhaps this figure was one of the earliest practitioners from the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","It was normal not to have seen such attire before, Jian Wushuang reassured himself inwardly.","The stiff voice gave him the impression that it was more like a puppet.","So he didn’t beat around the bush, loudly inquiring, “Are you a machine puppet being or a practitioner sealed within the tower?”","“Neither!” replied the strangely attired masked figure, shaking their head.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed slightly, sensing that the person before him was indeed very much alive. However, their speech was stiff, like that of a puppet.","“If so, then why are you here?” he pressed.","Neither a puppet nor a practitioner, yet still within the Nine Tribulations Tower.","Could this person be the true owner of the tower?","It was a possibility.","Upon hearing this, the masked figure smirked, stepping out of the light beam leisurely, and said nonchalantly, “I’m just waiting for someone here.”","“The person you’re waiting for couldn’t possibly be me!” Jian Wushuang replied, lacking a bit of confidence.","He had felt a resonance between the Nine Tribulations Tower and the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, believing it to be a treasure left by Teacher Xuan Yi.","Now, it seemed less likely.","It could also be that the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard resonated with treasures of the same level, causing him to misunderstand.","Regardless, gaining possession of the Nine Tribulations Tower was a win for him.","“It is you, but it’s also not you!” the masked figure spoke cryptically, shrouding their words in mystery.","Jian Wushuang cut to the chase, “Can you be more direct?”","“I’m waiting for someone to defeat me,” the masked figure replied casually, almost making Jian Wushuang burst into laughter.","He found it easy to converse with the figure because he could discern that their strength seemed lacking, despite emitting a faint divine aura.","Though unsure whether they were human or spirit, there was a faint taste of divine power, albeit weak, around them.","It was merely around 200,000 divine power.","With a breath, he could extinguish them.","“In that case, your wait ends today!” Jian Wushuang darted forward, launching a punch directly at the masked figure’s face.","The force behind this punch was at least 400,000 divine power, matching his base divine strength.","Dealing with someone with only 200,000 units of divine power should be simple.","Boom!","A tremendous explosion shattered the air.","Thinking he could easily defeat his opponent, Jian Wushuang was surprised to find the masked figure had vanished.","With a thought, Jian Wushuang froze.","The figure was now behind him, back turned, hands behind their back, appearing relaxed.","Their divine power remained at 200,000, unchanged.","“How is this possible?” Jian Wushuang exclaimed in disbelief. “Your divine power seems weak on the surface; how did you evade my attack?”","His previous punch not only contained a burst of divine power but also an explosion of speed.","Even a Universe Master couldn’t evade such a punch.","Yet, the figure did.","Indeed!","Things weren’t as simple as they seemed.","Initially, he thought the Nine Tribulations Tower would be like most treasures—nine levels, each guarded by a protector, defeating each yielding a treasure.","He had encountered such scenarios frequently."]},{"number":5797,"title":"Chapter 5797: Can’t Touch?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5797: Can’t Touch?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Unfortunately, this time, he guessed wrong.","It was true that the Nine Tribulations Tower had nine layers.","However, the guardians within the tower were somewhat unfathomable in strength.","If he relied solely on his strength to evade their attacks, he might have had some idea.","But his opponent moved like a ghost.","Each attempt to strike again was futile.","“Focus!” The voice behind the mask suddenly became stern. As Jian Wushuang attacked again, the opponent once more evaded effortlessly, not only dodging the strike but also delivering a heavy blow to Jian Wushuang’s head in return.","Jian Wushuang’s vision darkened, nearly causing him to black out.","Though he wasn’t injured, neither his Origin Source nor his divine power had changed, but that blow just now left him with an indescribable pain.","It felt like an adult punishing a child.","Clutching the back of his head, Jian Wushuang looked towards the masked figure, who had already retreated far away, filled with utter fury.","It was a disgrace!","“Ah!!!”","His hands clenched into fists, a red aura bursting from within him.","“Ha!”","The power of the Beast God surged forth.","With double the power of the Beast God, his divine power soared to 500,000.","At that moment, he became serious.","Without directly attacking, he crossed his arms, and behind him, figures began to emerge.","Origin Source Avatars!","Each avatar emitted the same aura.","But their strengths varied.","However, their differing strengths were indiscernible to others.","He refused to believe his opponent could break through this.","Here and now, he would fight like this!","Eventually, one of the avatars would confront the opponent.","Although the avatars were significantly weaker in power, dealing with an opponent like the masked figure, who possessed 200,000 divine power, was still manageable.","“Tsk tsk, you’d better hope I don’t get my hands on you!” Jian Wushuang sneered.","Several figures began to flicker.","Those were afterimages.","Meanwhile, his true self had already appeared before the opponent.","74 avatars instantly surrounded the masked figure.","They attacked together, while Jian Wushuang’s true self watched the opponent’s every move.","He wanted to see how the other party had dodged.","Then he would take the opportunity to strike.","Avoiding 74 avatars while also keeping an eye on his true self.","There was simply no way to avoid it.","The space here was very confined.","There wasn’t enough room for his footwork to maneuver.","But the next moment, he was dumbfounded.","Almost every time the avatars attacked, it was flawless, but the masked figure used a movement technique he couldn’t comprehend, swiftly dodging.","None of the avatars could even touch the opponent.","And from a distance, he felt as if the space had shrunk to inches.","It seemed like the area had widened.","His tactic of overwhelming with sheer numbers was no longer effective.","He could only rely on his true self to strike.","500,000 units of divine power, this was the threshold of the Fifth Tribulation.","Combined with the ambush.","He refused to believe it.","Gathering energy in his hands, condensing it into a sphere.","Directly throwing it out, using the burst of energy to cover his own approach, quickly closing in behind the opponent, he thrust out with a knife hand, clearly hitting, but Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel helpless.","Swish!","The figure struck in front of him flickered for a moment and then disappeared.","It was an afterimage left by the movement technique.","Even if his eyesight was poor, his hands could feel it, striking the air.","“Not bad, to be able to keep up with my afterimage so quickly, you still have tricks up your sleeve, use them all!” The masked figure, hands behind his back, yawned.","Jian Wushuang, upon hearing this, grew even more infuriated.","Especially seeing the casual demeanor.","Clearly, he was being looked down upon.","When had he ever endured such indignation?","And yet the opponent’s strength was clearly much weaker than his.","“If you’re brave, stop dodging!”","Jian Wushuang was clearly somewhat disheartened. As soon as he spoke, he regretted it.","Once again, in an unbelievable manner, the masked figure appeared in front of him.","Jian Wushuang threw a punch, hitting nothing but air.","Before he could attack again, he felt a twisting sensation in his abdomen, causing his entire body to convulse.","This time, the masked figure had truly struck.","Not only did he strike, but he also returned a punch, hitting Jian Wushuang in the abdomen.","The pain caused cold sweat to form on Jian Wushuang’s forehead.","Ridiculous!","But he refused to believe it.","500,000 divine power wasn’t enough.","Then make it 600,000.","He had never lost to the same level before, especially since the opponent’s power wasn’t on the same level as his.","How could he lose to them?","A being neither human nor ghost.","The power of the Beast God, quadrupled, directly increased his divine power by 200,000.","His entire body’s divine power reached 600,000.","This could be considered a small peak for him.","Once again, he made a move, but it was dodged again.","However, this time, he didn’t use his doppelg?nger, nor did he ambush; he struck the opponent’s afterimage.","The masked figure showed some differences and exclaimed, “You actually still hide your strength. What other cards do you have? Use them quickly. Your time is running out!”","“Time is running out?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He didn’t want to engage in meaningless attacks anymore.","The power of the Beast God disappeared in an instant.","What did the opponent mean by saying time was running out?","Could it be that if he couldn’t defeat the opponent, he would be stuck here forever?","“Yes, I’ll only give you half an hour. If you can’t defeat me, you’ll need to wait for a year before coming back. Time here flows at a normal rate, so your time acceleration won’t work!” The masked figure also took the time to explain the time flow.","Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief.","A chance to challenge once a year!","But in just one year, how could he make any progress?","Even if he could accelerate time outside, he couldn’t improve much.","Moreover, in a year, it would already be the Sacred Assembly.","He wouldn’t have time to come back to this Nine Tribulation Tower.","The opponent was so mysterious, especially their dodging technique. If he could learn it...","Then he would be invincible.","By then, even the Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation wouldn’t scare him.","He wondered what benefits defeating the opponent would bring.","Of course, it would be best if the opponent taught him that move.","He took the opportunity to inquire, “You haven’t said, what’s the benefit of defeating you? Otherwise, wouldn’t I have worked in vain?”","“You’re right, defeating me is indeed futile. As for the benefit, it’s the achievement you gain at the moment of defeating me!” The masked figure replied calmly.","Jian Wushuang almost spat blood!","What did it mean to gain achievement at the moment of defeating him?","Could it be that the opponent was the strongest in spacetime, and defeating him would make oneself invincible?","Too ridiculous.","“If you don’t believe it, you’re welcome to try!” The masked individual was confident in themselves.","Jian Wushuang coldly declared, “Then I will try!”","Finishing his words, his aura suddenly turned blue.","“Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","The blue Jian Wushuang might not have the formidable 600,000 divine power, as he was still an Emperor and his Origin Source hadn’t undergone significant changes, nor had his enhancements been as exaggerated as the divine power.","Even when he reached the level of Universe Master, his essence remained the strongest.","However, there was a certain confidence within him that made him feel more assured in his blue form.","Crucially, by employing the Eternal Ancient Transformation, he could enhance his Sword Dao, enabling him to execute the Starry Sky Chronicles.","He refused to believe that the opponent could evade his Starry Sky Chronicles."]},{"number":5798,"title":"Chapter 5798 Dual Sword Slash","paragraphs":["5798 Dual Sword Slash","The Sword of Life was unavoidable.","Unless the opponent wasn’t alive.","But, that seemed quite possible.","No matter how he looked at the opponent, they didn’t seem human.","“The power of the Starry Sky?” the masked figure remarked. “That’s somewhat interesting!”","Jian Wushuang was surprised, his mouth agape, and he said in astonishment, “You even know about the power of the Starry Sky?”","Knowledge of the power of the Starry Sky was scarce in the river of time.","The only instance he had witnessed it was when Nie Yuan had utilized the power of the Starry Sky.","It was a power belonging to the Starry Sky.","The fact that the opponent even knew about this surprised him.","Upon careful consideration, it wasn’t that surprising after all,","The Nine Tribulations Tower was similar to the Skysight I leavenly Chessboard.","Both probably originated from the Starry Sky.","Knowing about the power of the Starry Sky was normal.","“Do you think you’re the only one who wields the power of the Starry Sky?” the masked figure said, as his form changed and his aura turned blue.","Electric arcs also flashed around him,","At this moment, Jian Wushuang not only felt shocked but also sensed the opponent’s Origin Source.","Within that Origin Source, there was a hint of time.","“Hurry up and make your move, you only have the time it takes for an incense stick to burn!” the masked figure urged.","Without further ado, Jian Wushuang didn’t waste words. He gripped the hilt of his sword with his right hand and directly drew out the Wanjic Sword.","“The Starry Sky Chronicles!”","“The First Sword Move!”","As the words fell, a monotonous green aura erupted within the solemn hall.","Life!","The moment he sensed the opponent’s origin, he knew!","Victory!","A single sword strike!","Life, extinguished!","That was Death!","Seemingly one sword strike, yet it was a dual sword strike!","Life and Death walked together.","In this moment, he truly felt it.","The sensation of the blade piercing through the opponent’s body.","Clang!","Sheathed the sword!","Smooth and seamless.","Turning slowly, watching the opponent turn into a grey figure, he spoke, “You’ve lost!” “What sword technique did you just use?” came the stiff voice from the masked figure. Jian Wushuang replied nonchalantly, “Starry Sky Sword Technique!”","“You’re lying!”","The masked figure shook his head, refusing to believe it was the Starry Sky Sword Technique. He hailed from the Starry Sky; how could he have not seen such a technique? It even broke through his ‘Utmost Freedom Technique!!","“I have no reason to deceive you. This is the Starry Sky Sword Technique I’ve created. Perhaps it’s not known as Starry Sky where you come from, but it’s the Starry Sky I envisioned!” Jian Wushuang’s expression was impassive.","At the moment of victory, he didn’t feel much joy.","Because it seemed like he truly attained a sense of freedom.","This state of mind was peculiar.","He barely had time to savor it before it vanished.","“Perhaps!”","The masked figure’s body restored once more.","As he looked at Jian Wushuang, there was a hint of peculiarity in his eyes.","“You are the first practitioner to defeat me in our first encounter. No wonder you were chosen!” The masked figure acknowledged Jian Wushuang’s strength.","It wasn’t just his strength; what truly impressed him was Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship. Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow and said, “Has anyone else come to the Nine Tribulations Tower before?”","“Many have. Not long ago, a Celestial Maiden from your Temporal River came here. It took her 10,000 attempts to defeat my avatar here at the first layer!”","Jian Wushuang was startled by this revelation.","It wasn’t that he found it too outrageous.","It was the mention of the Celestial Maiden that stunned him.","Not long ago?","The other’s sense of time was exaggerated.","It had been billions of epochs since the fall of the Celestial Maiden.","Tens of thousands of cras.","In other words, more than thousands of Universe Masters at the Eighth Tribulation were","born and perished.","What an immensely long epoch it had been.","Yet, to the other, it seemed like just a short while ago.","Could it be that the Celestial Maiden had not fallen yet?","That was also a possibility.","Ah, they had been intercepted by the Celestial Maiden when they entered here.","It was Hu Qing who had stopped her.","And Hu Qing had also fallen into the Ancient Moon Ruins.","That was where the Celestial Maiden had fallen.","This had always been a puzzle!","Now there was a chance to inquire about the Celestial Maiden’s situation from the other","party.","But the response from the masked figure left him dumbfounded.","The Celestial Maiden had indeed fallen, but her spirit remained in this world.","Which meant transcending reincarnation,","Transcending reincarnation meant eternity.","If she existed eternally, how could she fall?","Jian Wushuang was utterly confused.","Just as he was about to ask the figure, the masked person removed their mask,","A delicate face appeared before him.","Neither male nor female!","The complexion was ghastly pale!","White hair, coiled atop the head, with a tall hairpin,","Behind him, there was a huge circular ring, much wider than his body.","“From now on, you can call me Weiss!”","As soon as the words fell, a scepter fell into Weiss’s hand.","The Origin Source and divine power aura on the figure disappeared.","Now when Jian Wushuang looked at him, it was as if he were looking at thin air.","If it weren’t for his eyes, he wouldn’t even sense the figure’s presence with his Thought","power alone.","When facing a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation, he would always feel a sun-like","aura if they didn’t deliberately hide it.","But facing Weiss, Jian Wushuang didn’t sense anything.","It was very strange.","Either the figure deliberately restrained his aura, or his strength far surpassed Jian","Wushuang’s.","“Weiss?” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself, then asked, “Can you now tell me the purpose","of this Nine Tribulations Tower?”","Weiss covered his mouth with a smile and said, “Of course, now I am your master, and I can","tell you everything you want to know!”","Master?","Jian Wushuang exclaimed, “You want to be my master?”","He hadn’t expected such a bizarre thing to happen after refining a treasure.","He even had to apprentice!","But what he cared most about was still the Nine Tribulations Tower, whether it had any","connection to Teacher Xuan Yi,","Was it resonating with the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard because they were both Temporal Treasures, or because of Teacher Xuan Yi?","Now the other party had come out and wanted him to be his disciple.","It made Jian Wushuang feel a bit at a loss.","But when he thought that even the Celestial Maiden had to attempt it tens of thousands of","times before passing, and he could pass it in one go, a sense of satisfaction naturally arose.","It seemed like apprenticing wouldn’t be a loss.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, ready to kneel down to apprentice, but was stopped by","Weiss.","“You don’t need to be so formal. In my world, the master-disciple relationship is just a tool!”","Weiss’s words were straightforward, leaving Jian Wushuang momentarily unsure how to","respond.","Weiss continued, “You’ll understand later. And about this tower, it’s not called Nine...”","Mid-sentence, Weiss seemed to remember something, then shook his head lightly, saying, “Let’s just call it the Nine Tribulations Tower!”","“Why did the Celestial Maiden fall while you’re still alive?” Jian Wushuang spoke more freely","in response to Weiss’s directness.","Upon hearing this, Weiss’s expression froze for a moment. Then, he tapped Jian Wushuang’s head with his scepter and said discontentedly, “I am a god, how could I die, huh?” After saying this, he covered his mouth and laughed.","By common sense, the Celestial Maiden should have been his disciple, so it’s no wonder he","said it’s just a tool."]},{"number":5799,"title":"Chapter 5799 Weiss","paragraphs":["5799 Weiss","The disciple was dead, yet he continued to smile.","“Are you a god? Have you existed since ancient times?” Jian Wushuang continued to inquire. The concept of gods was something he had never truly understood.","In the mortal world, there were gods, but when it truly came down to it, he found that gods weren’t all that remarkable.","They could also be killed.","Now, hearing someone claim to be a god once again, he was truly perplexed.","Weiss cleared his throat twice, then spoke, “Are you referring to the three from the upstream spacetime?”","Ancient beings.","In fact, it was just a term Jian Wushuang used.","For those three truly peak experts, there wasn’t a single complete name.","They were called many things.","“Yes, those three super strong individuals, their strength should be similar to the Celestial Maiden from back then!” Jian Wushuang exclaimed excitedly.","If that were true, then Weiss’s strength would be difficult to gauge.","To be able to produce someone like the Celestial Maiden.","“You’re mistaken. The three you mentioned are also in the Tribulation Realm, just like the Celestial Maiden. These people have not yet broken free from their constraints, they cannot be considered gods. I am the true god of the entire river of time and space!” Weiss finished speaking, his gaze becoming somewhat sharp.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but take a half step back.","In that moment, he was reminded of the gaze he had seen in the Starry Sky.","Too powerful.","It left one breathless.","The concept of gods, he now understood.","Weiss claimed that only he was a god, the rest were still in the Tribulation Realm.","The Celestial Maiden from before was probably also in the Ninth Tribulation.","Beyond the Ninth Tribulation, there were even stronger beings.","They just didn’t exist in the river of time and space.","“Since you’re the only god, why are you in this small tower?” Jian Wushuang voiced his confusion.","Someone so powerful, why would they be trapped in a small tower?","And still take disciples as tools.","This didn’t make sense.","“The Nine Tribulations Tower is not as simple as you think, I am here on someone else’s behalf, this is something I cannot tell you!” Weiss’s reply made Jian Wushuang think of Teacher Xuan Yi.","So he asked, “On someone else’s behalf, is it an old man named Xuan Yi?”","Weiss simply shook his head without answering.","Jian Wushuang was somewhat speechless.","The person he was dealing with was a god.","And yet, he knew nothing.","It seemed that Jian Wushuang had no connection with Teacher Xuan Yi.","But how could the resonance from the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard be explained?","According to Weiss, the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard didn’t belong to spacetime; it was a treasure from the Starry Sky.","The Nine Tribulations Tower was also a treasure from the Starry Sky. Though they were not. on the same level, they came from the same place. Hence, there was some resonance, ultimately unlocking the Nine Tribulations Tower.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t quite satisfied with this explanation.","He wasn’t interested in Weiss.","To be precise, Weiss sounded too arrogant.","He was determined to tread the path of the strong.","Yet, he hadn’t forgotten his original intention.","Walking through spacetime, searching for Teacher Xuan Yi, he also sought his own path. Not the guidance of gods.","Seeing Jian Wushuang silent, Weiss began to speak about the Nine Tribulations Tower.","“Jian Wushuang, from now on, you are my disciple. However, you cannot reveal my identity, and I won’t care about your life or death. But I will teach you the most powerful secret technique in this spacetime. Your repayment to me will be becoming the strongest in this spacetime!” Weiss stated his purpose.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t surprised by this!","To become the strongest in this spacetime.","It couldn’t be said that the other party was arrogant; he had just witnessed their strength.","“To be honest, I’m not interested,” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","He had already created the Starry Sky Chronicles, and when he reached the Universe Master level, he could create even more powerful ancient variations.","He didn’t lack powerful secret techniques at all.","He still had suspicions about the other’s identity.","He didn’t want to create more karmic ties with people.","When one ventures out, they must repay their debts. Becoming the number one in spacetime wasn’t that easy.","If the other party was just a true spirit, he might be tempted because he couldn’t be bound.","But the other was a god he couldn’t fathom,","Ilow could they cooperate?","He wasn’t confident!","Weiss seemed to have seen through Jian Wushuang.","He lightly tapped the staff on the ground, and the scene around them instantly changed.","“Jian Wushuang, how much do you understand about spacetime?” Weiss asked, lifting his","hand to trace an arc.","That was Jian Wushuang’s lifeline.","Simultaneously, it was Jian Wushuang’s timeline.","“You came from the mortal world, traveled through many material realms, and then entered","a peculiar universe. Let me see what you’ve experienced,” Weiss said.","The timeline that even the true spirits of Qishen Temple couldn’t peek into appeared exceptionally simple in Weiss’s eyes.","Jian Wushuang was also startled.","Looking up, he saw the entirety of his life from weakness to strength.","Weiss glanced over Jian Wushuang’s involvement with the Divine Power Universe and nodded, saying, “No wonder your strength is so formidable. It’s interesting. It seems someone has tampered with your cultivation path. They’ve touched something in this spacetime they shouldn’t have. Unfortunately, I can’t find him, otherwise, he would be","punished!”","“Alter time?” Jian Wushuang was taken aback.","Then he thought of his future self.","His future self had failed in achieving the Dao Merge.","He had originally thought that he had succeeded in achieving Dao Merge solely by his strength, but he didn’t expect someone to change his timeline.","And that person was not in this time.","“It couldn’t be Teacher Xuan Yi!” He had already formed an answer deep in his heart, but he","was somewhat unwilling to believe it.","And then there was Weiss’s remark.","He dared to mention punishment.","That meant he was on the same level as Teacher Xuan Yi.","“Heavens!”","Weiss chuckled as he stared at Jian Wushuang. “You don’t need to be surprised. Time flows","from the Starry Sky; nothing is impossible. Your timeline is in my hands now, and no one","can change it!”","“Who is the one trying to change it? Why does this time not exist?” Jian Wushuang seized the opportunity to pry into the secrets surrounding him.","“Ile is nothing. In the current timeline, he simply doesn’t exist. Perhaps, as he said, you will","meet him in the future!”","Meet in the future!","When will that be? Jian Wushuang fell silent, a hint of lamentation echoing in his heart. His current goal was to slay Mic Sheng, and his future goal was to find Teacher Xuan Yi.","But what about beyond that?","In his future, perhaps he would be very lonely!","Losing the meaning of cultivation.","How sad! Weiss approached him at this moment, gently patting Jian Wushuang’s shoulder and saying, “You don’t need to be sad. The road ahead is long. The world you see is merely outlined. There’s no need to cling to it!”","“No, it’s a world of flesh and blood. You high and mighty gods simply don’t understand!” Jian","Wushuang shook his head.","From the mundane mortal world to the present, he had experienced too much. Even if his Dao Heart was complete, he still held a shred of respect for the secular world.","Gods!","They couldn’t understand.","Because gods didn’t come from weakness.","As soon as the other spoke, Jian Wushuang guessed.","The Nine Tribulations Tower!","“It seems I’m about to add another stroke to my story!”","Strength wasn’t the goal. The purpose was the process of pursuing strength. That was the meaning of existence!"]},{"number":5800,"title":"Chapter 5800 Sacred Assembly Arrives","paragraphs":["5800 Sacred Assembly Arrives","Buzz!","The resounding sound of high-pitched horns filled the air!","On this day, powerful figures from all corners of Yue Kingdom gathered in the capital,","The Sacred Assembly!","Is upon us!","Led by the Empress herself, the entire Yue Kingdom, along with various factions, split into two camps.","One faction consisted of the royal family’s elites.","Naturally, they were loyal to the Empress.","Among them were Jian Wushuang and Wu Li, along with someone Wu Li had managed to","sway.","There were also some strong members from the royal family of Yue Kingdom.","The other faction comprised members of seven star sects.","Elder Muchen was among them.","The seven star sects, in fact, were an affiliated sect of the eight star sects.","Although it ostensibly belonged to the faction of the Ancient Wood Sect.","However, during the Sacred Assembly, they would assist the strong members of their own country while vying for favorable rankings.","Under normal circumstances, this might not have caused much conflict.","But this Sacred Assembly, the Empress was determined to make her mark,","Those who could participate in this Sacred Assembly were all superpowers within the same realm.","Four powerful individuals at the Emperor realm.","Two from the royal family.","Of course, Jian Wushuang and his wife were among them.","The other two came from the Qingyun Sect.","As for the Universe Masters, there were 24 in total.","Among them, only the Empress was at the level of the Fifth Tribulations.","She was the one who needed full assistance this time.","There were four Universe Masters at the Fourth Tribulation.","Two from the royal family, one from the Qingyun Sect, and the patriarch of the second most powerful family in Yue Kingdom, the “Li” family, personally joined the fray.","The remaining Universe Masters were all at the pinnacle of the Third Tribulation. They were strong individuals from various major clans and the two major forces. Today was the day they set out.","Jian Wushuang happened to leave the Nine Tribulations Tower on this very day.","Outside the imperial palace, with a cold voice resounding, all the strong individuals boarded the warships that had long been prepared.","“Set sail!”","The strong individuals participating in the Sacred Assembly boarded a separate warship.","On both sides of this warship were two larger ones.","Seated on these were some clan elders and prodigies among the Emperors.","When the Sacred Assembly began, there were often more spectators than participants.","Just like this time, there were tens of thousands of spectators .","But there were only a few dozen participants from Yue Kingdom,","After boarding the warship, Jian Wushuang, Elder Muchen, and Wu Li sat together at a table.","They chatted leisurely.","Princess Jinchen, unusually quiet, sat silently on the side.","Jian Wushuang knew what she was thinking.","It was nothing but thoughts about Shi Jiu.","This was their chance to meet.","Jian Wushuang had no interest in it at all.","Leaving Yue Kingdom today.","He might not come back.","By then, he and Wu Li would have to go into hiding.","Wu Li had already arranged the core members of the family before leaving.","Jian Wushuang had nothing weighing on his mind, just thinking about where to go next.","At the same time, he was also reminiscing about what happened inside the Nine Tribulations Tower.","After becoming Weiss’ disciple, he successfully entered the Nine Tribulations Tower for the second time.","Ile began challenging Weiss’ second avatar.","Unfortunately, he was no match at all. The gap was too wide, so he could only stay in the first level to cultivate.","Cultivating in the Nine Tribulations Tower was nothing special in itself.","The main thing was that practicing the secret techniques Weiss taught him went smoothly.","Only within the Nine Tribulations Tower could he cultivate the secret techniques Weiss","imparted.","Morcover, it had to be his true self who went to practice.","“The Utmost Freedom Intent. Technique!”","Jian Wushuang remembered Wei’s display of the Utmost Freedom Intent Technique and","couldn’t help but marvel at its power.","Cultivating it was extremely difficult.","He couldn’t even achieve the basics right now.","It was an extremely long process.","According to Weiss’ estimation, he needed to reach the Universe Master level to even begin,","Fortunately, he was powerful enough to wait.","As long as he could grasp the basics of the Utmost Freedom Intent Technique, he would","have a chance to pass the second level of the Nine Tribulations Tower.","Although cultivation was strenuous, its power was enough to make Jian Wushuang commit","to it.","Once he grasped the basics, his strength would skyrocket rapidly.","But for now, he couldn’t help himself,","It would take time to refine his skills.","On his way to the Ancient Wood Sect, Jian Wushuang did not engage in cultivation either.","In all aspects, he had reached the Emperor’s limit.","The Origin Source Starry Sky had already lit up countless black holes.","It was only a step away from condensing into a physical universe.","He also asked Weiss about the Origin Source Universe. According to Weiss, the countless black holes were already perfect.","Becoming the Universe Master didn’t pose any pressure at all.","But crossing the threshold into Tribulation Realm still required great effort. Becoming a Tribulation Realm cultivator was the key to mastering the universe.","What Jian Wushuang lacked now was the opportunity to enter the Tribulation Realm.","The Sacred Assembly was approaching unexpectedly.","Ilis time was running out.","In silence, Wu Li’s expression changed, and he transmitted his voice, “Jian Wushuang, do","you have something on your mind?”","He hesitated for a moment, then looked at Wu Li, only then realizing that it was a","transmission just now.","“Nothing much, the Sacred Assembly is about to begin, what could be on my mind!” Jian","Wushuang replied through voice transmission.","What was on his mind?!","Way too much.","But now wasn’t the time to think about that.","He couldn’t afford to dwell on trivial matters anymore.","He had to face reality squarely.","This time’s Sacred Assembly would have many Universe Masters in the Fifth Tribulation, all","much stronger than Jian Wushuang.","Preparation was essential,","Wu Li hadn’t yet informed him of the details of the plan; those needed discussion.","But this wasn’t the place for it.","The two could only hold off on discussing and talk with Elder Muchen about the Sacred","Assembly with a smile on their faces.","The purpose of this Sacred Assembly was clear.","It was to select the Holy Maiden candidate.","Their task was to assist Fengchen, the Empress, in becoming the Iloly Maiden candidate.","Once they became candidates, the rest was out of their hands.","That would be the time for Jian Wushuang and Wu Li to execute their plan.","The Saintess of the Ancient Wood Sect needed to resonate with the Wanliu Divine Tree.","No one could help the Empress with that.","In the Sixteen Kingdoms and some hidden forces in the Ancient Wood Continent, there were at least hundreds of Universe Masters in the Fifth Tribulation.","But there were fewer than a hundred contenders for the position of Holy Maiden. Among these hundred, there were only a few fully-fledged Universe Masters in the Fifth","Tribulation.","And there were only four positions for candidates.","Four candidates.","To compete for the position of Holy Maiden.","This would be the final battle.","It didn’t concern Jian Wushuang and the others much.","But by seizing this opportunity to sneak into the Wanliu, the stakes became higher.","Not only would it disrupt the Sacred Assembly, but it would also offend various forces.","Yet, these were all minor matters.","The real terror would come after they entered.","Being besieged by countless powerful individuals wouldn’t just be about plundering","treasures.","They would also investigate how they managed to enter the Wanliu.","That was the most crucial aspect.","Wu Li had said that having the power of Life would allow them to enter.","At that time, he was somewhat incredulous, but now it seemed truly unbelievable.","Certainly, some unique method was needed.","He wasn’t aware of this, but Wu Li was.","He just couldn’t ask.","He could also tell that Wu Li wasn’t simple.","Fortunately, during this period, his strength had skyrocketed, and even if Wu Li was only","half a step into the Fourth Tribulation, he was no match for Jian Wushuang.","He wasn’t afraid of any tricks the other party might pull.","Ile was only afraid that after being used up by the other party, the other would enter the","Wanliu.","That was what he had to worry about."]}]);
